window.__CH=window.__CH||{};window.__CH["df06"]={"id": "df06", "title": "时间调度、信噪比与噪声尺度", "focus": "把噪声调度写成信噪比的时间预算：线性、cosine、sigmoid 调度的数学差异，端点条件与离散步长选择，以及调度对 ELBO 权重的影响。", "claims": ["\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=\\frac{\\alpha_t^2}{\\sigma_t^2}", "\\text{cosine: }\\bar\\alpha_t=\\cos^2\\!\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\frac{t/T+s}{1+s}\\right)", "\\text{端点条件：}\\bar\\alpha_0=1,\\ \\bar\\alpha_T=0\\ \\text{（或近似）}"], "topics": ["信噪比的定义", "噪声尺度与时间", "cosine 调度", "线性调度", "调度的信息论解释", "最优调度的变分问题", "边界条件：t=0 与 t=1", "离散时间步的选择", "调度对采样步数的影响", "反例：端点奇异导致数值不稳定", "时间重参数化的不变性", "调度与 ELBO 权重", "代码：调度曲线的实现", "代码：不同调度的密度演化", "与数值积分章的接口", "本章推导链：调度 = 噪声的时间预算"], "html": "<h3 id=\"df06--h-信噪比的定义\">信噪比的定义<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-信噪比的定义\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用第二部已固定的扩散生成记号，并只引入本节必需的符号。设前向过程为 Itô 扩散</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{d}X_t = f(X_t,t)\\,\\mathrm{d}t + g(t)\\,\\mathrm{d}W_t,\\qquad t\\in[0,T],$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_t$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 值标准布朗运动，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f:\\mathbb{R}^d\\times[0,T]\\to\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 为漂移，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g:[0,T]\\to(0,\\infty)$</span> 为标量扩散系数。记前向过程的边际密度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span>，转移核为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{t\\mid s}(x_t\\mid x_s)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\le s&lt;t\\le T$</span>。对标准高斯前向过程，条件分布写成</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_{t\\mid 0}(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal{N}\\big(x_t;\\ \\alpha_t x_0,\\ \\sigma_t^2 I_d\\big),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t\\in(0,\\infty)$</span> 为信号缩放系数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\in[0,\\infty)$</span> 为噪声尺度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$I_d$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 维单位矩阵。等价地，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$X_t \\overset{d}{=} \\alpha_t X_0 + \\sigma_t \\varepsilon,\\qquad \\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,I_d),\\quad \\varepsilon\\perp X_0.$$</div>\n<p>本节新引入的符号表如下：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)$</span>：时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的信噪比，定义为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=\\alpha_t^2/\\sigma_t^2$</span>，取值于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,\\infty]$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t$</span>：对数信噪比，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t=\\log \\mathrm{SNR}(t)=\\log\\alpha_t^2-\\log\\sigma_t^2$</span>，取值于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}\\cup\\{+\\infty\\}$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>：累积信号系数，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\alpha_t$</span> 在本节记号下；后文 cosine 与线性调度节将用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 表示同一对象，故本节同时登记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t:=\\alpha_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\sigma_t:=\\sigma_t$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$r(t)$</span>：信噪比的倒数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$r(t)=1/\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=\\sigma_t^2/\\alpha_t^2$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t(x)$</span>：时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的得分函数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t(x)=\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x)$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 绝对连续且对数可微时定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>正则性假设如下，后续命题逐条引用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>(A1) 可测性与正性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t,\\sigma_t$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上 Borel 可测函数，且对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\ge0$</span>。</li>\n<li><strong>(A2) 端点非退化</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_0=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_0=1$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_T&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_T\\ge0$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_T=0$</span>，则约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(T)=0$</span>。</li>\n<li><strong>(A3) 局部有界与可微</strong>：在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,T)$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t,\\sigma_t$</span> 连续可微，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t&gt;0$</span>；在任意紧子区间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[a,b]\\subset(0,T)$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\inf_{t\\in[a,b]}\\sigma_t&gt;0$</span>。</li>\n<li><strong>(A4) 数据矩条件</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0\\in L^2(\\Omega;\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|X_0\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>条件 (A1)–(A3) 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,T)$</span> 上连续可微且取有限正值；(A2) 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 处信噪比为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_0=0,\\alpha_0=1$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T$</span> 处信噪比有限或为零。这正是本章后续“端点条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1,\\bar\\alpha_T=0$</span>（或近似）”的解析基础：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T=0$</span> 对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(T)=0$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_T&gt;0$</span> 保证终端分布非退化。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-定义-信噪比与相邻概念的区别\">定义：信噪比与相邻概念的区别<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-定义-信噪比与相邻概念的区别\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义 1（信噪比）</strong> 在假设 (A1)–(A2) 下，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span> 定义</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=\\frac{\\alpha_t^2}{\\sigma_t^2},$$</div>\n<p>并约定当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t=0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=+\\infty$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t=0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t&gt;0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=0$</span>。对数信噪比定义为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t=\\log\\mathrm{SNR}(t)$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)\\in(0,\\infty)$</span> 时取有限实值。</p>\n<p>这个定义与三个相邻概念必须区分。</p>\n<p>第一，它与<strong>噪声尺度</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 不同。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 是前向边际的标准差，量纲与数据 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0$</span> 相同；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)$</span> 是无量纲比值。固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 而改变 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t$</span> 会改变信噪比而不改变噪声的绝对幅度，因此调度设计不能只指定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span>。</p>\n<p>第二，它与<strong>得分函数</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t$</span> 不同。得分是密度对数的空间梯度，信噪比是时间索引上的标量预算。二者通过 Tweedie 恒等式联系：对高斯前向过程，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}[X_0\\mid X_t=x]=\\frac{1}{\\alpha_t}\\big(x+\\sigma_t^2\\,\\rho_t(x)\\big),$$</div>\n<p>该恒等式在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 对数可微且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|X_0\\|&lt;\\infty$</span> 时成立。它表明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2/\\alpha_t$</span> 是得分修正项的系数，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=\\alpha_t^2/\\sigma_t^2$</span> 是其倒数结构；两者不可混用。</p>\n<p>第三，它与<strong>概率流 ODE 速度</strong>不同。概率流 ODE 的速度场由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x,t)-\\tfrac12 g(t)^2\\rho_t(x)$</span> 给出，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)$</span> 是扩散系数，不是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span>。信噪比只描述边际分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 的缩放结构，不直接等于 ODE 速度的任一坐标分量。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 1（信噪比与条件分布协方差）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A2) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0$</span> 满足 (A4)。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,T)$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Cov}(X_t)=\\alpha_t^2\\,\\mathrm{Cov}(X_0)+\\sigma_t^2 I_d,$$</div>\n<p>且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0$</span> 各向同性且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}(X_0)=cI_d$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$c&gt;0$</span>）时，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=\\frac{\\alpha_t^2 c}{\\mathrm{Var}(X_t^{(1)})-\\sigma_t^2},$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t^{(1)}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 的第一坐标。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=\\alpha_t X_0+\\sigma_t\\varepsilon$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\perp X_0$</span>，协方差的双线性给出</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Cov}(X_t)=\\alpha_t^2\\mathrm{Cov}(X_0)+\\sigma_t^2\\mathrm{Cov}(\\varepsilon)=\\alpha_t^2\\mathrm{Cov}(X_0)+\\sigma_t^2 I_d.$$</div>\n<p>各向同性时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}(X_0)=cI_d$</span>，故第一坐标方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t^2 c+\\sigma_t^2$</span>，移项即得第二式。证毕。</p>\n<p>命题 1 说明信噪比不是边际方差的单调函数：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(X_t^{(1)})$</span> 同时含信号与噪声两部分，只有已知 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 时才能从方差反解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-主定理-信噪比作为时间预算的单调结构\">主定理：信噪比作为时间预算的单调结构<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-主定理-信噪比作为时间预算的单调结构\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定理 2（信噪比的对数导数分解）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,T)$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}t}\\lambda_t\n=2\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}t}\\log\\alpha_t-2\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}t}\\log\\sigma_t.$$</div>\n<p>若进一步假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t$</span> 非增、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 非减且均在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,T)$</span> 上可微，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t$</span> 非增，且</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\lambda_t=\\lambda_0-\\int_0^t 2\\left(\\frac{\\dot\\sigma_s}{\\sigma_s}-\\frac{\\dot\\alpha_s}{\\alpha_s}\\right)\\mathrm{d}s,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_0=+\\infty$</span> 按端点约定理解，右端积分在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,t]$</span> 上有限。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t=2\\log\\alpha_t-2\\log\\sigma_t$</span>。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,T)$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t,\\sigma_t&gt;0$</span> 且连续可微，链式法则给出第一式。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t$</span> 非增则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\alpha_t\\le0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 非减则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\sigma_t\\ge0$</span>，于是括号内 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\sigma_s/\\sigma_s-\\dot\\alpha_s/\\alpha_s\\ge0$</span>，被积函数非负，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t$</span> 非增。积分表达式由微积分基本定理在紧子区间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[\\epsilon,t]$</span> 上写出后令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon\\downarrow0$</span> 得到；被积函数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,t]$</span> 上连续且非负，积分有限或发散到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_0=+\\infty$</span> 的约定一致。证毕。</p>\n<p>定理 2 是本节的核心结构陈述：信噪比的时间导数完全由信号缩放的对数导数与噪声尺度的对数导数之差决定。后续线性、cosine、sigmoid 调度的数学差异，本质上就是这两个对数导数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上的不同剖面。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 3（端点信噪比与端点条件）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_0=0,\\alpha_0=1$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lim_{t\\downarrow0}\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=+\\infty$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t\\to+\\infty$</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_T=0,\\sigma_T&gt;0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(T)=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_T=-\\infty$</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_T&gt;0,\\sigma_T&gt;0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(T)=\\alpha_T^2/\\sigma_T^2\\in(0,\\infty)$</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 第 1 条由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_0=1&gt;0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\to0^+$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t^2/\\sigma_t^2\\to+\\infty$</span>。第 2 条由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_T=0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_T&gt;0$</span> 得比值为零，对数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\infty$</span>。第 3 条直接由正数之比为正有限数。证毕。</p>\n<p>推论 3 把本章 canonical 端点条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1,\\bar\\alpha_T=0$</span>（或近似）翻译为信噪比语言：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_0=0$</span> 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(0)=+\\infty$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T=0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_T&gt;0$</span> 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(T)=0$</span>。若终端只近似为零，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(T)$</span> 为小正数，这正是“或近似”的精确含义。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-恒等式-信噪比与得分修正系数\">恒等式：信噪比与得分修正系数<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-恒等式-信噪比与得分修正系数\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 4（Tweedie 恒等式中的信噪比结构）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 上绝对连续且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_t$</span> 连续可微，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x\\log p_t$</span> 平方可积。则对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span>-几乎处处的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}[X_0\\mid X_t=x]=\\frac{1}{\\alpha_t}\\Big(x+\\sigma_t^2\\,\\rho_t(x)\\Big),$$</div>\n<p>且得分修正项系数可写成</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\sigma_t^2}{\\alpha_t}=\\frac{1}{\\alpha_t\\,\\mathrm{SNR}(t)}\\cdot\\alpha_t^2=\\frac{\\alpha_t}{\\mathrm{SNR}(t)}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 第一个等式是高斯前向过程的标准 Tweedie 恒等式：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x)=\\int \\mathcal{N}(x;\\alpha_t x_0,\\sigma_t^2 I_d)p_0(x_0)\\mathrm{d}x_0$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 求梯度，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_x p_t(x)=\\int \\frac{\\alpha_t x_0-x}{\\sigma_t^2}\\,\\mathcal{N}(x;\\alpha_t x_0,\\sigma_t^2 I_d)p_0(x_0)\\mathrm{d}x_0.$$</div>\n<p>两边除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x)$</span> 得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\rho_t(x)=\\frac{\\alpha_t\\,\\mathbb{E}[X_0\\mid X_t=x]-x}{\\sigma_t^2},$$</div>\n<p>移项即得。交换求导与积分由 Leibniz 法则保证：被积函数对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 连续可微，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|X_0\\|&lt;\\infty$</span> 与高斯核的指数衰减给出局部一致可积的控制函数。第二个等式由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=\\alpha_t^2/\\sigma_t^2$</span> 直接代入：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\sigma_t^2}{\\alpha_t}=\\frac{\\alpha_t^2}{\\alpha_t\\,\\mathrm{SNR}(t)}=\\frac{\\alpha_t}{\\mathrm{SNR}(t)}.$$</div>\n<p>证毕。</p>\n<p>命题 4 的第二个等式是可检验的恒等式：得分修正项的系数与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t$</span> 成正比、与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)$</span> 成反比。这解释了为什么高信噪比区间（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 小）得分修正弱，而低信噪比区间（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 大）得分修正强。它也给出一个数值检验：给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0$</span> 与调度，可用蒙特卡洛估计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[X_0\\mid X_t=x]$</span> 并与右端比较。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-具体例子-高斯数据下的闭式信噪比\">具体例子：高斯数据下的闭式信噪比<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-具体例子-高斯数据下的闭式信噪比\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>例 5</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,c)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c&gt;0$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t=e^{-t}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=1-e^{-2t}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T&gt;0$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=\\frac{e^{-2t}}{1-e^{-2t}},\\qquad \\lambda_t=-2t-\\log(1-e^{-2t}).$$</div>\n<p>验证端点：<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_0=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(0)=+\\infty$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to\\infty$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)\\to0$</span>。验证命题 4：边际方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-2t}c+1-e^{-2t}$</span>，得分修正系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2/\\alpha_t=(1-e^{-2t})e^{t}=e^{t}-e^{-t}$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t/\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=e^{-t}(1-e^{-2t})/e^{-2t}=e^{t}-e^{-t}$</span>，两式一致。</p>\n<p><strong>数值检验代码</strong> 以下代码验证例 5 的端点、恒等式与命题 4 的系数一致性，并打印形状与预期结果。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\ndef snr_example(t, c=1.0):\n    alpha = np.exp(-t)\n    sigma2 = 1.0 - np.exp(-2.0 * t)\n    snr = alpha**2 / sigma2\n    lam = np.log(snr)\n    coef_left = sigma2 / alpha\n    coef_right = alpha / snr\n    return alpha, sigma2, snr, lam, coef_left, coef_right\n\nt = np.array([0.0, 0.1, 0.5, 1.0, 2.0, 5.0])\nalpha, sigma2, snr, lam, cl, cr = snr_example(t)\n\nassert alpha.shape == t.shape == snr.shape == lam.shape == cl.shape == cr.shape\nassert np.allclose(cl, cr, rtol=1e-12, atol=1e-12)\nassert np.isinf(snr[0]) and snr[0] &gt; 0\nassert np.all(np.diff(snr) &lt; 0)\nassert np.all(np.diff(lam) &lt; 0)\nprint(&quot;t shape:&quot;, t.shape)\nprint(&quot;snr:&quot;, snr)\nprint(&quot;log snr:&quot;, lam)\nprint(&quot;coef left == coef right:&quot;, np.allclose(cl, cr))\nprint(&quot;expected: snr[0]=inf, snr decreasing, lam decreasing, coefficients equal&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>运行预期：<code>snr[0]=inf</code>，<code>snr</code> 严格递减，<code>lam</code> 严格递减，<code>coef left == coef right</code> 为 <code>True</code>。该例同时检验了推论 3 的第 1 条与命题 4 的恒等式。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-与相邻节的分工\">与相邻节的分工<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-与相邻节的分工\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节只定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)$</span>、建立其对数导数分解、给出端点推论与得分恒等式。噪声尺度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 与时间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的参数化关系、cosine 与线性调度的具体函数形式、信息论解释、最优调度的变分问题、离散步长与 ELBO 权重，均留给后续各节。本节不展开这些内容，只确保后续节所需的符号与恒等式在此闭合。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>信噪比定义为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=\\alpha_t^2/\\sigma_t^2$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_0=0,\\alpha_0=1$</span> 时取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_T=0,\\sigma_T&gt;0$</span> 时取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>；它与噪声尺度、得分函数、概率流 ODE 速度是四个不同对象。</li>\n<li>对数信噪比满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}t}\\lambda_t=2\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}t}\\log\\alpha_t-2\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}t}\\log\\sigma_t$</span>；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t$</span> 非增、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 非减时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t$</span> 非增，这是“调度 = 噪声的时间预算”的解析骨架。</li>\n<li>端点条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1,\\bar\\alpha_T=0$</span>（或近似）等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(0)=+\\infty$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(T)=0$</span>（或小正数）；得分修正系数满足恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2/\\alpha_t=\\alpha_t/\\mathrm{SNR}(t)$</span>，可用于数值自检。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-信噪比在时间重参数化下的变换律\">信噪比在时间重参数化下的变换律<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-信噪比在时间重参数化下的变换律\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>后续第 11 节将讨论时间重参数化的不变性，本节先给出信噪比在该变换下的精确变换律，作为该节所需的局部接口。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi:[0,T]\\to[0,T']$</span> 为严格递增的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 微分同胚，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi(0)=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi(T)=T'$</span>。定义重参数化后的调度</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\alpha_u=\\alpha_{\\phi^{-1}(u)},\\qquad \\tilde\\sigma_u=\\sigma_{\\phi^{-1}(u)},\\qquad u\\in[0,T'].$$</div>\n<p><strong>命题 6（信噪比的重参数化协变性）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi$</span> 为上述微分同胚。则对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u\\in(0,T')$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\widetilde{\\mathrm{SNR}}(u):=\\frac{\\tilde\\alpha_u^2}{\\tilde\\sigma_u^2}=\\mathrm{SNR}\\big(\\phi^{-1}(u)\\big),$$</div>\n<p>且对数信噪比满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\lambda_u=\\lambda_{\\phi^{-1}(u)},\\qquad \\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}u}\\tilde\\lambda_u=\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}t}\\lambda_t\\Big|_{t=\\phi^{-1}(u)}\\cdot\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}u}\\phi^{-1}(u).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 第一式由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\alpha_u=\\alpha_{\\phi^{-1}(u)}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\sigma_u=\\sigma_{\\phi^{-1}(u)}$</span> 直接代入定义。第二式由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\lambda_u=\\log\\widetilde{\\mathrm{SNR}}(u)=\\lambda_{\\phi^{-1}(u)}$</span> 得到；对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 求导，链式法则给出</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}u}\\tilde\\lambda_u=\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}t}\\lambda_t\\Big|_{t=\\phi^{-1}(u)}\\cdot\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}u}\\phi^{-1}(u),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi^{-1}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,T')$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span>，故链式法则适用。证毕。</p>\n<p>命题 6 的意义在于：信噪比作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的函数在重参数化下是<strong>协变的标量场</strong>，其值不变，但其时间导数按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi^{-1}$</span> 的导数缩放。这正是后续“时间重参数化的不变性”一节要展开的内容：调度曲线的几何形状（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}$</span> 作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 的函数的图像）在重参数化下不变，而采样步长与 ELBO 权重的数值会变。本节只登记这一协变性，不展开其推论。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-信噪比的单调性与可逆性\">信噪比的单调性与可逆性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-信噪比的单调性与可逆性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>后续“噪声尺度与时间”与“离散时间步的选择”两节都需要从给定的信噪比水平反解时刻。本节给出该反解所需的单调性与可逆性条件。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7（严格单调下的可逆性）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,T)$</span> 上严格递减且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,T)$</span> 上严格递增，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,T)$</span> 上严格递减，从而存在严格递减的连续逆函数</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Lambda:(0,\\infty)\\to(0,T),\\qquad \\Lambda(\\lambda)=\\lambda^{-1}(\\lambda),$$</div>\n<p>满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_{\\Lambda(\\lambda)}=\\lambda$</span> 对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda\\in(0,\\infty)$</span> 成立。若进一步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,T)$</span> 上连续可微且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}t}\\lambda_t&lt;0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,\\infty)$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span>，且</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}\\lambda}\\Lambda(\\lambda)=\\left(\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}t}\\lambda_t\\Big|_{t=\\Lambda(\\lambda)}\\right)^{-1}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由定理 2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}t}\\lambda_t=2\\dot\\alpha_t/\\alpha_t-2\\dot\\sigma_t/\\sigma_t$</span>。严格递减与严格递增分别给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\alpha_t&lt;0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\sigma_t&gt;0$</span>，故两项均为负，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}t}\\lambda_t&lt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t$</span> 严格递减。由推论 3，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lim_{t\\downarrow0}\\lambda_t=+\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lim_{t\\uparrow T}\\lambda_t=-\\infty$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_T=0$</span>）或有限（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_T&gt;0$</span>）。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t$</span> 取遍 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,\\infty)$</span> 的情形下，严格单调连续函数的值域为区间，逆函数存在且连续。<span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 情形由反函数定理：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}t}\\lambda_t\\neq0$</span> 保证局部可逆且逆函数可微，导数公式由链式法则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}\\lambda}\\Lambda(\\lambda)\\cdot\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}t}\\lambda_t|_{\\Lambda(\\lambda)}=1$</span> 给出。证毕。</p>\n<p>命题 7 给出一个可检验的推论：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda\\in(0,\\infty)$</span>，时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda(\\lambda)$</span> 是唯一使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=e^{\\lambda}$</span> 的时刻。后续“离散时间步的选择”一节将用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda$</span> 把等间隔的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 网格映射为不等间隔的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 网格，从而构造对数信噪比均匀的采样步。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 8（对数信噪比均匀网格）</strong> 在命题 7 的条件下，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_k=\\lambda_{\\max}-k\\Delta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$k=0,1,\\dots,N$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta=(\\lambda_{\\max}-\\lambda_{\\min})/N$</span>，则对应时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_k=\\Lambda(\\lambda_k)$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_0&lt;t_1&lt;\\dots&lt;t_N$</span>，且相邻时刻的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 差恒为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda$</span> 严格递减，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_k$</span> 严格递减，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_k=\\Lambda(\\lambda_k)$</span> 严格递增。相邻差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_k-\\lambda_{k+1}=\\Delta$</span> 由构造直接给出。证毕。</p>\n<p>推论 8 是后续离散化节的直接输入：对数信噪比均匀网格把“信噪比预算”等分，而不是把时间等分。这正是 cosine 与线性调度在采样步数上表现不同的根源之一。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-信噪比与扩散系数-g-t-的独立性\">信噪比与扩散系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)$</span> 的独立性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-信噪比与扩散系数-g-t-的独立性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>一个常见的混淆是把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)$</span> 与扩散系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)$</span> 直接等同。本节澄清二者的关系：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t,\\sigma_t$</span> 决定，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t,\\sigma_t$</span> 又由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f,g$</span> 通过前向 SDE 的边际分布决定；但给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t,\\sigma_t$</span> 后，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)$</span> 不再独立可调。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9（边际缩放与扩散系数的相容性）</strong> 设前向 SDE 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{d}X_t=f(X_t,t)\\mathrm{d}t+g(t)\\mathrm{d}W_t$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=\\alpha_t X_0+\\sigma_t\\varepsilon$</span> 对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t,\\sigma_t$</span> 满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\dot\\alpha_t=\\alpha_t\\,a(t),\\qquad \\dot\\sigma_t^2=2\\sigma_t^2\\,a(t)+g(t)^2,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a(t)$</span> 由漂移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 上的线性部分决定；对标准 VP 过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x,t)=-\\tfrac12\\beta(t)x$</span>，有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a(t)=-\\tfrac12\\beta(t)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)^2=\\beta(t)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=\\alpha_t X_0+\\sigma_t\\varepsilon$</span> 应用 Itô 公式于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\mapsto X_t$</span>，并与 SDE 的漂移、扩散项逐项匹配。线性漂移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x,t)=a(t)x$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{d}(\\alpha_t X_0)=\\dot\\alpha_t X_0\\mathrm{d}t$</span>，而 SDE 漂移为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a(t)(\\alpha_t X_0+\\sigma_t\\varepsilon)$</span>，匹配 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0$</span> 系数得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\alpha_t=\\alpha_t a(t)$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\varepsilon$</span> 部分，Itô 等距给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{d}(\\sigma_t^2)=2\\sigma_t\\dot\\sigma_t\\mathrm{d}t+g(t)^2\\mathrm{d}t$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\sigma_t^2=2\\sigma_t^2 a(t)+g(t)^2$</span>。证毕。</p>\n<p>命题 9 说明：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=\\alpha_t^2/\\sigma_t^2$</span> 的演化由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a(t)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)$</span> 共同决定，不能只指定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)$</span> 就确定信噪比曲线。后续线性与 cosine 调度节将直接指定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 的形状，再由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=1-\\bar\\alpha_t^2$</span>（VP 归一化）反推 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span>，而不是从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)$</span> 出发。本节只登记这一相容性关系，不展开具体调度。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-一个反例边界-信噪比有限但得分恒等式失效\">一个反例边界：信噪比有限但得分恒等式失效<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-一个反例边界-信噪比有限但得分恒等式失效\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 4 的 Tweedie 恒等式要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 对数可微且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x\\log p_t$</span> 平方可积。本节给出一个边界情形，说明仅 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)\\in(0,\\infty)$</span> 不足以保证该恒等式成立；完整反例构造留给第 10 节。</p>\n<p><strong>边界情形 10</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0=\\delta_0$</span>（Dirac 质量），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t&gt;0$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t=\\mathcal{N}(0,\\sigma_t^2 I_d)$</span> 对数可微，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t(x)=-x/\\sigma_t^2$</span>，Tweedie 恒等式给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[X_0\\mid X_t=x]=0$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t$</span> 无关。此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=\\alpha_t^2/\\sigma_t^2$</span> 有限，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[X_0\\mid X_t=x]$</span> 不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t$</span>，说明信噪比本身不携带数据信息；数据信息只通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0$</span> 进入得分。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0$</span> 不是绝对连续（如支撑在低维流形上），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t$</span> 在流形外无定义，命题 4 的假设失效，恒等式不能逐点成立，只能作为弱意义下的分布恒等式理解。</p>\n<p>该边界情形的作用是划定命题 4 的适用边界：信噪比是调度侧的标量，得分恒等式是数据侧与调度侧的耦合；二者缺一不可。第 10 节将给出端点奇异导致数值不稳定的完整反例，本节不重复。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-信噪比作为时间预算的度量解释\">信噪比作为时间预算的度量解释<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-信噪比作为时间预算的度量解释\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节最后给出一个度量解释，为后续“调度的信息论解释”与“调度与 ELBO 权重”两节提供接口。定义时间预算测度</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{d}\\mu(t)=\\left|\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}t}\\lambda_t\\right|\\mathrm{d}t,\\qquad t\\in(0,T).$$</div>\n<p>在定理 2 的单调条件下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}t}\\lambda_t&lt;0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{d}\\mu(t)=-\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}t}\\lambda_t\\,\\mathrm{d}t$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 11（预算测度的总质量）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 与推论 3 的第 1、2 条下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_T=0$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mu\\big((0,T)\\big)=\\int_0^T\\left|\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}t}\\lambda_t\\right|\\mathrm{d}t=+\\infty,$$</div>\n<p>因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t$</span> 在两端分别发散到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\infty$</span>。若改为截断区间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[\\epsilon,T-\\epsilon]$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mu\\big([\\epsilon,T-\\epsilon]\\big)=\\lambda_\\epsilon-\\lambda_{T-\\epsilon}&lt;\\infty.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t$</span> 严格递减且两端发散，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T-\\dot\\lambda_t\\,\\mathrm{d}t=\\lambda_0-\\lambda_T=+\\infty$</span>。截断区间上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 连续可微，微积分基本定理给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_\\epsilon^{T-\\epsilon}-\\dot\\lambda_t\\,\\mathrm{d}t=\\lambda_\\epsilon-\\lambda_{T-\\epsilon}$</span>，有限。证毕。</p>\n<p>命题 11 说明：完整时间轴上的对数信噪比预算总质量发散，这是端点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(0)=+\\infty$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(T)=0$</span> 的直接后果。因此任何数值实现都必须截断端点，这正是后续“边界条件：<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span>”与“反例：端点奇异导致数值不稳定”两节要处理的问题。截断后的预算测度有限，可作为 ELBO 权重的加权测度：后续“调度与 ELBO 权重”一节将证明 ELBO 的每一项权重正比于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{d}\\mu$</span> 在对应时间格上的质量。本节只建立测度与总质量，不展开 ELBO 推导。</p>\n<p><strong>可检验推论 12</strong> 在例 5 的调度下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t=-2t-\\log(1-e^{-2t})$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}t}\\lambda_t=-2-\\frac{2e^{-2t}}{1-e^{-2t}}=-\\frac{2}{1-e^{-2t}}$</span>。故预算测度密度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{2}{1-e^{-2t}}$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\downarrow0$</span> 时发散如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/t$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to\\infty$</span> 时趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span>。截断区间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[\\epsilon,T-\\epsilon]$</span> 上的质量为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_\\epsilon-\\lambda_{T-\\epsilon}$</span>，可直接数值验证。</p>\n<p>至此，本节完成了信噪比的定义、对数导数分解、端点推论、得分恒等式、重参数化协变性、可逆性、与扩散系数的相容性、预算测度与总质量。后续各节将在此符号与恒等式基础上展开具体调度曲线、信息论解释、变分问题、离散化与 ELBO 权重。</p>\n<h3 id=\"df06--h-噪声尺度与时间\">噪声尺度与时间<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-噪声尺度与时间\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前节已定义的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t,\\sigma_t$</span> 为前向过程在连续时间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span> 的边际缩放系数与噪声系数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\prod_{s\\le t}\\alpha_s$</span> 的连续时间版本记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha(t)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=\\alpha_t^2/\\sigma_t^2$</span>。为避免与前节离散指标混淆，本节统一采用连续时间记号，并作如下约定：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>时间区间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I=[0,T]\\subset\\mathbb{R}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T&gt;0$</span> 固定；<span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 为连续时间变量。</li>\n<li>噪声尺度函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma:I\\to(0,\\infty)$</span> 连续可微且严格单调递增；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(0)=\\sigma_{\\min}&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(T)=\\sigma_{\\max}&lt;\\infty$</span>。</li>\n<li>信号缩放函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha:I\\to(0,1]$</span> 连续可微，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha(t)^2+\\sigma(t)^2=1$</span>（方差保持参数化），且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha(0)=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha(T)=0$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha(T)\\to 0^+$</span>。</li>\n<li>累积信噪比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=\\alpha(t)^2/\\sigma(t)^2$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I$</span> 上严格单调递减，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(0)=\\infty$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{\\min}\\to 0$</span>）或有限大值，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(T)=0$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha(T)=0$</span>）。</li>\n<li>记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda(t)=\\log\\mathrm{SNR}(t)$</span> 为对数信噪比，它是本节的核心坐标。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节只使用上述符号；凡引入新符号均在首次出现处定义。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-噪声尺度的定义与时间坐标的区别\">噪声尺度的定义与时间坐标的区别<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-噪声尺度的定义与时间坐标的区别\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义 1（噪声尺度）</strong> 称连续可微严格递增函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma:I\\to(0,\\infty)$</span> 为噪声尺度函数，若存在连续可微 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha:I\\to(0,1]$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha(t)^2+\\sigma(t)^2=1$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha(0)=1$</span>。称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(t)$</span> 在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的取值为该时刻的噪声尺度。</p>\n<p>噪声尺度与时间坐标是两个独立对象：<span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 是调度参数化的自变量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(t)$</span> 是由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 诱导的噪声强度。同一物理噪声水平可以由不同 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 到达，这正是后续“时间重参数化不变性”节的出发点。本节只固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的坐标含义，不讨论重参数化。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 1（尺度—信噪比互化）</strong> 在定义 1 的假设下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in I$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=\\frac{1-\\sigma(t)^2}{\\sigma(t)^2},\\qquad \\sigma(t)=\\bigl(1+\\mathrm{SNR}(t)\\bigr)^{-1/2}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由方差保持 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha(t)^2=1-\\sigma(t)^2$</span>，代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}=\\alpha^2/\\sigma^2$</span> 得第一式。第一式解出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^2=\\mathrm{SNR}^{-1}/(1+\\mathrm{SNR}^{-1})=1/(1+\\mathrm{SNR})$</span>，开方得第二式（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma&gt;0$</span>）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 1 说明：在方差保持参数化下，噪声尺度与信噪比互为单射变换，调度等价于在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 轴上指定一条随时间单调的路径。它与“噪声水平”概念的区别在于：噪声水平通常指 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 的瞬时值，而调度指整条路径 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(\\cdot)$</span>；前者是点，后者是曲线。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-时间作为噪声尺度的参数化-主定理\">时间作为噪声尺度的参数化：主定理<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-时间作为噪声尺度的参数化-主定理\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节的核心主张是：调度应被理解为“信噪比的时间预算”，即一条把时间区间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I$</span> 映射到对数信噪比区间的单调曲线 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda(t)$</span>。下面给出该表述的精确形式。</p>\n<p><strong>定理 1（调度—预算表示）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 满足定义 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda(t)=\\log\\mathrm{SNR}(t)$</span>。则：</p>\n<p>(i) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda:I\\to\\mathbb{R}$</span> 连续可微、严格单调递减，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda'(t)&lt;0$</span> 对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in I$</span> 成立；</p>\n<p>(ii) 若进一步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{\\min}\\to 0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha(T)=0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda(0)=+\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda(T)=-\\infty$</span>；</p>\n<p>(iii) 对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\le t_1&lt;t_2\\le T$</span>，时间预算恒等式成立：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_{t_1}^{t_2}\\bigl|\\lambda'(s)\\bigr|\\,\\mathrm{d}s=\\log\\frac{\\mathrm{SNR}(t_1)}{\\mathrm{SNR}(t_2)}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> (i) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda=\\log\\alpha^2-\\log\\sigma^2$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha^2=1-\\sigma^2$</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 严格递增，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha$</span> 严格递减，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\alpha^2$</span> 严格递减、<span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log\\sigma^2$</span> 严格递减，二者之和严格递减。连续可微性由复合函数链式法则继承。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda'(t)&lt;0$</span> 由严格单调递减且可微推出（若某点导数为零则与严格单调矛盾，需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma'$</span> 处处非零；由定义 1 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 严格递增且连续可微，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma'&gt;0$</span> 几乎处处，结合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha'=-\\sigma\\sigma'/\\alpha$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda'=-2\\sigma'/(\\alpha\\sigma)&lt;0$</span>）。</p>\n<p>(ii) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(0)=\\sigma_{\\min}\\to 0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha(0)\\to 1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(0)=\\alpha^2/\\sigma^2\\to+\\infty$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha(T)=0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(T)=0$</span>，取对数得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p>(iii) 由 (i) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 严格递减，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda'&lt;0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\lambda'|=-\\lambda'$</span>。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_{t_1}^{t_2}|\\lambda'(s)|\\,\\mathrm{d}s=-\\int_{t_1}^{t_2}\\lambda'(s)\\,\\mathrm{d}s=\\lambda(t_1)-\\lambda(t_2)=\\log\\frac{\\mathrm{SNR}(t_1)}{\\mathrm{SNR}(t_2)}.$$</div>\n<p>此处用了微积分基本定理，要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda'$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[t_1,t_2]$</span> 上连续，由 (i) 保证。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>定理 1(iii) 是本节的核心恒等式：它把“调度”翻译成“对数信噪比在时间上的积分预算”。给定任意严格递减的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda(t)$</span>，积分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int|\\lambda'|$</span> 就是该调度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[t_1,t_2]$</span> 上消耗的信噪比预算。不同调度（线性、cosine、sigmoid）的差异，正是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda'(t)$</span> 的形状差异，即预算在时间上的分配方式差异。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-从尺度到预算-三个可检验的推论\">从尺度到预算：三个可检验的推论<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-从尺度到预算-三个可检验的推论\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>推论 1（预算密度）</strong> 在定理 1 假设下，定义预算密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)=|\\lambda'(t)|$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)=2\\sigma'(t)/(\\alpha(t)\\sigma(t))$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T w(t)\\,\\mathrm{d}t=\\lambda(0)-\\lambda(T)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda=\\log(1-\\sigma^2)-\\log\\sigma^2$</span>，求导得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\lambda'(t)=\\frac{-2\\sigma\\sigma'}{1-\\sigma^2}-\\frac{2\\sigma'}{\\sigma}=-\\frac{2\\sigma'}{\\sigma}\\left(\\frac{\\sigma^2}{1-\\sigma^2}+1\\right)=-\\frac{2\\sigma'}{\\sigma(1-\\sigma^2)}.$$</div>\n<p>由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha^2=1-\\sigma^2$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)=|\\lambda'|=2\\sigma'/(\\alpha\\sigma)$</span>。积分式由定理 1(iii) 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_1=0,t_2=T$</span> 即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 1 给出可检验的恒等式：预算密度只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma'$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha$</span> 的显式形式无关（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha$</span> 由方差保持约束确定）。这解释了为什么调度设计只需指定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(t)$</span> 或等价地指定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda(t)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 2（方差保持下的预算—尺度关系）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(t)=\\sin\\theta(t)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha(t)=\\cos\\theta(t)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta:I\\to[0,\\pi/2]$</span> 连续可微严格递增，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta(0)=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta(T)=\\pi/2$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$w(t)=2\\cot\\theta(t)\\cdot\\theta'(t),\\qquad \\int_0^T w\\,\\mathrm{d}t=+\\infty.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma'=\\cos\\theta\\cdot\\theta'$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha=\\cos\\theta$</span>，代入推论 1 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=2\\cos\\theta\\,\\theta'/(\\cos\\theta\\sin\\theta)=2\\cot\\theta\\cdot\\theta'$</span>。积分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T 2\\cot\\theta\\,\\theta'\\,\\mathrm{d}t=2\\int_0^{\\pi/2}\\cot\\theta\\,\\mathrm{d}\\theta$</span>，该积分在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\to 0$</span> 处发散（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\cot\\theta\\sim 1/\\theta$</span>），故为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 2 说明：方差保持参数化下，若端点取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{\\min}=0$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta(0)=0$</span>），预算密度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 附近不可积。这正是后续“反例：端点奇异导致数值不稳定”节要处理的边界情形；本节只指出该奇异性来自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\cot\\theta$</span> 在零点的发散，而非调度曲线本身不连续。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 3（预算的时间分配比例）</strong> 在定理 1 假设下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\le t_1&lt;t_2\\le T$</span>，区间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[t_1,t_2]$</span> 消耗的预算占总预算的比例为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\int_{t_1}^{t_2}w(s)\\,\\mathrm{d}s}{\\int_0^T w(s)\\,\\mathrm{d}s}=\\frac{\\lambda(t_1)-\\lambda(t_2)}{\\lambda(0)-\\lambda(T)}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 分子由定理 1(iii) 等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda(t_1)-\\lambda(t_2)$</span>，分母等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda(0)-\\lambda(T)$</span>，相除即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 3 是调度比较的定量工具：两个调度若在相同时间区间消耗相同比例的预算，则它们在该区间上的“有效噪声进展”相同。线性调度与 cosine 调度的差异，正是该比例函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\mapsto(\\lambda(0)-\\lambda(t))/(\\lambda(0)-\\lambda(T))$</span> 的形状差异。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-具体例子-线性尺度调度的预算计算\">具体例子：线性尺度调度的预算计算<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-具体例子-线性尺度调度的预算计算\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(t)=t$</span>（线性噪声尺度），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha(t)=\\sqrt{1-t^2}$</span>。验证定义 1：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 严格递增，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha^2+\\sigma^2=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha(0)=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha(1)=0$</span>。计算预算密度：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$w(t)=\\frac{2\\sigma'(t)}{\\alpha(t)\\sigma(t)}=\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{1-t^2}\\cdot t}.$$</div>\n<p>在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\to+\\infty$</span>；在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\to+\\infty$</span>。两端均奇异。总预算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^1 w\\,\\mathrm{d}t$</span> 发散。这与推论 2 一致：线性 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(t)=t$</span> 对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta(t)=\\arcsin t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta(0)=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta(1)=\\pi/2$</span>，端点奇异。</p>\n<p>若改为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(t)=\\varepsilon+(1-\\varepsilon)t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\in(0,1)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(0)=\\varepsilon&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha(0)=\\sqrt{1-\\varepsilon^2}&lt;1$</span>，端点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 不再奇异；<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha(1)=0$</span> 仍奇异。这说明端点条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{\\min}&gt;0$</span> 不能同时严格成立（在方差保持下），只能近似成立。该近似正是后续“边界条件：<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span>”节的主题，本节只给出定量刻画：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 越小，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 附近预算密度越大，数值积分越需要精细步长。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-与相邻概念的区别-噪声尺度不是噪声水平-时间不是预算\">与相邻概念的区别：噪声尺度不是噪声水平，时间不是预算<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-与相邻概念的区别-噪声尺度不是噪声水平-时间不是预算\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节需明确三个区别，以防后续节混淆：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>噪声尺度 vs 噪声水平</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(t)$</span> 是尺度函数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的取值，是点；调度是整条曲线 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(\\cdot)$</span>。同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 值可由不同调度在不同 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 到达。</li>\n<li><strong>时间 vs 预算</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 是参数化的自变量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda(t)$</span> 是预算坐标。<span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的均匀网格不保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 的均匀网格；后者才是采样步长设计应依据的坐标（见后续“离散时间步的选择”节）。</li>\n<li><strong>预算密度 vs ELBO 权重</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)=|\\lambda'(t)|$</span> 刻画信噪比消耗速率，是调度的几何量；ELBO 权重是变分目标中各项的系数，依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)$</span> 但与后验方差等量耦合（见后续“调度与 ELBO 权重”节）。二者不可互相替代。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-时间网格与预算网格的分离-步长选择的定量约束\">时间网格与预算网格的分离：步长选择的定量约束<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-时间网格与预算网格的分离-步长选择的定量约束\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>上一小节已指出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的均匀网格不保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 的均匀网格。本小节把这一区别写成可计算的命题，为后续“离散时间步的选择”节提供精确接口。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 2（时间网格与预算网格）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0=t_0&lt;t_1&lt;\\cdots&lt;t_N=T$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I$</span> 的一个分划，称其为时间网格，步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t_k=t_k-t_{k-1}$</span>。称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\lambda_k=\\lambda(t_{k-1})-\\lambda(t_k)&gt;0$</span> 为该网格在第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 段消耗的预算，称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\Delta\\lambda_k\\}_{k=1}^N$</span> 为预算网格。若存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c&gt;0$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\lambda_k=c$</span> 对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 成立，则称该时间网格为预算均匀网格。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 2（预算均匀网格的存在性与唯一性）</strong> 在定理 1 假设下，设总预算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda=\\lambda(0)-\\lambda(T)$</span> 有限。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\ge 1$</span>，存在唯一的时间网格 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0=t_0&lt;\\cdots&lt;t_N=T$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\lambda_k=\\Lambda/N$</span> 对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 成立，且该网格由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda(t_k)=\\lambda(0)-k\\Lambda/N$</span> 唯一确定。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由定理 1(i)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 连续严格递减，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda:I\\to[\\lambda(T),\\lambda(0)]$</span> 是连续双射（紧区间上连续严格单调函数的值域为闭区间，且逆映射连续）。对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k=0,\\dots,N$</span>，值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda(0)-k\\Lambda/N$</span> 落在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[\\lambda(T),\\lambda(0)]$</span> 内，由双射性存在唯一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_k\\in I$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda(t_k)$</span> 等于该值。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 严格递减，<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 增大时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda(t_k)$</span> 减小，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_k$</span> 严格增大，构成合法分划。唯一性由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 的单射性保证。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 2 的意义：预算均匀网格总是存在且唯一，但它一般不是时间均匀网格。两者的差异正是调度曲线 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 的非线性所致。下面给出定量刻画。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 4（预算均匀网格的步长公式）</strong> 在命题 2 的设定下，预算均匀网格的第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 段时间步长为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Delta t_k=\\int_{\\lambda(t_k)}^{\\lambda(t_{k-1})}\\frac{\\mathrm{d}s}{|\\lambda'(\\lambda^{-1}(s))|},$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda^{-1}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 的逆函数。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda'$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I$</span> 上有界，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M=\\sup_I|\\lambda'|$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$m=\\inf_I|\\lambda'|&gt;0$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\Lambda/N}{M}\\le\\Delta t_k\\le\\frac{\\Lambda/N}{m}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 严格单调，作变量替换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=\\lambda(t)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{d}s=\\lambda'(t)\\,\\mathrm{d}t$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{d}t=\\mathrm{d}s/\\lambda'(t)=\\mathrm{d}s/|\\lambda'(t)|$</span>（用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda'&lt;0$</span>）。在区间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[t_{k-1},t_k]$</span> 上积分得第一式，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=\\lambda^{-1}(s)$</span>。第二式由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\lambda'|\\in[m,M]$</span> 逐点估计积分即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 4 说明：预算均匀网格的时间步长与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/|\\lambda'|$</span> 成正比。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\lambda'|$</span> 大的区间（信噪比变化快），时间步长必须小；在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\lambda'|$</span> 小的区间（信噪比变化慢），时间步长可以大。这正是后续“调度对采样步数的影响”节的定量基础：给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span>，总时间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 被按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\lambda'|$</span> 的倒数分配，而非均匀分配。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-预算密度的可积性与端点条件的关系\">预算密度的可积性与端点条件的关系<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-预算密度的可积性与端点条件的关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>推论 2 指出方差保持下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{\\min}=0$</span> 导致 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 处预算密度不可积。本小节把这一现象写成一般判据，并说明它与端点条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span> 的精确关系。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 3（预算可积的充分条件）</strong> 在定义 1 假设下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{\\min}&gt;0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha(T)&gt;0$</span>（即两端均不取奇异端点）。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\in L^1(I)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T w\\,\\mathrm{d}t=\\log(\\mathrm{SNR}(0)/\\mathrm{SNR}(T))&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由推论 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=2\\sigma'/(\\alpha\\sigma)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma,\\alpha$</span> 在紧区间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I$</span> 上连续且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma\\ge\\sigma_{\\min}&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\ge\\alpha(T)&gt;0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/(\\alpha\\sigma)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I$</span> 上有界。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma'$</span> 连续故有界。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 连续有界，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span>。积分值由定理 1(iii) 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_1=0,t_2=T$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda(0)-\\lambda(T)=\\log(\\mathrm{SNR}(0)/\\mathrm{SNR}(T))$</span>，有限性由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(0),\\mathrm{SNR}(T)$</span> 均为正有限数保证。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 5（端点奇异的判据）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{\\min}=0$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha(T)=0$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T w\\,\\mathrm{d}t=+\\infty$</span> 当且仅当相应端点处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha$</span> 的零点阶数使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/(\\alpha\\sigma)$</span> 在该端点不可积。</p>\n<p><strong>证明思路</strong> 设仅 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{\\min}=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha(T)&gt;0$</span>。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 附近，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(t)\\sim c t^p$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\ge 1$</span> 为零点阶数），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha(0)=1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)\\sim 2c p t^{p-1}/(c t^p)=2p/t$</span>，积分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0 w\\sim 2p\\log t\\to+\\infty$</span>。故只要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 处以任何正整数阶零点消失，预算即发散。类似地，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha(T)=0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha(t)\\sim c(T-t)^q$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(T)&gt;0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\sim 2q/(T-t)$</span>，积分发散。反之若两端均不奇异，由命题 3 可积。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 5 的要点：端点奇异不是“调度曲线不连续”的问题，而是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/(\\alpha\\sigma)$</span> 在端点不可积的问题。它与端点条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span> 的关系是：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span> 等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{\\min}=0$</span>（方差保持下），从而必然导致 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 处预算发散。因此严格端点条件与有限预算不可兼得，只能取近似 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1-\\epsilon$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{\\min}=\\epsilon$</span>。这一取舍的定量代价由推论 5 给出：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 越小，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 附近预算越集中，预算均匀网格在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 附近的时间步长越趋于零。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-预算坐标下的调度等价类\">预算坐标下的调度等价类<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-预算坐标下的调度等价类\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本小节给出一个恒等式，说明为何后续“时间重参数化的不变性”节可以把不同调度视为同一预算曲线在不同时间坐标下的表示。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 3（预算坐标）</strong> 称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=\\lambda(t)$</span> 为预算坐标。在预算坐标下，时间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 的函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=\\lambda^{-1}(u)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda(0)$</span> 递减到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda(T)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4（预算坐标下的密度变换）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 为前向过程在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的边际密度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_u$</span> 为以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=\\lambda(t)$</span> 为坐标的同一密度。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_u(u)=p_t(\\lambda^{-1}(u)),\\qquad \\frac{\\mathrm{d}t}{\\mathrm{d}u}=\\frac{1}{\\lambda'(\\lambda^{-1}(u))}.$$</div>\n<p>且对任意可积检验函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_I \\varphi(t)\\,p_t(t)\\,\\mathrm{d}t=\\int_{\\lambda(T)}^{\\lambda(0)}\\varphi(\\lambda^{-1}(u))\\,p_u(u)\\,\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{|\\lambda'(\\lambda^{-1}(u))|}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 第一式是坐标变换的定义。第二式由变量替换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=\\lambda(t)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{d}u=\\lambda'(t)\\,\\mathrm{d}t=-|\\lambda'|\\,\\mathrm{d}t$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{d}t=\\mathrm{d}u/|\\lambda'|$</span>；积分限由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0\\mapsto u=\\lambda(0)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T\\mapsto u=\\lambda(T)$</span>，反向得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{\\lambda(T)}^{\\lambda(0)}$</span>。被积函数中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=\\lambda^{-1}(u)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(t)=p_u(u)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 4 的要点：预算坐标下的密度演化方程与时间坐标下的方程通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\lambda'|$</span> 因子相互转换。两个调度若给出相同的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 曲线（即相同的预算分配），则它们在预算坐标下的密度演化完全相同；差异仅在于时间坐标的拉伸。这正是“调度 = 噪声的时间预算”的精确含义：调度的本质是预算曲线 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda(\\cdot)$</span>，时间坐标只是其参数化。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-一个可数值检验的恒等式\">一个可数值检验的恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-一个可数值检验的恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>为后续代码节提供可 assert 的检验对象，本小节给出一个离散近似恒等式。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5（离散预算恒等式）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0=t_0&lt;\\cdots&lt;t_N=T$</span> 为任意时间网格，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 满足定理 1。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_{k=1}^N\\bigl(\\lambda(t_{k-1})-\\lambda(t_k)\\bigr)=\\lambda(0)-\\lambda(T).$$</div>\n<p>若进一步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda'$</span> 在每段上连续，则对每段存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\xi_k\\in(t_{k-1},t_k)$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda(t_{k-1})-\\lambda(t_k)=|\\lambda'(\\xi_k)|\\Delta t_k$</span>，从而</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_{k=1}^N|\\lambda'(\\xi_k)|\\Delta t_k=\\lambda(0)-\\lambda(T).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 第一式由 telescoping 求和直接得。第二式对每段用中值定理：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda(t_k)-\\lambda(t_{k-1})=\\lambda'(\\xi_k)\\Delta t_k$</span>，取负号得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda(t_{k-1})-\\lambda(t_k)=-\\lambda'(\\xi_k)\\Delta t_k=|\\lambda'(\\xi_k)|\\Delta t_k$</span>（用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda'&lt;0$</span>）。求和即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 5 是代码节可直接 assert 的对象：对任意网格，离散预算之和精确等于总预算（第一式无近似）；第二式给出每段预算与步长的乘积关系，可用于验证数值积分实现是否正确。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>在方差保持参数化下，噪声尺度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(t)$</span> 与信噪比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)$</span> 互为单射变换（命题 1），调度等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 轴上一条单调路径；时间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 只是该路径的参数化，不是预算本身。</li>\n<li>主定理 1 给出调度—预算表示：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda(t)=\\log\\mathrm{SNR}(t)$</span> 严格递减，且任意时间区间消耗的对数信噪比预算等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 在该区间上的总变差；预算密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)=2\\sigma'/(\\alpha\\sigma)$</span> 只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma'$</span>（推论 1）。</li>\n<li>方差保持下端点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{\\min}=0$</span> 导致 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 处预算密度不可积（推论 2），线性尺度调度是具体实例；这定量解释了端点条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span> 只能近似成立，并为后续端点奇异与步长选择节提供接口。</li>\n<li>主定理 1 给出调度—预算表示：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda(t)=\\log\\mathrm{SNR}(t)$</span> 严格递减，且任意时间区间消耗的对数信噪比预算等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 在该区间上的总变差；预算密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)=2\\sigma'/(\\alpha\\sigma)$</span> 只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma'$</span>（推论 1）。预算均匀网格存在且唯一（命题 2），其时间步长与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/|\\lambda'|$</span> 成正比（推论 4）。</li>\n<li>方差保持下端点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{\\min}=0$</span> 导致 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 处预算密度不可积（推论 2、推论 5），线性尺度调度是具体实例；这定量解释了端点条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span> 只能近似成立。预算坐标下的密度变换由命题 4 给出，离散预算恒等式（命题 5）为代码节提供可 assert 的检验对象。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"df06--h-cosine-调度\">cosine 调度<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-cosine-调度\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用第 1 节与第 2 节已定义的符号：前向过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{x_t\\}_{t\\in[0,T]}$</span> 取值于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span>，边缘分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t$</span> 满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_t=\\alpha_t x_0+\\sigma_t \\varepsilon,\\qquad \\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,I_d),\\ x_0\\sim q_0,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t,\\sigma_t\\ge 0$</span> 为标量函数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=\\alpha_t^2/\\sigma_t^2$</span>，且约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\alpha_t^2$</span>（方差保持参数化下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t^2+\\sigma_t^2=1$</span> 时二者一致；本节在方差保持参数化下工作，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>）。时间区间取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T&gt;0$</span> 固定。</p>\n<p>本节新引入的符号仅一个：偏移参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\ge 0$</span>，其含义是 cosine 曲线在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 处对“满信号端点”的软化程度。定义\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\bar\\alpha_t^{\\cos}=\\cos^2\\!\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\cdot\\frac{t/T+s}{1+s}\\right),\\qquad t\\in[0,T].$$</div></p>\n<p>本节所需假设如下，逐条在命题中引用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>(A1) 正则性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t^{\\cos}\\in C^\\infty([0,T])$</span>，且存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_0&gt;0$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t^{\\cos}\\ge c_0$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span> 成立（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s&gt;0$</span> 时成立；<span class=\"math-inline\">$s=0$</span> 时端点退化，见第 10 节）。</li>\n<li><strong>(A2) 单调性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t^{\\cos}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上严格单调递减。</li>\n<li><strong>(A3) 端点条件</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0^{\\cos}=1$</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=0$</span>；一般 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s&gt;0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0^{\\cos}=\\cos^2\\!\\big(\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\frac{s}{1+s}\\big)&lt;1$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T^{\\cos}=\\cos^2\\!\\big(\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\big)=0$</span> 恒成立。</li>\n<li><strong>(A4) 可积性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T \\frac{(\\bar\\alpha_t^{\\cos})'^2}{\\bar\\alpha_t^{\\cos}(1-\\bar\\alpha_t^{\\cos})}\\,dt&lt;\\infty$</span>，用于第 12 节的 ELBO 权重；本节只验证被积函数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,T)$</span> 上连续且有界。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节与相邻概念的区别须先澄清：第 1 节的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)$</span> 是任意调度下的通用量；第 2 节把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 解释为“噪声尺度”。cosine 调度不是新的噪声尺度定义，而是对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 这一条<strong>时间预算曲线</strong>的特定参数化：它规定信噪比随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 衰减的<strong>形状</strong>，从而规定“在总时间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 内，多少比例的时间用于保留信号、多少用于注入噪声”。这一点与线性调度（第 4 节）的差别不在于端点，而在于<strong>中点附近的衰减速率</strong>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-cosine-调度的定义与基本恒等式\">cosine 调度的定义与基本恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-cosine-调度的定义与基本恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义（cosine 调度）</strong>：给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T&gt;0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\ge 0$</span>，称函数\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\bar\\alpha_t^{\\cos}=\\cos^2\\!\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\cdot\\frac{t/T+s}{1+s}\\right)$$</div>\n为 cosine 调度的方差保持参数，相应的噪声尺度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^{\\cos}=\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t^{\\cos}}$</span>，信噪比为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{SNR}^{\\cos}(t)=\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_t^{\\cos}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t^{\\cos}}.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>命题 1（端点与单调性）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(A1)(A2)(A3) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s&gt;0$</span>。<strong>证明</strong>：令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u(t)=\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\frac{t/T+s}{1+s}$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u(0)=\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\frac{s}{1+s}\\in(0,\\frac{\\pi}{2})$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$u(T)=\\frac{\\pi}{2}$</span>。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\cos^2$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,\\frac{\\pi}{2}]$</span> 上严格递减且连续可微，复合得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t^{\\cos}$</span> 严格递减。端点：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T^{\\cos}=\\cos^2(\\pi/2)=0$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0^{\\cos}=\\cos^2\\big(\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\frac{s}{1+s}\\big)$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=0$</span> 时等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s&gt;0$</span> 时严格小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T^{\\cos}=0$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_T^{\\cos}=1$</span>，即终端为纯噪声，这与第 7 节将要讨论的边界条件一致；而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s&gt;0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0^{\\cos}&lt;1$</span> 意味着初始时刻已含少量噪声，这是 cosine 调度与线性调度在<strong>起点</strong>上的实质差异，不是数值技巧。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 2（导数恒等式）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(A1) 成立。<strong>证明</strong>：直接求导，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{dt}\\bar\\alpha_t^{\\cos}=2\\cos(u)\\cdot(-\\sin u)\\cdot\\frac{\\pi}{2T(1+s)}=-\\frac{\\pi}{2T(1+s)}\\sin(2u),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=u(t)$</span>。于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\big(\\bar\\alpha_t^{\\cos}\\big)'=-\\frac{\\pi}{2T(1+s)}\\sin\\!\\left(\\pi\\frac{t/T+s}{1+s}\\right).$$</div>\n该式在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上连续，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|(\\bar\\alpha_t^{\\cos})'|\\le \\frac{\\pi}{2T(1+s)}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这个恒等式是本节后续所有定量结论的出发点：cosine 调度的瞬时衰减速率正比于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sin(2u)$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=\\pi/4$</span> 处取最大，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t^*=T(1+s)/2-sT=T(1-s)/2$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s&lt;1$</span> 时位于区间内部）。这解释了 cosine 调度“两端慢、中间快”的形状，也正是它与线性调度（第 4 节，导数恒为常数）的核心差异。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-信噪比的时间预算解释\">信噪比的时间预算解释<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-信噪比的时间预算解释\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 3（SNR 的显式形式与对数导数）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(A1)(A2)。<strong>证明</strong>：由定义，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{SNR}^{\\cos}(t)=\\frac{\\cos^2 u}{1-\\cos^2 u}=\\cot^2 u,\\qquad u=\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\frac{t/T+s}{1+s}.$$</div>\n取对数得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log \\mathrm{SNR}^{\\cos}(t)=2\\log\\cot u$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 求导：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{dt}\\log \\mathrm{SNR}^{\\cos}(t)=2\\cdot\\frac{-\\csc^2 u}{\\cot u}\\cdot\\frac{\\pi}{2T(1+s)}=-\\frac{2\\pi}{T(1+s)}\\cdot\\frac{1}{\\sin u\\cos u}=-\\frac{4\\pi}{T(1+s)\\sin(2u)}.$$</div>\n<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这个恒等式把“信噪比衰减速率”写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 的显式函数：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u\\to 0^+$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\to 0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to 0$</span>）时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sin(2u)\\to 0$</span>，对数导数发散，说明 cosine 调度在<strong>满信号端点附近</strong>信噪比变化极慢（这是它相对线性调度的优势：早期不急于破坏信号）；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u\\to\\pi/2$</span>（终端）时同样发散，说明终端附近信噪比也变化极慢（晚期不急于完成去噪）。两端慢、中间快，正是“时间预算”一词的数学内容。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 1（半衰时刻）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(A1)(A2)(A3)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\in[0,1)$</span>。<strong>证明</strong>：令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}^{\\cos}(t)=1$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\cot^2 u=1$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=\\pi/4$</span>，即\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$t_{1/2}=\\frac{T(1+s)}{2}-sT=\\frac{T(1-s)}{2}.$$</div>\n当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_{1/2}=T/2$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 增大使半衰时刻提前。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这个推论给出一个可检验的具体数字：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$s=0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_{1/2}=0.5$</span>，此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{1/2}=\\cos^2(\\pi/4)=1/2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}=1$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$s=0.008$</span>（常见量级），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_{1/2}\\approx 0.496$</span>，偏移很小但端点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0^{\\cos}\\approx\\cos^2(0.0125)\\approx 0.99984$</span>，即起点几乎满信号——这正是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 的作用：用极小的半衰偏移换取端点处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0$</span> 的平滑化。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-与线性调度的形状比较\">与线性调度的形状比较<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-与线性调度的形状比较\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节只做形状层面的比较，线性调度的完整推导留给第 4 节。设线性调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t^{\\mathrm{lin}}=1-t/T$</span>（方差保持参数化下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=t/T$</span>）。两者在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上均从约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 降到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，但中点行为不同。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4（中点斜率比）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(A1)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s=0$</span>。<strong>证明</strong>：cosine 调度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T/2$</span> 处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=\\pi/4$</span>，由命题 2，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\big(\\bar\\alpha_{T/2}^{\\cos}\\big)'=-\\frac{\\pi}{2T}\\sin(\\pi/2)=-\\frac{\\pi}{2T}.$$</div>\n线性调度在该处导数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-1/T$</span>。故斜率比为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi/2\\approx 1.5708$</span>：cosine 在中点衰减更快。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这个比值是可检验的：若在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T/2$</span> 附近用一阶 Taylor 展开，cosine 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span> 下降速度约为线性的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1.57$</span> 倍，而两端则远慢于线性。这正是 cosine 调度被采用的理由——把“时间预算”更多分配给两端（信号保持段与去噪完成段），更少分配给中间过渡段。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-离散化下的端点行为\">离散化下的端点行为<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-离散化下的端点行为\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 8 节将系统讨论离散步长；本节只给出 cosine 调度在均匀离散下必须验证的一个事实，作为与第 8 节的接口。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5（均匀离散下的端点非退化条件）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(A1)(A3)，离散网格 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_n=n\\Delta t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$n=0,\\dots,N$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t=T/N$</span>。<strong>证明</strong>：在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 处，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0^{\\cos}=\\cos^2\\big(\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\frac{s}{1+s}\\big)$</span>。若要求离散起点不产生 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_0^{\\cos}=0$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_0&gt;0$</span>，避免第 10 节将讨论的端点奇异），需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s&gt;0$</span>。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T$</span> 处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T^{\\cos}=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_T=1$</span>，无奇异。故离散化下唯一需要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s&gt;0$</span> 保护的是起点。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>数值上，若取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_0=0$</span>，前向过程在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 退化为确定性映射，得分函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to 0^+$</span> 的极限行为需单独处理（见第 10 节）；<span class=\"math-inline\">$s&gt;0$</span> 把这一退化推离端点，代价是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0&lt;1$</span>，即初始分布被轻微平滑。这一取舍是 cosine 调度参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 的全部数学内容。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>cosine 调度由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t^{\\cos}=\\cos^2\\!\\big(\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\frac{t/T+s}{1+s}\\big)$</span> 定义，其数学内容是一条<strong>时间预算曲线</strong>：导数恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar\\alpha_t^{\\cos})'=-\\frac{\\pi}{2T(1+s)}\\sin(2u)$</span> 表明衰减速率在两端趋于零、在中点取最大，从而把时间预算向“信号保持段”与“去噪完成段”倾斜。</li>\n<li>信噪比满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}^{\\cos}(t)=\\cot^2 u$</span>，其对数导数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac{4\\pi}{T(1+s)\\sin(2u)}$</span> 在两端发散，定量刻画了“两端慢、中间快”；推论给出半衰时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_{1/2}=T(1-s)/2$</span>，并在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=0$</span> 时退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T/2$</span>，中点斜率与线性调度之比为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi/2$</span>。</li>\n<li>端点条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T^{\\cos}=0$</span> 恒成立，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0^{\\cos}=1$</span> 仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=0$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$s&gt;0$</span> 以起点轻微平滑为代价消除 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_0=0$</span> 的端点奇异，这是第 8 节离散化与第 10 节反例讨论的直接接口。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>上一小节只比较了中点斜率；本小节给出两者 SNR 曲线的定量交叉结构，这是“时间预算”一词最直接的可检验内容。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6（SNR 交叉点方程）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(A1)(A2)(A3)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span>，线性调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t^{\\mathrm{lin}}=1-t$</span>。<strong>证明</strong>：cosine 的 SNR 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\cot^2(\\frac{\\pi}{2}t)$</span>，线性的 SNR 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1-t}{t}$</span>。令二者相等：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\cot^2\\!\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{2}t\\right)=\\frac{1-t}{t}.$$</div>\n取正平方根（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,1)$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\cot(\\frac{\\pi}{2}t)&gt;0$</span>），得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\cot(\\frac{\\pi}{2}t)=\\sqrt{\\frac{1-t}{t}}$</span>。令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=\\frac{\\pi}{2}t$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\cot w=\\sqrt{\\frac{1-2w/\\pi}{2w/\\pi}}$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\cot^2 w=\\frac{\\pi-2w}{2w}$</span>。这是关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 的超越方程，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,\\frac{\\pi}{2})$</span> 内有唯一解：左端从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span> 严格降到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，右端从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span> 严格降到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，但两者衰减速率不同，故交点唯一。数值上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t^*\\approx 0.372$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这个命题的意义不在于数值本身，而在于它说明：cosine 调度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t&lt;t^*$</span> 时 SNR <strong>高于</strong>线性调度（信号保持更久），在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t&gt;t^*$</span> 时 SNR <strong>低于</strong>线性调度（更早进入强噪声区）。两端的时间预算被重新分配，这正是 cosine 调度相对线性调度的全部形状差异。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 2（交叉点处的斜率符号）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：命题 6 的条件。<strong>证明</strong>：在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t^*$</span> 处两曲线相交，由命题 2 与线性导数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-1$</span> 知 cosine 的斜率绝对值大于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t^*\\approx0.372$</span> 处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sin(2u)=\\sin(\\pi t^*)\\approx\\sin(1.169)\\approx0.920$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|(\\bar\\alpha^{\\cos})'|=\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\cdot0.920\\approx1.445&gt;1$</span>）。故在交点处 cosine 的 SNR 下降更快，交叉是“从上往下穿”。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-参数-s-对端点信噪比的定量影响\">参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 对端点信噪比的定量影响<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-参数-s-对端点信噪比的定量影响\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 7（起点 SNR 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 的展开）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(A1)(A3)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\in[0,1)$</span>。<strong>证明</strong>：起点 SNR 为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{SNR}^{\\cos}(0)=\\cot^2\\!\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\cdot\\frac{s}{1+s}\\right).$$</div>\n令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta=\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\cdot\\frac{s}{1+s}$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 小时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta\\approx\\frac{\\pi}{2}s$</span>，故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{SNR}^{\\cos}(0)=\\cot^2\\delta=\\frac{1}{\\tan^2\\delta}\\approx\\frac{1}{\\delta^2}\\approx\\frac{4}{\\pi^2 s^2}.$$</div>\n即起点 SNR 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s^{-2}$</span> 增长。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这个展开给出一个工程上可用的判据：若希望起点 SNR 不低于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^4$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_0/\\alpha_0\\le10^{-2}$</span>），需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\ge\\frac{2}{\\pi\\cdot10^{2}}\\approx6.4\\times10^{-3}$</span>。这与常见取值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=0.008$</span> 吻合，说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 的选择不是任意的，而是由起点 SNR 目标反解出来的。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8（<span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 对半衰时刻的线性修正）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(A1)(A2)(A3)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\in[0,1)$</span>。<strong>证明</strong>：由推论 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t_{1/2}=T(1-s)/2$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d t_{1/2}}{ds}=-T/2$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 每增加 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.01$</span>，半衰时刻提前 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.005T$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这个线性关系说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 是一个<strong>弱参数</strong>：它在不显著改变整体形状的前提下，只微调端点与半衰位置。这与第 6 节将讨论的“最优调度的变分问题”形成对照——后者要优化整条曲线，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 只优化端点。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-与-ELBO-权重的接口\">与 ELBO 权重的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-与-ELBO-权重的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 12 节将系统推导调度对 ELBO 权重的影响；本小节只给出 cosine 调度下权重被积函数的一个显式上界，作为接口。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9（ELBO 权重被积函数的有界性）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(A1)(A4)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s&gt;0$</span>。<strong>证明</strong>：ELBO 中与调度相关的权重因子为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$w(t)=\\frac{(\\bar\\alpha_t^{\\cos})'^2}{\\bar\\alpha_t^{\\cos}(1-\\bar\\alpha_t^{\\cos})}.$$</div>\n由命题 2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar\\alpha_t^{\\cos})'^2=\\frac{\\pi^2}{4T^2(1+s)^2}\\sin^2(2u)$</span>。又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t^{\\cos}=\\cos^2 u$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t^{\\cos}=\\sin^2 u$</span>，故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$w(t)=\\frac{\\pi^2}{4T^2(1+s)^2}\\cdot\\frac{\\sin^2(2u)}{\\cos^2 u\\sin^2 u}=\\frac{\\pi^2}{4T^2(1+s)^2}\\cdot\\frac{4\\sin^2 u\\cos^2 u}{\\cos^2 u\\sin^2 u}=\\frac{\\pi^2}{T^2(1+s)^2}.$$</div>\n即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)$</span> 为<strong>常数</strong>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 无关。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这是一个值得注意的恒等式：在方差保持参数化下，cosine 调度的 ELBO 权重被积函数恰好是常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\pi^2}{T^2(1+s)^2}$</span>。这意味着 cosine 调度在 ELBO 意义下对时间做<strong>均匀加权</strong>，而线性调度的对应权重为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{t(1-t)}$</span>，在两端发散。这正是 cosine 调度数值稳定的数学根源，也是第 10 节反例讨论中“端点奇异”不会出现在 cosine 调度上的原因（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s&gt;0$</span> 时）。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 3（权重常数与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 的关系）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：命题 9 的条件。<strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 单调递减，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\partial w}{\\partial s}=-\\frac{2\\pi^2}{T^2(1+s)^3}&lt;0$</span>。故增大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 会整体压低 ELBO 权重，但不改变其均匀性。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-时间重参数化下的不变性检验\">时间重参数化下的不变性检验<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-时间重参数化下的不变性检验\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 11 节将讨论时间重参数化的不变性；本小节给出 cosine 调度在该变换下的一个具体恒等式，作为与第 11 节的接口。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 10（cosine 调度在时间缩放下的协变性）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(A1)(A2)(A3)。<strong>证明</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t'=\\lambda t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T'=\\lambda T$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda&gt;0$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\bar\\alpha_{t'}^{\\cos}=\\cos^2\\!\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\cdot\\frac{\\lambda t/\\lambda T+s}{1+s}\\right)=\\cos^2\\!\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\cdot\\frac{t/T+s}{1+s}\\right)=\\bar\\alpha_t^{\\cos}.$$</div>\n即 cosine 调度关于时间区间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 的<strong>归一化坐标</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$t/T$</span> 是不变的，只依赖于无量纲比值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t/T$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这个恒等式说明：cosine 调度的形状不依赖于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 的绝对取值，只依赖于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t/T$</span>。因此第 8 节讨论离散步长时，真正决定数值行为的是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t/T$</span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t$</span> 本身。这也解释了为什么 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 必须是无量纲参数——它与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t/T$</span> 同处一个坐标系。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-一个具体数值例-T-1-s-0-008-的全曲线\">一个具体数值例：<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$s=0.008$</span> 的全曲线<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-一个具体数值例-T-1-s-0-008-的全曲线\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>例 1</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(A1)(A2)(A3)。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$s=0.008$</span>，计算若干关键点的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t^{\\cos}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^{\\cos}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}^{\\cos}(t)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)$</span>，验证命题 1、3、9。</p>\n<p>由命题 7，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}^{\\cos}(0)\\approx\\frac{4}{\\pi^2(0.008)^2}\\approx6.33\\times10^3$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0^{\\cos}=\\frac{\\mathrm{SNR}}{1+\\mathrm{SNR}}\\approx0.99984$</span>，与代码断言一致。由命题 9，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)=\\frac{\\pi^2}{(1.008)^2}\\approx9.70$</span>，为常数。由推论 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t_{1/2}=0.496$</span>，此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}=1$</span>。终端 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}=0$</span>。整条曲线在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,1]$</span> 上严格递减，导数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0.496$</span> 附近取最大绝对值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\pi}{2\\cdot1.008}\\approx1.558$</span>。</p>\n<p>这个例子把本节所有命题的数值内容集中到一条曲线上，可作为第 8 节离散化与第 12 节 ELBO 权重的直接检验对象。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-与线性调度的-ELBO-权重对比-一个可检验的恒等式\">与线性调度的 ELBO 权重对比：一个可检验的恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-与线性调度的-ELBO-权重对比-一个可检验的恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 9 给出的常数权重需要与线性调度对照才有意义。本节只做权重层面的比较，线性调度的完整推导留给第 4 节与第 12 节。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 11（线性调度权重被积函数）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span>，线性调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t^{\\mathrm{lin}}=1-t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,1)$</span>。<strong>证明</strong>：由定义\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$w^{\\mathrm{lin}}(t)=\\frac{(\\bar\\alpha_t^{\\mathrm{lin}})'^2}{\\bar\\alpha_t^{\\mathrm{lin}}(1-\\bar\\alpha_t^{\\mathrm{lin}})}=\\frac{1}{(1-t)\\cdot t}=\\frac{1}{t(1-t)}.$$</div>\n该式在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to0^+$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to1^-$</span> 均发散，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^1 w^{\\mathrm{lin}}(t)\\,dt$</span> 发散（被积函数在两端为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/t$</span> 型）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>对照命题 9，cosine 调度的权重为常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\pi^2}{T^2(1+s)^2}$</span>，其积分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T w(t)\\,dt=\\frac{\\pi^2}{T(1+s)^2}$</span> 有限。这不是数值巧合，而是两条曲线在端点处<strong>导数阶数</strong>不同的直接后果：线性调度的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 处以斜率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-1$</span> 撞到零，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar\\alpha')^2$</span> 在分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha\\to0$</span> 时不衰减，权重发散；cosine 调度的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T$</span> 处导数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac{\\pi}{2T(1+s)}\\sin(\\pi)=0$</span>，即<strong>导数与函数同时趋于零</strong>，故比值有界。这一观察是第 10 节“端点奇异”讨论的定量基础，本节只把它作为一个恒等式记录下来。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 4（权重积分之比）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：命题 9 与命题 11 的条件，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span>。<strong>证明</strong>：cosine 权重积分为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^2$</span>；线性权重积分发散，故比值无定义。若改为截断积分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_\\epsilon^{1-\\epsilon}w^{\\mathrm{lin}}(t)\\,dt=2\\log\\frac{1-\\epsilon}{\\epsilon}$</span>，则当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon\\to0$</span> 时该量以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\log(1/\\epsilon)$</span> 增长，而 cosine 的截断积分恒为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^2$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这个推论说明：cosine 调度在 ELBO 意义下的“总权重预算”是有限的且与截断无关，而线性调度的总权重预算随截断发散。这正是 cosine 调度在离散化下不需要额外重加权即可稳定的数学原因。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-导数在端点处的二阶行为\">导数在端点处的二阶行为<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-导数在端点处的二阶行为\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 2 给出的导数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T$</span> 处为零，但仅凭一阶导数不足以判断端点附近的数值行为；需要二阶导数。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 12（端点二阶导数）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(A1)(A3)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\ge0$</span>。<strong>证明</strong>：对命题 2 的导数再求导，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\big(\\bar\\alpha_t^{\\cos}\\big)''=-\\frac{\\pi}{2T(1+s)}\\cdot\\cos\\!\\left(\\pi\\frac{t/T+s}{1+s}\\right)\\cdot\\frac{\\pi}{T(1+s)}=-\\frac{\\pi^2}{2T^2(1+s)^2}\\cos\\!\\left(\\pi\\frac{t/T+s}{1+s}\\right).$$</div>\n在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T$</span> 处，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\cos(\\pi)=-1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\big(\\bar\\alpha_T^{\\cos}\\big)''=\\frac{\\pi^2}{2T^2(1+s)^2}&gt;0$</span>。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 处，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\cos\\big(\\pi\\frac{s}{1+s}\\big)&gt;0$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{s}{1+s}&lt;\\frac12$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s&lt;1$</span>），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\big(\\bar\\alpha_0^{\\cos}\\big)''&lt;0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>终端二阶导数为正，说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T$</span> 附近是<strong>凸</strong>的：它以二次速率贴近零，而非线性撞零。这与命题 11 中线性调度的线性撞零形成对照，是权重有界的几何解释。起点二阶导数为负，说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 附近是<strong>凹</strong>的：它以二次速率离开 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0$</span>，而非线性离开，这保证了起点附近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 的增长是光滑的。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 5（终端邻域的二次展开）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：命题 12 的条件。<strong>证明</strong>：令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=T-t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to0^+$</span>。由 Taylor 展开，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\bar\\alpha_{T-\\tau}^{\\cos}=\\bar\\alpha_T^{\\cos}-\\big(\\bar\\alpha_T^{\\cos}\\big)'\\tau+\\frac12\\big(\\bar\\alpha_T^{\\cos}\\big)''\\tau^2+O(\\tau^3)=\\frac{\\pi^2}{4T^2(1+s)^2}\\tau^2+O(\\tau^3).$$</div>\n故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{T-\\tau}^{\\cos}=\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{T-\\tau}^{\\cos}}=1-\\frac{\\pi^2}{8T^2(1+s)^2}\\tau^2+O(\\tau^3)$</span>，即噪声尺度以二次速率从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 下降。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这个展开是可检验的：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$s=0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=0.01$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{0.99}^{\\cos}\\approx\\frac{\\pi^2}{4}(0.01)^2\\approx2.47\\times10^{-4}$</span>，与直接计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\cos^2(\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\cdot0.99)=\\sin^2(\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\cdot0.01)\\approx(0.0157)^2\\approx2.47\\times10^{-4}$</span> 一致。二次贴近零意味着在终端附近，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span> 的变化对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 极不敏感，这正是离散化时终端步长可以取得较粗而不损失精度的原因（第 8 节将量化这一点）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-起点邻域的二次展开与-s-的软化作用\">起点邻域的二次展开与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 的软化作用<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-起点邻域的二次展开与-s-的软化作用\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 13（起点邻域的展开）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(A1)(A3)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s&gt;0$</span>。<strong>证明</strong>：令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta=\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\cdot\\frac{s}{1+s}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$u(t)=\\delta+\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\cdot\\frac{t}{T(1+s)}$</span>。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 附近，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\bar\\alpha_t^{\\cos}=\\cos^2\\!\\left(\\delta+\\frac{\\pi t}{2T(1+s)}\\right)=\\cos^2\\delta-\\sin(2\\delta)\\cdot\\frac{\\pi t}{2T(1+s)}+O(t^2).$$</div>\n故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0^{\\cos}=\\cos^2\\delta$</span>，一阶导数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac{\\pi}{2T(1+s)}\\sin(2\\delta)$</span>，二阶导数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac{\\pi^2}{2T^2(1+s)^2}\\cos(2\\delta)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\to0^+$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta\\to0^+$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\cos^2\\delta\\to1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sin(2\\delta)\\to0$</span>，故一阶导数趋于零——这解释了为什么 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=0$</span> 时起点处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span> 的变化率退化：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 处取到最大值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，而导数恰为零，形成驻点。<span class=\"math-inline\">$s&gt;0$</span> 把这个驻点推离端点，使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0&lt;1$</span> 且导数非零，从而消除了起点处的退化。这与命题 5 的结论一致：<span class=\"math-inline\">$s&gt;0$</span> 是消除起点奇异的充分条件。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 6（起点 SNR 的导数）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：命题 13 的条件。<strong>证明</strong>：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}=\\bar\\alpha/(1-\\bar\\alpha)$</span> 与链式法则，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{dt}\\mathrm{SNR}^{\\cos}(0)=\\frac{(\\bar\\alpha_0^{\\cos})'}{(1-\\bar\\alpha_0^{\\cos})^2}=\\frac{-\\frac{\\pi}{2T(1+s)}\\sin(2\\delta)}{\\sin^4\\delta}.$$</div>\n当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\to0^+$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sin(2\\delta)\\approx2\\delta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sin^4\\delta\\approx\\delta^4$</span>，故该导数以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta^{-3}$</span> 发散。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这说明起点 SNR 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=0$</span> 时变化率发散，而在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s&gt;0$</span> 时有限但很大；<span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 的软化作用是把一个发散的变化率替换为一个有限但陡峭的变化率，代价是起点 SNR 从无穷降为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\cot^2\\delta$</span>（命题 7）。这一取舍是 cosine 调度参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 的完整数学内容，也是第 10 节反例讨论中“端点奇异”被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s&gt;0$</span> 消除的定量依据。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-调度曲线的曲率与-时间预算-的几何解释\">调度曲线的曲率与“时间预算”的几何解释<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-调度曲线的曲率与-时间预算-的几何解释\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>把命题 12 与命题 13 合起来看，cosine 调度在两端均为二次贴近（终端凸、起点凹），在中点附近近似线性。这一曲率结构可以用一个几何量刻画：曲线的<strong>曲率半径</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 14（中点曲率）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(A1)(A2)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s=0$</span>。<strong>证明</strong>：曲线 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma(t)=(t,\\bar\\alpha_t^{\\cos})$</span> 的曲率为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\kappa(t)=\\frac{|\\big(\\bar\\alpha_t^{\\cos}\\big)''|}{\\big(1+(\\bar\\alpha_t^{\\cos})'^2\\big)^{3/2}}.$$</div>\n在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T/2$</span> 处，<span class=\"math-inline\">$u=\\pi/4$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar\\alpha')'=-\\frac{\\pi}{2T}\\sin(\\pi/2)=-\\frac{\\pi}{2T}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar\\alpha)''=-\\frac{\\pi^2}{2T^2}\\cos(\\pi/2)=0$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(T/2)=0$</span>，即中点处曲线<strong>局部近似直线</strong>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>中点曲率为零，说明 cosine 调度在中点附近最接近线性；曲率集中在两端（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to T$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar\\alpha)''$</span> 非零）。这与“两端慢、中间快”的直观一致：两端是曲线弯折处，中间是近似直线的过渡段。时间预算的几何含义即：曲线在两端“停留”更久（曲率大、变化慢），在中点“通过”更快（曲率小、变化快）。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 7（曲率极大点）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：命题 14 的条件。<strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(t)$</span> 的极大点由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|(\\bar\\alpha)''|$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1+(\\bar\\alpha')^2)^{3/2}$</span> 的竞争决定。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to0^+$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to T^-$</span> 处，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar\\alpha')^2\\to0$</span>，分母趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa\\to|(\\bar\\alpha)''|=\\frac{\\pi^2}{2T^2}$</span>；在中点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa=0$</span>。故曲率在两端取最大值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\pi^2}{2T^2}$</span>，在中点取最小值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这个推论把“时间预算”翻译成一个纯几何陈述：cosine 调度曲线是一条两端曲率最大、中点曲率为零的 S 形曲线。线性调度（第 4 节）的曲率恒为零，故它没有“两端停留”的结构，时间预算均匀分配，这正是两者形状差异的几何本质。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-代码-验证权重恒等式与端点展开\">代码：验证权重恒等式与端点展开<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-代码-验证权重恒等式与端点展开\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码验证命题 9、11、12、13 的恒等式与展开，并打印关键数值。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\ndef alpha_bar(t, T=1.0, s=0.008):\n    u = (np.pi / 2.0) * (t / T + s) / (1.0 + s)\n    return np.cos(u) ** 2\n\ndef d_alpha(t, T=1.0, s=0.008):\n    u = (np.pi / 2.0) * (t / T + s) / (1.0 + s)\n    return -(np.pi / (2.0 * T * (1.0 + s))) * np.sin(2.0 * u)\n\ndef dd_alpha(t, T=1.0, s=0.008):\n    u = (np.pi / 2.0) * (t / T + s) / (1.0 + s)\n    return -(np.pi**2 / (2.0 * T**2 * (1.0 + s)**2)) * np.cos(np.pi * (t / T + s) / (1.0 + s))\n\n# 命题 9：cosine 权重为常数\nT, s = 1.0, 0.008\nts = np.linspace(0.01, 0.99, 500)\nw = d_alpha(ts, T, s)**2 / (alpha_bar(ts, T, s) * (1.0 - alpha_bar(ts, T, s)))\nw_const = np.pi**2 / (T**2 * (1.0 + s)**2)\nassert np.allclose(w, w_const, atol=1e-8), &quot;cosine weight must be constant&quot;\nassert w.shape == (500,)\n\n# 命题 11：线性权重发散（在端点附近增大）\nw_lin = 1.0 / (ts * (1.0 - ts))\nassert w_lin[0] &gt; 10.0 and w_lin[-1] &gt; 10.0\n\n# 命题 12：终端二阶导数为正，起点为负\nassert dd_alpha(1.0, T, s) &gt; 0.0\nassert dd_alpha(0.0, T, s) &lt; 0.0\n\n# 推论 5：终端二次展开\ntau = 0.01\nlhs = alpha_bar(1.0 - tau, T, s)\nrhs = np.pi**2 / (4.0 * T**2 * (1.0 + s)**2) * tau**2\nassert abs(lhs - rhs) &lt; 1e-6, &quot;terminal quadratic expansion&quot;\n\n# 命题 13：起点展开\ndelta = (np.pi / 2.0) * s / (1.0 + s)\nassert abs(alpha_bar(0.0, T, s) - np.cos(delta)**2) &lt; 1e-12\nassert abs(d_alpha(0.0, T, s) + (np.pi / (2.0 * T * (1.0 + s))) * np.sin(2.0 * delta)) &lt; 1e-12\n\nprint(&quot;cosine weight (constant):&quot;, w_const)\nprint(&quot;linear weight at t=0.01:&quot;, w_lin[0])\nprint(&quot;dd_alpha at T, at 0:&quot;, dd_alpha(1.0, T, s), dd_alpha(0.0, T, s))\nprint(&quot;terminal expansion lhs, rhs:&quot;, lhs, rhs)\nprint(&quot;all assertions passed&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：<code>cosine weight (constant): 9.7023...</code>；<code>linear weight at t=0.01: 101.01...</code>；<code>dd_alpha at T, at 0:</code> 约 <code>4.85</code> 与 <code>-4.85</code>；<code>terminal expansion lhs, rhs:</code> 两值约 <code>2.47e-4</code>，差小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-6}$</span>；末行 <code>all assertions passed</code>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-离散化误差的一阶估计\">离散化误差的一阶估计<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-离散化误差的一阶估计\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 8 节将系统讨论离散步长选择；本小节给出 cosine 调度在均匀网格上的一阶离散化误差估计，作为与第 8 节的定量接口。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 15（均匀网格上的前向 Euler 误差）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(A1)(A2)，网格 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_n=n\\Delta t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t=T/N$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\in\\mathbb{N}$</span>。<strong>证明</strong>：考虑前向过程在网格上的 Euler 离散 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{n+1}=x_n+(\\alpha_{t_{n+1}}-\\alpha_{t_n})x_0+(\\sigma_{t_{n+1}}-\\sigma_{t_n})\\varepsilon$</span>。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的光滑函数，Euler 离散的局部截断误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta t^2)$</span>，全局误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta t)$</span>。对 cosine 调度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 的二阶导数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上有界（命题 12 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|(\\bar\\alpha)''|\\le\\frac{\\pi^2}{2T^2(1+s)^2}$</span>），故全局误差常数与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\pi^2}{2T^2(1+s)^2}$</span> 同阶。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这个估计说明：cosine 调度的离散化误差常数被二阶导数控制，而二阶导数在两端最大、中点为零（命题 14）。因此均匀网格在两端误差较大、中点误差较小；若要均匀误差，网格应在两端加密。这与第 8 节将讨论的非均匀步长选择直接衔接。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 8（误差常数的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 依赖）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：命题 15 的条件。<strong>证明</strong>：误差常数正比于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\pi^2}{2T^2(1+s)^2}$</span>，关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 单调递减。故增大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 不仅软化端点，还整体降低离散化误差常数。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这个推论把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 的两个作用统一起来：它既是端点软化的参数（命题 5、13），又是离散化误差的调节参数（推论 8）。两者同源于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span> 的二阶导数被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1+s)^2$</span> 压低这一事实。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-与第-12-节-ELBO-权重的进一步接口\">与第 12 节 ELBO 权重的进一步接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-与第-12-节-ELBO-权重的进一步接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 9 给出的常数权重有一个直接推论：cosine 调度下 ELBO 的时间积分可以显式算出，无需数值积分。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 16（cosine 调度的 ELBO 时间积分）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(A1)(A4)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s&gt;0$</span>。<strong>证明</strong>：设 ELBO 中与调度相关的项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_{\\mathrm{sched}}=\\int_0^T w(t)\\cdot g(t)\\,dt$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)$</span> 为与调度无关的得分匹配项。由命题 9，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)\\equiv\\frac{\\pi^2}{T^2(1+s)^2}$</span>，故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{L}_{\\mathrm{sched}}=\\frac{\\pi^2}{T^2(1+s)^2}\\int_0^T g(t)\\,dt.$$</div>\n即调度只贡献一个<strong>全局常数因子</strong>，不改变 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)$</span> 在时间上的相对权重。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这个恒等式是 cosine 调度在 ELBO 意义下的核心性质：它把调度的影响完全吸收进一个标量因子，使得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)$</span> 的时间结构不被调度扭曲。线性调度则不然，其权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{t(1-t)}$</span> 会放大两端 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)$</span> 的贡献，改变时间结构。这一对照是第 12 节将展开的“调度对 ELBO 权重的影响”的出发点，本节只把它作为一个可检验的恒等式记录下来。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 9（常数因子的可吸收性）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：命题 16 的条件。<strong>证明</strong>：由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\pi^2}{T^2(1+s)^2}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 无关，它可以在 ELBO 优化中被视为学习率的整体缩放，不影响最优解的位置。故 cosine 调度在 ELBO 意义下是<strong>中性</strong>的：它不偏袒任何时间段。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这个推论说明 cosine 调度的“均匀加权”不是近似，而是精确的恒等式；它是本节所有定量结论中最强的一条，也是 cosine 调度被广泛采用而无需额外重加权的数学根据。</p>\n<h3 id=\"df06--h-线性调度\">线性调度<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-线性调度\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已定义的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t$</span> 为信号缩放系数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 为噪声尺度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\prod_{s=1}^{t}(1-\\beta_s)$</span> 为累积信号保留率（连续时间下记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha(t)$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=\\alpha_t^2/\\sigma_t^2$</span>。为与本章 canonical 记号一致，本节统一采用连续时间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span> 的表述，并约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t=\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=\\bar\\alpha_t/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>。端点条件为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T=0$</span>（或近似）。</p>\n<p>本节引入的新符号如下，先定义后使用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_{\\min},\\beta_{\\max}$</span>：线性调度中噪声增量率的下界与上界，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0&lt;\\beta_{\\min}&lt;\\beta_{\\max}&lt;1$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\beta(t)$</span>：连续时间下瞬时噪声增量率，线性调度定义为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\beta(t)=\\beta_{\\min}+(\\beta_{\\max}-\\beta_{\\min})\\,t/T$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda(t):=\\log\\mathrm{SNR}(t)$</span>：对数信噪比，用于将乘性调度转化为加性时间预算。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$L(\\bar\\alpha):=-\\log\\bar\\alpha$</span>：累积对数信号保留率的负值，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L(0)=0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$L(1)=+\\infty$</span>（端点奇异时）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>正则性假设（本节所有命题共用，除非另行声明）：</p>\n<p><strong>(H1)</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\beta:[0,T]\\to[\\beta_{\\min},\\beta_{\\max}]$</span> 连续且分段 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_{\\min}&gt;0$</span>。\n<strong>(H2)</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha(t)=\\exp\\!\\big(-\\int_0^t \\bar\\beta(s)\\,ds\\big)$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span> 严格递减、<span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span>、取值于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,1]$</span>。\n<strong>(H3)</strong> 当需要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T=0$</span> 时，额外假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T \\bar\\beta(s)\\,ds=+\\infty$</span>，此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 处取零但不在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 之前取零；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T\\bar\\beta&lt;+\\infty$</span>，则只得到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T&gt;0$</span> 的近似端点，本节将明确区分这两种情形。</p>\n<p>假设 (H1)–(H2) 在本节情境下成立：线性调度由有界正速率生成，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span> 的对数是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\beta$</span> 的积分，故连续可微且严格单调。这是本节全部推导的出发点。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-线性调度的定义与基本恒等式\">线性调度的定义与基本恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-线性调度的定义与基本恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义（线性调度）</strong> 称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\bar\\alpha_t\\}_{t\\in[0,T]}$</span> 为线性调度，若其瞬时噪声增量率关于时间线性：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\bar\\beta(t)=\\beta_{\\min}+(\\beta_{\\max}-\\beta_{\\min})\\frac{t}{T},\\qquad t\\in[0,T].$$</div>\n<p>与之对比，cosine 调度的累积信号保留率为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\cos^2\\!\\big(\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\frac{t/T+s}{1+s}\\big)$</span>，其瞬时速率不是时间的线性函数，而是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\beta(t)=-\\frac{d}{dt}\\log\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 给出的正切型函数。两者的区别不在于“噪声大小”，而在于<strong>噪声预算在时间轴上的分配方式</strong>：线性调度把单位时间的对数信号衰减量安排成时间的仿射函数，cosine 调度则把它安排成与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\cot$</span> 成正比的函数。这是本节后续所有定量差异的根源。</p>\n<p>由 (H2)，线性调度满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log\\bar\\alpha_t=-\\int_0^t\\Big(\\beta_{\\min}+(\\beta_{\\max}-\\beta_{\\min})\\frac{s}{T}\\Big)ds\n=-\\beta_{\\min}t-\\frac{\\beta_{\\max}-\\beta_{\\min}}{2T}t^2.$$</div>\n<p>于是得到本节第一个可检验恒等式。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 1（线性调度的显式累积信号）</strong> 在 (H1)–(H2) 下，线性调度的累积信号保留率与对数信噪比为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\exp\\!\\Big(-\\beta_{\\min}t-\\frac{\\beta_{\\max}-\\beta_{\\min}}{2T}t^2\\Big),\\qquad\n\\lambda(t)=\\log\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 第一式由 (H2) 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\beta$</span> 的仿射形式直接积分得到，积分中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\beta$</span> 连续故 Riemann 可积，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\beta\\ge\\beta_{\\min}&gt;0$</span> 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span> 严格递减。第二式由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=\\bar\\alpha_t/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span> 取对数即得。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 1（端点行为）</strong> 在命题 1 的假设下：</p>\n<p>(i) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t&lt;1$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t&gt;0$</span> 成立；\n(ii) 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T\\bar\\beta(s)\\,ds&lt;+\\infty$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T=\\exp(-\\beta_{\\min}T-\\tfrac{\\beta_{\\max}-\\beta_{\\min}}{2}T)&gt;0$</span>，端点条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T=0$</span> 只能近似成立；\n(iii) 若强行要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T=0$</span>，则必须令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_{\\max}\\to+\\infty$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\to+\\infty$</span>，此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\beta$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 附近无界，(H1) 失效。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> (i) 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=\\exp(0)=1$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\beta&gt;0$</span> 得严格递减。(ii) 将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T$</span> 代入命题 1 第一式，积分值为有限正数，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T&gt;0$</span>。(iii) 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T=0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T\\bar\\beta=+\\infty$</span>；由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\beta$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上仿射且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 有限，唯一可能是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_{\\max}=+\\infty$</span>，与 (H1) 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_{\\max}&lt;+\\infty$</span> 矛盾。证毕。</p>\n<p>推论 1 揭示了线性调度的一个结构性事实：<strong>在有限时间、有界速率下，线性调度不可能精确达到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T=0$</span></strong>。这与 cosine 调度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s&gt;0$</span> 时的情形类似（cosine 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T$</span> 处取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\cos^2(\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\cdot\\frac{1+s}{1+s})=\\cos^2(\\pi/2)=0$</span> 仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=0$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$s&gt;0$</span> 时为近似零）。因此本章 canonical 端点条件中的“或近似”对线性调度是必需的，而非可选的修饰。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-线性调度的信噪比预算\">线性调度的信噪比预算<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-线性调度的信噪比预算\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>调度的本质是信噪比的时间预算。定义<strong>对数信噪比速率</strong></p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$r(t):=\\frac{d}{dt}\\lambda(t)=\\frac{d}{dt}\\log\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}.$$</div>\n<p>由链式法则与 (H2)，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$r(t)=\\frac{d}{dt}\\big(\\log\\bar\\alpha_t-\\log(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)\\big)\n=-\\bar\\beta(t)+\\frac{\\bar\\beta(t)\\bar\\alpha_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\n=\\bar\\beta(t)\\cdot\\frac{2\\bar\\alpha_t-1}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}.$$</div>\n<p>注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r(t)$</span> 的符号随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 跨越 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span> 而改变：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t&gt;1/2$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}&gt;1$</span>）时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r(t)&gt;0$</span>，信噪比仍在上升；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t&lt;1/2$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r(t)&lt;0$</span>，信噪比开始下降。这解释了为什么扩散过程的前半段“加噪”在 SNR 意义上是先升后降——因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}=\\bar\\alpha/(1-\\bar\\alpha)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha\\to1$</span> 时发散，而在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha\\to0$</span> 时趋于零，峰值在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha=1/2$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 2（线性调度的 SNR 峰值时刻）</strong> 在 (H1)–(H2) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda(t)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上的唯一驻点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t^\\ast$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t^\\ast}=1/2$</span>，即</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$t^\\ast=\\frac{-\\beta_{\\min}+\\sqrt{\\beta_{\\min}^2+2(\\beta_{\\max}-\\beta_{\\min})\\ln 2}}{\\beta_{\\max}-\\beta_{\\min}}\\cdot\\frac{T}{1}$$</div>\n<p>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_{\\max}=\\beta_{\\min}$</span> 时退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t^\\ast=T\\ln 2/\\beta_{\\min}$</span>，需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\ln2/\\beta_{\\min}\\le T$</span> 才落在区间内）。该驻点是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 的极大值点。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r(t)=\\bar\\beta(t)(2\\bar\\alpha_t-1)/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\beta(t)&gt;0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$r(t)=0$</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=1/2$</span>。由命题 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 严格递减，故至多一个解。解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=1/2$</span> 即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_{\\min}t+\\frac{\\beta_{\\max}-\\beta_{\\min}}{2T}t^2=\\ln2$</span>，这是关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的二次方程，取正根得上式。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha&gt;1/2$</span> 时为正、在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha&lt;1/2$</span> 时为负，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t^\\ast$</span> 是极大值点。证毕。</p>\n<p>命题 2 给出一个可直接数值验证的恒等式：在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t^\\ast$</span> 处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t^\\ast)=1$</span>。这与 cosine 调度的对应结论（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}=1$</span> 出现在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha=1/2$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\cos^2(\\cdot)=1/2$</span> 处）形式一致，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t^\\ast$</span> 的解析表达式不同，因为两者的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha(t)$</span> 函数形式不同。这正是“调度差异 = 时间预算差异”的定量体现。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-线性调度与-cosine-调度的比较恒等式\">线性调度与 cosine 调度的比较恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-线性调度与-cosine-调度的比较恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>为把两种调度的差异写成可比较的恒等式，引入<strong>时间预算函数</strong></p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Lambda(t):=\\int_0^t \\bar\\beta(s)\\,ds=-\\log\\bar\\alpha_t.$$</div>\n<p>对线性调度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_{\\mathrm{lin}}(t)=\\beta_{\\min}t+\\frac{\\beta_{\\max}-\\beta_{\\min}}{2T}t^2$</span>，是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的二次函数。对 cosine 调度（<span class=\"math-inline\">$s=0$</span> 时），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\cos^2(\\frac{\\pi t}{2T})$</span>，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Lambda_{\\mathrm{cos}}(t)=-\\log\\cos^2\\!\\Big(\\frac{\\pi t}{2T}\\Big)=-2\\log\\cos\\!\\Big(\\frac{\\pi t}{2T}\\Big).$$</div>\n<p>两者在端点附近的行为截然不同：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to T$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_{\\mathrm{lin}}(T)&lt;+\\infty$</span>（推论 1(ii)），而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_{\\mathrm{cos}}(t)\\to+\\infty$</span>（因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\cos(\\pi t/2T)\\to0$</span>）。这意味着 cosine 调度在终点附近分配了<strong>无穷多的对数噪声预算</strong>，而线性调度只分配了有限预算。这一差异直接决定了采样末段的数值行为：cosine 调度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to T$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to0$</span> 更快，<span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 的奇异更强，需要更细的离散步长；线性调度则因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T&gt;0$</span> 而在终点保留了一个非零信号底，数值上更稳定但端点条件只能近似满足。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 3（预算比较恒等式）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_{\\mathrm{lin}}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_{\\mathrm{cos}}$</span> 如上，则在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,T)$</span> 上</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{dt}\\big(\\Lambda_{\\mathrm{cos}}-\\Lambda_{\\mathrm{lin}}\\big)(t)\n=\\pi\\tan\\!\\Big(\\frac{\\pi t}{2T}\\Big)\\cdot\\frac{1}{T}-\\bar\\beta_{\\mathrm{lin}}(t),$$</div>\n<p>且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to T^-$</span> 时右端第一项发散到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>，第二项有界。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_{\\mathrm{cos}}$</span> 求导：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}\\Lambda_{\\mathrm{cos}}=-\\frac{d}{dt}2\\log\\cos(\\frac{\\pi t}{2T})=2\\tan(\\frac{\\pi t}{2T})\\cdot\\frac{\\pi}{2T}=\\frac{\\pi}{T}\\tan(\\frac{\\pi t}{2T})$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_{\\mathrm{lin}}$</span> 求导得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\beta_{\\mathrm{lin}}(t)$</span>。相减即得恒等式。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to T^-$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tan(\\frac{\\pi t}{2T})\\to+\\infty$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\beta_{\\mathrm{lin}}$</span> 有界（(H1)），故差发散。证毕。</p>\n<p>命题 3 是一个可检验的恒等式：它把“cosine 在终点附近预算更多”这一直觉写成导数比较。数值上，若在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上均匀取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 个点计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_{\\mathrm{cos}}-\\Lambda_{\\mathrm{lin}}$</span>，该差值应随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 增大而单调增（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 足够靠近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 时），且末段斜率显著大于中段。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-线性调度的-ELBO-权重\">线性调度的 ELBO 权重<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-线性调度的-ELBO-权重\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节标题承诺“线性调度”，而本章第 12 节将展开“调度与 ELBO 权重”的一般理论。此处只给出线性调度下 ELBO 权重的<strong>显式表达式</strong>，作为本节的一个推论，不重复第 12 节的一般推导。</p>\n<p>在扩散模型的变分下界中，第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 步的 KL 项权重正比于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t^2/(2\\sigma_t^2\\bar\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t))$</span>（离散形式）或其连续对应。对线性调度，连续时间下的权重密度为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$w(t)=\\frac{\\bar\\beta(t)^2}{2\\,\\bar\\alpha_t\\,(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}\\cdot\\frac{1}{\\bar\\beta(t)}\n=\\frac{\\bar\\beta(t)}{2\\,\\bar\\alpha_t\\,(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)},$$</div>\n<p>其中第一个因子来自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t^2/\\sigma_t^2$</span> 的连续化，第二个因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\bar\\beta(t)$</span> 来自将离散求和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t$</span> 转为积分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int \\bar\\beta(t)\\,dt$</span> 的 Jacobian（即时间重参数化）。这里用到了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\approx\\bar\\beta(t)dt$</span> 的连续极限。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4（线性调度 ELBO 权重的端点行为）</strong> 在 (H1)–(H2) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to0^+$</span> 时趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\beta(0)/2=\\beta_{\\min}/2$</span>（有限），在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to T^-$</span> 时趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\beta(T)/(2\\bar\\alpha_T(1-\\bar\\alpha_T))$</span>；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T&gt;0$</span>（推论 1(ii)），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(T)$</span> 有限；若强行 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T=0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)\\to+\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to0^+$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t\\to0$</span>，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\beta(t)\\to\\beta_{\\min}$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span> 的倒数行为需仔细处理：<span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)=\\bar\\beta(t)/(2\\bar\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t))$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t\\sim\\bar\\beta(0)t\\to0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)\\sim\\beta_{\\min}/(2\\cdot1\\cdot\\beta_{\\min}t)=1/(2t)\\to+\\infty$</span>。注意：这与“趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_{\\min}/2$</span>”矛盾，需重新检查连续化的 Jacobian。</p>\n<p>正确的连续化应保留 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t^2/\\sigma_t^2$</span> 中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 而非约去：离散 KL 项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\sigma_t^2\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>。连续极限下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\approx\\bar\\beta(t)dt$</span>，故权重密度（每单位 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dt$</span>）为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\bar\\beta(t)^2 dt^2}{2\\sigma_t^2\\bar\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}\\cdot\\frac{1}{dt}=\\frac{\\bar\\beta(t)^2 dt}{2\\sigma_t^2\\bar\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dt\\to0$</span> 时该密度趋于零——这说明连续时间 ELBO 的权重需以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\beta(t)$</span> 为测度而非 Lebesgue 测度。为避免与第 12 节的一般推导冲突，本节只陈述一个<strong>无歧义的离散权重恒等式</strong>，不展开连续极限。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4（离散线性调度的 ELBO 权重恒等式）</strong> 设离散时间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1,\\dots,T$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=\\bar\\beta(t\\Delta)$</span> 为线性调度的离散采样，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta=T/T$</span> 为步长。则第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 步 KL 权重</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$w_t=\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\sigma_t^2\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}$$</div>\n<p>满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t=\\frac{\\beta_t}{2\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}\\cdot\\beta_t$</span>，且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\to0$</span>（细步长）时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t=O(\\beta_t)$</span>，故总权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t w_t=O(\\sum_t\\beta_t)=O(\\Lambda(T))$</span> 有界当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda(T)&lt;+\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 第一式由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 代入即得。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\to0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\bar\\alpha_t=\\beta_t\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span>（一阶），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t\\approx\\beta_t^2/(2(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}(1-\\bar\\alpha_t))$</span>，主阶为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\beta_t)$</span>。求和得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t w_t=O(\\sum_t\\beta_t)=O(\\Lambda(T))$</span>，由推论 1(ii) 线性调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda(T)&lt;+\\infty$</span>，故总权重有界。证毕。</p>\n<p>命题 4 的要点是：线性调度的 ELBO 总权重有界，因为其对数噪声预算有限；cosine 调度（<span class=\"math-inline\">$s=0$</span>）的总权重发散，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_{\\mathrm{cos}}(T)=+\\infty$</span>。这是两种调度在训练目标上的实质差异，而非数值细节。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-具体例子-beta_-min-10--4-beta_-max-0-02-T-1000-的数值验证\">具体例子：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_{\\min}=10^{-4}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_{\\max}=0.02$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1000$</span> 的数值验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-具体例子-beta_-min-10--4-beta_-max-0-02-T-1000-的数值验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_{\\min}=10^{-4}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_{\\max}=0.02$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1000$</span>（离散步数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span>，步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta=1$</span>）。由命题 1，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\bar\\alpha_{1000}=\\exp\\!\\Big(-10^{-4}\\cdot1000-\\frac{0.02-10^{-4}}{2\\cdot1000}\\cdot1000^2\\Big)\n=\\exp\\!\\Big(-0.1-\\frac{0.0199}{2}\\cdot1000\\Big)\n=\\exp(-0.1-9.95)=\\exp(-10.05)\\approx4.3\\times10^{-5}.$$</div>\n<p>即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T\\approx4.3\\times10^{-5}&gt;0$</span>，端点条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T=0$</span> 仅近似成立（误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$4.3\\times10^{-5}$</span>）。SNR 峰值时刻由命题 2：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$t^\\ast=\\frac{-10^{-4}+\\sqrt{10^{-8}+2(0.0199)\\ln2}}{0.0199}\\cdot\\frac{1000}{1}\n\\approx\\frac{-10^{-4}+\\sqrt{10^{-8}+0.02758}}{0.0199}\\cdot1000\n\\approx\\frac{0.16605}{0.0199}\\cdot1000\\approx834.4.$$</div>\n<p>即 SNR 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\approx834$</span> 处达到峰值 1，之后下降。这与 cosine 调度（<span class=\"math-inline\">$s=0$</span>）的峰值时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t^\\ast=T/2=500$</span> 形成对比：线性调度把 SNR 峰值推后了约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$334$</span> 步，因为其噪声预算在前期分配较少、后期较多（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\beta$</span> 随时间线性增）。这一差异可通过代码节直接验证。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-线性调度的离散化与步长选择\">线性调度的离散化与步长选择<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-线性调度的离散化与步长选择\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节不展开“离散时间步的选择”（属第 8 节），但给出线性调度下步长选择的一个<strong>必要条件</strong>，作为本节推导链的收束。由命题 4，离散权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t=O(\\beta_t)$</span>，故若要求每步权重不超过阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span>，需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\le 2\\epsilon\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)/\\beta_t$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t^2\\le2\\epsilon\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>。在线性调度下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=\\bar\\beta(t\\Delta)\\Delta$</span>，故步长需满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Delta\\le\\frac{\\sqrt{2\\epsilon\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}}{\\bar\\beta(t\\Delta)}.$$</div>\n<p>在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 小，右端分子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sim\\sqrt{2\\epsilon\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 小，故步长需相应缩小；但线性调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T&gt;0$</span> 保证了右端非零，步长下界存在。这与 cosine 调度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to T$</span> 时右端趋于零、步长必须趋于零形成对比——后者正是第 10 节“端点奇异导致数值不稳定”的反例来源。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p>线性调度由仿射瞬时速率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\beta(t)=\\beta_{\\min}+(\\beta_{\\max}-\\beta_{\\min})t/T$</span> 定义，其累积信号保留率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\exp(-\\beta_{\\min}t-\\frac{\\beta_{\\max}-\\beta_{\\min}}{2T}t^2)$</span> 与对数信噪比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda(t)=\\log(\\bar\\alpha_t/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t))$</span> 均有显式闭式；在有限时间、有界速率下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T&gt;0$</span>，端点条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T=0$</span> 只能近似成立（命题 1、推论 1）。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>线性调度的 SNR 峰值时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t^\\ast$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t^\\ast}=1/2$</span> 唯一确定，其解析表达式为二次方程的正根；与 cosine 调度相比，线性调度把对数噪声预算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda(t)$</span> 安排为时间的二次函数而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log\\cos^2$</span> 型函数，两者在终点附近的预算导数差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\pi}{T}\\tan(\\frac{\\pi t}{2T})-\\bar\\beta_{\\mathrm{lin}}(t)$</span> 发散（命题 2、命题 3）。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>线性调度的离散 ELBO 权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t=\\beta_t^2/(2\\sigma_t^2\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}(1-\\bar\\alpha_t))$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t=O(\\beta_t)$</span>，总权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Lambda(T))$</span> 有界；步长选择的必要条件为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\le\\sqrt{2\\epsilon\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}/\\bar\\beta(t\\Delta)$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to T$</span> 时因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T&gt;0$</span> 而保持非零下界（命题 4）。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p>本节标题承诺线性调度，而本章第 11 节将展开“时间重参数化的不变性”的一般理论。此处只给出线性调度在<strong>仿射时间重参数化</strong>下的一个精确协变恒等式，作为本节推导链的补充环节，不重复第 11 节的一般论证。</p>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi:[0,T]\\to[0,T]$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 严格递增映射，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi(0)=0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi(T)=T$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi'(t)&gt;0$</span>。定义重参数化后的调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta(t):=\\bar\\beta(\\varphi(t))\\varphi'(t)$</span>，即把原速率在时间轴上“拉伸”。由 (H2) 的积分表示，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\Lambda(t):=\\int_0^t\\tilde\\beta(s)\\,ds=\\int_0^t\\bar\\beta(\\varphi(s))\\varphi'(s)\\,ds=\\int_0^{\\varphi(t)}\\bar\\beta(u)\\,du=\\Lambda(\\varphi(t)),$$</div>\n<p>其中第二个等号用了换元 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=\\varphi(s)$</span>，要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 严格递增（故为微分同胚，换元合法）。于是重参数化后的累积信号保留率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\alpha_t=\\exp(-\\tilde\\Lambda(t))=\\bar\\alpha_{\\varphi(t)}$</span>，即<strong>信号保留率沿重参数化后的时间轨迹与原调度在同一物理时刻的值相同</strong>。这是时间重参数化的核心不变性：调度曲线作为“噪声预算对物理时间的函数”<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda\\circ\\varphi^{-1}$</span> 在重参数化下不变，变的只是预算被读取的时间坐标。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5（线性调度在仿射重参数化下的协变恒等式）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi(t)=ct$</span> 为仿射映射（<span class=\"math-inline\">$c&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$cT=T$</span> 要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c=1$</span>，故非平凡仿射重参数化需允许 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 变化；此处取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi(t)=ct$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$cT=T'$</span>，即把区间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 映到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T']$</span>）。则线性调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\beta(t)=\\beta_{\\min}+(\\beta_{\\max}-\\beta_{\\min})t/T$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 下的像 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta(t)=\\bar\\beta(ct)c$</span> 仍是线性调度，其参数为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\beta_{\\min}=c\\beta_{\\min},\\qquad \\tilde\\beta_{\\max}=c\\beta_{\\max},\\qquad \\tilde T=T'.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta(t)=c\\big(\\beta_{\\min}+(\\beta_{\\max}-\\beta_{\\min})ct/T\\big)=c\\beta_{\\min}+c(\\beta_{\\max}-\\beta_{\\min})ct/T$</span>。令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_{\\min}=c\\beta_{\\min}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_{\\max}=c\\beta_{\\max}$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta(t)=\\tilde\\beta_{\\min}+(\\tilde\\beta_{\\max}-\\tilde\\beta_{\\min})t/\\tilde T$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde T=T'=cT$</span>。验证：<span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\tilde\\beta_{\\max}-\\tilde\\beta_{\\min})t/\\tilde T=c(\\beta_{\\max}-\\beta_{\\min})t/(cT)=(\\beta_{\\max}-\\beta_{\\min})t/T$</span>，与上式一致。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta$</span> 是参数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(c\\beta_{\\min},c\\beta_{\\max},T')$</span> 的线性调度。证毕。</p>\n<p>命题 5 说明线性调度类在仿射时间重参数化下<strong>封闭</strong>：重参数化只改变速率参数与时间区间长度，不改变“线性”这一结构。这与 cosine 调度形成对比：cosine 调度在仿射重参数化下一般不再是 cosine 型（因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\cos^2$</span> 的复合不保持 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\cos^2$</span> 形式），除非重参数化恰好是恒等映射。这一结构性差异是线性调度在工程上易于“调参”的数学根源：改变总步数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 等价于同时缩放 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_{\\min}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_{\\max}$</span>，而调度形状不变。</p>\n<p>由命题 5 与命题 1，重参数化后的端点信号保留率为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\alpha_{T'}=\\exp\\!\\Big(-c\\beta_{\\min}T-\\frac{c(\\beta_{\\max}-\\beta_{\\min})}{2T'}(T')^2\\Big)\n=\\exp\\!\\Big(-c\\beta_{\\min}T-\\frac{c(\\beta_{\\max}-\\beta_{\\min})}{2}T\\Big).$$</div>\n<p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c&gt;1$</span>（时间拉伸）时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\alpha_{T'}$</span> 比原 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T$</span> 更小，更接近端点条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T=0$</span>；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c&lt;1$</span>（时间压缩）时反之。这给出一个可操作的恒等式：<strong>线性调度的端点近似精度由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 控制，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c\\to+\\infty$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\alpha_{T'}\\to0$</span></strong>。但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c\\to+\\infty$</span> 意味着 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_{\\max}=c\\beta_{\\max}\\to+\\infty$</span>，与 (H1) 的有界性冲突——这再次印证推论 1(iii)：精确端点条件在有限速率下不可达。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-线性调度的对数-SNR-曲率\">线性调度的对数 SNR 曲率<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-线性调度的对数-SNR-曲率\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 2 给出了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda(t)$</span> 的驻点，但未刻画其曲率。曲率决定了 SNR 峰值附近的“平坦度”，进而影响采样在峰值附近的步长需求。定义对数 SNR 的二阶导数</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\kappa(t):=\\frac{d^2}{dt^2}\\lambda(t)=\\frac{d}{dt}\\Big(\\bar\\beta(t)\\frac{2\\bar\\alpha_t-1}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\Big).$$</div>\n<p>由乘积法则与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}\\bar\\alpha_t=-\\bar\\beta(t)\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\kappa(t)=\\bar\\beta'(t)\\frac{2\\bar\\alpha_t-1}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\n+\\bar\\beta(t)\\cdot\\frac{d}{dt}\\Big(\\frac{2\\bar\\alpha_t-1}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\Big).$$</div>\n<p>第二因子求导：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(\\bar\\alpha)=\\frac{2\\bar\\alpha-1}{1-\\bar\\alpha}$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g'(\\bar\\alpha)=\\frac{2(1-\\bar\\alpha)+(2\\bar\\alpha-1)}{(1-\\bar\\alpha)^2}=\\frac{1}{(1-\\bar\\alpha)^2}$</span>。故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{dt}g(\\bar\\alpha_t)=g'(\\bar\\alpha_t)\\cdot(-\\bar\\beta(t)\\bar\\alpha_t)=-\\frac{\\bar\\beta(t)\\bar\\alpha_t}{(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)^2}.$$</div>\n<p>代入得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\kappa(t)=\\bar\\beta'(t)\\frac{2\\bar\\alpha_t-1}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}-\\frac{\\bar\\beta(t)^2\\bar\\alpha_t}{(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)^2}.$$</div>\n<p>在线性调度下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\beta'(t)=(\\beta_{\\max}-\\beta_{\\min})/T$</span> 为常数。在驻点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t^\\ast$</span> 处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t^\\ast}=1/2$</span>，第一项为零，第二项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\bar\\beta(t^\\ast)^2\\cdot\\frac{1/2}{(1/2)^2}=-2\\bar\\beta(t^\\ast)^2&lt;0$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(t^\\ast)=-2\\bar\\beta(t^\\ast)^2$</span>，峰值是局部极大且曲率为负，其绝对值随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\beta(t^\\ast)$</span> 增大而增大。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6（线性调度 SNR 峰值的曲率恒等式）</strong> 在 (H1)–(H2) 下，线性调度在驻点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t^\\ast$</span> 处的对数 SNR 曲率为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\kappa(t^\\ast)=-2\\Big(\\beta_{\\min}+\\frac{\\beta_{\\max}-\\beta_{\\min}}{T}t^\\ast\\Big)^2.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由上述推导，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(t^\\ast)=-2\\bar\\beta(t^\\ast)^2$</span>，代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\beta(t^\\ast)=\\beta_{\\min}+(\\beta_{\\max}-\\beta_{\\min})t^\\ast/T$</span> 即得。证毕。</p>\n<p>命题 6 是一个可数值检验的恒等式：在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t^\\ast$</span> 附近用有限差分计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 的二阶导数，应与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-2\\bar\\beta(t^\\ast)^2$</span> 吻合到离散误差阶。其意义在于：线性调度的 SNR 峰值曲率完全由该时刻的瞬时速率决定，而瞬时速率又由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_{\\min}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_{\\max}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 线性决定。因此调大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_{\\max}$</span> 会使峰值更“尖”，采样在峰值附近需要更细的步长才能分辨 SNR 的快速变化；调小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_{\\max}$</span> 则使峰值更“平”，步长可放宽。这与第 9 节“调度对采样步数的影响”直接接口。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-线性调度与-cosine-调度的端点预算差-一个精确积分\">线性调度与 cosine 调度的端点预算差：一个精确积分<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-线性调度与-cosine-调度的端点预算差-一个精确积分\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 3 给出了预算导数差，但未给出预算差的积分值。定义端点预算差</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D:=\\Lambda_{\\mathrm{cos}}(T^-)-\\Lambda_{\\mathrm{lin}}(T)=\\lim_{t\\to T^-}\\big(\\Lambda_{\\mathrm{cos}}(t)-\\Lambda_{\\mathrm{lin}}(t)\\big).$$</div>\n<p>由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_{\\mathrm{cos}}(t)=-2\\log\\cos(\\frac{\\pi t}{2T})$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to T^-$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\cos(\\frac{\\pi t}{2T})\\to0^+$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_{\\mathrm{cos}}(t)\\to+\\infty$</span>；而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_{\\mathrm{lin}}(T)&lt;+\\infty$</span>（推论 1(ii)）。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D=+\\infty$</span>。这不是一个有限的“差值”，而是 cosine 调度在终点分配了无穷预算、线性调度分配了有限预算的定性差异。</p>\n<p>为把这一差异写成可比较的有限量，取截断点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T-\\delta$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta&gt;0$</span> 小），定义截断预算差</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_\\delta:=\\Lambda_{\\mathrm{cos}}(T-\\delta)-\\Lambda_{\\mathrm{lin}}(T-\\delta).$$</div>\n<p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta\\to0^+$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_{\\mathrm{cos}}(T-\\delta)=-2\\log\\cos(\\frac{\\pi(T-\\delta)}{2T})=-2\\log\\sin(\\frac{\\pi\\delta}{2T})\\sim-2\\log(\\frac{\\pi\\delta}{2T})\\to+\\infty$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_{\\mathrm{lin}}(T-\\delta)\\to\\Lambda_{\\mathrm{lin}}(T)&lt;+\\infty$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_\\delta\\sim-2\\log\\delta+O(1)$</span>，发散速率为对数型。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7（截断预算差的对数发散速率）</strong> 在 (H1)–(H2) 下，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta\\to0^+$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_\\delta=-2\\log\\Big(\\frac{\\pi\\delta}{2T}\\Big)+o(\\log\\delta)+\\Lambda_{\\mathrm{lin}}(T)+O(\\delta).$$</div>\n<p>特别地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lim_{\\delta\\to0^+}D_\\delta/\\log(1/\\delta)=2$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\cos(\\frac{\\pi(T-\\delta)}{2T})=\\cos(\\frac{\\pi}{2}-\\frac{\\pi\\delta}{2T})=\\sin(\\frac{\\pi\\delta}{2T})$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_{\\mathrm{cos}}(T-\\delta)=-2\\log\\sin(\\frac{\\pi\\delta}{2T})$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta\\to0^+$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sin(\\frac{\\pi\\delta}{2T})\\sim\\frac{\\pi\\delta}{2T}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-2\\log\\sin(\\frac{\\pi\\delta}{2T})=-2\\log(\\frac{\\pi\\delta}{2T})+o(1)=-2\\log\\delta-2\\log(\\frac{\\pi}{2T})+o(1)$</span>。又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_{\\mathrm{lin}}(T-\\delta)=\\Lambda_{\\mathrm{lin}}(T)-\\int_{T-\\delta}^T\\bar\\beta(s)\\,ds=\\Lambda_{\\mathrm{lin}}(T)+O(\\delta)$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\beta$</span> 有界）。相减得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_\\delta=-2\\log\\delta-2\\log(\\frac{\\pi}{2T})+\\Lambda_{\\mathrm{lin}}(T)+O(\\delta)+o(1)$</span>，即所证。除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(1/\\delta)=-\\log\\delta$</span> 取极限得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span>。证毕。</p>\n<p>命题 7 的要点是：cosine 调度相对线性调度的端点预算优势是<strong>对数发散</strong>的，发散系数恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span>（来自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\cos^2$</span> 的平方）。这一系数可直接数值验证：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta=10^{-k}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_\\delta/\\log(1/\\delta)$</span> 应随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 增大趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span>。它定量解释了为什么 cosine 调度在终点附近需要更细的步长：预算以对数速率堆积，<span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 的奇异强度相应更高。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-线性调度的离散采样误差界\">线性调度的离散采样误差界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-线性调度的离散采样误差界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节最后一个补充环节：把线性调度的连续闭式与离散采样之间的误差写成可检验的界。设离散时间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_n=n\\Delta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$n=0,\\dots,N$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta=T/N$</span>。离散累积信号保留率定义为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\alpha_n=\\prod_{k=1}^n(1-\\beta_k)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_k=\\bar\\beta(t_k)\\Delta$</span> 为线性调度的离散增量。连续值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha(t_n)=\\exp(-\\Lambda(t_n))$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8（线性调度离散化的相对误差界）</strong> 在 (H1)–(H2) 下，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Big|\\log\\hat\\alpha_n-\\log\\bar\\alpha(t_n)\\Big|\\le\\frac{1}{2}\\sum_{k=1}^n\\beta_k^2\\le\\frac{N}{2}\\big(\\beta_{\\max}\\Delta\\big)^2=\\frac{T\\beta_{\\max}^2}{2N}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(1-\\beta_k)=-\\beta_k-\\frac{\\beta_k^2}{2}+O(\\beta_k^3)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_k\\le\\beta_{\\max}\\Delta&lt;1$</span>（(H1) 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_{\\max}&lt;1$</span>，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 足够小使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_{\\max}\\Delta&lt;1$</span>），故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log\\hat\\alpha_n=\\sum_{k=1}^n\\log(1-\\beta_k)=-\\sum_{k=1}^n\\beta_k-\\frac{1}{2}\\sum_{k=1}^n\\beta_k^2+O\\Big(\\sum_{k=1}^n\\beta_k^3\\Big).$$</div>\n<p>而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\bar\\alpha(t_n)=-\\Lambda(t_n)=-\\int_0^{t_n}\\bar\\beta(s)\\,ds$</span>。由左矩形近似误差界，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\big|\\sum_{k=1}^n\\beta_k-\\Lambda(t_n)\\big|\\le\\frac{1}{2}\\sum_{k=1}^n\\beta_k^2$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\beta$</span> 的变差有界，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\bar\\beta'|\\le(\\beta_{\\max}-\\beta_{\\min})/T$</span>）。合并得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Big|\\log\\hat\\alpha_n-\\log\\bar\\alpha(t_n)\\Big|\\le\\frac{1}{2}\\sum_{k=1}^n\\beta_k^2+O\\Big(\\sum_{k=1}^n\\beta_k^3\\Big).$$</div>\n<p>主阶为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2}\\sum_{k=1}^n\\beta_k^2\\le\\frac{n}{2}(\\beta_{\\max}\\Delta)^2\\le\\frac{T\\beta_{\\max}^2}{2N}$</span>。证毕。</p>\n<p>命题 8 给出一个可直接数值检验的误差界：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 增大，离散与连续的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\hat\\alpha_n$</span> 之差应被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\beta_{\\max}^2/(2N)$</span> 控制。其工程含义是：线性调度的离散化误差随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1/N)$</span> 衰减，且系数正比于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_{\\max}^2$</span>。这为第 8 节“离散时间步的选择”提供了一个具体的误差预算：若要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\hat\\alpha_n$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\bar\\alpha(t_n)$</span> 的相对误差不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span>，则需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\ge T\\beta_{\\max}^2/(2\\epsilon)$</span>。注意此界对线性调度成立是因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\beta$</span> 的变差有界（仿射），对 cosine 调度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to T$</span> 附近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\beta$</span> 无界，该界失效——这正是第 10 节反例的另一来源。</p>\n<h3 id=\"df06--h-调度的信息论解释\">调度的信息论解释<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-调度的信息论解释\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已定义的符号：前向过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\alpha_t x_0+\\sigma_t\\varepsilon$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I_d)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t,\\sigma_t&gt;0$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span> 连续可微且单调（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t$</span> 递减、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 递增），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=\\alpha_t^2/\\sigma_t^2$</span> 严格递减。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\alpha_t^2$</span>（本章 canonical 记号下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 即信号方差比例），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\sigma_t^2=\\sigma_t^2$</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t+\\bar\\sigma_t^2=1$</span>（方差保持参数化）。记边缘密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(x_t;\\alpha_t x_0,\\sigma_t^2 I_d)$</span>，数据分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)$</span>，边缘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x_t)=\\int p_t(x_t\\mid x_0)q(x_0)\\,\\mathrm dx_0$</span>。</p>\n<p>本节新引入的符号：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，定义<strong>信噪比对数速率</strong>（log-SNR 的时间导数）\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\lambda(t):=\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm dt}\\log \\mathrm{SNR}(t)=\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm dt}\\bigl(\\log\\alpha_t^2-\\log\\sigma_t^2\\bigr),$$</div>\n以及<strong>信息速率</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$R(t):=-\\lambda(t)&gt;0$</span>（由 SNR 严格递减保证）。定义<strong>每单位 log-SNR 的熵产生率</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal E(t):=\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm dt}H(p_t)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 为微分熵（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 绝对连续且微分熵有限时）。</p>\n<p>假设（本节全局）：(A1) <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 有紧支撑 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K\\subset\\mathbb R^d$</span> 且具有密度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{q}\\|x_0\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>；(A2) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t,\\sigma_t\\in C^1([0,T])$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}$</span> 严格递减；(A3) 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 具有有限微分熵且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\mapsto p_t(x)\\log p_t(x)$</span> 可积。这些假设在本章情境下成立：紧支撑保证各阶矩有限，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 存在，方差保持参数化保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 与高斯卷积，故微分熵有限（高斯卷积的熵被高斯熵上界控制）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-信息论量-从-SNR-到熵产生\">信息论量：从 SNR 到熵产生<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-信息论量-从-SNR-到熵产生\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义 5.1（调度作为信噪比预算）</strong> 称映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\mapsto \\mathrm{SNR}(t)$</span> 为一个<strong>调度</strong>。其信息论内容由三元组 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\lambda(t),R(t),\\mathcal E(t))$</span> 刻画。两个调度若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 相同则称<strong>信息等价</strong>；若仅时间参数化不同而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 的像集相同，则称<strong>重参数化等价</strong>（第 11 节展开）。</p>\n<p>区别说明：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)$</span> 是逐点代数量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda(t)$</span> 是其对数导数、是局部信息量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal E(t)$</span> 是边缘分布的泛函导数。三者关系不是简单相乘：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal E$</span> 依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 只依赖调度。这正是“调度 = 噪声的时间预算”的精确含义——调度只规定信息注入的<strong>速率</strong>，不规定<strong>总量</strong>（总量由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 决定）。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5.2（熵产生率恒等式）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,T)$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal E(t)=\\lambda(t)\\,\\mathbb E_{p_t}\\!\\left[\\frac{\\|x_t-\\alpha_t x_0\\|^2}{\\sigma_t^2}\\right]-\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm dt}\\mathbb E_{p_t}\\log p_t(x_t\\mid x_0).$$</div>\n更具体地，若记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D(t)=\\mathbb E_{p_t}\\bigl[-\\log p_t(x_t\\mid x_0)\\bigr]$</span> 为条件交叉熵，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm dt}H(p_t)=\\lambda(t)\\,d-D'(t).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)–(A3)，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D\\in C^1([0,T])$</span>（由 (A2) 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 与紧支撑下的一致可积性保证，见证明末）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由方差保持参数化，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(x_t;\\alpha_t x_0,\\sigma_t^2 I_d)$</span>，故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$-\\log p_t(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\frac{d}{2}\\log(2\\pi\\sigma_t^2)+\\frac{\\|x_t-\\alpha_t x_0\\|^2}{2\\sigma_t^2}.$$</div>\n对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 求导，注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的分布随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 变，需用 Leibniz 法则对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p_t(x_t)\\,(\\cdot)\\,\\mathrm dx_t$</span> 求导。写 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p_t)=-\\int p_t\\log p_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D(t)=-\\int p_t\\log p_t(\\cdot\\mid x_0)$</span>（对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 边缘化后），有恒等式\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(p_t)=\\mathbb E_{p_t}[-\\log p_t(x_t)]=\\mathbb E_{p_t}[-\\log p_t(x_t\\mid x_0)]-\\mathbb E_{p_t}\\!\\left[\\log\\frac{p_t(x_t)}{p_t(x_t\\mid x_0)}\\right]=D(t)-I(t),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(t)=\\mathbb E_{p_t}\\log\\frac{p_t(x_t\\mid x_0)}{p_t(x_t)}$</span> 为互信息。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 求导：<span class=\"math-inline\">$H'(t)=D'(t)-I'(t)$</span>。另一方面，直接对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D(t)$</span> 求导（Leibniz，被积函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 且紧支撑下一致有界）：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D'(t)=\\frac{d}{2}\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm dt}\\log\\sigma_t^2+\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm dt}\\mathbb E_{p_t}\\!\\left[\\frac{\\|x_t-\\alpha_t x_0\\|^2}{2\\sigma_t^2}\\right].$$</div>\n第一项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{2}\\cdot 2\\frac{\\dot\\sigma_t}{\\sigma_t}=d\\,\\frac{\\dot\\sigma_t}{\\sigma_t}$</span>。第二项中，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p_t}\\|x_t-\\alpha_t x_0\\|^2=\\mathbb E_{p_t}\\|\\sigma_t\\varepsilon\\|^2=d\\sigma_t^2$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t-\\alpha_t x_0=\\sigma_t\\varepsilon$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\perp x_0$</span>），故该项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{2}\\cdot\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm dt}\\log\\sigma_t^2=d\\frac{\\dot\\sigma_t}{\\sigma_t}$</span>，合计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D'(t)=2d\\frac{\\dot\\sigma_t}{\\sigma_t}$</span>。而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda(t)=2\\frac{\\dot\\alpha_t}{\\alpha_t}-2\\frac{\\dot\\sigma_t}{\\sigma_t}$</span>，在方差保持下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\alpha_t\\alpha_t+\\dot\\sigma_t\\sigma_t=0$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\dot\\alpha_t}{\\alpha_t}=-\\frac{\\sigma_t^2}{\\alpha_t^2}\\frac{\\dot\\sigma_t}{\\sigma_t}$</span>，代入得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda(t)=-2\\frac{\\dot\\sigma_t}{\\sigma_t}\\bigl(1+\\frac{\\sigma_t^2}{\\alpha_t^2}\\bigr)=-2\\frac{\\dot\\sigma_t}{\\sigma_t}\\frac{1}{\\alpha_t^2}$</span>。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D'(t)=-d\\,\\alpha_t^2\\lambda(t)$</span>。代回 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H'(t)=D'(t)-I'(t)$</span> 并用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I'(t)$</span> 的表达式（对互信息求导，Fubini 交换，紧支撑下合法）得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal E(t)=\\lambda(t)\\,d-D'(t)=\\lambda(t)\\,d+d\\,\\alpha_t^2\\lambda(t)=d\\,\\lambda(t)\\,(1+\\alpha_t^2).$$</div>\n最后一步用了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D'=-d\\alpha_t^2\\lambda$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 5.3（线性调度的熵产生为常数倍）</strong> 对线性调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=1-t/T$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span>），在方差保持下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=t/T$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=(T-t)/t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda(t)=-T/(t(T-t))$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal E(t)=d\\lambda(t)(1+\\bar\\alpha_t)=-\\frac{dT}{t(T-t)}\\bigl(1+1-\\tfrac tT\\bigr)=-\\frac{dT(2T-t)}{t(T-t)^2}$</span>。特别地 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal E(t)\\to-\\infty$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to0^+$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to T^-$</span>，说明线性调度在两端熵产生率发散——这是第 10 节端点奇异的信息论根源。</p>\n<p><strong>验证</strong>：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1/2$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda=-1/(\\tfrac12\\cdot\\tfrac12)=-4$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha=1/2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal E=-4\\cdot1\\cdot1.5=-6$</span>。直接按公式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal E=d\\lambda(1+\\bar\\alpha)=-4\\cdot1.5=-6$</span>，一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-主定理-调度决定-ELBO-的权重剖面\">主定理：调度决定 ELBO 的权重剖面<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-主定理-调度决定-ELBO-的权重剖面\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定理 5.4（ELBO 的 SNR 重加权表示）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，扩散模型的证据下界（ELBO）可写成\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{ELBO}=\\mathbb E_q[\\log p_\\theta(x_0\\mid x_1)]-\\sum_{k=1}^{N}\\mathbb E_{q}\\Bigl[D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\bigl(q(x_{t_{k-1}}\\mid x_{t_k},x_0)\\,\\|\\,p_\\theta(x_{t_{k-1}}\\mid x_{t_k})\\bigr)\\Bigr],$$</div>\n且对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span>，该 KL 项在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t_{k-1}}\\mid x_{t_k},x_0)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 均为高斯、方差匹配时等于\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm{SNR}(t_{k-1})-\\mathrm{SNR}(t_k)}{2}\\,\\mathbb E_{q}\\bigl\\|\\,\\hat x_\\theta(x_{t_k},t_k)-x_0\\,\\bigr\\|^2,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_\\theta$</span> 为去噪预测器。因此 ELBO 的每一项权重正比于<strong>相邻信噪比之差</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\mathrm{SNR}_k=\\mathrm{SNR}(t_{k-1})-\\mathrm{SNR}(t_k)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：离散时间网格 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0=t_0&lt;t_1&lt;\\cdots&lt;t_N=T$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t_{k-1}}\\mid x_{t_k},x_0)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 均为高斯且方差相同（标准 DDPM 参数化）；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_\\theta$</span> 平方可积。</p>\n<p><strong>证明（关键步骤）</strong>：由贝叶斯公式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t_{k-1}}\\mid x_{t_k},x_0)=\\mathcal N\\bigl(x_{t_{k-1}};\\mu_k(x_{t_k},x_0),\\Sigma_k\\bigr)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_k=\\frac{\\alpha_{t_{k-1}}\\sigma_{t_k}^2}{\\sigma_{t_{k-1}}^2}x_0+\\frac{\\alpha_{t_k}\\sigma_{t_{k-1}}^2-\\alpha_{t_{k-1}}\\sigma_{t_k}^2}{\\sigma_{t_{k-1}}^2}x_{t_k}$</span> 之类标准形式（此处不展开系数，仅用方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_k=\\sigma_{t_{k-1}}^2-\\frac{\\alpha_{t_{k-1}}^2\\sigma_{t_k}^2}{\\sigma_{t_{k-1}}^2}$</span> 的结构）。两个同方差高斯的 KL 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2\\Sigma_k}\\|\\mu_k-\\mu_\\theta\\|^2$</span>。将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_k$</span> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的系数提出，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\mu_k-\\mu_\\theta\\|^2=\\bigl(\\frac{\\alpha_{t_{k-1}}\\sigma_{t_k}^2}{\\sigma_{t_{k-1}}^2}\\bigr)^2\\|\\hat x_\\theta-x_0\\|^2$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_\\theta$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t_k}$</span> 预测 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>）。代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_k$</span> 化简：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{1}{2\\Sigma_k}\\Bigl(\\frac{\\alpha_{t_{k-1}}\\sigma_{t_k}^2}{\\sigma_{t_{k-1}}^2}\\Bigr)^2=\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot\\frac{\\alpha_{t_{k-1}}^2\\sigma_{t_k}^4}{\\sigma_{t_{k-1}}^4}\\Big/\\Bigl(\\sigma_{t_{k-1}}^2-\\frac{\\alpha_{t_{k-1}}^2\\sigma_{t_k}^2}{\\sigma_{t_{k-1}}^2}\\Bigr).$$</div>\n用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t_{k-1}}^2-\\alpha_{t_{k-1}}^2\\sigma_{t_k}^2/\\sigma_{t_{k-1}}^2=\\sigma_{t_{k-1}}^2(1-\\alpha_{t_{k-1}}^2\\sigma_{t_k}^2/\\sigma_{t_{k-1}}^4)$</span>，并注意方差保持下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha^2+\\sigma^2=1$</span>，逐步化简得系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=\\frac{1}{2}\\bigl(\\mathrm{SNR}(t_{k-1})-\\mathrm{SNR}(t_k)\\bigr)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 5.5（cosine 调度的权重近似均匀）</strong> 对 cosine 调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\cos^2\\!\\bigl(\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\frac{t/T+s}{1+s}\\bigr)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=\\bar\\alpha_t/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)=\\cot^2\\!\\bigl(\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\frac{t/T+s}{1+s}\\bigr)$</span>。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=0$</span>、等距网格 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_k=kT/N$</span> 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\mathrm{SNR}_k=\\cot^2(\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\frac{k-1}{N})-\\cot^2(\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\frac{k}{N})$</span>。用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\cot^2 u-\\cot^2 v=\\frac{\\sin(v-u)\\sin(v+u)}{\\sin^2 u\\sin^2 v}$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$u&lt;v$</span>），取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\frac{k-1}{N}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v=\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\frac{k}{N}$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\mathrm{SNR}_k=\\frac{\\sin(\\pi/(2N))\\sin(\\pi(2k-1)/(2N))}{\\sin^2(\\pi(k-1)/(2N))\\sin^2(\\pi k/(2N))}$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 居中时该量近似常数，两端发散——cosine 调度把权重预算集中在中间 SNR 区间，与线性调度的两端发散形成对照。数值验证见下方代码。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-与相邻概念的区别-信息速率-vs-得分范数\">与相邻概念的区别：信息速率 vs. 得分范数<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-与相邻概念的区别-信息速率-vs-得分范数\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>调度只规定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda(t)$</span>，不规定得分函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t$</span> 的范数。二者通过 Tweedie 恒等式联系：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t(x_t)=\\frac{\\alpha_t\\hat x_0(x_t)-x_t}{\\sigma_t^2}$</span>，其期望范数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\nabla\\log p_t\\|^2$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 的泛函，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 不是。因此“调度优化”只能优化时间预算，不能替代对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 的得分估计精度。这一点在第 6 节（最优调度的变分问题）中将被形式化为：变分问题在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 上优化，约束是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\lambda\\,\\mathrm dt=\\log\\mathrm{SNR}(0)-\\log\\mathrm{SNR}(T)$</span> 固定。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>调度作为信噪比预算，其局部信息量是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda(t)=\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm dt}\\log\\mathrm{SNR}(t)$</span>；熵产生率满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal E(t)=d\\lambda(t)(1+\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>，线性调度两端发散，cosine 调度中部近似均匀。</li>\n<li>ELBO 的第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 项权重精确等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac12(\\mathrm{SNR}(t_{k-1})-\\mathrm{SNR}(t_k))$</span> 乘以去噪误差，故调度通过相邻 SNR 差直接决定训练信号的加权剖面。</li>\n<li>调度只规定信息注入速率，不规定得分范数或数据熵总量；重参数化只改变 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 的时间标签而不改变其像集，这为第 11 节的不变性命题提供了信息论表述。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-信息速率与熵产生率的可加性\">信息速率与熵产生率的可加性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-信息速率与熵产生率的可加性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>上一段已把调度刻画为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda(t)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal E(t)$</span> 的二元组。本节补足的关键在于：这两个量在<strong>时间拼接</strong>下如何复合，以及这一复合性质如何把“调度 = 时间预算”从比喻提升为恒等式。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 5.6（调度的拼接）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_1:[0,T_1]\\to(0,\\infty)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_2:[0,T_2]\\to(0,\\infty)$</span> 为两个调度，满足拼接条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_1(T_1)=\\mathrm{SNR}_2(0)$</span>。定义拼接调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_1\\oplus\\mathrm{SNR}_2:[0,T_1+T_2]\\to(0,\\infty)$</span> 为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$(\\mathrm{SNR}_1\\oplus\\mathrm{SNR}_2)(t)=\\begin{cases}\\mathrm{SNR}_1(t), &amp; t\\in[0,T_1],\\\\ \\mathrm{SNR}_2(t-T_1), &amp; t\\in(T_1,T_1+T_2].\\end{cases}$$</div>\n拼接条件保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_1\\oplus\\mathrm{SNR}_2$</span> 连续；若两端在拼接点的一阶导数也匹配，则拼接调度属于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5.7（信息速率的拼接可加性）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_1,\\mathrm{SNR}_2$</span> 满足拼接条件且各自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span>，则拼接调度的对数速率满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\lambda_{\\oplus}(t)=\\begin{cases}\\lambda_1(t), &amp; t\\in(0,T_1),\\\\ \\lambda_2(t-T_1), &amp; t\\in(T_1,T_1+T_2),\\end{cases}$$</div>\n且在拼接点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T_1$</span> 处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_\\oplus$</span> 至多有一个跳跃，跳跃量等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_2(0^+)-\\lambda_1(T_1^-)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,T_1)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(T_1,T_1+T_2)$</span> 内部，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_\\oplus=\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm dt}\\log\\mathrm{SNR}_\\oplus$</span> 直接由分段定义求导得到，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_1,\\lambda_2$</span> 一致。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T_1$</span> 处，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\mathrm{SNR}_\\oplus$</span> 连续（拼接条件），但其左右导数分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_1(T_1^-)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_2(0^+)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_\\oplus$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_1$</span> 处的跳跃为二者之差。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 5.8（拼接调度的总信息预算）</strong> 在命题 5.7 的假设下，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_0^{T_1+T_2}\\lambda_\\oplus(t)\\,\\mathrm dt=\\log\\frac{\\mathrm{SNR}_1(0)}{\\mathrm{SNR}_2(T_2)}.$$</div>\n即拼接调度的总对数信噪比变化只依赖首尾端点，与中间拼接点无关。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 5.7，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^{T_1+T_2}\\lambda_\\oplus=\\int_0^{T_1}\\lambda_1+\\int_0^{T_2}\\lambda_2=\\bigl(\\log\\mathrm{SNR}_1(T_1)-\\log\\mathrm{SNR}_1(0)\\bigr)+\\bigl(\\log\\mathrm{SNR}_2(T_2)-\\log\\mathrm{SNR}_2(0)\\bigr)$</span>。用拼接条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_1(T_1)=\\mathrm{SNR}_2(0)$</span> 消去中间项，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\mathrm{SNR}_2(T_2)-\\log\\mathrm{SNR}_1(0)$</span>，即所证。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>信息论解读</strong>：推论 5.8 说明“总信息预算”是一个<strong>端点泛函</strong>，调度曲线只决定预算如何在时间上分配。这与第 6 节变分问题的约束 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\lambda\\,\\mathrm dt=\\log\\mathrm{SNR}(0)-\\log\\mathrm{SNR}(T)$</span> 完全一致：约束固定的是端点差，优化的是分配形状。拼接可加性因此是变分问题的结构性前提——若总预算不具端点性，约束就无法写成单个积分等式。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-熵产生率的拼接与凸性\">熵产生率的拼接与凸性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-熵产生率的拼接与凸性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 5.9（熵产生率在拼接下的可加性失效）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t^{(1)},p_t^{(2)}$</span> 分别为两个调度下的边缘族，且拼接条件保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{T_1}^{(1)}=p_0^{(2)}$</span>（即拼接点处边缘分布一致）。则拼接调度的熵产生率满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal E_\\oplus(t)=\\begin{cases}\\mathcal E_1(t), &amp; t\\in(0,T_1),\\\\ \\mathcal E_2(t-T_1), &amp; t\\in(T_1,T_1+T_2),\\end{cases}$$</div>\n但<strong>总熵变</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^{T_1+T_2}\\mathcal E_\\oplus\\,\\mathrm dt=H(p_{T_1+T_2}^{(2)})-H(p_0^{(1)})$</span> 不等于两段总熵变之和减去中间熵，除非中间熵为零。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：分段内部 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal E_\\oplus=\\mathcal E_1$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal E_2$</span> 由定义直接得到。总熵变为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p_{T_1+T_2}^{(2)})-H(p_0^{(1)})$</span>。而两段总熵变之和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bigl(H(p_{T_1}^{(1)})-H(p_0^{(1)})\\bigr)+\\bigl(H(p_{T_2}^{(2)})-H(p_0^{(2)})\\bigr)$</span>。用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{T_1}^{(1)}=p_0^{(2)}$</span>，两者之差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p_{T_1}^{(1)})-H(p_0^{(2)})=0$</span>（因分布相同），故实际上二者相等。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>说明</strong>：上述证明显示，在边缘分布拼接一致的条件下，总熵变<strong>确实</strong>可加。真正失效的是<strong>逐点</strong>可加性：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal E_\\oplus(T_1)$</span> 在拼接点无定义（左右极限一般不等），因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal E$</span> 依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 可微性，而拼接点处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 的时间导数可能跳跃。这与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 的跳跃是同一现象的两个侧面：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 跳跃导致 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal E=d\\lambda(1+\\bar\\alpha)$</span> 在拼接点跳跃（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span> 连续时）。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 5.10（cosine 与线性拼接的熵产生剖面）</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_1=T_2=1/2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_1$</span> 为线性调度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1/2]$</span> 的限制，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_2$</span> 为 cosine 调度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[1/2,1]$</span> 的限制，拼接条件要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_1(1/2)=\\mathrm{SNR}_2(1/2)$</span>。线性调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_1(t)=(1-2t)/(2t)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1/2$</span> 处为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，而 cosine 调度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1/2$</span> 处为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\cot^2(\\pi/4)=1$</span>，不满足拼接条件。故该拼接不合法；合法拼接需先对两调度做端点对齐（第 11 节重参数化）。这说明拼接可加性不是无条件的，拼接条件是实质约束。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-得分范数与信息速率的分离-一个恒等式\">得分范数与信息速率的分离：一个恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-得分范数与信息速率的分离-一个恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>上一段断言“<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\nabla\\log p_t\\|^2$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 的泛函，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 不是”。此处给出精确恒等式，把这一分离写成可检验的形式。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5.11（得分范数与 SNR 速率的关系）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S(t)=\\mathbb E_{p_t}\\|\\nabla\\log p_t(x_t)\\|^2$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$S(t)=\\frac{1}{\\sigma_t^2}\\,\\mathbb E_{p_t}\\bigl\\|\\alpha_t\\hat x_0(x_t)-x_t\\bigr\\|^2/\\sigma_t^2\\cdot\\sigma_t^2=\\frac{\\mathbb E_{p_t}\\|\\alpha_t\\hat x_0-x_t\\|^2}{\\sigma_t^4},$$</div>\n且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S(t)$</span> 可分解为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$S(t)=\\frac{\\alpha_t^2}{\\sigma_t^4}\\,\\mathbb E_{p_t}\\|\\hat x_0-x_0\\|^2+\\frac{\\alpha_t^2}{\\sigma_t^4}\\,\\mathbb E_{p_t}\\|x_0\\|^2-\\frac{2\\alpha_t}{\\sigma_t^4}\\mathbb E_{p_t}\\langle \\hat x_0-x_0,x_t-\\alpha_t x_0\\rangle+\\frac{d}{\\sigma_t^2}.$$</div>\n特别地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S(t)$</span> 依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\hat x_0-x_0\\|^2$</span>（去噪误差）与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|x_0\\|^2$</span>（数据二阶矩），而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda(t)$</span> 只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t,\\sigma_t$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由 Tweedie 恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t(x_t)=(\\alpha_t\\hat x_0(x_t)-x_t)/\\sigma_t^2$</span>，两边取平方期望得第一式。第二式由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\alpha_t x_0+\\sigma_t\\varepsilon$</span> 代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t\\hat x_0-x_t=\\alpha_t(\\hat x_0-x_0)-\\sigma_t\\varepsilon$</span>，展开平方并用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\varepsilon]=0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\varepsilon\\|^2=d$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\perp x_0$</span> 得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 5.12（得分范数的下界）</strong> 在命题 5.11 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S(t)\\ge d/\\sigma_t^2$</span>，等号当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0=x_0$</span>（完美去噪）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由分解式，前三项之和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{\\sigma_t^4}\\mathbb E\\|\\alpha_t(\\hat x_0-x_0)\\|^2\\ge0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S(t)\\ge d/\\sigma_t^2$</span>。等号条件为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0=x_0$</span> 几乎处处。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>信息论解读</strong>：推论 5.12 说明得分范数有一个由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 决定的<strong>几何下界</strong>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 无关；超出下界的部分才是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 的信息内容。调度通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 移动这个下界，但不改变超出部分的结构。这正是“调度优化只能优化时间预算”的精确含义：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 控制下界的移动速率，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0-x_0$</span> 控制信息内容，二者在 ELBO 中相乘（定理 5.4 的权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\mathrm{SNR}$</span> 乘以去噪误差），但不可互相替代。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-时间预算的变分刻画-从速率到分配\">时间预算的变分刻画：从速率到分配<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-时间预算的变分刻画-从速率到分配\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>上一段把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal E$</span> 的拼接性质确立为端点泛函，但尚未回答一个结构性问题：给定总预算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L=\\log\\mathrm{SNR}(0)-\\log\\mathrm{SNR}(T)$</span>，何种 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 在何种意义下是“最优分配”？本节不展开第 6 节的完整变分问题，只在此处建立一个<strong>局部</strong>判据，说明信息论解释为何必须区分“速率最优”与“分配最优”。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 5.13（预算泛函与分配泛函）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T\\lambda\\,\\mathrm dt=L$</span> 的连续函数全体。定义两个泛函：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal B[\\lambda]=\\int_0^T w(t)\\,\\lambda(t)\\,\\mathrm dt,\\qquad \\mathcal A[\\lambda]=\\int_0^T \\lambda(t)^2\\,\\mathrm dt,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)=\\mathbb E_{p_t}\\|\\hat x_0(x_t)-x_0\\|^2$</span> 为去噪误差剖面（依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 与调度，但在本节视为给定权函数）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal B$</span> 是 ELBO 的连续极限（定理 5.4 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum\\Delta\\mathrm{SNR}_k\\cdot w_k$</span> 在网格加密下的极限），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal A$</span> 是速率平方的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 能量。</p>\n<p><strong>区别说明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal B$</span> 是<strong>线性</strong>泛函，其最优解在约束下退化——若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 无界，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal B$</span> 无下界，说明线性目标不能单独决定分配；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal A$</span> 是<strong>凸</strong>泛函，其最优解唯一，是常数速率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda\\equiv L/T$</span>。二者刻画的是不同问题：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal B$</span> 关心“预算花在何处最省误差”，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal A$</span> 关心“速率本身的平滑性”。第 6 节的变分问题将是二者的加权组合，而非任一单独泛函。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5.14（常数速率是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 能量最小解）</strong> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L$</span> 上，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal A[\\lambda]$</span> 的唯一极小点为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda^\\star\\equiv L/T$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal A[\\lambda^\\star]=L^2/T$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由 Cauchy–Schwarz，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bigl(\\int_0^T\\lambda\\bigr)^2\\le T\\int_0^T\\lambda^2$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal A[\\lambda]\\ge L^2/T$</span>，等号当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 为常数。约束 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\lambda=L$</span> 迫使该常数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L/T$</span>。唯一性由等号条件给出。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 5.15（常数速率对应指数型 SNR 调度）</strong> 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda\\equiv L/T$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=\\log\\mathrm{SNR}(0)-\\frac{L}{T}t$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=\\mathrm{SNR}(0)\\,e^{-Lt/T}$</span>。在方差保持参数化下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\mathrm{SNR}(t)/(1+\\mathrm{SNR}(t))$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=1/(1+\\mathrm{SNR}(t))$</span>。这是<strong>指数调度</strong>，其 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 为常数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal E(t)=d\\lambda(1+\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 单调变化但不发散（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}$</span> 在两端取有限值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(0)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(T)$</span>）。</p>\n<p><strong>验证</strong>：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(0)=10^4$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(1)=10^{-4}$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L=\\log 10^8$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda=-L$</span>。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1/2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}=10^0=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha=1/2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal E=-L\\cdot1.5$</span>，有限。对比线性调度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1/2$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal E=-6$</span>（推论 5.3 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span> 情形），指数调度的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal E$</span> 量级由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 决定而非由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的端点奇性决定。</p>\n<p><strong>信息论解读</strong>：推论 5.15 说明，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 意义下的最优分配是<strong>对数域线性</strong>的，即 SNR 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log$</span> 尺度上匀速衰减。这与 cosine 调度“中部近似均匀”形成对照：cosine 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}$</span> 尺度上中部均匀，指数调度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\mathrm{SNR}$</span> 尺度上全程均匀。二者都是“均匀”，但均匀的坐标不同，故 ELBO 权重剖面不同（定理 5.4）。这精确化了“调度 = 时间预算”的第二层含义：预算的<strong>坐标选择</strong>（线性 SNR 还是对数 SNR）本身是调度设计的一部分。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-熵产生率与预算坐标的不变性\">熵产生率与预算坐标的不变性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-熵产生率与预算坐标的不变性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 5.16（熵产生率在重参数化下的协变律）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi:[0,T]\\to[0,T']$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 严格递增双射，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi(0)=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi(T)=T'$</span>。定义重参数化调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}'(u)=\\mathrm{SNR}(\\phi^{-1}(u))$</span>。则在 (A1)–(A3) 下，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\lambda'(u)=\\lambda(\\phi^{-1}(u))\\,\\frac{\\mathrm d\\phi^{-1}}{\\mathrm d u}(u),\\qquad \\mathcal E'(u)=\\mathcal E(\\phi^{-1}(u))\\,\\frac{\\mathrm d\\phi^{-1}}{\\mathrm d u}(u).$$</div>\n即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal E$</span> 都是<strong>一阶密度</strong>，在重参数化下按 Jacobian 协变，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}$</span> 本身是<strong>零阶标量</strong>，不变。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\mathrm{SNR}'(u)=\\log\\mathrm{SNR}(\\phi^{-1}(u))$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 求导用链式法则得第一式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal E'(u)=\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm du}H(p_{\\phi^{-1}(u)})=\\frac{\\mathrm d H}{\\mathrm dt}\\big|_{t=\\phi^{-1}(u)}\\cdot\\frac{\\mathrm d\\phi^{-1}}{\\mathrm d u}$</span>，得第二式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}'(u)=\\mathrm{SNR}(\\phi^{-1}(u))$</span> 直接由定义，无 Jacobian。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 5.17（总预算的重参数化不变性）</strong> 在命题 5.16 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^{T'}\\lambda'(u)\\,\\mathrm du=\\int_0^T\\lambda(t)\\,\\mathrm dt=L$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^{T'}\\mathcal E'(u)\\,\\mathrm du=\\int_0^T\\mathcal E(t)\\,\\mathrm dt=H(p_T)-H(p_0)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：换元 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=\\phi(t)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm du=\\phi'(t)\\,\\mathrm dt$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\mathrm d\\phi^{-1}}{\\mathrm d u}=1/\\phi'(t)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda'(u)\\,\\mathrm du=\\lambda(t)\\,\\mathrm dt$</span>，积分相等。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal E$</span> 同理。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>信息论解读</strong>：推论 5.17 是第 11 节“时间重参数化的不变性”的信息论侧写：总预算与总熵变是<strong>端点量</strong>，在重参数化下不变；而逐点速率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 与逐点熵产生 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal E$</span> 是<strong>密度量</strong>，按 Jacobian 变换。这解释了为何第 6 节的变分问题必须在固定端点约束下进行：若允许端点变动，总预算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 本身成为变量，问题退化为无约束优化，失去“预算”语义。同时说明，调度设计的自由度分为两类——<strong>坐标选择</strong>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi$</span>，改变密度但不改变总量）与<strong>预算总量</strong>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span>，改变端点），二者不可混为一谈。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-一个可检验的恒等式-熵产生率对-SNR-的导数\">一个可检验的恒等式：熵产生率对 SNR 的导数<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-一个可检验的恒等式-熵产生率对-SNR-的导数\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>上一段建立了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal E$</span> 的协变律，但未给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal E$</span> 作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}$</span> 函数的显式依赖。以下恒等式把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal E$</span> 写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}$</span> 的泛函导数，从而把“调度 = 时间预算”落实为可微结构。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5.18（熵产生率对 log-SNR 的变分）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 及方差保持参数化下，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s(t)=\\log\\mathrm{SNR}(t)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha(s)=e^s/(1+e^s)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^2(s)=1/(1+e^s)$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal E(t)=-\\frac{\\mathrm ds}{\\mathrm dt}\\,d\\,\\bigl(1+\\bar\\alpha(s(t))\\bigr)=-\\lambda(t)\\,d\\,\\frac{1+2e^{s(t)}}{1+e^{s(t)}}.$$</div>\n等价地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal E$</span> 作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 的函数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal E=-d\\,\\dot s\\,(1+\\bar\\alpha(s))$</span>，其对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 的偏导为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial s}\\bigl[\\mathcal E/\\dot s\\bigr]=-d\\,\\frac{e^s}{(1+e^s)^2}=-\\frac{d}{4}\\,\\mathrm{sech}^2\\!\\bigl(s/2\\bigr).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 5.2 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal E=d\\lambda(1+\\bar\\alpha)$</span>，代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda=-\\dot s$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=\\log\\mathrm{SNR}$</span> 递减）与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha=e^s/(1+e^s)$</span>，得第一式。第二式对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 求偏导：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial s}(1+\\bar\\alpha)=\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial s}\\frac{1+2e^s}{1+e^s}=\\frac{2e^s(1+e^s)-(1+2e^s)e^s}{(1+e^s)^2}=\\frac{e^s}{(1+e^s)^2}$</span>，乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-d$</span> 得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 5.19（熵产生率对 SNR 的敏感度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=0$</span> 处最大）</strong> 在命题 5.18 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bigl|\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial s}[\\mathcal E/\\dot s]\\bigr|$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=0$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha=1/2$</span>）处取最大值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d/4$</span>，并向 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\to\\pm\\infty$</span> 指数衰减。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{sech}^2(s/2)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=0$</span> 处为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，为全局最大，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{sech}^2$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=0$</span> 对称、单调递减于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|s|$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>信息论解读</strong>：推论 5.19 说明，调度对熵产生率的影响在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}=1$</span> 附近最敏感，在两端（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}\\to\\infty$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to0$</span>）饱和。这为第 9 节“调度对采样步数的影响”提供了定量依据：采样步数应密集分配在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}\\approx1$</span> 的区间，因为该区间内 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal E$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 的变化最敏感，即信息量变化最快。同时说明，cosine 调度把权重集中在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}\\approx1$</span> 附近（推论 5.5），正是利用了该敏感度峰值——这不是巧合，而是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{sech}^2$</span> 结构的必然结果。</p>\n<h3 id=\"df06--h-最优调度的变分问题\">最优调度的变分问题<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-最优调度的变分问题\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已建立的符号：前向过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\alpha_t x_0+\\sigma_t\\varepsilon$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t,\\sigma_t&gt;0$</span> 为时间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span> 上的连续可微函数，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t^2+\\sigma_t^2=1$</span>（方差保持参数化）。信噪比定义为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=\\frac{\\alpha_t^2}{\\sigma_t^2}.$$</div>\n记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\equiv\\alpha_t$</span>（本章 canonical 记号），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\sigma_t\\equiv\\sigma_t$</span>。令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\alpha_t x_0,\\sigma_t^2 I)$</span>，边缘分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t(x_t)=\\int q_t(x_t\\mid x_0)\\,p_{\\mathrm{data}}(x_0)\\,dx_0$</span>。记得分函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(x)=\\nabla_x\\log q_t(x)$</span>。</p>\n<p>本节新引入的符号如下，先定义后使用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>调度（schedule）</strong>：映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda:[0,T]\\to[0,\\infty)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda(t)=\\mathrm{SNR}(t)$</span>，要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 连续、严格单调递减、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda(0)=\\infty$</span>（或取有限大值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_{\\max}$</span>）、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda(T)=0$</span>（或取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_{\\min}$</span>）。称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 为<strong>信噪比调度</strong>。</li>\n<li><strong>时间预算密度</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho(t)=-\\dfrac{d}{dt}\\log\\lambda(t)=-\\dfrac{\\dot\\lambda(t)}{\\lambda(t)}\\ge 0$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\lambda=d\\lambda/dt$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 刻画单位时间内对数信噪比的衰减速率，称为<strong>对数信噪比速率</strong>。</li>\n<li><strong>变分泛函</strong>：对可允许调度类 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda$</span>（定义见下文），定义\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal J[\\lambda]=\\int_0^T w(t)\\,\\rho(t)\\,dt,\\qquad w(t)=\\mathbb E_{q_t}\\!\\left[\\|\\nabla_x\\log q_t(x_t)-\\nabla_x\\log q_t(x_t\\mid x_0)\\|^2\\right],$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)$</span> 为得分匹配的瞬时残差能量（对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\sim p_{\\mathrm{data}}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\sim q_t(\\cdot\\mid x_0)$</span> 取期望）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>假设 A1（正则性）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t,\\sigma_t\\in C^1([0,T])$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t&gt;0$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,T)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_0=1,\\sigma_0=0$</span>（端点按极限理解），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_T=0,\\sigma_T=1$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda(t)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,T)$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\lambda&lt;0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 A2（可积性）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)\\rho(t)\\in L^1([0,T])$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,T)$</span> 上连续、有界：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{t\\in(0,T)}w(t)\\le W&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 A3（可允许类）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda=\\{\\lambda\\in C^1((0,T))\\cap C([0,T]):\\lambda\\text{ 严格递减},\\ \\lambda(0)=\\lambda_{\\max},\\ \\lambda(T)=\\lambda_{\\min},\\ \\rho(t)\\ge 0,\\ \\int_0^T\\rho\\,dt=\\log(\\lambda_{\\max}/\\lambda_{\\min})\\}$</span>。后一约束是端点条件的直接推论，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda$</span> 中所有调度共享同一“总预算” <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_0=\\log(\\lambda_{\\max}/\\lambda_{\\min})$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 A4（数据正则性）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{data}}$</span> 有紧支撑且密度有界，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_{\\mathrm{data}}$</span> 平方可积；由此 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t&gt;0$</span> 时具有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 密度且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t$</span> 平方可积（高斯卷积的光滑化效应）。</p>\n<p>下面说明本节与相邻概念的区别：第 5 节从信息论角度把调度解释为“每单位时间消除的不确定度”，其对象是熵速率；本节的变分问题则以<strong>得分匹配残差能量</strong>为被积权重，对<strong>对数信噪比速率</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 做时间预算分配。二者共享 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 这一对象，但泛函不同：信息论解释给出的是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 与熵的关系式，本节给出的是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 的最优分配条件。这一区别是本节全部推导的出发点。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-一-变分问题的建立与一阶条件\">一、变分问题的建立与一阶条件<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-一-变分问题的建立与一阶条件\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义 1（最优调度）</strong>：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda^\\star\\in\\Lambda$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J[\\lambda^\\star]=\\inf_{\\lambda\\in\\Lambda}\\mathcal J[\\lambda]$</span>，称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda^\\star$</span> 为<strong>变分最优调度</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 1（泛函的等价形式）</strong>：在 A1–A3 下，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal J[\\lambda]=\\int_0^T w(t)\\rho(t)\\,dt=\\int_{\\lambda_{\\min}}^{\\lambda_{\\max}}\\frac{w(t(\\lambda))}{\\lambda}\\,d\\lambda,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t(\\lambda)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 的反函数。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho=-d\\log\\lambda/dt$</span> 与换元 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=\\log\\lambda$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$du=\\dot\\lambda/\\lambda\\,dt=-\\rho\\,dt$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 增至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\lambda_{\\max}$</span> 降至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\lambda_{\\min}$</span>。于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_0^T w(t)\\rho(t)\\,dt=\\int_0^T w(t)\\left(-\\frac{d u}{dt}\\right)dt=\\int_{\\log\\lambda_{\\min}}^{\\log\\lambda_{\\max}}w(t(u))\\,du.$$</div>\n再令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda=e^u$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$du=d\\lambda/\\lambda$</span>，得第二等式。被积函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t(\\lambda))/\\lambda$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[\\lambda_{\\min},\\lambda_{\\max}]$</span> 上可积：<span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 有界（A2），<span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\lambda\\le 1/\\lambda_{\\min}&lt;\\infty$</span>，且区间长度有限。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 1 的关键含义：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J$</span> 只依赖<strong>复合函数</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\circ t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 轴上的取值，而不单独依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的参数化。这为后面的时间重参数化不变性（第 11 节）埋下接口，本节只用它做一阶条件推导。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 2（一阶变分条件）</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda^\\star\\in\\Lambda$</span> 为内点极小点，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\in C^1((0,T))$</span>，则对任意满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T h(t)\\,dt=0$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 扰动 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$h(0)=h(T)=0$</span>），有\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_0^T\\Big[w'(t)\\rho^\\star(t)-w(t)\\frac{\\dot\\rho^\\star(t)}{\\rho^\\star(t)}\\Big]h(t)\\,dt=0,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho^\\star=-\\dot\\lambda^\\star/\\lambda^\\star$</span>。若进一步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho^\\star&gt;0$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,T)$</span>，则逐点成立\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$w'(t)\\rho^\\star(t)=w(t)\\frac{\\dot\\rho^\\star(t)}{\\rho^\\star(t)}.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：取扰动 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_\\epsilon=\\lambda^\\star\\exp(-\\epsilon h)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_\\epsilon\\in\\Lambda$</span>（因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int h=0$</span> 保证端点不变，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 充分小时严格递减性保持）。对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_\\epsilon=\\rho^\\star+\\epsilon\\dot h$</span>。计算\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal J[\\lambda_\\epsilon]-\\mathcal J[\\lambda^\\star]=\\int_0^T w(t)\\big(\\rho_\\epsilon-\\rho^\\star\\big)dt=\\epsilon\\int_0^T w(t)\\dot h(t)\\,dt.$$</div>\n对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int w\\dot h$</span> 分部积分：<span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\dot h=(wh)'-\\dot w h$</span>，边界项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[wh]_0^T=0$</span> 因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h(0)=h(T)=0$</span>。故一阶变分为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\epsilon\\int_0^T w'(t)h(t)\\,dt$</span>。另一方面，若把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 视为独立变分对象并施加约束 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\rho=L_0$</span>，用 Lagrange 乘子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span>，变分为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int(w+\\mu)\\delta\\rho=0$</span>，结合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta\\rho=\\epsilon\\dot h$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int(w+\\mu)\\dot h=0$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w'=0$</span> 在弱意义下——这与上式一致当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 为常数。更精细地，将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 的变分与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 的变分联立：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho=-\\dot\\lambda/\\lambda$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta\\rho=-(\\delta\\dot\\lambda)/\\lambda+(\\dot\\lambda/\\lambda)(\\delta\\lambda/\\lambda)=-\\delta(\\log\\lambda)'$</span>。于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\delta\\mathcal J=\\int_0^T w\\,\\delta\\rho\\,dt=\\int_0^T w\\,\\big(-\\delta(\\log\\lambda)'\\big)dt=\\int_0^T w'\\,\\delta(\\log\\lambda)\\,dt,$$</div>\n其中末步用了分部积分与边界项消失（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta(\\log\\lambda)$</span> 在端点为零）。令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta(\\log\\lambda)=-\\epsilon h$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_\\epsilon=\\lambda^\\star e^{-\\epsilon h}$</span>），得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta\\mathcal J=-\\epsilon\\int w'h$</span>。另一方面由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_\\epsilon=\\rho^\\star+\\epsilon\\dot h$</span> 直接得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta\\mathcal J=\\epsilon\\int w\\dot h$</span>。两式相等给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int w\\dot h=-\\int w'h$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int(w\\dot h+w'h)=0$</span>，亦即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int(wh)'=0$</span>，边界项消失使其自动成立——这说明上述两条路径给出的是同一恒等式，尚未给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho^\\star$</span> 的逐点条件。要得到逐点条件，须把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 作为独立函数变分并保留约束 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\rho=L_0$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta\\mathcal J=\\int(w+\\mu)\\delta\\rho=0$</span> 对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta\\rho$</span> 成立，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w+\\mu=0$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,T)$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 为常数。但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 由数据与调度共同决定，一般不为常数；因此<strong>内点极小点存在的必要条件是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho^\\star$</span> 的支撑上为常数</strong>——这正是下一小节要展开的“等残差原则”。将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 常数记作 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar w$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J=\\bar w L_0$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 的具体形状无关；此时任何满足端点与单调性的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 都是极小点（泛函平坦）。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 非常数，则极小点必在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda$</span> 的边界上取得，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 取退化形式（某处集中）。这一结论的严格表述见命题 3。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>命题 3（等残差原则与边界解）</strong>：在 A1–A4 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,T)$</span> 上非常数，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda$</span> 的内点无临界点；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\inf_\\Lambda\\mathcal J$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 的退化极限取得，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho\\to L_0\\delta_{t^\\star}$</span>（Dirac 质量集中于某 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t^\\star$</span>），此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J\\to L_0\\,w(t^\\star)$</span>，最优 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t^\\star=\\arg\\min_t w(t)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 2 的 Lagrange 乘子论证，内点临界点要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w+\\mu\\equiv 0$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 常数。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 非常数，内点无临界点。考虑退化族 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_\\epsilon=L_0\\,\\phi_\\epsilon(t-t^\\star)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_\\epsilon$</span> 为磨光核（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\phi_\\epsilon=1$</span>，支撑半径 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span>）。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 连续（A2）与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_\\epsilon$</span> 的磨光性质，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_0^T w(t)\\rho_\\epsilon(t)\\,dt=L_0\\int w(t)\\phi_\\epsilon(t-t^\\star)\\,dt\\to L_0\\,w(t^\\star)\\quad(\\epsilon\\to0),$$</div>\n收敛由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 有界与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_\\epsilon$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 归一性保证（Dominated Convergence，控制函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W\\phi_\\epsilon$</span> 可积）。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\inf_\\Lambda\\mathcal J\\le L_0\\min_t w(t)$</span>。反之对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho\\in\\Lambda$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int w\\rho\\ge L_0\\min_t w(t)$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\rho=L_0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\ge\\min w$</span>）。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\inf=L_0\\min_t w$</span>，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t^\\star=\\arg\\min w$</span> 取得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 3 的工程含义直接而尖锐：<strong>若得分匹配残差能量沿时间非常数，则“最优调度”在连续时间意义下退化为把全部对数信噪比预算集中在残差最小的时间点上</strong>。这显然不是实践中想要的调度；实践中的 cosine、线性调度是<strong>受约束的平滑调度</strong>，其最优性只能相对于更窄的调度类（例如限制 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 的 Lipschitz 常数或限制 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 的形状族）来谈。这就引出下一小节的受限变分问题。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-二-受限变分问题与平滑调度的最优性\">二、受限变分问题与平滑调度的最优性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-二-受限变分问题与平滑调度的最优性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义 2（Lipschitz 调度类）</strong>：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M&gt;0$</span>，令\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Lambda_M=\\{\\lambda\\in\\Lambda:\\ \\rho\\in\\mathrm{Lip}_M((0,T)),\\ \\rho\\ge 0\\},$$</div>\n即对数信噪比速率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span>-Lipschitz。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_M$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda$</span> 的凸子集（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 的 Lipschitz 常数与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\rho$</span> 约束在凸组合下保持）。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4（受限问题的存在性与一阶条件）</strong>：设 A1–A4 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\in C^1$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w'$</span> 有界。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_M$</span> 上取得极小点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda^\\star_M$</span>；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda^\\star_M$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_M$</span> 的内点，则存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span> 使\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$w(t)+\\mu=\\nu(t),\\qquad \\nu(t)=\\int_0^t \\dot\\rho^\\star(s)\\,ds\\cdot\\frac{w(s)}{\\rho^\\star(s)}\\ \\text{的某种对偶变量},$$</div>\n更具体地，一阶条件为：存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu\\in\\mathbb R$</span> 与有界变差函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span>（对偶于 Lipschitz 约束），使\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$w(t)+\\mu=\\eta(t),\\qquad \\eta\\text{ 满足 }|\\eta|\\le M\\text{ 的互补松弛}.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明思路与关键步骤</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_M$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 拓扑下非空（常速率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho\\equiv L_0/T$</span> 属于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_M$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M\\ge L_0/T$</span> 时），且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_M$</span> 上弱下半连续（被积函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\rho$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 线性，线性泛函在弱拓扑下连续）。由 Banach–Alaoglu，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_M$</span> 的有界闭凸子集弱紧，故极小点存在。内点一阶条件由 Lagrange 乘子定理给出：约束为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\rho=L_0$</span>（乘子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span>）与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Lip}(\\rho)\\le M$</span>（乘子为有界变差函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span>，对应 Lipschitz 约束的积分形式）。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 的变分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta\\rho$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int(w+\\mu)\\delta\\rho+\\int\\eta\\,\\delta\\rho'=0$</span>，分部积分得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w+\\mu-\\dot\\eta=0$</span> 于弱意义，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\eta=w+\\mu$</span>，配合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\eta|\\le M$</span> 的互补松弛。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 4 说明：在 Lipschitz 约束下，最优 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 的形状由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 的导数决定——<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\eta=w+\\mu$</span> 意味着 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 的原函数加线性项，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 触及边界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pm M$</span> 的区间对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 的斜率饱和（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 取最大斜率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span>）。这正是 cosine 调度“两端平、中间陡”形状的变分来源：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 在中间时间段较大时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 在中间触及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 以最大速率下降；两端 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 较小，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 斜率受约束而趋平。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-三-可检验推论-cosine-调度的残差权重恒等式\">三、可检验推论：cosine 调度的残差权重恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-三-可检验推论-cosine-调度的残差权重恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>推论 1（cosine 调度的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J$</span> 显式表达）</strong>：取 canonical cosine 调度\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\cos^2\\!\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\frac{t/T+s}{1+s}\\right),\\qquad \\bar\\sigma_t^2=1-\\bar\\alpha_t^2,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\ge0$</span> 为偏移参数。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\lambda(t)=\\cot^2\\!\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\frac{t/T+s}{1+s}\\right),\\qquad \\rho(t)=\\frac{\\pi}{T(1+s)}\\cdot\\frac{2\\tan\\theta}{1+\\tan^2\\theta}\\Big|_{\\theta=\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\frac{t/T+s}{1+s}},$$</div>\n且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho(t)=\\dfrac{\\pi}{T}\\sin(\\pi t/T)\\cdot\\dfrac{2}{\\sin^2(\\pi t/T)+1}$</span> 的等价形式可由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda=\\cot^2\\theta$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\log\\lambda/d\\theta=-2/(\\sin\\theta\\cos\\theta)$</span> 逐步算出。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda=\\bar\\alpha_t^2/\\bar\\sigma_t^2=\\cos^2\\theta/(1-\\cos^2\\theta)=\\cot^2\\theta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta=\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\frac{t/T+s}{1+s}$</span>。于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log\\lambda=2\\log\\cot\\theta,\\qquad \\frac{d\\log\\lambda}{d\\theta}=-2\\frac{1}{\\sin\\theta\\cos\\theta}=-\\frac{4}{\\sin 2\\theta}.$$</div>\n链式法则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho=-\\frac{d\\log\\lambda}{dt}=-\\frac{d\\log\\lambda}{d\\theta}\\cdot\\frac{d\\theta}{dt}=\\frac{4}{\\sin 2\\theta}\\cdot\\frac{\\pi}{2T(1+s)}=\\frac{2\\pi}{T(1+s)\\sin 2\\theta}$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta=\\pi t/(2T)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sin 2\\theta=\\sin(\\pi t/T)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho(t)=\\frac{2\\pi}{T\\sin(\\pi t/T)}$</span>。端点行为：<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to0^+$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sin(\\pi t/T)\\sim\\pi t/T$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho\\sim 2/t\\to\\infty$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to T^-$</span> 时同理 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho\\to\\infty$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 1 的端点发散正是第 10 节“端点奇异”的入口：cosine 调度的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 在两端不可积？检查：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T\\rho\\,dt=\\log(\\lambda_{\\max}/\\lambda_{\\min})$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_{\\max}=\\cot^2(\\frac{\\pi s}{2(1+s)})$</span> 有限（<span class=\"math-inline\">$s&gt;0$</span> 时），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_{\\min}=0$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\lambda_{\\min}=-\\infty$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\rho=\\infty$</span>。这说明<strong>严格端点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T=0$</span> 使总预算发散</strong>，实践中必须取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_{\\min}&gt;0$</span> 的近似端点。这一事实与假设 A3 的有限预算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_0$</span> 冲突，故 A3 中端点按“近似”理解，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s&gt;0$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_{\\min}&gt;0$</span> 截断是必要的。本节后续公式均在截断意义下成立。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 2（线性调度的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 与预算）</strong>：取线性调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=1-t/T$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span>），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda(t)=(1-t/T)^2/(1-(1-t/T)^2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho(t)=\\dfrac{2}{T}\\cdot\\dfrac{1}{1-t/T}\\cdot\\dfrac{1}{1-(1-t/T)^2}^{-1}$</span> 的具体形式为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\rho(t)=\\frac{2}{T}\\left(\\frac{1}{1-t/T}+\\frac{1}{1+t/T}\\right)=\\frac{4}{T}\\cdot\\frac{1}{1-(t/T)^2}.$$</div>\n<strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\lambda=2\\log(1-t/T)-\\log(1-(1-t/T)^2)$</span>。求导：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{dt}\\log\\lambda=-\\frac{2}{T(1-t/T)}+\\frac{2(1-t/T)(-1/T)}{1-(1-t/T)^2}\\cdot(-1)=\\frac{2}{T}\\Big(-\\frac{1}{1-t/T}+\\frac{1-t/T}{1-(1-t/T)^2}\\Big).$$</div>\n注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-(1-u)^2=u(2-u)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$u=1-t/T$</span>，故第二项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=\\frac{u}{u(2-u)}=\\frac{1}{2-u}=\\frac{1}{1+t/T}$</span>。合并得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho=\\frac{2}{T}(\\frac{1}{1+t/T}-\\frac{1}{1-t/T})$</span> 的符号需复核：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}\\log\\lambda$</span> 应为负（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 递减），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho=-\\frac{d}{dt}\\log\\lambda=\\frac{2}{T}(\\frac{1}{1-t/T}-\\frac{1}{1+t/T})=\\frac{2}{T}\\cdot\\frac{2t/T}{1-(t/T)^2}=\\frac{4t/T^2}{1-(t/T)^2}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 2 与推论 1 对比：线性调度的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 处为零（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 附近变化慢），在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to T$</span> 处发散（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda\\to0$</span> 快）；cosine 调度的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 在两端均发散、中间有极小。这一差异直接决定了两类调度在得分匹配残差加权下的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J$</span> 值不同，是第 9 节“采样步数影响”的定量基础。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-四-具体例子-高斯数据下的-w-t-与数值验证\">四、具体例子：高斯数据下的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)$</span> 与数值验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-四-具体例子-高斯数据下的-w-t-与数值验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>例 1</strong>：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{data}}=\\mathcal N(0,I_d)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 维。此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t=\\mathcal N(0,(\\alpha_t^2+\\sigma_t^2)I_d)=\\mathcal N(0,I_d)$</span>（方差保持），得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(x)=-x$</span>。条件得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(x\\mid x_0)=-(x-\\alpha_t x_0)/\\sigma_t^2$</span>。残差\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s_t(x)-s_t(x\\mid x_0)=-x+\\frac{x-\\alpha_t x_0}{\\sigma_t^2}=\\frac{(1-\\sigma_t^2)x-\\alpha_t x_0}{\\sigma_t^2}=\\frac{\\alpha_t^2 x-\\alpha_t x_0}{\\sigma_t^2}=\\frac{\\alpha_t(\\alpha_t x-x_0)}{\\sigma_t^2}.$$</div>\n在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x=\\alpha_t x_0+\\sigma_t\\varepsilon$</span> 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t x-x_0=\\alpha_t^2x_0+\\alpha_t\\sigma_t\\varepsilon-x_0=(\\alpha_t^2-1)x_0+\\alpha_t\\sigma_t\\varepsilon=-\\sigma_t^2x_0+\\alpha_t\\sigma_t\\varepsilon$</span>。故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|s_t-s_t(\\cdot\\mid x_0)\\|^2=\\frac{\\|\\alpha_t\\sigma_t\\varepsilon-\\sigma_t^2x_0\\|^2}{\\sigma_t^4}=\\frac{\\alpha_t^2\\|\\varepsilon\\|^2-2\\alpha_t\\sigma_t\\langle\\varepsilon,x_0\\rangle+\\sigma_t^2\\|x_0\\|^2}{\\sigma_t^2}.$$</div>\n取期望（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\varepsilon\\|^2=d$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\langle\\varepsilon,x_0\\rangle=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|x_0\\|^2=d$</span>）：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$w(t)=\\frac{\\alpha_t^2 d+\\sigma_t^2 d}{\\sigma_t^2}=d\\left(\\frac{\\alpha_t^2}{\\sigma_t^2}+1\\right)=d\\big(\\lambda(t)+1\\big).$$</div>\n于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J[\\lambda]=d\\int_0^T(\\lambda(t)+1)\\rho(t)\\,dt$</span>。代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho=-d\\log\\lambda/dt$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int(\\lambda+1)\\rho\\,dt=-\\int(\\lambda+1)d\\log\\lambda$</span>。令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=\\log\\lambda$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda=e^u$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\int(e^u+1)du=-\\big[e^u+u\\big]_{u_{\\max}}^{u_{\\min}}=(\\lambda_{\\max}-\\lambda_{\\min})+\\log(\\lambda_{\\max}/\\lambda_{\\min})$</span>。故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal J[\\lambda]=d\\big[(\\lambda_{\\max}-\\lambda_{\\min})+L_0\\big],$$</div>\n<strong>与调度形状无关</strong>，只依赖端点。这验证了命题 3 的“泛函平坦”结论在高斯数据下的具体形态：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 的仿射函数时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J$</span> 对所有调度相同。这也说明：<strong>在高斯数据这一特例下，“最优调度”问题退化，任何满足端点条件的调度等价</strong>；非平凡的最优性只在非高斯数据（<span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 非仿射）时出现。这一例子同时验证了命题 1 的换元公式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int w\\rho=\\int(w/\\lambda)d\\lambda$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w/\\lambda=d(1+1/\\lambda)$</span>，积分得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d[(\\lambda-\\log\\lambda)]$</span> 的端点差，与上式一致。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>最优调度问题被表述为对对数信噪比速率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 的变分泛函 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J[\\lambda]=\\int w\\rho\\,dt$</span>，其被积权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 是得分匹配的瞬时残差能量；换元 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda=e^u$</span> 把泛函化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 轴上的积分，揭示 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J$</span> 只依赖复合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\circ t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 轴上的取值。</li>\n<li>无约束内点极小点的必要条件是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 支撑上为常数（等残差原则）；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 非常数，连续时间下的下确界由退化的 Dirac 型 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 取得，最优集中点为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 的最小点——这说明平滑调度（cosine、线性）的最优性只能相对于 Lipschitz 受限类 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_M$</span> 陈述，其一阶条件由对偶变量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w+\\mu$</span> 的原函数关系给出。</li>\n<li>高斯数据例子给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)=d(\\lambda(t)+1)$</span>，此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J=d[(\\lambda_{\\max}-\\lambda_{\\min})+L_0]$</span> 与调度形状无关，验证了泛函平坦性；cosine 与线性调度的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 显式表达（推论 1、2）显示二者端点奇异行为不同，为后续边界条件节与离散步长节提供定量接口。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-五-变分问题的对偶表述与预算约束的几何意义\">五、变分问题的对偶表述与预算约束的几何意义<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-五-变分问题的对偶表述与预算约束的几何意义\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 3 与命题 4 给出的结论需要在对偶空间中重新表述，才能与后续第 12 节“调度与 ELBO 权重”建立精确接口。本小节把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J$</span> 的极小化写成线性规划的对偶形式，并说明预算约束 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T\\rho\\,dt=L_0$</span> 的几何意义是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 在测度空间中的质量守恒。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 3（预算测度）</strong>：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda\\in\\Lambda$</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\lambda$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,T)$</span> 上由密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho(t)\\,dt$</span> 给出的正测度，即对任意 Borel 集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B\\subset(0,T)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\lambda(B)=\\int_B\\rho(t)\\,dt$</span>。由 A3，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\lambda((0,T))=L_0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\lambda$</span> 是总质量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_0$</span> 的概率测度乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5（对偶表述）</strong>：在 A1–A4 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J[\\lambda]=\\int_0^T w(t)\\,d\\mu_\\lambda(t)$</span>，且\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\inf_{\\lambda\\in\\Lambda}\\mathcal J[\\lambda]=\\sup\\Big\\{\\alpha L_0-\\int_0^T(\\alpha-w(t))_+\\,dt:\\ \\alpha\\in\\mathbb R\\Big\\},$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\cdot)_+=\\max(\\cdot,0)$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 连续，上确界在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha=w(t^\\star)$</span> 处取得，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t^\\star=\\arg\\min_t w(t)$</span>，且对偶值等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_0\\min_t w(t)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\lambda$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 的积分，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\lambda$</span> 遍历总质量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_0$</span> 的正测度集合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal M_{L_0}$</span>（因为对任意这样的测度，可取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 为其密度并构造 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span>，只要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 连续且正；连续性由磨光逼近，磨光不改变总质量）。于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\inf_{\\lambda\\in\\Lambda}\\mathcal J[\\lambda]=\\inf_{\\mu\\in\\mathcal M_{L_0}}\\int w\\,d\\mu.$$</div>\n这是线性规划：极小化线性泛函于仿射集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal M_{L_0}$</span> 上。其对偶由 Lagrange 乘子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha$</span> 给出：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\inf_{\\mu\\in\\mathcal M_{L_0}}\\int w\\,d\\mu=\\sup_{\\alpha\\in\\mathbb R}\\Big[\\alpha L_0+\\inf_{\\mu\\in\\mathcal M_{L_0}}\\int(w-\\alpha)\\,d\\mu\\Big].$$</div>\n内层下确界：对正测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span> 总质量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int(w-\\alpha)\\,d\\mu\\ge L_0\\inf_t(w(t)-\\alpha)=L_0(\\min w-\\alpha)$</span>，等号由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu=L_0\\delta_{t^\\star}$</span> 取得。但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal M_{L_0}$</span> 允许任意正测度，故内层下确界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_0\\min_t(w-\\alpha)$</span>。代回得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sup_\\alpha\\Big[\\alpha L_0+L_0\\min_t(w-\\alpha)\\Big]=L_0\\sup_\\alpha\\Big[\\alpha+\\min_t(w-\\alpha)\\Big]=L_0\\min_t w,$$</div>\n末步因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha+\\min_t(w-\\alpha)=\\min_t w$</span> 对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha$</span> 成立（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\min_t(w-\\alpha)=\\min_t w-\\alpha$</span>）。故对偶值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=L_0\\min_t w$</span>，与命题 3 的原始值一致，强对偶成立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 5 的对偶形式给出一个可检验的恒等式：<strong>对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha L_0-\\int(\\alpha-w)_+\\,dt\\le\\mathcal J[\\lambda]$</span></strong>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha=w(t^\\star)$</span> 时右端等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_0\\min w$</span>，达到下界。这一不等式链在数值上可直接验证：对给定调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 与任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha$</span>，计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha L_0-\\int(\\alpha-w)_+\\,dt$</span> 应不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J[\\lambda]$</span>。这为第 12 节的 ELBO 权重下界提供了一个纯测度论的出发点——ELBO 的每一项可写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\cdot]$</span> 对某个测度的积分，其权重正是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 的离散化。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 3（预算约束的不可约性）</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_1,\\lambda_2\\in\\Lambda$</span> 有相同端点，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J[\\lambda_1]-\\mathcal J[\\lambda_2]=\\int_0^T w(t)\\,(\\rho_1-\\rho_2)(t)\\,dt$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T(\\rho_1-\\rho_2)\\,dt=0$</span>。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J$</span> 的差只由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_1-\\rho_2$</span> 的<strong>形状</strong>决定，与总预算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_0$</span> 无关；特别地，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 为常数，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J[\\lambda_1]=\\mathcal J[\\lambda_2]$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：第一式由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J$</span> 的定义直接相减。第二式由 A3 的预算约束：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\rho_1=\\int\\rho_2=L_0$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\equiv\\bar w$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J[\\lambda_i]=\\bar w\\int\\rho_i=\\bar w L_0$</span>，两者相等。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 3 是命题 3 的定量补充：它说明<strong>调度之间的比较只在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 非常数时有意义</strong>，且比较的尺度是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 的差而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 本身。这解释了为何 cosine 与线性调度在高斯数据下给出相同的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J$</span>（例 1），而在非高斯数据下差异由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 的形状与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 的差的內积决定。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-六-与得分匹配目标的等价性-从-mathcal-J-到去噪损失\">六、与得分匹配目标的等价性：从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J$</span> 到去噪损失<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-六-与得分匹配目标的等价性-从-mathcal-J-到去噪损失\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节开头定义的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)$</span> 是得分匹配的瞬时残差能量。为使变分问题与训练目标严格对应，需要把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)$</span> 写成去噪得分匹配（denoising score matching）损失的期望形式，并验证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J$</span> 与训练损失的等价性。这一等价性是第 12 节 ELBO 权重推导的前提。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 4（去噪得分匹配损失）</strong>：对得分网络 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x,t)$</span>，定义\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}(\\theta)=\\int_0^T \\ell(t)\\,\\mathbb E_{x_0\\sim p_{\\mathrm{data}},\\,x_t\\sim q_t(\\cdot\\mid x_0)}\\big[\\|s_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\nabla_x\\log q_t(x_t\\mid x_0)\\|^2\\big]\\,dt,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell(t)&gt;0$</span> 为训练权重函数。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)=\\mathbb E[\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q_t(\\cdot\\mid x_0)\\|^2]$</span> 为瞬时损失。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J$</span> 与 DSM 的等价性）</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 在最优时取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t=\\nabla\\log q_t$</span>（即网络容量无限、训练收敛）。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal J[\\lambda]=\\int_0^T w(t)\\rho(t)\\,dt=\\int_0^T g_{\\mathrm{opt}}(t)\\,\\rho(t)\\,dt,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_{\\mathrm{opt}}(t)=\\mathbb E[\\|\\nabla\\log q_t(x_t)-\\nabla\\log q_t(x_t\\mid x_0)\\|^2]=w(t)$</span>。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J$</span> 是 DSM 损失在权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell(t)=\\rho(t)$</span> 下的期望值，且<strong>最优调度等价于在 DSM 训练中取权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell(t)=\\rho(t)$</span></strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta=s_t$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)=\\mathbb E[\\|s_t(x_t)-\\nabla\\log q_t(x_t\\mid x_0)\\|^2]=w(t)$</span>，逐点相等。代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}$</span> 的定义，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell=\\rho$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}=\\int w\\rho\\,dt=\\mathcal J$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 6 的工程含义是精确的：<strong>调度选择与训练权重选择是同一个变分问题的两个面</strong>。若固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell(t)=1$</span>（均匀权重），则训练损失为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int w\\,dt$</span>，与调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 无关；此时调度只影响采样，不影响训练。若取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell(t)=\\rho(t)$</span>，则训练损失等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J$</span>，调度通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 进入训练。这解释了为何实践中“调度”与“损失权重”常被分开处理：它们是同一泛函的不同参数化，但只有在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell=\\rho$</span> 时二者严格耦合。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 4（均匀权重下的调度无关性）</strong>：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell(t)\\equiv1$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 无关，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}=\\int_0^T w(t)\\,dt$</span>，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda\\in\\Lambda$</span> 相同。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell\\equiv1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}=\\int g_{\\mathrm{opt}}\\,dt=\\int w\\,dt$</span>，不含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 4 与推论 3 形成对照：推论 3 说 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 常数时与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 无关；推论 4 说均匀权重下 DSM 损失对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 无关。两者共同刻画了“调度何时真正进入目标函数”的边界：<strong>只有当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 非常数且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 耦合时，调度才影响训练目标</strong>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-七-一个非高斯例子-混合分布的-w-t-与调度的非平凡最优性\">七、一个非高斯例子：混合分布的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)$</span> 与调度的非平凡最优性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-七-一个非高斯例子-混合分布的-w-t-与调度的非平凡最优性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>例 1 的高斯数据使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J$</span> 退化。为使变分问题非平凡，需构造 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)$</span> 非常数的数据分布。本小节给出一个可解析计算的混合分布例子，验证命题 3 的“最优集中点”结论，并说明平滑调度的次优性有定量下界。</p>\n<p><strong>例 2</strong>：取一维数据 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{data}}=\\frac12\\delta_{-a}+\\frac12\\delta_{+a}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$a&gt;0$</span>。前向过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\alpha_t x_0+\\sigma_t\\varepsilon$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t$</span> 是双峰高斯混合：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q_t(x)=\\frac12\\mathcal N(x;\\alpha_t a,\\sigma_t^2)+\\frac12\\mathcal N(x;-\\alpha_t a,\\sigma_t^2).$$</div>\n条件得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q_t(x\\mid x_0)=-(x-\\alpha_t x_0)/\\sigma_t^2$</span>。边缘得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q_t(x)$</span> 由混合公式给出：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla\\log q_t(x)=\\frac{\\frac12\\mathcal N(x;\\alpha_t a,\\sigma_t^2)\\cdot(-\\frac{x-\\alpha_t a}{\\sigma_t^2})+\\frac12\\mathcal N(x;-\\alpha_t a,\\sigma_t^2)\\cdot(-\\frac{x+\\alpha_t a}{\\sigma_t^2})}{q_t(x)}.$$</div>\n在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x=\\alpha_t x_0+\\sigma_t\\varepsilon$</span> 下取期望可得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)$</span> 的解析表达，但形式较长；本小节只给出其<strong>极限行为</strong>，足以验证非平凡性。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7（混合分布的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)$</span> 极限）</strong>：在例 2 中，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to0^+$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\to0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t\\to1$</span>）时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)\\to0$</span>；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to T^-$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t\\to0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\to1$</span>）时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t\\to\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)\\to\\mathbb E[\\|\\nabla\\log\\mathcal N(0,1)(x)-\\nabla\\log q_t(x\\mid x_0)\\|^2]$</span>，其值有限且正。特别地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,T)$</span> 上非常数，故命题 3 适用：连续时间最优调度退化为集中于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\arg\\min_t w(t)$</span> 的 Dirac 测度。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to0^+$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\to0$</span>，条件分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t(\\cdot\\mid x_0)$</span> 趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{x_0}$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t$</span> 趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{data}}$</span>（离散），两者得分在支撑上一致（离散分布的得分在支撑点无定义，但按磨光极限，残差趋于零），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\to0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to T^-$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t\\to0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t\\to\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span>，条件分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t(\\cdot\\mid x_0)\\to\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span> 与边缘相同，故残差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q_t-\\nabla\\log q_t(\\cdot\\mid x_0)\\to0$</span>？需复核：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t\\to0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\to\\varepsilon$</span>，条件分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(0,\\sigma_t^2)\\to\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span>，与边缘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span> 相同，故残差趋于零。这与“<span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 端有限正”矛盾——实际上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t\\to0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda\\to0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 的行为由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 的阶决定。对高斯数据 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=d(\\lambda+1)\\to d$</span>；对混合数据，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t$</span> 小时近似高斯，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 趋于高斯情形的值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span>（一维 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>）。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(T^-)\\to1$</span>，有限正。<span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 在两端分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，中间连续，故非常数。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 7 说明：混合数据的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 增至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，最小值在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 端。由命题 3，连续时间最优调度把全部预算集中在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 附近——这显然是退化解（采样时无噪声可用）。因此实践中的平滑调度是<strong>受 Lipschitz 约束的次优解</strong>，其次优间隙由命题 4 的对偶变量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 量化：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J[\\lambda^\\star_M]-\\mathcal J[\\lambda^\\star]\\le M\\cdot\\mathrm{Lip}(w)\\cdot T^2/2$</span> 量级（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的互补松弛与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w'$</span> 有界推出）。这一间隙估计是第 9 节“采样步数影响”的定量基础：Lipschitz 约束越松（<span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 越大），平滑调度越接近退化最优，但采样所需的步数越多。</p>\n<p><strong>本节新增内容的收束</strong>：命题 5–7 与推论 3–4 把变分问题从“无约束退化”推进到“受限非平凡”，并建立了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J$</span> 与 DSM 训练权重的严格等价。这些结果共同构成第 12 节 ELBO 权重推导的入口：ELBO 的每一项是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J$</span> 的离散化，其权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho(t_k)\\Delta t_k$</span> 正是预算测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\lambda$</span> 在区间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[t_k,t_{k+1})$</span> 上的质量。端点奇异（第 10 节）与离散步长（第 8 节）的问题，则对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 在端点不可积时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\lambda$</span> 的磨光逼近是否保持 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J$</span> 的收敛性——这将在后续节中以命题形式给出。</p>\n<h3 id=\"df06--h-边界条件-t-0-与-t-1\">边界条件：t=0 与 t=1<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-边界条件-t-0-与-t-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已定义的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t$</span> 为信号缩放系数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 为噪声缩放系数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 为累积信号保留率（在 cosine 调度中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\cos^2(\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\frac{t/T+s}{1+s})$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=\\alpha_t^2/\\sigma_t^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 为总时间，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 为 cosine 调度的偏移参数。本节引入以下新符号并在此定义：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span>：前向过程在连续时间下的瞬时噪声注入率，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\exp(-\\int_0^t \\beta_u\\,du)$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t&gt;0$</span> 时）。该定义与前序节中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 的累积形式一致，仅在此处显式写出以保证端点分析的完备性。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span>，本节将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 归一化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 而不失一般性（时间重参数化不变性将在后续节展开，此处仅作归一化声明）。因此端点记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\sigma_t^2=1-\\bar\\alpha_t^2$</span>：累积噪声方差（在方差保持参数化下）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节假设：</p>\n<p><strong>(A1)</strong> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\in(0,1)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 连续可微。</p>\n<p><strong>(A2)</strong> 端点极限存在：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lim_{t\\to 0^+}\\bar\\alpha_t=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lim_{t\\to 1^-}\\bar\\alpha_t=0$</span>（或近似为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_1=\\varepsilon$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon&gt;0$</span> 足够小）。</p>\n<p><strong>(A3)</strong> 瞬时噪声率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=-\\frac{d}{dt}\\log\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,1)$</span> 上非负且局部可积。</p>\n<p><strong>(A4)</strong> 对数值稳定性分析，假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 在端点附近的行为由幂律控制：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to 1^-$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\sim c(1-t)^{-\\gamma}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma\\ge 0$</span>；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to 0^+$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\sim c' t^{\\delta}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta\\ge 0$</span>。</p>\n<p>这些假设在本章情境下为何成立：cosine 调度与线性调度均满足 (A1)–(A3)（前序节已证），(A4) 是对端点渐近行为的显式刻画，用于第 10 节反例节的失效分析；本节仅用它陈述端点条件与数值稳定性的关系，不展开反例构造。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-端点条件的精确表述\">端点条件的精确表述<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-端点条件的精确表述\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序节已给出端点条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T=0$</span>（或近似）。本节将其精确化为两个层次：<strong>严格端点条件</strong>与<strong>近似端点条件</strong>，并说明二者在数学与数值上的区别。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 1（严格端点条件）</strong>。称调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\bar\\alpha_t\\}_{t\\in[0,1]}$</span> 满足严格端点条件，若</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\bar\\alpha_0=1,\\qquad \\bar\\alpha_1=0,$$</div>\n<p>且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1]$</span> 上连续。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 2（近似端点条件）</strong>。称调度满足近似端点条件（截断参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\in(0,1)$</span>），若</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\bar\\alpha_0=1,\\qquad \\bar\\alpha_1=\\varepsilon,$$</div>\n<p>且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1]$</span> 上连续、严格递减。</p>\n<p>二者的区别不在于“哪个更对”，而在于它们对应不同的数学对象：严格端点条件对应一个在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 处退化的前向过程（数据分布被完全摧毁为纯噪声），近似端点条件对应一个在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 处仍保留 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 比例信号的“截断”过程。后续节将证明：严格端点条件下反向 SDE 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 处的漂移系数发散，而近似端点条件下漂移有界；这是第 10 节反例节的数学根源。本节只建立端点条件与 SNR 的关系。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 1（端点 SNR 的极限行为）</strong>。在 (A1)–(A2) 下：</p>\n<p>(i) 若满足严格端点条件，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lim_{t\\to 0^+}\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=+\\infty$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lim_{t\\to 1^-}\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=0$</span>；</p>\n<p>(ii) 若满足近似端点条件（截断 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span>），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(0)=+\\infty$</span>（形式上），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(1)=\\varepsilon^2/(1-\\varepsilon^2)&lt;+\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=\\alpha_t^2/\\sigma_t^2$</span> 及方差保持参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=1-\\bar\\alpha_t^2$</span>（前序节已定义），得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_t^2}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t^2}.$$</div>\n<p>(i) 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to 0^+$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to 1$</span>，故分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t^2\\to 0^+$</span>，分子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to 1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)\\to+\\infty$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to 1^-$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to 0$</span>，分子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to 0$</span>，分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to 1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)\\to 0$</span>。极限运算仅用到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 的连续性与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t^2$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,1)$</span> 上非零（由 (A1)），无需交换积分与极限。</p>\n<p>(ii) 代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_1=\\varepsilon$</span> 直接得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(1)=\\varepsilon^2/(1-\\varepsilon^2)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 1 说明：严格端点条件下 SNR 在两端分别取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，是“完整”的信噪比预算；近似端点条件则在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 处截断 SNR 于有限值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon^2/(1-\\varepsilon^2)$</span>。二者在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 处的行为相同（均发散），差异仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-端点条件对累积噪声率-beta_t-的约束\">端点条件对累积噪声率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 的约束<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-端点条件对累积噪声率-beta_t-的约束\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>端点条件不仅是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 的取值约束，它还通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=-\\frac{d}{dt}\\log\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 对瞬时噪声率施加可积性约束。这一约束是后续节讨论离散步长与数值稳定性的前提。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 2（严格端点条件下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 的可积性）</strong>。在 (A1)–(A3) 及严格端点条件下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,1)$</span> 上非负，且</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_0^1 \\beta_t\\,dt=+\\infty.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。由 (A3)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\ge 0$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\exp(-\\int_0^t\\beta_u\\,du)$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t&gt;0$</span> 时）及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_1=0$</span>，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to 1^-$</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_0^t\\beta_u\\,du=-\\log\\bar\\alpha_t\\to+\\infty.$$</div>\n<p>由单调收敛定理（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\ge 0$</span>，积分关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 单调递增），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^1\\beta_t\\,dt=\\lim_{t\\to 1^-}\\int_0^t\\beta_u\\,du=+\\infty$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 2 的推论是：严格端点条件下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 附近不可积，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to 1^-$</span> 时必须以足够快的速度发散。由 (A4)，这要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma\\ge 1$</span>（若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\sim c(1-t)^{-\\gamma}$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int^1(1-t)^{-\\gamma}dt$</span> 发散当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma\\ge 1$</span>）。cosine 调度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to 1^-$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\sim \\frac{\\pi^2}{4}\\frac{(1-t)^2}{(1+s)^2}$</span>（前序节已推导），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=-\\frac{d}{dt}\\log\\bar\\alpha_t\\sim \\frac{2}{1-t}$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma=1$</span>，恰处于可积性临界点。线性调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=1-t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to 1^-$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\sim \\frac{1}{1-t}$</span>，同样 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma=1$</span>。这说明两类标准调度在严格端点条件下均处于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 可积性的临界边界，这是第 10 节反例节讨论数值不稳定的定量依据。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 1（近似端点条件下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 的可积性）</strong>。在 (A1)–(A3) 及近似端点条件（截断 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span>）下，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_0^1\\beta_t\\,dt=-\\log\\varepsilon&lt;+\\infty.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_1=\\varepsilon&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^1\\beta_t\\,dt=-\\log\\bar\\alpha_1=-\\log\\varepsilon$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 1 表明：近似端点条件将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 的总积分从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span> 截断为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log\\varepsilon$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 在整个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1]$</span> 上可积。这是近似端点条件在数值上更稳健的数学原因：它把端点奇异性转化为一个有限的可积奇异。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-端点条件与时间重参数化的关系\">端点条件与时间重参数化的关系<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-端点条件与时间重参数化的关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>端点条件的第三个层面是它与时间重参数化的兼容性。后续节将证明时间重参数化的不变性，本节先建立端点条件在该不变性下的变换规则，以确保本节结论与后续节接口一致。</p>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=\\phi(t)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1]\\to[0,1]$</span> 的严格递增 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 微分同胚，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi(0)=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi(1)=1$</span>。定义重参数化后的调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\alpha_\\tau=\\bar\\alpha_{\\phi^{-1}(\\tau)}$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\beta_\\tau=-\\frac{d}{d\\tau}\\log\\tilde\\alpha_\\tau=-\\frac{d}{dt}\\log\\bar\\alpha_t\\cdot\\frac{dt}{d\\tau}=\\beta_t\\cdot(\\phi^{-1})'(\\tau).$$</div>\n<p><strong>命题 3（端点条件在重参数化下的不变性）</strong>。在 (A1)–(A2) 下，严格端点条件与近似端点条件均在上述重参数化下保持不变；但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 的可积性（命题 2 与推论 1）在严格端点条件下不变，在近似端点条件下变为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_0^1\\tilde\\beta_\\tau\\,d\\tau=-\\log\\varepsilon.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。端点值：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\alpha_0=\\bar\\alpha_{\\phi^{-1}(0)}=\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\alpha_1=\\bar\\alpha_{\\phi^{-1}(1)}=\\bar\\alpha_1$</span>，故严格与近似端点条件均不变。可积性：由换元公式（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 微分同胚，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 非负可测），</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_0^1\\tilde\\beta_\\tau\\,d\\tau=\\int_0^1\\beta_t\\cdot(\\phi^{-1})'(\\phi(t))\\cdot\\phi'(t)\\,dt=\\int_0^1\\beta_t\\,dt.$$</div>\n<p>严格端点条件下右端为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>（命题 2），近似端点条件下为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log\\varepsilon$</span>（推论 1）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 3 的关键在于：端点条件本身是重参数化不变的，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 的逐点值会因时间缩放而改变；可积性作为积分量不变。这为后续节“时间重参数化的不变性”提供了端点层面的接口：任何调度在端点处的信噪比预算总量（以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\beta$</span> 衡量）是重参数化不变量。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-具体例子-cosine-调度的端点验证\">具体例子：cosine 调度的端点验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-具体例子-cosine-调度的端点验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 cosine 调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\cos^2(\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\frac{t+s}{1+s})$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s=0.008$</span>（前序节已定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 为偏移参数）。验证端点条件与命题 1、命题 2。</p>\n<p>在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=\\cos^2(\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\frac{s}{1+s})$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=0.008$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{s}{1+s}\\approx 0.00794$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\cdot 0.00794\\approx 0.01247$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\cos^2(0.01247)\\approx 0.99969$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0\\approx 0.99969$</span>，近似为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>（严格端点条件要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$s&gt;0$</span> 时为近似端点条件在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 端的偏移）。</p>\n<p>在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_1=\\cos^2(\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\frac{1+s}{1+s})=\\cos^2(\\frac{\\pi}{2})=0$</span>。严格端点条件成立。</p>\n<p>SNR 端点值：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(0)=\\bar\\alpha_0^2/(1-\\bar\\alpha_0^2)\\approx 0.99938/(1-0.99938)\\approx 1611$</span>（有限大，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s&gt;0$</span> 截断了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 端的发散）；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(1)=0/(1-0)=0$</span>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to 1^-$</span> 的渐近：由前序节 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\sim \\frac{\\pi^2}{4}\\frac{(1-t)^2}{(1+s)^2}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=-\\frac{d}{dt}\\log\\bar\\alpha_t\\sim \\frac{2}{1-t}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^1\\beta_t\\,dt=+\\infty$</span>（命题 2 成立）。数值上，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^{1-\\delta}\\beta_t\\,dt\\approx -2\\log\\delta$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta=10^{-3}$</span> 时约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$13.8$</span>，随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta\\to 0$</span> 发散。</p>\n<p>该例子验证了：cosine 调度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 端满足严格端点条件，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 端因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s&gt;0$</span> 而满足近似端点条件（截断 SNR 于有限值）；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 附近以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma=1$</span> 的幂律发散，恰处于可积性临界点。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-端点条件对-ELBO-权重的接口\">端点条件对 ELBO 权重的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-端点条件对-ELBO-权重的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节最后建立端点条件与 ELBO 权重的接口（详细推导在第 12 节）。在连续时间 ELBO 中，权重函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)$</span> 通常取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)$</span> 的函数。端点条件通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 的可积性直接影响 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)$</span> 的可积性：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>严格端点条件下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)=\\beta_t$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^1 w(t)\\,dt=+\\infty$</span>，ELBO 的连续时间积分在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 端发散，需引入截断或重加权；</li>\n<li>近似端点条件下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^1 w(t)\\,dt=-\\log\\varepsilon&lt;+\\infty$</span>，ELBO 积分有限。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这一接口的精确陈述留给第 12 节，本节仅指出：端点条件不是孤立的边界约定，它通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 的可积性决定了 ELBO 权重是否可积，从而决定了连续时间 ELBO 是否需要截断。这是本节与后续节“调度与 ELBO 权重”的衔接点。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p>端点条件分为严格端点条件（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_1=0$</span>）与近似端点条件（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_1=\\varepsilon&gt;0$</span>），二者对应不同的数学对象：前者使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(1)=0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 端不可积，后者将 SNR 截断于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon^2/(1-\\varepsilon^2)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 总积分为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log\\varepsilon$</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>cosine 与线性调度在严格端点条件下均满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\sim c(1-t)^{-1}$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma=1$</span>），恰处于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 可积性的临界边界；这是端点奇异导致数值不稳定的定量根源，其反例构造在第 10 节集中处理。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>端点条件在时间重参数化下不变，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^1\\beta_t\\,dt$</span> 是重参数化不变量；该不变量通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 的可积性决定 ELBO 权重是否可积，构成本节与“调度与 ELBO 权重”节的接口。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-端点条件与反向过程的初始分布\">端点条件与反向过程的初始分布<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-端点条件与反向过程的初始分布\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>端点条件在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 处的取值决定了反向过程在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 处的初始分布，这一关系是本节与反向 SDE 章的直接接口。设前向过程在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 处的边际分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_1$</span>，反向过程从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_1$</span> 出发向 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 演化。端点条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_1=0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_1=\\varepsilon$</span> 对应两种不同的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_1$</span>，其差异必须在数学上显式写出，否则反向过程的初始条件无法被唯一确定。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 3（端点边际分布）</strong>。设数据分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{data}}$</span>，前向过程在方差保持参数化下的边际分布为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_t(x)=\\int p_{\\mathrm{data}}(x_0)\\,\\mathcal{N}\\!\\left(x;\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0,\\,(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)\\,I\\right)dx_0.$$</div>\n<p>则端点边际分布记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0=p_{\\mathrm{data}}$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span>）与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_1$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_1$</span> 取严格或近似端点值）。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4（严格端点条件下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_1$</span> 为标准高斯）</strong>。在 (A1)–(A2) 及严格端点条件下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{data}}$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\|x_0\\|^2\\,p_{\\mathrm{data}}(dx_0)&lt;+\\infty$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_1=\\mathcal{N}(0,I)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。由定义 3，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_1=0$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_1(x)=\\int p_{\\mathrm{data}}(x_0)\\,\\mathcal{N}(x;0,I)\\,dx_0=\\mathcal{N}(x;0,I)\\int p_{\\mathrm{data}}(dx_0)=\\mathcal{N}(x;0,I)$</span>。此处交换积分与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的积分仅用到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{N}(x;0,I)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 为常数且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{data}}$</span> 为概率测度（Fubini 定理，被积函数关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 可积且与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 无关），二阶矩条件在此处并非必需，仅用于保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_1$</span> 的协方差有限。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 4 说明：严格端点条件把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_1$</span> 钉死为标准高斯，反向过程的初始分布因此完全确定，无需额外假设。这是严格端点条件在数学上的“干净”之处。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5（近似端点条件下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_1$</span> 为高斯卷积）</strong>。在 (A1)–(A2) 及近似端点条件（截断 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span>）下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_1$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{data}}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{N}(0,(1-\\varepsilon^2)I)$</span> 的卷积，即</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_1(x)=\\int p_{\\mathrm{data}}(x_0)\\,\\mathcal{N}\\!\\left(x;\\sqrt{\\varepsilon}\\,x_0,\\,(1-\\varepsilon^2)\\,I\\right)dx_0.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。直接代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_1=\\varepsilon$</span> 于定义 3。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 5 说明：近似端点条件下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_1$</span> 不是标准高斯，而是数据分布被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\varepsilon}$</span> 缩放后再卷积一个方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\varepsilon^2$</span> 的高斯。反向过程若从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{N}(0,I)$</span> 出发，则初始分布与真实 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_1$</span> 之间存在偏差，偏差量由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 控制。这一偏差是近似端点条件在数学上“不干净”的代价，但它换来了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 的可积性（推论 1）。二者的权衡是第 12 节 ELBO 权重讨论的出发点。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-端点条件与得分函数在边界处的行为\">端点条件与得分函数在边界处的行为<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-端点条件与得分函数在边界处的行为\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>得分函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x)$</span> 在端点处的行为直接由端点条件决定，这是本节与得分匹配章、反向 SDE 章的关键接口。本节只建立端点条件对得分函数渐近阶的约束，不展开得分匹配的估计理论（属后续章）。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to 0^+$</span> 时得分函数的渐近阶）</strong>。在 (A1)–(A3) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{data}}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 上具有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 正密度且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\|\\nabla\\log p_{\\mathrm{data}}(x)\\|^2\\,p_{\\mathrm{data}}(dx)&lt;+\\infty$</span>。则当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to 0^+$</span> 时，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span>-几乎处处的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x)=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\left(\\mathbb{E}[x_0\\mid x_t=x]-\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\right)\\cdot(-1)+\\nabla\\log p_{\\mathrm{data}}\\text{ 的低阶修正},$$</div>\n<p>更精确地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x)$</span> 的主项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac{x-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\mathbb{E}[x_0\\mid x_t=x]}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，其量级为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O((1-\\bar\\alpha_t)^{-1})$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。由定义 3 及 Tweedie 公式（前序节已建立得分与后验均值的关系），</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x)=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\mathbb{E}[x_0\\mid x_t=x]-x}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}.$$</div>\n<p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to 0^+$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to 1$</span>，分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t\\to 0^+$</span>；分子中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[x_0\\mid x_t=x]\\to x/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\to x_0$</span> 在分布意义下），故分子趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，得分函数的主项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O((1-\\bar\\alpha_t)^{-1})$</span>。此处用到后验均值关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 的连续性（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{data}}$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 正密度保证）及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 的正性（由高斯卷积保证）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 6 的推论是：<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to 0^+$</span> 时得分函数的量级由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 控制，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 附近的行为由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 附近的幂律指数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span> 决定（(A4)）。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta=1$</span>（线性调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=1-t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 附近），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t\\sim t$</span>，得分函数量级为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(t^{-1})$</span>；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta=2$</span>（cosine 调度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 附近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\approx 1-\\frac{\\pi^2}{4}\\frac{t^2}{(1+s)^2}$</span>），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t\\sim t^2$</span>，得分函数量级为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(t^{-2})$</span>。这一差异说明：不同调度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 端的得分函数奇异性阶数不同，这是后续节“调度对采样步数的影响”的定量依据之一。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to 1^-$</span> 时得分函数的渐近阶）</strong>。在 (A1)–(A3) 及严格端点条件下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{data}}$</span> 具有有限二阶矩。则当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to 1^-$</span> 时，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span>-几乎处处的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x)=-x+O(\\bar\\alpha_t),$$</div>\n<p>即得分函数趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\nabla_x\\log\\mathcal{N}(x;0,I)=-x$</span>，偏差量为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。由命题 4，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_1=\\mathcal{N}(0,I)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_1(x)=-x$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的连续性（高斯卷积关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 连续，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 连续）及得分函数关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 的连续性（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 正且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 的条件下），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t(x)\\to\\nabla\\log p_1(x)=-x$</span>。偏差阶由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to 0$</span> 的速率决定：将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_1$</span> 处展开，一阶偏差正比于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 的均值项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\mathbb{E}[x_0]$</span>，方差项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>，二者关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 的一阶展开给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span> 的得分偏差）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 7 说明：严格端点条件下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to 1^-$</span> 时得分函数有界且趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-x$</span>，无奇异性。这与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to 0^+$</span> 端的奇异性形成对比：端点条件的“奇异”只发生在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 端（信号端），<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 端（噪声端）在严格端点条件下是正则的。这一不对称性是本节的核心观察之一，它解释了为何数值不稳定主要出现在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 附近而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 附近（第 10 节反例节将给出具体构造）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-端点条件与离散化误差的接口\">端点条件与离散化误差的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-端点条件与离散化误差的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节最后建立端点条件与离散化误差的接口（详细推导在第 8 节“离散时间步的选择”）。设离散时间网格为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0=t_0&lt;t_1&lt;\\cdots&lt;t_N=1$</span>，步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_n=t_{n+1}-t_n$</span>。端点条件通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 在端点附近的幂律指数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span> 影响离散化误差的量级。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8（端点附近离散化误差的量级）</strong>。在 (A1)–(A4) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to 1^-$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\sim c(1-t)^{-\\gamma}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma\\ge 1$</span>。则对最后一个区间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[t_{N-1},t_N]$</span>，若采用左端点求积 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{t_{N-1}}^{1}\\beta_t\\,dt\\approx\\beta_{t_{N-1}}\\Delta_{N-1}$</span>，求积误差为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\left|\\int_{t_{N-1}}^{1}\\beta_t\\,dt-\\beta_{t_{N-1}}\\Delta_{N-1}\\right|=O\\!\\left(\\Delta_{N-1}^{1-\\gamma}\\right)\\quad(\\gamma&gt;1),$$</div>\n<p>或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\log\\Delta_{N-1}^{-1})$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma=1$</span>）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=c(1-t)^{-\\gamma}(1+o(1))$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{t_{N-1}}^{1}\\beta_t\\,dt\\approx\\frac{c}{\\gamma-1}\\Delta_{N-1}^{1-\\gamma}$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma&gt;1$</span>），而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_{t_{N-1}}\\Delta_{N-1}\\approx c\\Delta_{N-1}^{1-\\gamma}$</span>。二者之差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{c}{\\gamma-1}\\Delta_{N-1}^{1-\\gamma}-c\\Delta_{N-1}^{1-\\gamma}=c\\Delta_{N-1}^{1-\\gamma}\\left(\\frac{1}{\\gamma-1}-1\\right)=O(\\Delta_{N-1}^{1-\\gamma})$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma=1$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{t_{N-1}}^{1}\\beta_t\\,dt\\approx -c\\log\\Delta_{N-1}$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_{t_{N-1}}\\Delta_{N-1}\\approx c$</span>，误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\log\\Delta_{N-1}^{-1})$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 8 的推论是：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma=1$</span>（cosine 与线性调度在严格端点条件下）时，最后一个区间的求积误差为对数阶，随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_{N-1}\\to 0$</span> 发散但缓慢；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma&gt;1$</span> 时误差为幂律阶，随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_{N-1}\\to 0$</span> 发散更快。这解释了为何 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma=1$</span> 恰是“可接受”的临界点：对数发散在数值上可通过截断控制，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma&gt;1$</span> 的幂律发散则需要更激进的截断或重参数化。这是第 8 节“离散时间步的选择”与第 10 节反例节的定量接口。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 2（近似端点条件下离散化误差有界）</strong>。在近似端点条件（截断 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span>）下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1]$</span> 上有界（由 (A3) 及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_1=\\varepsilon&gt;0$</span> 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 附近不奇异），故最后一个区间的求积误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta_{N-1})$</span>，与内部区间同阶。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。近似端点条件下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1]$</span> 上连续且非负（(A3)），故有界。左端点求积误差由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 的 Lipschitz 常数控制，为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta_{N-1})$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 2 说明：近似端点条件把端点奇异性完全消除，代价是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_1$</span> 与标准高斯之间存在偏差（命题 5）。这一权衡是第 8 节离散时间步选择的核心：若采用严格端点条件，则需在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 附近加密网格以控制对数误差；若采用近似端点条件，则网格可均匀，但需接受 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_1$</span> 的偏差。二者在数学上均为合法选择，选择依据是具体任务对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_1$</span> 精度的要求，而非“哪个更正确”。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-端点条件与时间预算的守恒\">端点条件与时间预算的守恒<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-端点条件与时间预算的守恒\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节最后把端点条件纳入本章主旨“调度 = 噪声的时间预算”的框架。前序节已建立 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)$</span> 作为时间预算的度量，本节证明端点条件决定了该预算在两端的总量。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9（端点条件对 SNR 预算总量的约束）</strong>。在 (A1)–(A3) 下，定义 SNR 的对数预算为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{B}=\\int_0^1\\log\\mathrm{SNR}(t)\\,dt=\\int_0^1\\left(2\\log\\bar\\alpha_t-\\log(1-\\bar\\alpha_t^2)\\right)dt.$$</div>\n<p>则：</p>\n<p>(i) 严格端点条件下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{B}$</span> 的被积函数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 端以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\log\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 为主项，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to 0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\bar\\alpha_t\\to-\\infty$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{B}=-\\infty$</span>；</p>\n<p>(ii) 近似端点条件下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{B}$</span> 有限，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{B}$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 连续。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。(i) 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to 1^-$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to 0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\bar\\alpha_t\\to-\\infty$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(1-\\bar\\alpha_t^2)\\to\\log 1=0$</span>，故被积函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to-\\infty$</span>。由单调性（被积函数关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 附近单调递减至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\infty$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{B}=-\\infty$</span>。(ii) 近似端点条件下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_1=\\varepsilon&gt;0$</span>，被积函数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1]$</span> 上有界（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\bar\\alpha_t\\ge\\log\\varepsilon$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(1-\\bar\\alpha_t^2)\\le\\log(1-\\varepsilon^2)$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\ge\\varepsilon$</span>），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{B}$</span> 有限；关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 的连续性由被积函数关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 的连续性与有界性（Dominated Convergence，控制函数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\log\\varepsilon|+|\\log(1-\\varepsilon^2)|$</span> 的常数倍）保证。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 9 说明：严格端点条件下 SNR 的对数预算总量为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\infty$</span>，即“预算在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 端被无限透支”；近似端点条件把预算截断为有限值。这与命题 2、推论 1 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 可积性结论一致：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 的不可积性与 SNR 对数预算的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\infty$</span> 是同一端点奇异性的两种表述。本章主旨“调度 = 噪声的时间预算”在端点层面的精确含义因此是：端点条件决定预算总量是有限还是无限，从而决定调度是否需要在端点处截断。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 3（cosine 调度的预算总量）</strong>。对 cosine 调度，严格端点条件下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{B}=-\\infty$</span>；若取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s&gt;0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 端截断（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0&lt;1$</span>），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 端的 SNR 发散被截断为有限值，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 端的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{B}=-\\infty$</span> 仍成立（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_1=0$</span>）。故 cosine 调度的预算总量在严格端点条件下恒为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\infty$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 无关。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。由命题 9(i)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{B}=-\\infty$</span> 仅由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_1=0$</span> 决定，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 端行为无关。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 3 的工程含义是：cosine 调度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 端的预算透支无法通过调整 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 消除，只能通过近似端点条件（截断 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span>）或时间重参数化（后续节）处理。这是本节与第 11 节“时间重参数化的不变性”的接口：重参数化不改变 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{B}$</span> 的有限性（命题 3），故端点奇异性的消除必须来自端点条件本身，而非时间坐标的变换。</p>\n<p><strong>本节补充小结</strong></p>\n<p>（承前三条小结，此处仅补充本节新增内容的要点，不重复前三条。）</p>\n<ol start=\"4\">\n<li>\n<p>端点条件决定反向过程的初始分布：严格端点条件下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_1=\\mathcal{N}(0,I)$</span>（命题 4），近似端点条件下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_1$</span> 为数据分布与高斯的卷积（命题 5）；二者在数学上均为合法对象，差异在于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_1$</span> 是否被钉死。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>得分函数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 端的奇异性阶数由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 的幂律指数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span> 决定（命题 6），在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 端严格端点条件下无奇异（命题 7）；端点奇异性的不对称性是数值不稳定主要出现在信号端而非噪声端的数学根源。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>端点条件通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 的幂律指数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma$</span> 决定离散化误差量级（命题 8）：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma=1$</span> 时为对数阶，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma&gt;1$</span> 时为幂律阶；近似端点条件把误差降为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)$</span>（推论 2）。端点条件同时决定 SNR 对数预算总量是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\infty$</span>（严格）还是有限（近似）（命题 9），这是本章主旨“调度 = 噪声的时间预算”在端点层面的精确表述。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"df06--h-离散时间步的选择\">离散时间步的选择<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-离散时间步的选择\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已建立的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t,\\sigma_t$</span> 为前向过程在连续时间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span> 上的信号与噪声系数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\prod_{s\\le t}\\alpha_s$</span> 在连续时间下理解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\exp(-\\int_0^t \\beta_s\\,ds)$</span> 的缩写（前序节已定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 为噪声速率），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=\\alpha_t^2/\\sigma_t^2$</span>。本节新引入的符号如下。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>离散网格：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{t_n\\}_{n=0}^{N}$</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0=t_0&lt;t_1&lt;\\cdots&lt;t_N=T$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_n=t_n-t_{n-1}$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$n=1,\\dots,N$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_{\\max}=\\max_n\\Delta_n$</span>。</li>\n<li>离散信噪比：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_n=\\bar\\alpha_{t_n}^2/\\bar\\sigma_{t_n}^2$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\sigma_t^2=1-\\bar\\alpha_t^2$</span>（前序节方差保持参数化下已定义）。</li>\n<li>步长函数：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta(t)$</span> 为网格在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 处的局部间距，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_n=\\int_{t_{n-1}}^{t_n}\\frac{ds}{\\rho(s)}$</span> 对某密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho&gt;0$</span> 成立（即网格由密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 的逆累积分布生成）。</li>\n<li>权重泛函：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{W}_N(\\rho)=\\sum_{n=1}^N w(t_n)\\Delta_n$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)$</span> 为 ELBO 中第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 项损失的权重（其显式形式在“调度与 ELBO 权重”节给出；本节仅假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\in C([0,T])$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\ge 0$</span>）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节假设：(A1) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\in C^1([0,T])$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t&gt;0$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T=0$</span>；(A2) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\sigma_t^2=1-\\bar\\alpha_t^2$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T)$</span> 上严格正；(A3) 网格密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho\\in C([0,T])$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\inf\\rho&gt;0$</span>；(A4) 权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\in C([0,T])$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\ge0$</span>。这些假设在本章情境下成立：cosine 与线性调度均给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>，端点条件由“边界条件”节保证，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 取为本章后续节将构造的调度密度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 由 ELBO 分解给出且连续。</p>\n<p>本节的核心任务是：在给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 与调度（即给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>）下，选择网格 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{t_n\\}$</span> 使某一离散化误差或权重泛函达到最优，并给出可检验的判别准则。这与相邻概念的区别在于：调度决定“噪声随时间如何变化”，而离散时间步决定“在哪些时刻采样该变化”；前者是连续时间对象，后者是网格逼近问题。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-离散化误差的分解\">离散化误差的分解<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-离散化误差的分解\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(t)$</span> 为某一待离散化的连续函数（例如得分函数沿轨迹的取值，或 ELBO 中被积函数），其离散近似为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_n f(t_n)\\Delta_n$</span>。由前序节“与数值积分章的接口”所约定的误差阶，我们有如下引理。</p>\n<p><strong>引理 1（一阶求积误差的网格依赖）</strong> 假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in C^1([0,T])$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|f'|\\le L$</span>。对任意网格 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{t_n\\}$</span>，左端点求积误差满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\left|\\int_0^T f(t)\\,dt-\\sum_{n=1}^N f(t_{n-1})\\Delta_n\\right|\\le \\frac{L}{2}\\sum_{n=1}^N \\Delta_n^2.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 在每个区间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[t_{n-1},t_n]$</span> 上，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(t)=f(t_{n-1})+f'(\\xi_t)(t-t_{n-1})$</span>，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_{t_{n-1}}^{t_n}f(t)\\,dt-f(t_{n-1})\\Delta_n=\\int_{t_{n-1}}^{t_n}f'(\\xi_t)(t-t_{n-1})\\,dt.$$</div>\n<p>取绝对值并用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|f'|\\le L$</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\left|\\int_{t_{n-1}}^{t_n}f'(\\xi_t)(t-t_{n-1})\\,dt\\right|\\le L\\int_{t_{n-1}}^{t_n}(t-t_{n-1})\\,dt=\\frac{L}{2}\\Delta_n^2.$$</div>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 求和即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>引理 1 表明：误差由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_n\\Delta_n^2$</span> 控制，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_n\\Delta_n=T$</span> 的约束下，等步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_n=T/N$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_n\\Delta_n^2=T^2/N$</span> 达到最小。但这只是“均匀误差”意义下的最优；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 的变化率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 剧烈变化（在扩散模型中，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 时得分函数尺度通常更大），则应让 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_n$</span> 随局部 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L(t)$</span> 反比调整。这引出下一小节的加权变分问题。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-加权误差与最优网格密度\">加权误差与最优网格密度<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-加权误差与最优网格密度\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>将引理 1 局部化：设局部误差密度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac12 L(t)\\Delta(t)^2$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L(t)=|f'(t)|$</span> 的上界函数。总误差近似为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$E(\\Delta)=\\frac12\\int_0^T L(t)\\Delta(t)^2\\,dt,\\qquad \\text{约束}\\quad \\int_0^T\\frac{dt}{\\Delta(t)}=N.$$</div>\n<p>第二个约束来自网格点数：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta(t)$</span> 为局部间距，则单位时间内的点数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\Delta(t)$</span>，总点数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T dt/\\Delta(t)=N$</span>。令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho(t)=1/\\Delta(t)$</span>，则问题化为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\min_{\\rho&gt;0}\\ \\frac12\\int_0^T \\frac{L(t)}{\\rho(t)^2}\\,dt\\quad\\text{s.t.}\\quad \\int_0^T\\rho(t)\\,dt=N.$$</div>\n<p><strong>命题 2（最优网格密度的显式解）</strong> 在 (A3) 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L\\in C([0,T])$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L&gt;0$</span>，则上述变分问题的唯一极小点为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\rho^\\star(t)=\\frac{N\\,L(t)^{1/3}}{\\int_0^T L(s)^{1/3}\\,ds},\\qquad \\Delta^\\star(t)=\\frac{1}{\\rho^\\star(t)}=\\frac{\\int_0^T L(s)^{1/3}\\,ds}{N\\,L(t)^{1/3}}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 这是等式约束下的凸变分问题。构造 Lagrange 函数</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{L}(\\rho,\\lambda)=\\frac12\\int_0^T\\frac{L(t)}{\\rho(t)^2}\\,dt+\\lambda\\left(\\int_0^T\\rho(t)\\,dt-N\\right).$$</div>\n<p>对被积函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac12 L/\\rho^2+\\lambda\\rho$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 求变分：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_\\rho=-\\frac{L}{\\rho^3}+\\lambda=0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho^3=L/\\lambda$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho(t)=(L(t)/\\lambda)^{1/3}$</span>。代入约束 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T (L/\\lambda)^{1/3}dt=N$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda^{1/3}=\\frac{1}{N}\\int_0^T L^{1/3}ds$</span>，于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho^\\star$</span> 如上。被积函数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho&gt;0$</span> 上严格凸（二阶变分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3L/\\rho^4&gt;0$</span>），故极小点唯一。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 2 给出一个可检验的推论：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L(t)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to T$</span> 时发散（例如得分函数在端点奇异），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho^\\star(t)\\to\\infty$</span>，即网格在端点附近无限加密。这与“反例：端点奇异导致数值不稳定”节所讨论的现象一致，但本节只给出密度层面的结论，不展开数值构造。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-信噪比均匀网格\">信噪比均匀网格<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-信噪比均匀网格\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>扩散模型实践中常用的一类离散化不是按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 等距，而是按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}$</span> 的对数等距。设网格满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\mathrm{SNR}(t_n)=\\log\\mathrm{SNR}(0)-n\\delta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$n=0,\\dots,N$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta=(\\log\\mathrm{SNR}(0)-\\log\\mathrm{SNR}(T))/N$</span>。这等价于取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho(t)\\propto\\left|\\frac{d}{dt}\\log\\mathrm{SNR}(t)\\right|$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 3（对数 SNR 网格的密度）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A2) 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,T)$</span> 上严格单调递减且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span>，则对数 SNR 等距网格对应的密度为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\rho_{\\log}(t)=\\frac{N\\left|\\frac{d}{dt}\\log\\mathrm{SNR}(t)\\right|}{\\left|\\log\\mathrm{SNR}(0)-\\log\\mathrm{SNR}(T)\\right|}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 对数 SNR 等距意味着相邻网格点满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{t_{n-1}}^{t_n}\\frac{d}{dt}\\log\\mathrm{SNR}(t)\\,dt=-\\delta$</span>（取绝对值）。因此区间长度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_n$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\left|\\frac{d}{dt}\\log\\mathrm{SNR}\\right|\\Delta_n\\approx\\delta$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_n\\approx\\delta/\\left|\\frac{d}{dt}\\log\\mathrm{SNR}\\right|$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho=1/\\Delta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span> 的归一化即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 3 的恒等式可用于检验代码实现：对 cosine 调度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}\\log\\mathrm{SNR}(t)$</span> 有显式表达式，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_{\\log}$</span> 可逐点计算并与数值差分比对。这一比对将在“代码：调度曲线的实现”节执行，本节只给出解析形式。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-端点条件对步长的约束\">端点条件对步长的约束<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-端点条件对步长的约束\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序节已确立端点条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T=0$</span>（或近似）。在离散网格上，这两个条件转化为对首末步长的约束。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 4（端点步长的下界）</strong> 假设 (A1)–(A2) 成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T$</span> 附近满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\le C(T-t)^\\kappa$</span> 对某 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C&gt;0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa&gt;0$</span>。若要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_N\\le\\epsilon$</span>（即末端信噪比不超过给定阈值），则末步步长必须满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Delta_N\\le \\left(\\frac{\\epsilon}{C^2}\\right)^{1/(2\\kappa)}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_N=\\bar\\alpha_{t_N}^2/\\bar\\sigma_{t_N}^2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\sigma_{t_N}^2=1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_N}^2$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t_N}$</span> 小时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_N\\approx\\bar\\alpha_{t_N}^2$</span>。由假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t_N}\\le C(T-t_{N-1})^\\kappa=C\\Delta_N^\\kappa$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_N\\le C^2\\Delta_N^{2\\kappa}$</span>。令其 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le\\epsilon$</span> 即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 4 说明：端点条件不是免费的，它强制末步步长随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 缩放。对线性调度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 附近线性趋于零（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa=1$</span>），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_N\\le\\sqrt{\\epsilon}/C$</span>；对 cosine 调度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\cos^2(\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\frac{t/T+s}{1+s})$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T$</span> 处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T=\\cos^2(\\frac{\\pi}{2})=0$</span> 且一阶导数为零、二阶导数非零，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa=2$</span>，末端步长可放宽至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_N\\le(\\epsilon/C^2)^{1/4}$</span>。这一差异是 cosine 调度在相同 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 下末端更稳定的解析原因，与“调度对采样步数的影响”节的结论衔接。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-具体例子-线性调度的最优网格\">具体例子：线性调度的最优网格<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-具体例子-线性调度的最优网格\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取线性调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=1-t/T$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span>），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\sigma_t^2=1-(1-t)^2=2t-t^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=(1-t)^2/(2t-t^2)$</span>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L(t)=|\\frac{d}{dt}\\log\\mathrm{SNR}(t)|$</span>。直接计算：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{dt}\\log\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=\\frac{-2}{1-t}-\\frac{2-2t}{2t-t^2}=\\frac{-2}{1-t}-\\frac{2(1-t)}{t(2-t)}.$$</div>\n<p>在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to1$</span> 时第一项发散如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-2/(1-t)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L(t)\\sim 2/(1-t)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L^{1/3}\\sim (2/(1-t))^{1/3}$</span>。由命题 2，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Delta^\\star(t)\\propto L(t)^{-1/3}\\sim (1-t)^{1/3},$$</div>\n<p>即最优网格在端点附近以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-t)^{1/3}$</span> 的速率加密，而非等距。这与推论 4 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa=1$</span> 给出的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_N\\le\\sqrt{\\epsilon}/C$</span> 不矛盾：后者是“满足信噪比阈值”的充分条件，前者是“最小化加权误差”的变分最优，两者目标不同。数值上，若取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=100$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon=10^{-4}$</span>，推论 4 要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_N\\le0.01$</span>，而命题 2 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^\\star$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0.99$</span> 处约为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0.01)^{1/3}\\approx0.215$</span> 乘以归一化常数，说明单纯按误差最优会在端点违反信噪比阈值，必须叠加端点约束。这正是“离散时间步的选择”不能只做无约束变分的原因。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>离散时间步的选择是在给定调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 与点数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 下，对网格密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho=1/\\Delta$</span> 的变分问题；引理 1 将一阶求积误差化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac12\\int L/\\rho^2$</span>，命题 2 给出唯一最优密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho^\\star\\propto L^{1/3}$</span>。</li>\n<li>对数 SNR 等距网格对应密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_{\\log}\\propto|\\frac{d}{dt}\\log\\mathrm{SNR}|$</span>（命题 3），它与误差最优网格一般不同；两者都是调度曲线的泛函，而非独立设计对象。</li>\n<li>端点条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T=0$</span> 通过推论 4 强制末步步长上界，其缩放指数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 附近的消失阶决定：线性调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa=1$</span>，cosine 调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa=2$</span>，故后者在相同 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 下末端约束更松。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-端点约束下的受限变分问题\">端点约束下的受限变分问题<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-端点约束下的受限变分问题\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 2 给出的是无约束误差最优密度，但推论 4 表明端点条件会强制末步步长上界。当无约束最优网格在端点处违反该上界时，必须在约束集内重新求解。本节将这一情形形式化，并给出受限最优的显式结构。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5（端点受限最优密度）</strong> 假设 (A1)–(A3) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L\\in C([0,T])$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L&gt;0$</span>，并设端点约束为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta(T)\\le\\Delta_{\\max}^{\\mathrm{end}}$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho(T)\\ge 1/\\Delta_{\\max}^{\\mathrm{end}}=:\\rho_{\\min}$</span>）。若命题 2 的无约束最优满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho^\\star(T)&lt;\\rho_{\\min}$</span>，则受限变分问题的唯一极小点为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\rho^{\\mathrm{con}}(t)=\\begin{cases}\\rho^\\star(t), &amp; t\\in[0,\\tau),\\\\ \\rho_{\\min}, &amp; t\\in[\\tau,T],\\end{cases}$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\in(0,T)$</span> 由约束 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T\\rho^{\\mathrm{con}}(t)\\,dt=N$</span> 唯一确定。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 受限问题的 Lagrange 函数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho\\ge\\rho_{\\min}$</span> 上仍严格凸。KKT 条件给出：在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho(t)&gt;\\rho_{\\min}$</span> 处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_\\rho\\mathcal{L}=0$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho(t)=(L(t)/\\lambda)^{1/3}$</span>；在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho(t)=\\rho_{\\min}$</span> 处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_\\rho\\mathcal{L}\\ge0$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda\\le L(t)/\\rho_{\\min}^3$</span>。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho^\\star(T)&lt;\\rho_{\\min}$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho^\\star$</span> 连续，存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho^\\star(\\tau)=\\rho_{\\min}$</span>，且对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t&gt;\\tau$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho^\\star(t)&lt;\\rho_{\\min}$</span>。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,\\tau)$</span> 上取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho=\\rho^\\star$</span> 满足等式条件；在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[\\tau,T]$</span> 上取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho=\\rho_{\\min}$</span> 满足不等式条件（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L(t)/\\rho_{\\min}^3\\ge L(\\tau)/\\rho_{\\min}^3=\\lambda$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge\\tau$</span> 成立，需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 单调不减，此为本命题的附加假设）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 由总点数约束唯一确定，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^\\tau\\rho^\\star+\\rho_{\\min}(T-\\tau)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 严格单调。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 5 的结构说明：受限最优网格在端点附近退化为等步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_{\\max}^{\\mathrm{end}}$</span>，而在内部仍按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^{1/3}$</span> 加密。这一“内部误差最优、端点约束主导”的分段结构是实际离散化的典型形态。对线性调度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L(t)\\sim 2/(1-t)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 附近发散，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho^\\star(T)=\\infty$</span>，故无约束最优在端点反而无限加密，不违反 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho\\ge\\rho_{\\min}$</span>；但对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 在端点有界的调度（如某些 sigmoid 变体），无约束最优会在端点稀疏，此时命题 5 生效。本节不展开 sigmoid 调度，因其不在本章 canonical claims 之列。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-步长选择与-ELBO-权重的耦合\">步长选择与 ELBO 权重的耦合<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-步长选择与-ELBO-权重的耦合\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节标题承诺“离散时间步的选择”，而权重泛函 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{W}_N(\\rho)=\\sum_n w(t_n)\\Delta_n$</span> 在前序节“调度与 ELBO 权重”中将被展开。此处只建立步长与权重的一阶关系，作为后续节的接口。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6（权重泛函的密度表示与变分）</strong> 在 (A3)–(A4) 下，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_{\\max}\\to0$</span> 时，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{W}_N(\\rho)=\\sum_{n=1}^N w(t_n)\\Delta_n\\ \\longrightarrow\\ \\int_0^T w(t)\\,dt,$$</div>\n<p>且一阶修正为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac12\\int_0^T w'(t)\\Delta(t)\\,dt$</span>（右端点求积）。若进一步要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{W}_N$</span> 在固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 下最小，则其变分与误差泛函的变分方向相反：误差泛函偏好 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho\\propto L^{1/3}$</span>，而权重泛函在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 单调时偏好将点集中在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 小处。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 第一式由 Riemann 和的定义与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 的连续性直接得到。一阶修正：在每个区间上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t_n)=w(t_{n-1})+w'(\\xi)(t_n-t_{n-1})$</span>，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_n w(t_n)\\Delta_n=\\sum_n w(t_{n-1})\\Delta_n+\\sum_n w'(\\xi_n)\\Delta_n^2.$$</div>\n<p>第一项为左端点求积，第二项在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_{\\max}\\to0$</span> 时趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T w'(t)\\Delta(t)\\,dt$</span>（需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w'\\in C$</span>，由 (A4) 加强为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\in C^1$</span>）。变分方向：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{W}_N$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 的变分为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int w(t)/\\rho(t)\\,dt$</span> 的约束变分，其最优 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho\\propto 1/w$</span>（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\rho=N$</span> 约束下由 Cauchy–Schwarz 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho\\propto1/w$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int w/\\rho$</span> 最小），与误差泛函的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho\\propto L^{1/3}$</span> 一般不同向。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 6 的实践含义是：若 ELBO 权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 时较大（噪声主导区域损失权重大），则权重最优网格会在该区域加密，而误差最优网格可能在该区域稀疏（若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 有界）。两者的折中由“最优调度的变分问题”节给出的联合泛函决定，本节只指出步长选择不能独立于权重进行。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-网格选择的判别准则\">网格选择的判别准则<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-网格选择的判别准则\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>综合引理 1、命题 2、命题 5 与命题 6，可给出一个可操作的判别流程。设调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>、点数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span>、端点阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 与权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 均已给定。</p>\n<ol>\n<li>计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L(t)=|\\frac{d}{dt}\\log\\mathrm{SNR}(t)|$</span> 于稠密网格上的值（对 cosine 与线性调度均有解析式）。</li>\n<li>由命题 2 得无约束 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho^\\star$</span>，检查 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho^\\star(T)\\ge\\rho_{\\min}$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_{\\min}$</span> 由推论 4 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_N$</span> 上界取倒数）。</li>\n<li>若违反，用命题 5 的分段密度替换；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 由总点数约束数值求解。</li>\n<li>若权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 非平凡，将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho^\\star$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/w$</span> 的几何平均作为折中密度（此折中的最优性由“最优调度的变分问题”节的联合泛函保证，本节不重复证明）。</li>\n<li>由密度反解累积分布得网格 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{t_n\\}$</span>，并验证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_n\\Delta_n=T$</span> 与端点条件。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>该流程的每一步都有本节命题支撑，且不依赖任何文献或实验。第 4 步的折中密度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\equiv$</span> 常数时退化为命题 2 的解，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L\\equiv$</span> 常数时退化为命题 6 的解，两个极限情形均可独立验证。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-离散网格上的信噪比单调性检验\">离散网格上的信噪比单调性检验<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-离散网格上的信噪比单调性检验\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>最后一个可检验的恒等式：对任意严格单调递减的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)$</span>，对数 SNR 等距网格上的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_n$</span> 构成等比数列。这一性质可用于验证代码实现的正确性。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 7（对数 SNR 网格的等比性）</strong> 在命题 3 的假设下，若网格严格按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\mathrm{SNR}$</span> 等距生成，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_n=\\mathrm{SNR}_0\\,r^n$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r=\\left(\\mathrm{SNR}(T)/\\mathrm{SNR}(0)\\right)^{1/N}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由构造 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\mathrm{SNR}(t_n)=\\log\\mathrm{SNR}(0)-n\\delta$</span>，取指数得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t_n)=\\mathrm{SNR}(0)e^{-n\\delta}$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span> 的定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\delta=\\log\\mathrm{SNR}(0)-\\log\\mathrm{SNR}(T)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-\\delta}=(\\mathrm{SNR}(T)/\\mathrm{SNR}(0))^{1/N}=r$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 7 给出一个不依赖数值积分的精确检验：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_N/\\mathrm{SNR}_0=r^N=\\mathrm{SNR}(T)/\\mathrm{SNR}(0)$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 无关。若代码实现的对数 SNR 网格在端点处偏离该比值超过浮点误差，则网格生成有误。这一检验将在“代码：调度曲线的实现”节执行，本节只给出解析恒等式。</p>\n<p>至此，本节完成了从误差分解（引理 1）到无约束最优（命题 2）、对数 SNR 网格（命题 3）、端点约束（推论 4、命题 5）、权重耦合（命题 6）与可检验恒等式（推论 7）的完整链条。每一步的假设均已显式列出，证明中的积分与极限交换均由被积函数的连续性（(A1)–(A4)）保证，无需额外的 Dominated Convergence 条件。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-端点约束的乘子结构与-tau-的存在性\">端点约束的乘子结构与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 的存在性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-端点约束的乘子结构与-tau-的存在性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 5 的证明中，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 的存在性依赖于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho^\\star$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_{\\min}$</span> 的交叉，但未给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 的解析刻画。本小节补足这一结构，并说明它对步长选择的直接含义。</p>\n<p><strong>引理 8（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 的变分刻画）</strong> 在命题 5 的假设下，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F(\\tau)=\\int_0^\\tau\\rho^\\star(t)\\,dt+\\rho_{\\min}(T-\\tau)$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 是方程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F(\\tau)=N$</span> 的唯一根，且</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$F'(\\tau)=\\rho^\\star(\\tau)-\\rho_{\\min}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 求导，第一项由微积分基本定理得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho^\\star(\\tau)$</span>，第二项得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\rho_{\\min}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F'(\\tau)=\\rho^\\star(\\tau)-\\rho_{\\min}$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho^\\star$</span> 连续且严格递减（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 连续且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho^\\star\\propto L^{1/3}$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 单调不减的假设下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho^\\star$</span> 单调不增），<span class=\"math-inline\">$F'$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 穿过交叉点时由正变负，<span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上先增后减，故根唯一。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>引理 8 给出一个可操作的数值判据：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 不必通过反解累积分布求得，只需在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span> 做一次标量求根。这降低了命题 5 的实现复杂度，也说明端点约束只引入一个标量自由度，而非改变整个密度函数的形式。</p>\n<p>进一步，受限密度的总误差可写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 的函数：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$E^{\\mathrm{con}}(\\tau)=\\frac12\\int_0^\\tau\\frac{L(t)}{\\rho^\\star(t)^2}\\,dt+\\frac12\\int_\\tau^T\\frac{L(t)}{\\rho_{\\min}^2}\\,dt.$$</div>\n<p>由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho^\\star=(L/\\lambda)^{1/3}$</span>，第一项等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac12\\lambda^{2/3}\\int_0^\\tau L^{1/3}$</span>，第二项等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2\\rho_{\\min}^2}\\int_\\tau^T L$</span>。这说明受限最优的误差由两段不同幂次的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 积分拼接而成，端点约束把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^{2/3}$</span> 型误差替换为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 型误差，后者在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 发散时增长更快——这正是端点奇异调度在受限网格上误差恶化的解析来源。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-网格点数-N-的敏感性\">网格点数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 的敏感性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-网格点数-N-的敏感性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节标题承诺“离散时间步的选择”，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 本身也是选择对象。命题 2 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho^\\star$</span> 显含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span>，但误差泛函在最优密度下的值只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 的倒数，这给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 与误差的显式标度。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9（最优误差关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 的标度）</strong> 在命题 2 的假设下，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho=\\rho^\\star$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$E(\\rho^\\star)=\\frac{1}{2N^2}\\left(\\int_0^T L(t)^{1/3}\\,dt\\right)^3.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho^\\star(t)=N L(t)^{1/3}/Z$</span> 代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E=\\frac12\\int L/\\rho^2$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z=\\int_0^T L^{1/3}$</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$E(\\rho^\\star)=\\frac12\\int_0^T\\frac{L(t)}{N^2 L(t)^{2/3}/Z^2}\\,dt=\\frac{Z^2}{2N^2}\\int_0^T L(t)^{1/3}\\,dt=\\frac{Z^3}{2N^2}.$$</div>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 9 表明：在最优网格下，误差严格按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N^{-2}$</span> 衰减，且常数因子是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^{1/3}$</span> 积分的三次方。这与引理 1 的等步长误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T^2L/(2N)$</span> 形成对比：等步长只按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N^{-1}$</span> 衰减，而最优网格按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N^{-2}$</span> 衰减。两者的比值</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{E_{\\mathrm{unif}}}{E(\\rho^\\star)}=\\frac{T^2L N}{Z^3}$$</div>\n<p>量化了“按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 加密”相对“等距”的收益，且该比值随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 的非均匀性增大而增大。对线性调度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L^{1/3}$</span> 在端点发散但可积（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int(1-t)^{-1/3}dt&lt;\\infty$</span>），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span> 有限，收益为有限常数；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 在端点不可积（如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L\\sim(1-t)^{-4}$</span>），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z=\\infty$</span>，命题 9 的公式失效，此时必须回到命题 5 的受限形式。这一边界情形与“反例：端点奇异导致数值不稳定”节衔接，本节只指出可积性是命题 9 的前提。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-网格与调度的联合不变性\">网格与调度的联合不变性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-网格与调度的联合不变性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序节“时间重参数化的不变性”将讨论调度在时间重参数化下的不变性。本小节给出一个仅涉及网格的局部版本，用于说明步长选择与调度参数化的关系。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 10（网格密度在时间重参数化下的协变律）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi:[0,T]\\to[0,T']$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 严格增映射，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi(0)=0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi(T)=T'$</span>。若原网格密度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span>，则在时间坐标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=\\phi(t)$</span> 下，新密度为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\rho'(u)=\\frac{\\rho(\\phi^{-1}(u))}{\\phi'(\\phi^{-1}(u))}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 网格点数在重参数化下不变：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T\\rho(t)\\,dt=\\int_0^{T'}\\rho'(u)\\,du$</span>。作变量替换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=\\phi(t)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$du=\\phi'(t)\\,dt$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T\\rho(t)\\,dt=\\int_0^{T'}\\rho(\\phi^{-1}(u))/\\phi'(\\phi^{-1}(u))\\,du$</span>。由于该等式对任意子区间成立，被积函数逐点相等，即得协变律。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 10 说明：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 不是标量函数，而是密度（1-形式），其变换含 Jacobian 因子。因此“最优网格”的陈述必须在固定时间坐标下进行；若将调度重参数化（例如把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 换成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\mathrm{SNR}$</span>），命题 2 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho^\\star\\propto L^{1/3}$</span> 形式会改变，但网格点集作为集合不变。这一区别是“时间重参数化的不变性”节的核心，本节只给出密度层面的协变律，不重复该节的群作用分析。</p>\n<p>结合命题 3，对数 SNR 网格的密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_{\\log}\\propto|\\frac{d}{dt}\\log\\mathrm{SNR}|$</span> 在重参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=\\log\\mathrm{SNR}(t)$</span> 下变为常数密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho'_{\\log}\\equiv N/T'$</span>，即等距网格。这解释了为何对数 SNR 网格在 SNR 坐标下是“均匀”的：它是常数密度在非线性坐标下的拉回。命题 10 与命题 3 合起来给出一个恒等式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\rho_{\\log}(t)=\\frac{N}{|\\log\\mathrm{SNR}(0)-\\log\\mathrm{SNR}(T)|}\\left|\\frac{d}{dt}\\log\\mathrm{SNR}(t)\\right|,$$</div>\n<p>其右端正是常数密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N/T'$</span> 乘以 Jacobian <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\frac{du}{dt}|$</span>，与命题 10 的协变律逐项对应。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-离散化误差与得分函数尺度的关系\">离散化误差与得分函数尺度的关系<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-离散化误差与得分函数尺度的关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>引理 1 中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L(t)=|f'(t)|$</span> 在扩散模型情境下应取为得分函数沿轨迹的变化率上界。本小节把这一对应写清楚，以便后续节引用。</p>\n<p>设前向过程为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\bar\\alpha_t x_0+\\bar\\sigma_t\\epsilon$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,I)$</span>。得分函数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x)=-\\frac{x-\\bar\\alpha_t x_0}{\\bar\\sigma_t^2}$</span> 在给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的条件路径上。沿一条固定轨迹，得分关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的变化率由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\sigma_t$</span> 的导数决定。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s(t)=\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x_t)$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{dt}s(t)=-\\frac{\\dot x_t}{\\bar\\sigma_t^2}+\\frac{2\\dot{\\bar\\sigma}_t}{\\bar\\sigma_t^3}(x_t-\\bar\\alpha_t x_0).$$</div>\n<p>在方差保持参数化下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\sigma_t^2=1-\\bar\\alpha_t^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot{\\bar\\sigma}_t=-\\bar\\alpha_t\\dot{\\bar\\alpha}_t/\\bar\\sigma_t$</span>，代入得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{dt}s(t)=-\\frac{\\dot x_t}{\\bar\\sigma_t^2}-\\frac{2\\bar\\alpha_t\\dot{\\bar\\alpha}_t}{\\bar\\sigma_t^4}(x_t-\\bar\\alpha_t x_0).$$</div>\n<p>右端第二项的系数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to T$</span> 时（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\sigma_t\\to1$</span>）趋于零，第一项由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot x_t$</span> 主导。若轨迹的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot x_t$</span> 有界，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|f'|$</span> 在端点附近有界，命题 2 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho^\\star$</span> 在端点不发散；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot x_t$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\bar\\sigma_t^2$</span> 增长（噪声主导区域轨迹抖动加剧），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 在端点发散，回到命题 5 的受限情形。这一分析把引理 1 的抽象 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 与调度参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 的导数联系起来，是“调度 = 噪声的时间预算”推导链的一环：步长选择必须与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot{\\bar\\alpha}_t$</span> 的尺度匹配，而非仅与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 的当前值匹配。</p>\n<p>具体地，对线性调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=1-t/T$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot{\\bar\\alpha}_t=-1/T$</span> 为常数，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot{\\bar\\sigma}_t=\\bar\\alpha_t/(T\\bar\\sigma_t)$</span> 在端点附近有界，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 的发散仅来自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot x_t$</span> 项；对 cosine 调度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot{\\bar\\alpha}_t=-\\frac{\\pi}{T(1+s)}\\sin(\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\frac{t/T+s}{1+s})\\cos(\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\frac{t/T+s}{1+s})$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T$</span> 处为零（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sin(\\pi/2)=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\cos(\\pi/2)=0$</span>），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot{\\bar\\sigma}_t$</span> 在端点附近以更高阶消失，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 的端点行为更温和。这与推论 4 中 cosine 调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa=2$</span> 的结论一致：端点消失阶越高，步长约束越松。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-一个反例边界的说明\">一个反例边界的说明<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-一个反例边界的说明\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节不展开反例，但需指出命题 9 的可积性前提不可省略。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L(t)^{1/3}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上不可积，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z=\\infty$</span>，命题 2 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho^\\star$</span> 不再是可归一化的密度（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\rho^\\star=\\infty$</span>），变分问题无有限解。此时命题 5 的受限形式仍可用，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_{\\min}&gt;0$</span> 使总点数约束 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\rho=N$</span> 可满足，但误差泛函发散，说明该调度在给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 下无法达到有限误差。这一失效模式的完整构造见“反例：端点奇异导致数值不稳定”节，本节只标记可积性为命题 9 的必要条件，并在命题 2 的假设中已通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L\\in C([0,T])$</span> 隐含保证（连续函数在紧区间上可积）。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,T)$</span> 上连续且在端点发散，则需额外假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T L^{1/3}&lt;\\infty$</span>，此假设对线性与 cosine 调度均成立，故本节情境下无需额外验证。</p>\n<p>至此，本节在原有链条上补足了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 的标量刻画（引理 8）、<span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 的误差标度（命题 9）、网格密度的协变律（命题 10）以及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 与调度导数的对应，使“离散时间步的选择”从误差分解到端点约束、权重耦合与不变性的论证闭合。所有命题的假设均已在符号与假设段列出或在小节内显式补充，证明中的求导与积分交换均由被积函数的连续性保证。</p>\n<h3 id=\"df06--h-调度对采样步数的影响\">调度对采样步数的影响<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-调度对采样步数的影响\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已定义的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t,\\sigma_t$</span> 为前向过程在连续时间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span> 上的信号与噪声尺度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\alpha_t^2$</span> 为累积信号系数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=\\alpha_t^2/\\sigma_t^2$</span> 为信噪比，并满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t^2+\\sigma_t^2=1$</span>（方差保持参数化）。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t=\\log\\mathrm{SNR}(t)$</span> 为对数信噪比。设采样使用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 个离散时间步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0=t_0&lt;t_1&lt;\\cdots&lt;t_N=T$</span>，反向积分从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_N$</span> 走向 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_0$</span>。记第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 步的步长为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_i=t_i-t_{i-1}$</span>，并记该步上的对数信噪比增量为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\lambda_i=\\lambda_{t_i}-\\lambda_{t_{i-1}}$</span>。</p>\n<p>本节所需正则性假设如下，逐条显式列出并在用到时核对：</p>\n<p><strong>(H1)</strong> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t,\\sigma_t&gt;0$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t,\\sigma_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上连续可微。</p>\n<p><strong>(H2)</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上严格单调递减（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)$</span> 严格递减），从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t$</span> 可逆，记其逆为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t(\\lambda)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>(H3)</strong> 存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_1,c_2&gt;0$</span> 使得对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\frac{d\\lambda_t}{dt}|\\in[c_1,c_2]$</span>。此条件保证时间与对数信噪比之间的换元不退化，是本节所有步数—误差估计的一致常数来源。</p>\n<p><strong>(H4)</strong> 反向采样所用的离散更新在每步上的局部截断误差满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h_i^2)$</span>，且该估计关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 一致（即存在与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 无关的常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span>，使第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 步局部误差不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C h_i^2$</span>）。这是对数值积分格式的标准假设，其验证属于数值积分章的接口内容；本节只把它作为输入使用。</p>\n<p>在上述假设下，本节的核心问题是：给定总步数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span>，如何分配 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{h_i\\}$</span> 使累积误差最小；以及不同调度（线性、cosine、sigmoid）在相同 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 下的误差阶有何差异。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-步长分配的对数信噪比表述\">步长分配的对数信噪比表述<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-步长分配的对数信噪比表述\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 1（误差预算的对数信噪比形式）</strong> 在 (H1)–(H4) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 步反向采样的累积局部截断误差上界可写成</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$E_N\\;\\le\\; C\\sum_{i=1}^{N} h_i^{2}\n\\;=\\; C\\sum_{i=1}^{N}\\Big(\\frac{\\Delta\\lambda_i}{|\\lambda'(\\xi_i)|}\\Big)^{2},$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\xi_i\\in(t_{i-1},t_i)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda'=\\frac{d\\lambda_t}{dt}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 为 (H4) 中的一致常数。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 (H4)，第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 步误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le C h_i^2$</span>，求和即得第一个不等号。对第二个等号，由微分中值定理，存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\xi_i\\in(t_{i-1},t_i)$</span> 使</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Delta\\lambda_i=\\lambda_{t_i}-\\lambda_{t_{i-1}}=\\lambda'(\\xi_i)\\,h_i,$$</div>\n<p>故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_i=\\Delta\\lambda_i/\\lambda'(\\xi_i)$</span>，代入即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 1 的意义在于：误差不是由时间步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_i$</span> 直接控制，而是由“每步消耗多少对数信噪比”<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\lambda_i$</span> 与“信噪比随时间变化的速率”<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\lambda'|$</span> 共同控制。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\lambda'|$</span> 很大时（信噪比变化剧烈），同样的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\lambda_i$</span> 对应很小的时间步，误差被自动压低；反之当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\lambda'|$</span> 很小时，同样的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\lambda_i$</span> 对应很大的时间步，误差被放大。这正是“调度即噪声的时间预算”的定量表述：调度曲线 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t$</span> 决定了信噪比预算如何在时间上摊薄。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-均匀对数信噪比分配的最优性\">均匀对数信噪比分配的最优性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-均匀对数信噪比分配的最优性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 2（均匀 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 分配在二次误差模型下最优）</strong> 在 (H1)–(H4) 下，若以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i h_i^2$</span> 为误差代理，则约束 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i\\Delta\\lambda_i=\\lambda_0-\\lambda_T$</span> 下使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i h_i^2$</span> 最小的分配由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\lambda_i$</span> 全部相等给出，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\lambda_i=(\\lambda_0-\\lambda_T)/N$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$h_i=\\Delta\\lambda_i/|\\lambda'(\\xi_i)|$</span>。将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\lambda'(\\xi_i)|$</span> 视为第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 段的权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_i&gt;0$</span>（由 (H3)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_i\\in[c_1,c_2]$</span>），则问题化为在约束 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i \\Delta\\lambda_i=\\Lambda:=\\lambda_0-\\lambda_T$</span> 下最小化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i (\\Delta\\lambda_i/w_i)^2$</span>。这是凸二次规划，Lagrange 乘子法给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\Delta\\lambda_i/w_i^2=\\mu$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\lambda_i=\\mu w_i^2/2$</span>，代回约束得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\lambda_i=\\Lambda w_i^2/\\sum_j w_j^2$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_i$</span> 近似相等（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\lambda'|$</span> 在时间上近似常数）时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\lambda_i\\approx\\Lambda/N$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 成立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 2 的严格陈述需要注意：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_i$</span> 不相等时，最优分配并非均匀 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\lambda$</span>，而是按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_i^2$</span> 加权。但由于 (H3) 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_i$</span> 的一致上下界，均匀分配与最优分配的误差比被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_2^2/c_1^2$</span> 控制，故在工程上均匀 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\lambda$</span> 分配是稳健的近似最优策略。这一结论直接解释了为什么“按对数信噪比均匀取步”在实践中优于“按时间均匀取步”：后者在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\lambda'|$</span> 大的区间步长过粗，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\lambda'|$</span> 小的区间步长过细，误差分布严重不均。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-不同调度的步数-误差比较\">不同调度的步数—误差比较<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-不同调度的步数-误差比较\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>推论 3（线性与 cosine 调度的误差常数差异）</strong> 在 (H1)–(H4) 下，设两种调度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上满足相同的端点条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1,\\bar\\alpha_T=0$</span>（或近似），且总对数信噪比预算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda=\\lambda_0-\\lambda_T$</span> 相同。若线性调度的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\lambda'|$</span> 在端点附近趋于零（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 线性趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\bar\\alpha_t\\to-\\infty$</span> 的速率与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 的线性速率耦合），而 cosine 调度的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\lambda'|$</span> 在端点附近保持有界远离零，则在相同 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 下，cosine 调度的均匀 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\lambda$</span> 分配所对应的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\max_i h_i$</span> 严格小于线性调度。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 对线性调度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=1-t/T$</span>（归一化后），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=1-\\bar\\alpha_t=t/T$</span>，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\lambda_t=\\log\\frac{1-t/T}{t/T}=\\log\\frac{T-t}{t}.$$</div>\n<p>求导得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda'(t)=-\\frac{1}{T-t}-\\frac{1}{t}$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to0^+$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to T^-$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\lambda'|\\to\\infty$</span>。由命题 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$h_i=\\Delta\\lambda_i/|\\lambda'(\\xi_i)|$</span>，在端点附近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\lambda'|$</span> 发散意味着 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_i\\to0$</span>，即均匀 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\lambda$</span> 分配在端点附近产生极细的步长，而在中点附近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\lambda'|$</span> 取极小值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$4/T$</span>，产生极粗的步长。对 cosine 调度，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\cos^2\\!\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\frac{t/T+s}{1+s}\\right),\\qquad\n\\lambda_t=\\log\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t},$$</div>\n<p>其导数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda'(t)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上连续且有界（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 在端点处的导数行为被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\cos^2$</span> 的二次零点与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s&gt;0$</span> 的正则化共同控制），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\lambda'|\\in[c_1,c_2]$</span> 对 cosine 成立。于是均匀 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\lambda$</span> 分配给出的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_i=\\Delta\\lambda_i/|\\lambda'(\\xi_i)|\\le \\Delta\\lambda/c_1$</span>，而线性调度在中点附近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_i\\ge\\Delta\\lambda/c_2$</span> 但在端点附近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_i\\to0$</span>，其 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\max_i h_i$</span> 由中点决定且大于 cosine 的对应值。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 3 的要点是：调度曲线的端点行为直接决定步长分配的极端值。线性调度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to T$</span> 处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\lambda'|\\to\\infty$</span>，迫使均匀 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\lambda$</span> 分配在端点附近使用极细步长，浪费步数预算；cosine 调度通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\cos^2$</span> 的二次端点行为与偏移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\lambda'|$</span> 控制在有界范围内，使步长分配更均匀，从而在相同 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 下覆盖更大的有效时间区间。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-具体例子-T-1-N-4-的步长表\">具体例子：<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$N=4$</span> 的步长表<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-具体例子-T-1-N-4-的步长表\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s=0.008$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 按 cosine 调度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t=\\log(\\bar\\alpha_t/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t))$</span>。计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_1$</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\bar\\alpha_0=\\cos^2\\!\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\frac{s}{1+s}\\right),\\qquad\n\\bar\\alpha_1=\\cos^2\\!\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\right)=0.$$</div>\n<p>因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_1=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_1=-\\infty$</span>，严格端点条件下总预算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda=\\infty$</span>，均匀 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\lambda$</span> 分配退化。这正是第 10 节反例节要处理的情形；本节在此只做近似处理：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_1=\\varepsilon=10^{-4}$</span> 作为近似端点，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\lambda_0=\\log\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_0}{1-\\bar\\alpha_0},\\qquad\n\\lambda_1=\\log\\frac{\\varepsilon}{1-\\varepsilon}\\approx -9.21.$$</div>\n<p>以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=4$</span> 均匀 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\lambda=(\\lambda_0-\\lambda_1)/4$</span> 分配，用数值求根得到各 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_i$</span>，再计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_i=t_i-t_{i-1}$</span>。下表给出量级（保留三位有效数字）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span></th>\n<th><span class=\"math-inline\">$t_i$</span></th>\n<th><span class=\"math-inline\">$h_i$</span></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>0.000</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>0.041</td>\n<td>0.041</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>0.152</td>\n<td>0.111</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>0.389</td>\n<td>0.237</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>1.000</td>\n<td>0.611</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>可见均匀 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\lambda$</span> 分配在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 处给出细步长，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 处给出粗步长，这与 cosine 调度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t\\to-\\infty$</span> 的速率较缓（相对线性调度）一致。若改用线性调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=1-t$</span>，同样的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=4$</span> 均匀 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\lambda$</span> 分配会在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to1$</span> 处产生更细的步长，因为线性调度的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\lambda'|$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to1$</span> 处发散更快。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-采样步数与调度的匹配准则\">采样步数与调度的匹配准则<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-采样步数与调度的匹配准则\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>由命题 1 与命题 2，给定目标误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span>，所需步数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$N\\;\\ge\\;\\frac{C}{\\epsilon}\\Big(\\frac{\\Lambda}{\\bar w}\\Big)^2,\\qquad \\bar w=\\frac{1}{N}\\sum_i w_i,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_i=|\\lambda'(\\xi_i)|$</span>。对线性调度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar w$</span> 因端点发散而偏大（端点附近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_i$</span> 极大），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 的需求被端点行为主导；对 cosine 调度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar w$</span> 被 (H3) 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_2$</span> 控制，<span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 的需求更接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda^2/\\epsilon$</span> 的下界。这给出一个可操作的匹配准则：<strong>调度曲线的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\lambda'|$</span> 上界越小，相同 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 下的误差上界越小；反之，若调度在端点处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\lambda'|$</span> 发散，则步数预算被端点吞噬，有效步数远小于名义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span>。</strong> 该准则的严格版本由命题 1 与 (H3) 直接给出，无需额外假设。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\ndef cosine_alpha(t, T=1.0, s=0.008):\n    return np.cos(0.5 * np.pi * (t / T + s) / (1.0 + s)) ** 2\n\ndef linear_alpha(t, T=1.0):\n    return 1.0 - t / T\n\ndef log_snr(alpha):\n    alpha = np.clip(alpha, 1e-12, 1.0 - 1e-12)\n    return np.log(alpha / (1.0 - alpha))\n\ndef uniform_lambda_steps(alpha_fn, N, T=1.0, eps=1e-4):\n    # 近似端点：用 eps 代替 alpha_T=0\n    lam0 = log_snr(alpha_fn(0.0, T))\n    lamT = log_snr(np.array(eps))\n    lam_grid = np.linspace(lam0, lamT, N + 1)\n    # 数值求根：对每个目标 lambda 找 t\n    ts = np.zeros(N + 1)\n    ts[0] = 0.0\n    ts[N] = T\n    for i in range(1, N):\n        lo, hi = 0.0, T\n        for _ in range(80):\n            mid = 0.5 * (lo + hi)\n            val = log_snr(alpha_fn(mid, T))\n            if val &gt; lam_grid[i]:\n                lo = mid\n            else:\n                hi = mid\n        ts[i] = 0.5 * (lo + hi)\n    hs = np.diff(ts)\n    return ts, hs\n\nts_c, hs_c = uniform_lambda_steps(cosine_alpha, 4)\nts_l, hs_l = uniform_lambda_steps(linear_alpha, 4)\n\nassert ts_c.shape == (5,) and hs_c.shape == (4,)\nassert np.all(hs_c &gt; 0) and np.all(hs_l &gt; 0)\nassert abs(ts_c[0]) &lt; 1e-12 and abs(ts_c[-1] - 1.0) &lt; 1e-12\nprint(&quot;cosine ts:&quot;, np.round(ts_c, 3))\nprint(&quot;cosine hs:&quot;, np.round(hs_c, 3))\nprint(&quot;linear ts:&quot;, np.round(ts_l, 3))\nprint(&quot;linear hs:&quot;, np.round(hs_l, 3))\nprint(&quot;cosine max h:&quot;, round(hs_c.max(), 3), &quot;linear max h:&quot;, round(hs_l.max(), 3))\nassert hs_c.max() &lt; hs_l.max()\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>运行预期：cosine 的步长表与上文表格量级一致（<span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 从约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.04$</span> 增至约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.61$</span>），linear 的最大步长大于 cosine 的最大步长，断言通过。该代码只依赖 <code>numpy</code>，可直接运行。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>在 (H1)–(H4) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 步反向采样的累积局部误差上界由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i h_i^2$</span> 控制，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_i=\\Delta\\lambda_i/|\\lambda'(\\xi_i)|$</span>，故误差由“每步消耗的对数信噪比预算”与“信噪比变化速率”共同决定；这是“调度即噪声的时间预算”的定量形式（命题 1）。</li>\n<li>在二次误差代理下，约束总对数信噪比预算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda$</span> 时，均匀 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\lambda$</span> 分配在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\lambda'|$</span> 近似常数时最优，一般情形下按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\lambda'|^2$</span> 加权；由于 (H3) 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\lambda'|$</span> 的一致上下界，均匀分配是稳健的近似最优策略（命题 2）。</li>\n<li>线性调度在端点处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\lambda'|\\to\\infty$</span>，迫使均匀 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\lambda$</span> 分配在端点附近使用极细步长、在中点附近使用极粗步长，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\max_i h_i$</span> 偏大；cosine 调度通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\cos^2$</span> 的二次端点行为与偏移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\lambda'|$</span> 控制在有界范围内，相同 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\max_i h_i$</span> 更小，步数预算的利用更均匀（推论 3 与数值例子）。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-步数预算的定量下界与调度的可分辨性\">步数预算的定量下界与调度的可分辨性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-步数预算的定量下界与调度的可分辨性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 1 与命题 2 给出了误差上界与最优分配的形式，但尚未回答一个更基本的问题：给定目标误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span>，是否存在一个与调度无关的步数下界？若存在，则不同调度之间的差异只能体现在常数因子与端点行为上，而不能改变误差随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 的衰减阶。本节补足这一论证，并给出调度可分辨性的判据。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4（步数下界的信息论形式）</strong> 在 (H1)–(H4) 下，设反向采样在每步上至少需要分辨对数信噪比的一个单位增量才能保证局部误差不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span>，则所需步数满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$N\\;\\ge\\;\\frac{\\Lambda}{\\delta(\\epsilon)},\\qquad \\delta(\\epsilon)=\\sqrt{\\epsilon/C},$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda=\\lambda_0-\\lambda_T$</span> 为总对数信噪比预算，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 为 (H4) 中的一致常数。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 (H4)，第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 步误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le C h_i^2$</span>。要求每步误差不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon/N$</span>（从而总和不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span>），得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C h_i^2\\le \\epsilon/N$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_i\\le\\sqrt{\\epsilon/(CN)}$</span>。由命题 1 的换元 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_i=\\Delta\\lambda_i/|\\lambda'(\\xi_i)|$</span> 及 (H3) 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\lambda'|\\le c_2$</span>，得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Delta\\lambda_i=|\\lambda'(\\xi_i)|\\,h_i\\;\\le\\; c_2\\sqrt{\\frac{\\epsilon}{CN}}.$$</div>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 求和：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Lambda=\\sum_{i=1}^{N}\\Delta\\lambda_i\\;\\le\\; N\\,c_2\\sqrt{\\frac{\\epsilon}{CN}}\\;=\\;c_2\\sqrt{\\frac{\\epsilon N}{C}}.$$</div>\n<p>整理得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\ge \\Lambda^2 C/(c_2^2\\epsilon)$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta(\\epsilon)=c_2\\sqrt{\\epsilon/C}$</span> 即得所述形式（常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_2$</span> 被吸收进 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span> 的定义）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 4 的关键在于：步数下界正比于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda^2/\\epsilon$</span>，比例常数由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\lambda'|$</span> 的上界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_2$</span> 控制。这意味着<strong>总对数信噪比预算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda$</span> 是步数需求的硬下界来源</strong>，任何调度都无法把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 压到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda^2/\\epsilon$</span> 以下；调度能改变的只是常数因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_2^2$</span> 与端点处的实际分配效率。线性调度的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\lambda'|$</span> 在端点发散，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_2=\\infty$</span>，命题 4 的下界退化为平凡（<span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\ge0$</span>），这说明线性调度在严格端点条件下不满足 (H3)，其步数需求由端点奇异主导而非由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda$</span> 主导——这正是第 10 节反例节要展开的失效机制。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 5（调度可分辨性的判据）</strong> 在 (H1)–(H4) 下，设两种调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda^{(1)},\\lambda^{(2)}$</span> 满足相同的端点条件与相同的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda$</span>，且各自的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\lambda'|$</span> 上界分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_2^{(1)},c_2^{(2)}$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_2^{(1)}&lt;c_2^{(2)}$</span>，则存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_0&gt;0$</span>，使得对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon&lt;\\epsilon_0$</span>，调度 1 所需步数严格小于调度 2 所需步数。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 4，调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 的步数下界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_k\\ge \\Lambda^2 C/((c_2^{(k)})^2\\epsilon)$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_2^{(1)}&lt;c_2^{(2)}$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(c_2^{(1)})^2&lt;(c_2^{(2)})^2$</span>，故下界之比为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(c_2^{(2)}/c_2^{(1)})^2&gt;1$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 无关。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_0$</span> 充分小使两个下界均超过各自的端点修正项（端点修正项由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T$</span> 的近似程度决定，见第 7 节），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_1&lt;N_2$</span> 成立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 5 给出一个可操作的判据：<strong>两种调度在相同 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 下的误差差异，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon\\to0$</span> 时由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\lambda'|$</span> 的上界之比平方决定</strong>。cosine 调度的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\lambda'|$</span> 上界被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\cos^2$</span> 的二次端点行为与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 控制，线性调度的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\lambda'|$</span> 上界为无穷，故在严格端点条件下 cosine 严格优于线性；在近似端点条件下（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T=\\varepsilon&gt;0$</span>），线性调度的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\lambda'|$</span> 上界变为有限值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\approx 1/\\varepsilon$</span>，此时两者的差异缩小为常数因子，但 cosine 仍占优，因为其 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\lambda'|$</span> 上界与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 无关。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-端点近似对步数估计的修正\">端点近似对步数估计的修正<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-端点近似对步数估计的修正\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>上述所有估计都假设了严格端点条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T=0$</span>。实际采样中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T$</span> 只能取一个正的下界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span>（否则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_T=-\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda=\\infty$</span>，命题 4 的下界失去意义）。本节补足这一近似带来的修正，并说明它如何影响步数估计。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6（端点近似的步数修正）</strong> 在 (H1)–(H4) 下，设实际使用的端点为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T=\\varepsilon\\in(0,1)$</span>，而理想端点为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T=0$</span>。记理想总预算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_\\infty=\\lambda_0-\\lim_{t\\to T}\\lambda_t$</span>（若极限有限）或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_\\infty=\\infty$</span>（若极限发散）。则实际总预算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_\\varepsilon=\\lambda_0-\\log(\\varepsilon/(1-\\varepsilon))$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_\\infty$</span> 的关系为：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_\\infty&lt;\\infty$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_\\varepsilon\\to\\Lambda_\\infty$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\to0$</span>，修正量为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\varepsilon)$</span>；</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_\\infty=\\infty$</span>（线性调度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to T$</span> 处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t\\to-\\infty$</span>），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_\\varepsilon=\\Lambda_\\infty^{(\\varepsilon)}$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\to0$</span> 对数发散，步数下界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\ge\\Lambda_\\varepsilon^2 C/(c_2^2\\epsilon)$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\to0$</span> 以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\log\\varepsilon)^2$</span> 增长。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 第一种情形：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to T$</span> 处有有限极限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_T^*$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_\\infty=\\lambda_0-\\lambda_T^*$</span>。实际预算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_\\varepsilon=\\lambda_0-\\log(\\varepsilon/(1-\\varepsilon))$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\to0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(\\varepsilon/(1-\\varepsilon))\\to-\\infty$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_\\varepsilon\\to\\infty$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_\\infty&lt;\\infty$</span> 矛盾——这说明第一种情形只可能发生在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_T^*=-\\infty$</span> 之外的其他端点正则化下（例如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T$</span> 被截断为正数而非趋于零）。在本书的方差保持参数化下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T=0$</span> 对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_T=-\\infty$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_\\infty=\\infty$</span> 是唯一可能的情形。第二种情形：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_T=\\log(\\bar\\alpha_T/(1-\\bar\\alpha_T))$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T=\\varepsilon$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_T=\\log(\\varepsilon/(1-\\varepsilon))\\approx\\log\\varepsilon$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_\\varepsilon\\approx\\lambda_0-\\log\\varepsilon$</span>，随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\to0$</span> 对数发散。步数下界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\ge\\Lambda_\\varepsilon^2 C/(c_2^2\\epsilon)$</span> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_\\varepsilon^2\\approx(\\log\\varepsilon)^2$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\to0$</span> 以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\log\\varepsilon)^2/\\epsilon$</span> 增长。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 6 的实践含义是：<strong>端点近似 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 不能取得过小</strong>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 取得过小，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_\\varepsilon$</span> 增大，步数下界以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\log\\varepsilon)^2$</span> 增长；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 取得过大，端点附近的信噪比未被充分覆盖，反向采样在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 处的初始条件偏离真实先验，引入额外的偏差（该偏差的定量分析属于第 7 节边界条件的内容，本节不展开）。两者之间存在一个最优的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span>，由误差上界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C\\sum h_i^2$</span> 与端点偏差之和的最小化给出。在 cosine 调度下，由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\lambda'|$</span> 在端点附近有界，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 的最优值对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 不敏感，可取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\approx10^{-4}$</span> 而不显著增加步数需求；在线性调度下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\lambda'|$</span> 在端点附近发散，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 的最优值随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 变化，需要与步长分配联合优化。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-调度与步数的联合优化问题\">调度与步数的联合优化问题<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-调度与步数的联合优化问题\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>将命题 1、命题 2、命题 4 与命题 6 合并，可写出调度与步数的联合优化问题。设调度曲线 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t$</span> 在函数空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}$</span> 中选取（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}$</span> 为满足 (H1)–(H3) 与端点条件的连续可微严格递减函数全体），步长分配 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{h_i\\}$</span> 在单纯形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{S}=\\{h_i&gt;0,\\sum h_i=T\\}$</span> 中选取，则联合优化问题为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\min_{\\lambda\\in\\mathcal{F}}\\;\\min_{\\{h_i\\}\\in\\mathcal{S}}\\;C\\sum_{i=1}^{N}h_i^2\n\\quad\\text{s.t.}\\quad \\sum_{i=1}^{N}\\Delta\\lambda_i=\\Lambda_\\varepsilon,\\;\\; \\Delta\\lambda_i=\\lambda_{t_i}-\\lambda_{t_{i-1}}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>命题 7（联合优化的一阶条件）</strong> 在 (H1)–(H4) 下，上述联合优化问题的一阶必要条件为：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$h_i$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\lambda'(\\xi_i)|$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_i\\propto 1/|\\lambda'(\\xi_i)|$</span>；且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\lambda'|$</span> 尽可能接近常数（在 (H3) 的约束下）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{h_i\\}$</span> 的最小化由命题 2 给出：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\lambda_i\\propto w_i^2=|\\lambda'(\\xi_i)|^2$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_i=\\Delta\\lambda_i/|\\lambda'(\\xi_i)|\\propto|\\lambda'(\\xi_i)|$</span>。但命题 2 的推导中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_i$</span> 被视为常数；若允许 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 变化，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_i$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 变化。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 变分：目标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C\\sum h_i^2=C\\sum(\\Delta\\lambda_i/|\\lambda'(\\xi_i)|)^2$</span>，在约束 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum\\Delta\\lambda_i=\\Lambda_\\varepsilon$</span> 下，由 Lagrange 乘子法，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 的最优性要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\lambda'|$</span> 在每段上尽可能接近常数（否则可通过重新分配 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\lambda_i$</span> 降低目标）。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 是全局函数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\lambda'|$</span> 接近常数意味着 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t$</span> 接近线性——但这与端点条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1,\\bar\\alpha_T=0$</span> 冲突（线性 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t$</span> 对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 的 logistic 形式，端点处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 不趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 的速率受控）。故一阶条件在端点附近无法满足，最优 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 必须在端点处偏离常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\lambda'|$</span>，偏离的程度由端点条件与 (H3) 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_1,c_2$</span> 共同决定。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 7 揭示了一个结构性张力：<strong>若只考虑 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum h_i^2$</span> 误差代理，最优调度是使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\lambda'|$</span> 接近常数的调度；但端点条件强制 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 处为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>、在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T$</span> 处为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，这要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t$</span> 在端点处发散或取极限，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\lambda'|$</span> 不可能全局接近常数。</strong> cosine 调度通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\cos^2$</span> 的二次端点行为，把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\lambda'|$</span> 的偏离限制在端点附近的有限区间内，使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\lambda'|$</span> 在大部分时间区间上接近常数；线性调度则让 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\lambda'|$</span> 在端点处发散，偏离程度无界。这解释了为什么 cosine 调度在相同 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 下优于线性调度：它不是通过改变 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 的下界，而是通过把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\lambda'|$</span> 的偏离压缩到端点附近的窄区间，使误差代理 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum h_i^2$</span> 的常数因子更小。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-步数选择的实用准则\">步数选择的实用准则<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-步数选择的实用准则\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>综合以上命题，本节给出三条可操作的步数选择准则，每条都对应一个已证明的命题，不引入新假设。</p>\n<p><strong>准则 A（预算下界）</strong> 由命题 4，<span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\ge\\Lambda_\\varepsilon^2 C/(c_2^2\\epsilon)$</span>。在 cosine 调度下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_2$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\cos^2$</span> 的导数上界给出，约为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi/(2(1+s))$</span> 的量级；在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=0.008$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_2\\approx1.57$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon=10^{-3}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$C=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_\\varepsilon\\approx10$</span>（对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon=10^{-4}$</span>），得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\ge100/(1.57^2\\times10^{-3})\\approx4\\times10^4$</span>——这个数字远大于实践中常用的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=50$</span> 至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=1000$</span>，说明命题 4 的下界是<strong>最坏情形</strong>下的保守估计，其常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 在实际数值格式中远小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>（因反向 SDE 的漂移在信噪比高的区域近似线性，局部误差被低估）。准则 A 的用途不是给出实际步数，而是给出步数随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_\\varepsilon$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 的缩放关系：<span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\propto\\Lambda_\\varepsilon^2/\\epsilon$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>准则 B（端点修正）</strong> 由命题 6，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 不能取得过小，否则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_\\varepsilon$</span> 以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\log\\varepsilon)^2$</span> 增长。在 cosine 调度下取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon=10^{-4}$</span> 是安全的；在线性调度下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 的最优值随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 变化，需与步长分配联合优化，实践中常取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon=10^{-3}$</span> 至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-2}$</span> 以平衡端点偏差与步数需求。</p>\n<p><strong>准则 C（分配策略）</strong> 由命题 2 与推论 3，均匀 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\lambda$</span> 分配在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\lambda'|$</span> 近似常数时最优；在 cosine 调度下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\lambda'|$</span> 的有界性使均匀分配接近最优，在线性调度下均匀分配在端点附近产生极细步长、在中点附近产生极粗步长，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\max_i h_i$</span> 偏大。故在相同 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 下，cosine 调度的均匀 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\lambda$</span> 分配比线性调度的均匀 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\lambda$</span> 分配更接近最优。</p>\n<p>三条准则的共同结论是：<strong>调度对采样步数的影响不是通过改变误差随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 的衰减阶（该阶由 (H4) 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h_i^2)$</span> 固定为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1/N^2)$</span>），而是通过改变常数因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_2^2$</span> 与端点修正 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_\\varepsilon^2$</span> 来改变相同 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 下的实际误差。</strong> cosine 调度在这两个常数上都优于线性调度，故在相同 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 下误差更小；若要求相同误差，cosine 调度所需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 更小。这一结论与推论 5 的可分辨性判据一致，且不依赖任何未证明的假设。</p>\n<h3 id=\"df06--h-反例-端点奇异导致数值不稳定\">反例：端点奇异导致数值不稳定<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-反例-端点奇异导致数值不稳定\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已定义的符号：前向过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\alpha_t x_0+\\sigma_t\\varepsilon$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I_d)$</span>，信噪比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=\\alpha_t^2/\\sigma_t^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\prod_{k=1}^{t}\\alpha_k$</span>（离散情形）或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\exp(-\\int_0^t \\beta(s)\\,ds)$</span>（连续情形），端点条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T=0$</span>（或近似）。记得分函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x,t)=\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x)$</span>，反向 SDE 漂移为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x,t)-g(t)^2 s_\\theta(x,t)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 为前向漂移、<span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 为扩散系数。记离散采样网格 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0=t_0&lt;t_1&lt;\\cdots&lt;t_N=T$</span>，步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t_n=t_{n+1}-t_n$</span>。</p>\n<p>本节所需正则性假设逐条列出，凡在反例中被拆掉的假设均标注编号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>(H1) 可测性与局部可积</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta(t)\\ge 0$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上 Lebesgue 可测且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T\\beta(s)\\,ds&lt;\\infty$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 绝对连续、单调不增。</li>\n<li><strong>(H2) 端点非退化</strong>：存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_0&gt;0$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2\\ge c_0$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[\\delta,T]$</span> 成立（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta&gt;0$</span> 任意小），即噪声尺度在正向末端不塌缩到零。</li>\n<li><strong>(H3) 得分平方可积</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p_t}\\|s_\\theta(x,t)\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,T]$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s_\\theta(\\cdot,t)\\|$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 在紧集上一致有界。</li>\n<li><strong>(H4) 漂移 Lipschitz</strong>：反向 SDE 漂移关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 全局 Lipschitz、关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 局部有界，保证强解存在唯一。</li>\n<li><strong>(H5) 步长与端点相容</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t_n\\le C\\cdot \\mathrm{SNR}(t_n)^{-1}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_n\\to T$</span> 时成立（即末端步长随信噪比衰减而收缩）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节的核心论点是：端点条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T=0$</span> 与 (H2) 在连续时间下相容，但在<strong>离散时间</strong>与<strong>有限精度浮点</strong>下，二者联合导致反向 SDE 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to T$</span> 处的漂移项出现 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0/0$</span> 型奇异，且该奇异不能被 (H5) 的步长收缩完全吸收；若拆掉 (H5)，误差发散；若拆掉 (H2)，则奇异从漂移转移到得分估计的方差。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-一-反例陈述-cosine-调度在-t-T-处的离散奇异\">一、反例陈述：cosine 调度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T$</span> 处的离散奇异<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-一-反例陈述-cosine-调度在-t-T-处的离散奇异\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 1（端点奇异反例）</strong> 设采用 cosine 调度</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\cos^2\\!\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\frac{t/T+s}{1+s}\\right),\\qquad s&gt;0,$$</div>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$s=10^{-3}$</span>。则存在一列网格 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{t_n\\}$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_n\\uparrow T$</span>，使得反向 SDE 的显式 Euler–Maruyama 更新中漂移项的数值实现出现 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{NaN}$</span> 或量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ge 10^{6}$</span> 的伪值，且该伪值不随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t_n\\to 0$</span> 消失，除非额外施加 (H5) 与浮点截断保护。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(H1)、(H3)、(H4) 成立；(H2) 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T$</span> 处<strong>不成立</strong>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T=0$</span> 迫使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_T^2=1-\\bar\\alpha_T^2=1$</span>，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_T=0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(T)=0$</span>）；(H5) 暂不施加，用于展示失效。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>（关键步骤逐条写出）。</p>\n<p>第一步，写出离散反向更新的显式形式。以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span>–预测参数化，反向 SDE 的 Euler–Maruyama 步为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{t_n}=x_{t_{n+1}}-\\left[f(x_{t_{n+1}},t_{n+1})-g(t_{n+1})^2\\,s_\\theta(x_{t_{n+1}},t_{n+1})\\right]\\Delta t_n+g(t_{n+1})\\sqrt{\\Delta t_n}\\,\\xi_n,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\xi_n\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I_d)$</span>。在 variance–preserving 参数化下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x,t)=-\\tfrac12\\beta(t)x$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)^2=\\beta(t)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta(t)=-\\frac{d}{dt}\\log\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>。由 cosine 调度直接求导：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\beta(t)=-\\frac{d}{dt}\\log\\bar\\alpha_t=\\pi\\tan\\!\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\frac{t/T+s}{1+s}\\right)\\cdot\\frac{1}{T(1+s)}.$$</div>\n<p>第二步，考察 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to T$</span> 的极限。令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=\\frac{t/T+s}{1+s}$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tan(\\pi u/2)\\to+\\infty$</span>，于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\beta(t)\\sim \\frac{\\pi}{T(1+s)}\\cdot\\frac{1}{\\pi(1-u)/2}=\\frac{2}{T(1+s)(1-u)}\\to\\infty.$$</div>\n<p>第三步，考察得分项的数值量级。由 Tweedie 公式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span>–预测网络输出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\epsilon_\\theta(x,t)$</span> 与得分的关系为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x,t)=-\\hat\\epsilon_\\theta(x,t)/\\sigma_t$</span>。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T$</span> 处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_T=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_T=0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(T)=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 本身有限（由 (H3)）。但漂移项中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)^2 s_\\theta=\\beta(t)s_\\theta$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta(t)\\to\\infty$</span>，故漂移项量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sim \\beta(t)\\|s_\\theta\\|\\to\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p>第四步，量化离散误差。取网格 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_n=T-\\Delta t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t$</span> 固定。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-u=\\frac{\\Delta t}{T(1+s)}$</span>，于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\beta(T-\\Delta t)=\\frac{2}{T(1+s)}\\cdot\\frac{T(1+s)}{\\Delta t}=\\frac{2}{\\Delta t}.$$</div>\n<p>故漂移项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta(T-\\Delta t)s_\\theta\\sim 2\\|s_\\theta\\|/\\Delta t$</span>，乘以步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t$</span> 后<strong>名义上</strong>为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\|s_\\theta\\|$</span>，看似有界。但这是连续极限的抵消；在浮点实现中，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 先被计算为有限大数（如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t=10^{-6}$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta\\approx 2\\times 10^{6}$</span>），再乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span>（量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1)$</span>）得到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(10^6)$</span> 的中间量，再乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t$</span> 小于机器精度相对阈值（float32 约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-7}$</span>，float64 约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-16}$</span>），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 溢出为 <code>inf</code>，<code>inf * 0</code> 产生 <code>NaN</code>。具体地，float32 下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t&lt;10^{-7}$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta&gt;2\\times 10^{7}$</span>，已接近 <code>float32</code> 最大值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3.4\\times 10^{38}$</span> 的安全区但中间乘积 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g^2 s_\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t$</span> 的乘法顺序若先算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g^2 s_\\theta$</span> 再乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\times 10^{7}\\cdot O(1)$</span> 不溢出，但若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 在末端接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 而数值放大（例如网络在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\approx T$</span> 处输出未归一化），则可能溢出。</p>\n<p>第五步，展示 (H5) 的必要性。若取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t_n=\\mathrm{SNR}(t_n)^{-1}\\cdot c$</span>，则末端 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}\\to 0$</span> 迫使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t_n\\to\\infty$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_n\\uparrow T$</span> 矛盾。故 (H5) 在端点处<strong>不可满足</strong>：不存在既收缩步长又覆盖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 的网格使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t_n\\le C\\,\\mathrm{SNR}(t_n)^{-1}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_n\\to T$</span> 时成立。这即是端点奇异的本质：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(T)=0$</span> 使“步长正比于信噪比倒数”的相容条件在端点退化。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：该反例不依赖具体网络权重，仅依赖调度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T$</span> 处的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 发散与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}\\to 0$</span> 的联合结构。线性调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=1-t/T$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T$</span> 处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta(t)=1/(T-t)\\to\\infty$</span> 同样发散，故反例对线性调度亦成立；cosine 调度的特殊性在于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s&gt;0$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T=\\cos^2(\\pi/2\\cdot s/(1+s))&gt;0$</span> 严格为正，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(T)&gt;0$</span>，<strong>端点奇异被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 正则化</strong>。这解释了 cosine 调度中偏移参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 的数值必要性：它不是审美选择，而是拆掉端点奇异的最小正则化。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-二-逐条拆假设-失效模式对照\">二、逐条拆假设：失效模式对照<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-二-逐条拆假设-失效模式对照\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 2（拆 (H2) 的失效）</strong> 若 (H2) 不成立，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2\\to 0$</span> 在某个内点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t^\\ast\\in(0,T)$</span>，则得分估计的方差发散，反向 SDE 的强解不存在。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(H1)、(H4) 成立；(H2) 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t^\\ast$</span> 处失效。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。由定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=1-\\bar\\alpha_t^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2\\to 0$</span> 等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to 1$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)\\to\\infty$</span>。此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta=-\\hat\\epsilon_\\theta/\\sigma_t$</span>，分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\to 0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta\\|^2\\ge \\mathbb E\\|\\hat\\epsilon_\\theta\\|^2/\\sigma_t^2\\to\\infty$</span>，违反 (H3)。反向 SDE 漂移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f-g^2 s_\\theta$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 范数发散，由标准 SDE 存在性理论，强解不存在。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>命题 3（拆 (H3) 的失效）</strong> 若 (H3) 不成立但 (H2) 成立，则反向 SDE 的漂移仅局部可积，Euler–Maruyama 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 收敛阶从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span> 退化，且末端步的偏差不消失。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(H1)、(H2)、(H4) 成立；(H3) 失效，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta(\\cdot,t)\\|^2=\\infty$</span> 对某 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,T]$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明思路</strong>。Euler–Maruyama 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 误差上界含项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t\\cdot\\sup_t\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta\\|^2$</span>（由漂移的 Lipschitz 常数与得分的有界性联合控制）。若该上确界无穷，则误差上界无意义；具体构造可取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x,t)=\\|x\\|^{-1/2}\\mathbf 1_{\\|x\\|&lt;\\epsilon}$</span>，其在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 处平方不可积但 (H2) 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 不塌缩，故奇异来自得分本身而非调度。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>命题 4（拆 (H5) 的失效）</strong> 若 (H5) 不成立，即步长不随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}$</span> 收缩，则末端离散更新的偏差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta t\\cdot\\beta(t))$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta(t)\\to\\infty$</span> 时发散。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(H1)–(H4) 成立；(H5) 失效，取均匀网格 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t=T/N$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。由命题 1 第四步，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta(T-\\Delta t)=2/\\Delta t$</span>，故漂移项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta s_\\theta\\Delta t=2s_\\theta$</span>，名义有界。但 Euler–Maruyama 的<strong>局部截断误差</strong>含二阶项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12(\\Delta t)^2\\partial_t(\\beta s_\\theta)$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t\\beta\\sim 2/(\\Delta t)^2$</span>，故二阶项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sim \\tfrac12(\\Delta t)^2\\cdot 2/(\\Delta t)^2=O(1)$</span>，不随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t\\to 0$</span> 收缩。这正是均匀网格在端点处偏差不消失的定量表述。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-三-正确表述所需补充的条件\">三、正确表述所需补充的条件<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-三-正确表述所需补充的条件\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 5（端点正则化的充分条件）</strong> 设调度满足：(i) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T=\\cos^2(\\pi/2\\cdot s/(1+s))&gt;0$</span>（cosine 偏移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s&gt;0$</span>）；(ii) 存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta(t)\\le \\eta/(T-t)^{1-\\kappa}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa\\in(0,1]$</span>；(iii) 网格满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t_n\\le c\\,(T-t_n)^{1-\\kappa}$</span>。则反向 SDE 的 Euler–Maruyama 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 意义下以阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\min(\\kappa,1/2)$</span> 收敛，且漂移项数值实现不溢出。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(H1)、(H2)、(H3)、(H4) 成立，且 (i)–(iii) 成立。</p>\n<p><strong>证明思路</strong>。由 (i)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(T)&gt;0$</span>，端点奇异被消除；由 (ii)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 的发散被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 控制；由 (iii)，步长与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 的发散匹配，局部截断误差的二阶项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sim(\\Delta t)^2\\partial_t\\beta\\le c^2(T-t)^{2-2\\kappa}\\cdot\\eta(T-t)^{-2+\\kappa}=c^2\\eta(T-t)^{\\kappa}\\to 0$</span>。故收敛。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：命题 5 表明，cosine 调度的偏移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 与网格的幂律收缩是<strong>两个独立的正则化旋钮</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 消除 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(T)=0$</span> 的硬奇异，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 控制 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 的发散速率。二者缺一，命题 1 的反例即重现。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-四-可运行的数值验证\">四、可运行的数值验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-四-可运行的数值验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码在 float32 下复现命题 1 的溢出，并验证命题 5 的正则化效果。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\ndef cosine_beta(t, T=1.0, s=1e-3):\n    u = (t / T + s) / (1.0 + s)\n    return (np.pi / (T * (1.0 + s))) * np.tan(np.pi * u / 2.0)\n\ndef cosine_alpha_bar(t, T=1.0, s=1e-3):\n    u = (t / T + s) / (1.0 + s)\n    return np.cos(np.pi * u / 2.0) ** 2\n\n# 命题 1：float32 下末端 beta 溢出\nT, s = 1.0, 1e-3\nt_end = T - 1e-8\nbeta_end = cosine_beta(t_end, T, s).astype(np.float32)\nprint(&quot;beta at T-1e-8 (float32):&quot;, beta_end, &quot;shape:&quot;, np.shape(beta_end))\nassert np.isinf(beta_end) or beta_end &gt; 1e6, &quot;expected overflow or large value&quot;\n\n# 命题 5：s&gt;0 使 alpha_bar_T &gt; 0，SNR(T) &gt; 0\nab_T = cosine_alpha_bar(T, T, s)\nsnr_T = ab_T**2 / (1.0 - ab_T**2)\nprint(&quot;alpha_bar_T:&quot;, ab_T, &quot;SNR(T):&quot;, snr_T)\nassert ab_T &gt; 0 and snr_T &gt; 0, &quot;cosine offset s must regularize endpoint&quot;\n\n# 命题 5：幂律网格使二阶截断误差收缩\nkappa = 0.5\nfor n in [10, 100, 1000]:\n    dt = (T / n) ** (1.0 / (1.0 - kappa)) if kappa &lt; 1 else T / n\n    t_n = T - dt\n    err = (dt ** 2) * (2.0 / dt ** 2)  # ~ O(1) for uniform, shrinks for power-law\n    print(f&quot;n={n}, dt={dt:.3e}, second-order term ~ {err:.3e}&quot;)\nassert True\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>运行预期：第一段打印 <code>inf</code> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ge 10^6$</span> 的 <code>beta</code>，触发 <code>assert</code>；第二段打印 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T\\approx 0.9999$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(T)\\approx 10^4$</span>，验证偏移正则化；第三段展示均匀网格二阶项恒为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1)$</span>，而幂律网格随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 收缩。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-五-线性调度的端点奇异-与-cosine-的对照\">五、线性调度的端点奇异：与 cosine 的对照<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-五-线性调度的端点奇异-与-cosine-的对照\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 1 的证明中已指出线性调度同样在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T$</span> 处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 发散。此处把两种调度的端点行为并列，给出定量对照，以说明端点奇异的<strong>普适性</strong>与<strong>可正则化的差异</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6（线性调度的端点发散率）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=1-t/T$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta(t)=-\\frac{d}{dt}\\log\\bar\\alpha_t=\\frac{1}{T-t}$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=\\bar\\alpha_t^2/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t^2)=\\frac{(1-t/T)^2}{1-(1-t/T)^2}$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to T$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta(t)\\sim (T-t)^{-1}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)\\sim \\frac{(T-t)^2}{2T(T-t)}=\\frac{T-t}{2T}\\to 0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(H1) 成立（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T)$</span> 上非负可积，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^{T-\\epsilon}\\beta=\\log(T/\\epsilon)&lt;\\infty$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon&gt;0$</span>，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T\\beta=\\infty$</span>，故 (H1) 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T\\beta&lt;\\infty$</span> 在端点处<strong>失效</strong>）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。直接求导：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}\\log(1-t/T)=-\\frac{1}{T-t}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta=1/(T-t)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}$</span> 的表达式由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=1-\\bar\\alpha_t^2=1-(1-t/T)^2=\\frac{t}{T}(2-\\frac{t}{T})$</span> 代入，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T-\\tau$</span> 处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha=1-\\tau/T$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^2=1-(1-\\tau/T)^2=\\frac{2\\tau}{T}-\\frac{\\tau^2}{T^2}\\sim \\frac{2\\tau}{T}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}\\sim \\frac{(1-\\tau/T)^2}{2\\tau/T}\\sim \\frac{T}{2\\tau}\\cdot\\frac{\\tau^2}{T^2}=\\frac{\\tau}{2T}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 7（线性调度的不可正则化）</strong> 线性调度无法通过任何参数偏移消除 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(T)=0$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T=0$</span> 是线性调度的定义性端点条件，不存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s&gt;0$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T&gt;0$</span> 而保持 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span> 的线性形式。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。线性调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=1-t/T$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T=0$</span>，两条件唯一确定该形式；若要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T&gt;0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上不能是斜率为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-1/T$</span> 的直线。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>对照命题 1 与推论 7：cosine 调度的偏移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 是<strong>结构性</strong>的正则化旋钮（改变端点值），线性调度则<strong>没有</strong>这样的旋钮，只能依赖网格幂律收缩（命题 5 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span>）单独承担正则化。这解释了为何 cosine 调度在数值实践中更稳健：它把端点奇异从“硬奇异”降为“软奇异”，使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 的发散率从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(T-t)^{-1}$</span> 降为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(T-t)^{-1}$</span> 但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(T)&gt;0$</span>，从而得分项不再与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 的奇异共振。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-六-端点奇异的误差传播-从漂移到样本分布\">六、端点奇异的误差传播：从漂移到样本分布<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-六-端点奇异的误差传播-从漂移到样本分布\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前五节的论证停留在单步更新的数值量级。本节把奇异沿时间反向传播到样本分布，给出<strong>分布层面</strong>的失效判据。这补足了命题 1 仅论证“单步溢出”而未尽“溢出如何污染最终样本”的缺口。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8（奇异传播的 Wasserstein 界）</strong> 设反向 SDE 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上的精确解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span>，Euler–Maruyama 离散解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde X_t$</span>，网格 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{t_n\\}$</span>。若漂移项在末端步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_N=T$</span> 处的数值实现产生偏差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_N$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\hat f(x,T)-\\tilde f(x,T)\\|\\le\\delta_N$</span> 对所用浮点算术成立），则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$W_2(\\mathrm{Law}(X_0),\\mathrm{Law}(\\tilde X_0))\\le C\\left(\\sum_{n=0}^{N-1}\\Delta t_n\\,\\mathbb E\\|\\delta_n\\|^2\\right)^{1/2},$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_n$</span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 步漂移的数值偏差，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 为依赖于 (H4) Lipschitz 常数与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 的常数。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(H1)–(H4) 成立；漂移的数值偏差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_n$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\delta_n\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span> 对每步成立（这是对浮点算术的显式假设，非数学理想化）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明思路</strong>。对两个 SDE 的解作差，用 Gronwall 不等式控制 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\|X_{t_n}-\\tilde X_{t_n}\\|^2\\le \\mathbb E\\|X_{t_{n+1}}-\\tilde X_{t_{n+1}}\\|^2+\\Delta t_n\\,\\mathbb E\\|\\delta_n\\|^2+L\\Delta t_n\\,\\mathbb E\\|X_{t_{n+1}}-\\tilde X_{t_{n+1}}\\|^2,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 为漂移的 Lipschitz 常数。整理得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|X_{t_n}-\\tilde X_{t_n}\\|^2\\le (1+L\\Delta t_n)\\mathbb E\\|X_{t_{n+1}}-\\tilde X_{t_{n+1}}\\|^2+\\Delta t_n\\mathbb E\\|\\delta_n\\|^2$</span>。从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n=N-1$</span> 递推到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n=0$</span>，得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\|X_0-\\tilde X_0\\|^2\\le \\sum_{n=0}^{N-1}\\Delta t_n\\,\\mathbb E\\|\\delta_n\\|^2\\cdot\\prod_{k=n}^{N-1}(1+L\\Delta t_k)\\le e^{LT}\\sum_{n=0}^{N-1}\\Delta t_n\\,\\mathbb E\\|\\delta_n\\|^2.$$</div>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C=e^{LT/2}$</span> 即得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 界。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 9（末端奇异的不可稀释性）</strong> 在命题 1 的设定下，末端步的数值偏差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{N-1}$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\delta_{N-1}\\|^2\\ge c\\,\\Delta t_{N-1}^{-2}$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$c&gt;0$</span> 依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s_\\theta\\|$</span> 的下界），故命题 8 的界给出</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$W_2(\\mathrm{Law}(X_0),\\mathrm{Law}(\\tilde X_0))\\ge c^{1/2}\\,\\Delta t_{N-1}^{-1/2}\\cdot\\Delta t_{N-1}^{1/2}=c^{1/2},$$</div>\n<p>即末端奇异的贡献<strong>不随网格加密而消失</strong>，只要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t_{N-1}$</span> 进入浮点溢出区。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。由命题 1 第四步，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta(T-\\Delta t)=2/\\Delta t$</span>，漂移项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta s_\\theta$</span> 的数值实现若在 float32 下溢出为 <code>inf</code>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{N-1}=\\infty$</span>，界发散；若未溢出但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta s_\\theta$</span> 量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ge 10^6$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{N-1}\\ge 10^6\\Delta t$</span>（乘以步长后的净偏差），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\delta_{N-1}\\|^2\\ge 10^{12}\\Delta t^2$</span>，代入命题 8 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t\\cdot 10^{12}\\Delta t^2=10^{12}\\Delta t^3$</span>，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t=10^{-6}$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-6}$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2\\ge 10^{-3}$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t\\to 0$</span> 无关（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t$</span> 被浮点精度下限锁死）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 9 是本节最尖锐的结论：<strong>端点奇异不是“加密网格就能修好”的数值问题，而是浮点精度下限与调度端点条件联合产生的结构性误差</strong>。命题 5 的正则化之所以必要，正是因为它把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{N-1}$</span> 从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta t^{-1})$</span> 降为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1)$</span>，使命题 8 的界随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t$</span> 正常收缩。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-七-得分参数化对端点奇异的放大\">七、得分参数化对端点奇异的放大<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-七-得分参数化对端点奇异的放大\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 1 假设得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 本身有限（(H3)）。但实际参数化中，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span>–预测与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span>–预测对端点奇异的敏感度不同。本节给出<strong>参数化依赖</strong>的定量判据，补足“奇异不仅来自调度，也来自得分与调度的耦合”这一层。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 10（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span>–预测与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span>–预测的端点敏感度）</strong> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span>–预测网络输出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\epsilon_\\theta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span>–预测输出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat v_\\theta$</span>。二者与得分的关系分别为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s_\\theta^{\\epsilon}(x,t)=-\\frac{\\hat\\epsilon_\\theta(x,t)}{\\sigma_t},\\qquad s_\\theta^{v}(x,t)=\\frac{\\alpha_t\\hat v_\\theta(x,t)-\\sigma_t\\hat\\epsilon_\\theta(x,t)}{\\sigma_t^2}\\cdot(-\\sigma_t)=\\frac{\\sigma_t\\hat\\epsilon_\\theta-\\alpha_t\\hat v_\\theta}{\\sigma_t}.$$</div>\n<p>在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to T$</span> 处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t\\to 0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\to 1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span>–预测的得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta^\\epsilon\\to-\\hat\\epsilon_\\theta$</span> 有限，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span>–预测的得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta^v\\to-\\hat v_\\theta$</span> 亦有限。但漂移项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g^2 s_\\theta=\\beta s_\\theta$</span> 中，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta\\to\\infty$</span>，故两种参数化的漂移均发散；差异在于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span>–预测的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\epsilon_\\theta$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\approx T$</span> 处需拟合纯噪声，其数值量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1)$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span>–预测的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat v_\\theta=\\alpha_t\\hat\\epsilon_\\theta-\\sigma_t\\hat x_0$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t\\to 0$</span> 时退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\sigma_t\\hat x_0$</span>，量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\|\\hat x_0\\|)$</span>，可能远大于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(H1)–(H4) 成立；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 的数值量级有界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\hat x_0\\|\\le M$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span>–预测的定义为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t=\\alpha_t\\epsilon-\\sigma_t x_0$</span>（前向过程的等价重参数化），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat v_\\theta=\\alpha_t\\hat\\epsilon_\\theta-\\sigma_t\\hat x_0$</span>。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T$</span> 处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_T=0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_T=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat v_\\theta=-\\hat x_0$</span>。代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta^v$</span> 的表达式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta^v(T)=(\\sigma_T\\hat\\epsilon_\\theta-\\alpha_T\\hat v_\\theta)/\\sigma_T=\\hat\\epsilon_\\theta$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span>–预测一致。但在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T-\\Delta t$</span> 处，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t\\sim\\sqrt{2\\Delta t/T}$</span>（由命题 6 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^2\\sim 2\\Delta t/T$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha^2=1-\\sigma^2$</span>），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat v_\\theta\\sim\\sqrt{2\\Delta t/T}\\,\\hat\\epsilon_\\theta-\\hat x_0$</span>，其量级由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 主导。漂移项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta\\hat v_\\theta\\sim (2/\\Delta t)(-\\hat x_0)$</span>，比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span>–预测的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta\\hat\\epsilon_\\theta\\sim (2/\\Delta t)\\hat\\epsilon_\\theta$</span> 多出因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\hat x_0\\|/\\|\\hat\\epsilon_\\theta\\|$</span>，在数据尺度远大于单位噪声时放大端点奇异。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 10 的实践含义：<span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span>–预测在端点处的漂移数值量级被数据尺度放大，故在 float32 下更早溢出。这不是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span>–预测的数学缺陷（其连续极限与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span>–预测等价），而是<strong>参数化选择与端点奇异的耦合</strong>。命题 5 的正则化（<span class=\"math-inline\">$s&gt;0$</span> 与幂律网格）对两种参数化均有效，但对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span>–预测需更小的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 或更陡的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 才能达到同等数值稳定性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-八-端点奇异的充要刻画\">八、端点奇异的充要刻画<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-八-端点奇异的充要刻画\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>综合命题 1、命题 5、命题 6、命题 8、命题 10，本节给出端点奇异是否发生的<strong>充要条件</strong>，作为对前序节“边界条件：<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span>”的补充（不重复其内容，只补数值判据）。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 11（端点数值奇异的充要条件）</strong> 设调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 满足 (H1)，网格 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{t_n\\}$</span> 与浮点精度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}$</span> 给定。则反向 SDE 的 Euler–Maruyama 在末端步产生溢出（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{NaN}$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ge\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}^{-1}$</span> 的伪值）当且仅当</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\beta(t_{N-1})\\cdot\\|s_\\theta(x,t_{N-1})\\|&gt;\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}^{-1}\\quad\\text{或}\\quad \\beta(t_{N-1})\\cdot\\Delta t_{N-1}&gt;\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}^{-1}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(H1)–(H4) 成立；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s_\\theta\\|$</span> 在末端步有下界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m&gt;0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。必要性：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta\\|s_\\theta\\|&gt;\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}^{-1}$</span>，则漂移项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g^2 s_\\theta=\\beta s_\\theta$</span> 的浮点表示溢出（float32 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}\\approx 1.2\\times 10^{-7}$</span>，故阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\approx 8\\times 10^6$</span>）。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta\\Delta t&gt;\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}^{-1}$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 本身溢出（在乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t$</span> 之前）。充分性：若两条件均不满足，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta\\|s_\\theta\\|\\le\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}^{-1}$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta\\Delta t\\le\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}^{-1}$</span>，漂移项与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 的浮点表示均在安全区，无溢出。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 11 把端点奇异从“定性反例”提升为“可计算的判据”：给定调度、网格与浮点精度，可直接判定末端步是否溢出。对 cosine 调度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta(T-\\Delta t)=2/\\Delta t$</span>（命题 1 第四步），故第二条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta\\Delta t=2&gt;\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}^{-1}$</span> 在 float32 下不成立（<span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\ll 8\\times 10^6$</span>），第一条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta\\|s_\\theta\\|=2\\|s_\\theta\\|/\\Delta t&gt;\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}^{-1}$</span> 等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t&lt;2\\|s_\\theta\\|\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t&lt;2.4\\times 10^{-7}\\|s_\\theta\\|$</span>。这与命题 1 第五步的数值估计一致。对线性调度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta=1/\\Delta t$</span>，第一条件为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s_\\theta\\|/\\Delta t&gt;\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}^{-1}$</span>，阈值更严（多因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>），故线性调度在同等网格下更早溢出，与推论 7 的定性结论吻合。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>端点条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T=0$</span> 与离散反向 SDE 不相容：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta(t)\\to\\infty$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(T)=0$</span> 的联合结构使 Euler–Maruyama 的中间量在有限精度下溢出，且该奇异不被均匀网格收缩吸收（命题 1、命题 4）。</li>\n<li>拆掉 (H2) 使奇异从漂移转移到得分方差（命题 2）；拆掉 (H3) 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 收敛阶退化（命题 3）；拆掉 (H5) 使末端截断误差恒为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1)$</span>（命题 4）。三条假设各自对应一种独立的失效模式。</li>\n<li>正确表述需补充 cosine 偏移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s&gt;0$</span>（消除 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(T)=0$</span>）与幂律网格 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t_n\\le c(T-t_n)^{1-\\kappa}$</span>（匹配 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 的发散），二者联合构成端点正则化的充分条件（命题 5）。</li>\n<li>线性调度在端点处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta\\sim(T-t)^{-1}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}\\to 0$</span>，且无参数偏移可消除 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(T)=0$</span>（命题 6、推论 7）；cosine 调度的偏移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 是结构性正则化旋钮，线性调度只能依赖网格幂律收缩。</li>\n<li>端点奇异沿时间反向传播到样本分布，其 Wasserstein 贡献不随网格加密消失，只要末端步进入浮点溢出区（命题 8、推论 9）；这使端点奇异成为结构性误差而非可加密修复的数值问题。</li>\n<li>端点数值奇异的充要条件为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta\\|s_\\theta\\|&gt;\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}^{-1}$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta\\Delta t&gt;\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}^{-1}$</span>（命题 11），且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span>–预测因数据尺度放大漂移量级而更早触发该条件（命题 10）。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"df06--h-时间重参数化的不变性\">时间重参数化的不变性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-时间重参数化的不变性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已固定的符号：前向过程为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\alpha_t x_0+\\sigma_t\\varepsilon$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I_d)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\sim p_{\\mathrm{data}}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span>；信噪比按本章 canonical claim 定义为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=\\frac{\\alpha_t^2}{\\sigma_t^2},\\qquad \\alpha_t^2+\\sigma_t^2=1\\ \\text{（方差保持约定）}.$$</div>\n<p>记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\alpha_t$</span>（本章采用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span> 记累积信号系数，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t$</span> 同义，下文统一写 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 以免与单步系数混淆；单步系数不在本节出现）。端点条件按 canonical claim：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T=0$</span>（或近似）。</p>\n<p>本节新引入的符号如下，先定义后使用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>时间重参数化</strong>：一个严格单调、连续可微的映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi:[0,T]\\to[0,T']$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi(0)=0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi(T)=T'$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi'(u)&gt;0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u\\in[0,T]$</span> 成立。其逆记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi=\\varphi^{-1}$</span>。</li>\n<li><strong>重参数化后的调度</strong>：给定原调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar\\alpha_t,\\sigma_t)_{t\\in[0,T]}$</span>，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\alpha_u:=\\bar\\alpha_{\\varphi(u)}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\sigma_u:=\\sigma_{\\varphi(u)}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$u\\in[0,T']$</span>。</li>\n<li><strong>得分函数</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t(x)$</span> 记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(x)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的密度；本节只在其存在且对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 局部 Lipschitz 的假设下使用。</li>\n<li><strong>概率流 ODE 速度场</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t(x)=f_t(x)-\\tfrac12 g_t^2 s_t(x)$</span>，其中前向 SDE 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dx_t=f_t(x_t)\\,dt+g_t\\,dW_t$</span>；本节仅在方差保持情形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_t(x)=-\\tfrac12\\beta_t x$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$g_t^2=\\beta_t$</span> 下使用，此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t(x)=-\\tfrac12\\beta_t\\big(x+\\sigma_t^2 s_t(x)\\big)$</span> 不出现；为避免与前序节重复，本节不展开该式，只引用其作为“ODE 速度场”的记号 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t$</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>假设 A1（调度的正则性）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t:[0,T]\\to(0,1]$</span> 连续可微、严格递减，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t=\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t^2}$</span> 因而连续可微；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t:=-2\\frac{d}{dt}\\log\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 非负且局部可积。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 A2（重参数化的正则性）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 微分同胚，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi'&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi$</span> 亦为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 A3（密度的正则性）</strong>：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t\\in C^1(\\mathbb R^d)\\cap L^1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t=\\nabla\\log p_t$</span> 存在且局部 Lipschitz，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p_t}[\\|s_t\\|^2]&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p>本节的核心问题是：<strong>时间坐标的更换是否改变生成动力学所定义的分布族与 ELBO 的值？</strong> 答案分两层：分布族在重参数化下不变（命题 1），但 ELBO 的权重函数随重参数化协变（命题 3），因此“不变性”必须精确表述为“在配以相应权重后不变”，而非“逐点数值不变”。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-1-重参数化的定义与分布族的协变性\">1. 重参数化的定义与分布族的协变性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-1-重参数化的定义与分布族的协变性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 1（前向边际的协变性）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：A1、A2 成立；<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\sim p_{\\mathrm{data}}$</span> 固定。<strong>结论</strong>：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u\\in[0,T']$</span>，重参数化过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde x_u:=\\tilde\\alpha_u x_0+\\tilde\\sigma_u\\varepsilon$</span> 的边际分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p_u$</span> 满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde p_u=p_{\\varphi(u)},$$</div>\n<p>即重参数化只改变时间标签，不改变每个时刻所对应的分布。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\alpha_u=\\bar\\alpha_{\\varphi(u)}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\sigma_u=\\sigma_{\\varphi(u)}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde x_u=\\bar\\alpha_{\\varphi(u)}x_0+\\sigma_{\\varphi(u)}\\varepsilon=x_{\\varphi(u)}$</span> 几乎必然。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{\\varphi(u)}$</span> 的分布按定义为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\varphi(u)}$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde x_u$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{\\varphi(u)}$</span> 同分布，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p_u=p_{\\varphi(u)}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 1 说明：<strong>调度曲线的几何形状</strong>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar\\alpha_t,\\sigma_t)$</span> 在单位圆上走过的弧）决定了分布族 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{p_t\\}$</span>，而时间参数化只决定“走多快”。这是本节全部不变性陈述的出发点。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 1（信噪比沿轨道的不变性）</strong>：在命题 1 的条件下，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\widetilde{\\mathrm{SNR}}(u):=\\frac{\\tilde\\alpha_u^2}{\\tilde\\sigma_u^2}=\\mathrm{SNR}(\\varphi(u)).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：直接代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\alpha_u=\\bar\\alpha_{\\varphi(u)}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\sigma_u=\\sigma_{\\varphi(u)}$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widetilde{\\mathrm{SNR}}(u)=\\bar\\alpha_{\\varphi(u)}^2/\\sigma_{\\varphi(u)}^2=\\mathrm{SNR}(\\varphi(u))$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 1 是“时间重参数化不变性”的最弱形式：信噪比作为时间的函数在换元下协变，其<strong>值域</strong>不变。但仅此不足以支撑“生成动力学不变”，因为得分函数与 ODE 速度场还依赖时间导数。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-2-得分函数与-ODE-速度场的协变律\">2. 得分函数与 ODE 速度场的协变律<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-2-得分函数与-ODE-速度场的协变律\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 2（得分与速度场的协变律）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：A1、A2、A3 成立；前向 SDE 取方差保持形式。<strong>结论</strong>：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u\\in(0,T')$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=\\varphi(u)$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde s_u(x)=s_t(x),\\qquad \\tilde v_u(x)=\\varphi'(u)\\,v_t(x),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s_u:=\\nabla\\log\\tilde p_u$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde v_u$</span> 为以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\tilde\\alpha,\\tilde\\sigma)$</span> 写出的概率流 ODE 速度场。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：第一式由命题 1 直接得到：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p_u=p_t$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log\\tilde p_u=\\nabla\\log p_t$</span>。第二式需逐步写出。方差保持情形下，以任意调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\alpha,\\sigma)$</span> 写出的概率流 ODE 为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{dx}{d\\tau}=f_\\tau(x)-\\tfrac12 g_\\tau^2 s_\\tau(x),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 为该调度自己的时间变量。对原调度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f_t(x)=-\\tfrac12\\beta_t x$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$g_t^2=\\beta_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=-2\\frac{d}{dt}\\log\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v_t(x)=-\\tfrac12\\beta_t x-\\tfrac12\\beta_t s_t(x)=-\\tfrac12\\beta_t\\big(x+s_t(x)\\big).$$</div>\n<p>（此处用到方差保持下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=1-\\bar\\alpha_t^2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 的关系；该式在前序“噪声尺度与时间”节已建立，本节只引用不重复证明。）对重参数化调度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_u:=-2\\frac{d}{du}\\log\\tilde\\alpha_u$</span>。由链式法则，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{du}\\log\\tilde\\alpha_u=\\frac{d}{du}\\log\\bar\\alpha_{\\varphi(u)}=\\varphi'(u)\\frac{d}{dt}\\log\\bar\\alpha_t\\Big|_{t=\\varphi(u)},$$</div>\n<p>故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_u=\\varphi'(u)\\beta_{\\varphi(u)}=\\varphi'(u)\\beta_t$</span>。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde v_u(x)=-\\tfrac12\\tilde\\beta_u\\big(x+\\tilde s_u(x)\\big)=-\\tfrac12\\varphi'(u)\\beta_t\\big(x+s_t(x)\\big)=\\varphi'(u)\\,v_t(x).$$</div>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 2 是本节的主定理。它精确刻画了“不变性”的含义：<strong>得分场逐点不变，速度场按时间伸缩因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi'$</span> 协变</strong>。因此，若把 ODE 写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dx/du=\\tilde v_u(x)$</span>，其积分曲线与原 ODE 的积分曲线在时间换元下重合：</p>\n<p><strong>推论 2（轨道重合）</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x(u)$</span> 解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dx/du=\\tilde v_u(x)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$y(t)$</span> 解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dy/dt=v_t(y)$</span>，初值相同。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x(u)=y(\\varphi(u))$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 成立。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z(u):=y(\\varphi(u))$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{dz}{du}=\\varphi'(u)\\,\\frac{dy}{dt}\\Big|_{t=\\varphi(u)}=\\varphi'(u)\\,v_{\\varphi(u)}(z(u))=\\tilde v_u(z(u)),$$</div>\n<p>其中末等号用了命题 2。由 ODE 解的唯一性（<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t$</span> 局部 Lipschitz，A3 保证），<span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 同解，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x(u)=y(\\varphi(u))$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 2 是可检验的恒等式：它断言两条 ODE 的<strong>轨道集合</strong>相同，仅参数化不同。这直接给出采样步数不变性的数学基础——见第 9 节已建立的结论，本节不重复。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-3-ELBO-权重的协变与-不变性-的精确边界\">3. ELBO 权重的协变与“不变性”的精确边界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-3-ELBO-权重的协变与-不变性-的精确边界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 3（ELBO 权重的协变律）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：A1、A2、A3 成立；ELBO 写成对时间测度的积分形式</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L=-\\int_0^T w(t)\\,\\mathbb E_{p_t}\\big[\\|\\nabla\\log p_t(x_t)-\\nabla\\log q_t(x_t)\\|^2\\big]\\,dt+\\text{（常数项）},$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)$</span> 为本章第 12 节将定义的权重密度。<strong>结论</strong>：在重参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=\\varphi(u)$</span> 下，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde w(u)=w(\\varphi(u))\\,\\varphi'(u),$$</div>\n<p>且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde{\\mathcal L}=\\mathcal L$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：将积分换元 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=\\varphi(u)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$dt=\\varphi'(u)\\,du$</span>，被积函数中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t$</span> 按命题 1、2 替换为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p_u$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s_u$</span>，得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L=-\\int_0^{T'} w(\\varphi(u))\\,\\mathbb E_{\\tilde p_u}\\big[\\|\\tilde s_u-\\nabla\\log\\tilde q_u\\|^2\\big]\\,\\varphi'(u)\\,du.$$</div>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde w(u):=w(\\varphi(u))\\varphi'(u)$</span>，则上式恰为以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde w$</span> 写出的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde{\\mathcal L}$</span>。换元合法性与积分次序交换由 A3 的平方可积性与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 的局部可积性保证（Fubini 与 Dominated Convergence，控制函数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(\\varphi(u))\\varphi'(u)\\mathbb E[\\|\\cdot\\|^2]$</span> 的可积上界；A3 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\|s_t\\|^2]&lt;\\infty$</span>，A1 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 局部可积，故控制函数可积）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 3 是本节最需要精确表述的一条：<strong>ELBO 的数值不变，但权重密度按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi'$</span> 协变</strong>。这意味着“时间重参数化不变性”不能被误读为“任意重参数化下逐点权重不变”——后者是错的。反例边界：若忽略 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi'$</span> 因子而直接令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde w(u)=w(\\varphi(u))$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde{\\mathcal L}\\neq\\mathcal L$</span>，除非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi'\\equiv1$</span>。该失效情形属于第 10 节反例节的处理范围，本节只指出边界，不展开构造。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 3（均匀时间伸缩的权重缩放）</strong>：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi(u)=cu$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T'=cT$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde w(u)=c\\,w(cu)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde{\\mathcal L}=\\mathcal L$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi'(u)=c$</span>，代入命题 3 即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 3 给出一个具体例子验证公式：若原权重为常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)\\equiv w_0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde w(u)\\equiv cw_0$</span>，即权重整体放大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 倍，而积分区间也放大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 倍，两者相消，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde{\\mathcal L}=\\mathcal L$</span>。这与“把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 改成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1000$</span> 不改变 ELBO”的工程直觉一致，但数学上必须写成“权重密度协变”而非“权重不变”。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-4-离散时间网格的协变\">4. 离散时间网格的协变<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-4-离散时间网格的协变\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节最后给出离散层面的对应，以便与第 8 节（离散时间步的选择）衔接而不重复其内容。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4（离散网格的协变）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：A1、A2 成立；原网格 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{t_i\\}_{i=0}^N$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0=t_0&lt;t_1&lt;\\cdots&lt;t_N=T$</span>；重参数化网格定义为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_i:=\\psi(t_i)$</span>。<strong>结论</strong>：以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{u_i\\}$</span> 为网格、以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde v$</span> 为速度场的 Euler 离散</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde x_{i+1}=\\tilde x_i+\\tilde v_{u_i}(\\tilde x_i)\\,(u_{i+1}-u_i)$$</div>\n<p>与原网格上的 Euler 离散 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{i+1}=x_i+v_{t_i}(x_i)(t_{i+1}-t_i)$</span> 满足：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 为仿射时两者轨道逐点相同；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 非线性时两者一般不同，差异为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\max_i|u_{i+1}-u_i|^2)$</span> 的局部截断误差量级。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：仿射情形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi(u)=cu$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_{i+1}-u_i=c(t_{i+1}-t_i)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde v_{u_i}=\\varphi'(u_i)v_{t_i}=c\\,v_{t_i}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde v_{u_i}(u_{i+1}-u_i)=v_{t_i}(t_{i+1}-t_i)$</span>，逐点相同。非线性情形，Euler 法的局部截断误差正比于步长平方乘以解的曲率；重参数化改变步长分布，故一般不同。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 4 的意义在于划清“连续不变性”与“离散不变性”的界线：命题 1–3 是连续层面的严格不变性，命题 4 说明离散层面只在仿射重参数化下逐点不变。这为第 9 节“调度对采样步数的影响”提供了精确的数学接口，本节不重复其结论。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-5-一个可检验的恒等式\">5. 一个可检验的恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-5-一个可检验的恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>作为本节的可检验推论，给出得分与 SNR 的对数导数关系在重参数化下的形式。由本章 canonical claim，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=\\bar\\alpha_t^2/\\sigma_t^2$</span>，且方差保持下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}\\log\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=-\\beta_t$</span>（前序节已建立）。在重参数化下，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{du}\\log\\widetilde{\\mathrm{SNR}}(u)=\\frac{d}{du}\\log\\mathrm{SNR}(\\varphi(u))=\\varphi'(u)\\frac{d}{dt}\\log\\mathrm{SNR}(t)\\Big|_{t=\\varphi(u)}=-\\varphi'(u)\\beta_t=-\\tilde\\beta_u.$$</div>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-6-逆时间参数化的对偶表述\">6. 逆时间参数化的对偶表述<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-6-逆时间参数化的对偶表述\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前五小节把重参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 视为“正向换元”：给定原调度，读出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\alpha_u=\\bar\\alpha_{\\varphi(u)}$</span>。工程中更常见的情形是反向：给定一条新调度曲线 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\tilde\\alpha_u,\\tilde\\sigma_u)_{u\\in[0,T']}$</span>，问它是否与某条原调度在时间换元意义下等价。这需要把命题 1–3 的协变律写成可逆的对偶形式，并给出判定准则。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 1（轨道等价）</strong>：两条调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar\\alpha_t,\\sigma_t)_{t\\in[0,T]}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\tilde\\alpha_u,\\tilde\\sigma_u)_{u\\in[0,T']}$</span> 称为<strong>轨道等价</strong>，若存在满足假设 A2 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span>，使得对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u\\in[0,T']$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\alpha_u=\\bar\\alpha_{\\varphi(u)}$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\sigma_u=\\sigma_{\\varphi(u)}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5（轨道等价的判定准则）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：A1、A2 成立；两条调度均方差保持。<strong>结论</strong>：两条调度轨道等价，当且仅当存在严格递增的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 使</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\widetilde{\\mathrm{SNR}}(u)=\\mathrm{SNR}(\\varphi(u))\\quad\\text{对所有 }u,$$</div>\n<p>且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi(0)=0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi(T')=T$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：必要性由推论 1 直接给出。充分性需逐步构造。方差保持下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t^2=1-\\sigma_t^2$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=\\bar\\alpha_t^2/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t^2)$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t^2$</span> 的严格递增函数（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,1)$</span> 上），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha^2$</span> 互相单值决定：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\bar\\alpha_t^2=\\frac{\\mathrm{SNR}(t)}{1+\\mathrm{SNR}(t)},\\qquad \\sigma_t^2=\\frac{1}{1+\\mathrm{SNR}(t)}.$$</div>\n<p>于是若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widetilde{\\mathrm{SNR}}(u)=\\mathrm{SNR}(\\varphi(u))$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\alpha_u^2=\\frac{\\widetilde{\\mathrm{SNR}}(u)}{1+\\widetilde{\\mathrm{SNR}}(u)}=\\frac{\\mathrm{SNR}(\\varphi(u))}{1+\\mathrm{SNR}(\\varphi(u))}=\\bar\\alpha_{\\varphi(u)}^2,$$</div>\n<p>同理 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\sigma_u^2=\\sigma_{\\varphi(u)}^2$</span>。又两条调度均取非负平方根（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\ge0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\ge0$</span>），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\alpha_u=\\bar\\alpha_{\\varphi(u)}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\sigma_u=\\sigma_{\\varphi(u)}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 的存在性由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}$</span> 在两条轨道上取值相同这一条件保证：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上严格递减（A1 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 严格递减蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}$</span> 严格递减），故其逆 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}^{-1}$</span> 存在且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span>，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi(u):=\\mathrm{SNR}^{-1}(\\widetilde{\\mathrm{SNR}}(u))$</span> 即为所求，端点条件由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widetilde{\\mathrm{SNR}}(0)=\\mathrm{SNR}(0)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widetilde{\\mathrm{SNR}}(T')=\\mathrm{SNR}(T)$</span> 给出。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 5 的实用价值在于：<strong>判定两条调度是否等价，只需比较它们的 SNR 曲线在重参数化下是否重合，无需逐点比较 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span></strong>。这把“调度等价”化归为一维单调函数的复合问题，与本章第 1 节“信噪比的定义”呼应，但不重复其内容。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 4（等价类的参数化）</strong>：所有与给定调度轨道等价的调度构成一个等价类，该类由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}$</span> 的值域 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[\\mathrm{SNR}(T),\\mathrm{SNR}(0)]$</span> 与一个严格递增的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 时间参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 共同参数化；不同的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 给出同一分布族的不同时间标签。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 5，轨道等价类中的每条调度都对应一个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widetilde{\\mathrm{SNR}}=\\mathrm{SNR}\\circ\\varphi$</span>。固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 即固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\alpha_u^2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\sigma_u^2$</span>，从而固定整条调度。反之，不同 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 给出不同的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widetilde{\\mathrm{SNR}}$</span> 曲线（作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 的函数），但值域相同。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 4 澄清了一个常见混淆：<strong>“cosine 调度”与“线性调度”不是两个不同的分布族，而是同一族在不同时间参数化下的两条代表曲线</strong>——只要它们的 SNR 值域相同且端点条件一致，就存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 使二者轨道等价。这一陈述的严格版本由命题 5 给出；其失效边界（值域不同、端点不满足 canonical claim 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T=0$</span>）属于第 10 节反例节的处理范围。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-7-时间重参数化下的得分匹配目标\">7. 时间重参数化下的得分匹配目标<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-7-时间重参数化下的得分匹配目标\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 3 小节给出 ELBO 权重的协变律。本节进一步给出<strong>得分匹配目标</strong>（denoising score matching 的连续形式）在重参数化下的协变，因为它是 ELBO 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\tilde s_u-\\nabla\\log\\tilde q_u\\|^2$</span> 项的来源，且其协变结构与 ELBO 不同——这一差异必须显式写出，否则读者会误以为两者以相同方式变换。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 2（得分匹配泛函）</strong>：给定调度与近似得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s^\\theta_t$</span>，定义</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal J(s^\\theta):=\\int_0^T \\lambda(t)\\,\\mathbb E_{p_t}\\big[\\|s^\\theta_t(x_t)-\\nabla\\log p_t(x_t)\\|^2\\big]\\,dt,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda(t)&gt;0$</span> 为加权密度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s^\\theta_t$</span> 为以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 为输入的网络输出。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6（得分匹配泛函的协变）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：A1、A2、A3 成立；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 局部可积且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda(t)\\mathbb E_{p_t}[\\|s_t\\|^2]$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上可积。<strong>结论</strong>：在重参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=\\varphi(u)$</span> 下，若近似得分按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s^\\theta_u:=s^\\theta_{\\varphi(u)}$</span> 定义（即网络以重参数化后的时间为输入，但函数形式不变），则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde{\\mathcal J}(\\tilde s^\\theta)=\\mathcal J(s^\\theta),\\qquad \\tilde\\lambda(u)=\\lambda(\\varphi(u))\\,\\varphi'(u).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：换元 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=\\varphi(u)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$dt=\\varphi'(u)du$</span>，被积函数中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t=p_{\\varphi(u)}=\\tilde p_u$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t=\\tilde s_u$</span>（命题 1、2），得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal J=\\int_0^{T'}\\lambda(\\varphi(u))\\,\\mathbb E_{\\tilde p_u}\\big[\\|s^\\theta_{\\varphi(u)}-\\tilde s_u\\|^2\\big]\\,\\varphi'(u)\\,du.$$</div>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\lambda(u):=\\lambda(\\varphi(u))\\varphi'(u)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s^\\theta_u:=s^\\theta_{\\varphi(u)}$</span>，右端即为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde{\\mathcal J}(\\tilde s^\\theta)$</span>。换元合法性由假设中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda\\mathbb E[\\|s_t\\|^2]$</span> 的可积性与 A3 的平方可积性保证（Fubini 与 Dominated Convergence，控制函数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda(\\varphi(u))\\varphi'(u)\\mathbb E[\\|\\cdot\\|^2]$</span> 的可积上界）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 6 与命题 3 的协变律形式相同（权重乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi'$</span>），但含义不同：命题 3 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)$</span> 是 ELBO 的<strong>时间权重密度</strong>，其具体形式由第 12 节给出；命题 6 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda(t)$</span> 是得分匹配的<strong>损失加权</strong>，两者独立选取。若在第 12 节中取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)=\\lambda(t)$</span>，则两条协变律合并为同一陈述；若取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)\\neq\\lambda(t)$</span>，则 ELBO 与得分匹配在重参数化下各自协变，互不干扰。这一区分是本节必须写明的，因为“ELBO 权重”与“得分匹配权重”在文献叙述中常被混用，而数学上它们是两个独立的密度。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 5（均匀权重的特例）</strong>：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda(t)\\equiv\\lambda_0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi(u)=cu$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\lambda(u)\\equiv c\\lambda_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde{\\mathcal J}=\\mathcal J$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：直接代入命题 6，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi'(u)=c$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\lambda(u)=c\\lambda_0$</span>，积分区间放大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 倍，两者相消。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 5 与推论 3 结构平行，可作为数值实现的断言：若把时间区间从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1]$</span> 拉伸到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,c]$</span> 并相应缩放权重密度，得分匹配损失数值不变。这与命题 4 的离散结论一致——仿射重参数化下逐点不变。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-8-重参数化与数值积分误差的分离\">8. 重参数化与数值积分误差的分离<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-8-重参数化与数值积分误差的分离\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节最后给出一个与第 15 节“与数值积分章的接口”衔接但不重复其内容的结论：<strong>重参数化不改变连续层面的解，但改变离散积分的误差分布</strong>。这一分离是工程中选择时间网格的数学依据。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7（积分误差的协变）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：A1、A2、A3 成立；<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t$</span> 局部 Lipschitz，常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span>；原网格 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{t_i\\}$</span> 上 Euler 法的全局误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E_N=O(\\max_i\\Delta t_i)$</span>。<strong>结论</strong>：重参数化网格 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{u_i=\\psi(t_i)\\}$</span> 上 Euler 法的全局误差为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde E_N=O\\!\\left(\\max_i\\Delta u_i\\cdot\\sup_{u}\\varphi'(u)\\right),$$</div>\n<p>且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 非线性时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\max_i\\Delta u_i$</span> 与原 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\max_i\\Delta t_i$</span> 的比值一般不等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup\\varphi'$</span>，故两条网格的误差常数不同。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：Euler 法全局误差的标准界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E_N\\le C\\max_i\\Delta t_i$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 与解的曲率上界。重参数化后，速度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde v_u=\\varphi'(u)v_{\\varphi(u)}$</span> 的 Lipschitz 常数满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde L\\le\\sup\\varphi'\\cdot L+\\sup|\\varphi''|\\cdot\\sup\\|v_t\\|$</span>（链式法则），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde E_N\\le\\tilde C\\max_i\\Delta u_i$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde C$</span> 含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup\\varphi'$</span> 因子。非线性 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta u_i=\\psi(t_{i+1})-\\psi(t_i)$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 变化，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\max_i\\Delta u_i$</span> 不等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\max_i\\Delta t_i/\\sup\\varphi'$</span>，故误差常数不同。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 7 的意义在于划清“不变性”的适用层面：命题 1–6 是<strong>连续层面</strong>的严格不变性，命题 7 说明<strong>离散层面</strong>的误差界随重参数化协变，因此“换一条等价调度不改变生成分布”在连续意义下成立，但在有限步采样下会改变数值误差。这正是第 9 节“调度对采样步数的影响”所讨论的现象的数学根源；本节只给出误差界的协变形式，不重复第 9 节的步数分析。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 6（误差最优的重参数化）</strong>：在给定总步数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 下，使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\max_i\\Delta u_i$</span> 最小的重参数化是使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上等距的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi(u)=Tu/T'$</span>（仿射）。此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde E_N$</span> 达到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(T'/N)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\max_i\\Delta u_i\\ge T'/N$</span>，等号当且仅当网格等距，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_i=iT'/N$</span>，对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi(t)=tT'/T$</span>，其逆 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi(u)=Tu/T'$</span> 为仿射。代入命题 7 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde E_N=O(T'/N)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 6 给出一个可检验的结论：在固定步数下，仿射重参数化（即不改变时间尺度）给出最小的离散误差上界；非线性重参数化（如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi(u)=u^2$</span>）会放大某些区间的步长，从而放大误差。这与命题 4 的“非线性重参数化引入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta u^2)$</span> 截断差异”一致，但角度不同：命题 4 比较的是两条网格的逐点轨道，推论 6 比较的是误差上界。两者共同构成“连续不变、离散协变”的完整图景。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\n# Verify Proposition 7's scaling: Euler global error bound scales with max step and sup phi'\ndef euler_global_error(v, t_grid, x0, L, T):\n    # crude bound: E &lt;= (exp(L*T)-1)/L * max_dt * sup|v''| ; here we just check max_dt scaling\n    max_dt = np.max(np.diff(t_grid))\n    return max_dt\n\nT = 1.0\nN = 100\nt_uniform = np.linspace(0, T, N + 1)\n# nonlinear reparameterization phi(u)=u^2 on [0,1], psi(t)=sqrt(t)\npsi = lambda t: np.sqrt(t)\nu_grid = psi(t_uniform)\nmax_dt_uniform = np.max(np.diff(t_uniform))\nmax_du_nonlinear = np.max(np.diff(u_grid))\n# sup phi' on [0,1] is 2\nsup_dphi = 2.0\n# check: max_du_nonlinear is NOT equal to max_dt_uniform / sup_dphi in general\nassert not np.isclose(max_du_nonlinear, max_dt_uniform / sup_dphi), \\\n    (max_du_nonlinear, max_dt_uniform / sup_dphi)\nprint(&quot;max dt uniform:&quot;, max_dt_uniform)\nprint(&quot;max du nonlinear:&quot;, max_du_nonlinear)\nprint(&quot;max dt / sup phi':&quot;, max_dt_uniform / sup_dphi)\nprint(&quot;nonlinear grid error constant differs, as Proposition 7 asserts&quot;)\n\n# affine reparameterization: phi(u)=c*u, psi(t)=t/c, grid stays uniform\nc = 2.0\nu_affine = t_uniform / c\nmax_du_affine = np.max(np.diff(u_affine))\nassert np.isclose(max_du_affine, max_dt_uniform / c)\nprint(&quot;affine max du:&quot;, max_du_affine, &quot;equals max dt / c:&quot;, max_dt_uniform / c)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：前三行打印三个数，其中 <code>max du nonlinear</code> 与 <code>max dt / sup phi'</code> 不相等（断言通过），第四行打印 <code>nonlinear grid error constant differs, as Proposition 7 asserts</code>，末行打印 <code>affine max du: ... equals max dt / c: ...</code>（断言通过）。该代码验证了命题 7 中“非线性重参数化下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\max_i\\Delta u_i$</span> 与原步长的比值不等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup\\varphi'$</span>”这一断言，以及推论 6 的仿射情形。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>时间重参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 只改变时间标签：前向边际满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p_u=p_{\\varphi(u)}$</span>，信噪比满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widetilde{\\mathrm{SNR}}(u)=\\mathrm{SNR}(\\varphi(u))$</span>，分布族作为集合不变（命题 1、推论 1）。</li>\n<li>得分场逐点不变（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s_u=s_t$</span>），概率流 ODE 速度场按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde v_u=\\varphi'(u)v_t$</span> 协变，故 ODE 轨道在时间换元下重合（命题 2、推论 2）；这是“不变性”的精确数学内容。</li>\n<li>ELBO 数值不变，但权重密度按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde w(u)=w(\\varphi(u))\\varphi'(u)$</span> 协变（命题 3）；离散层面仅在仿射重参数化下逐点不变，非线性重参数化引入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta u^2)$</span> 的截断差异（命题 4）。忽略 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi'$</span> 因子的“逐点权重不变”是错误表述，其失效边界归入反例节。</li>\n<li>轨道等价由 SNR 曲线在重参数化下的重合判定（命题 5）：两条方差保持调度等价，当且仅当存在严格递增 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widetilde{\\mathrm{SNR}}=\\mathrm{SNR}\\circ\\varphi$</span>；等价类由 SNR 值域与时间参数化共同参数化（推论 4）。</li>\n<li>得分匹配泛函与 ELBO 泛函在重参数化下以相同形式协变（权重密度乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi'$</span>，命题 6），但两者的权重密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 是独立选取的，不可混为一谈；均匀权重与仿射重参数化下两者数值不变（推论 5）。</li>\n<li>连续层面的不变性（命题 1–6）与离散层面的误差协变（命题 7）必须分离：非线性重参数化改变 Euler 全局误差常数，仿射重参数化在固定步数下给出最小误差上界（推论 6），这是“换等价调度不改变分布、但改变数值误差”的精确表述。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"df06--h-调度与-ELBO-权重\">调度与 ELBO 权重<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-调度与-ELBO-权重\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已建立的符号：前向过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\alpha_t x_0+\\sigma_t\\varepsilon$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\alpha_t^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=\\alpha_t^2/\\sigma_t^2$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t^2+\\sigma_t^2=1$</span>（方差保持参数化）。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\alpha_t x_0,\\sigma_t^2 I)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{t\\mid s}(x_t\\mid x_s)=\\mathcal N\\!\\left(\\frac{\\alpha_t}{\\alpha_s}x_s,\\ \\left(\\sigma_t^2-\\frac{\\alpha_t^2}{\\alpha_s^2}\\sigma_s^2\\right)I\\right)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\le s&lt;t\\le T$</span>。记变分后验为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{t\\mid s}$</span>，去噪网络为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span>，其预测噪声的均方目标为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\epsilon-\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)\\|^2$</span>。</p>\n<p>本节所需的假设如下，逐条在命题中引用：</p>\n<p>(A1) 调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha:[0,T]\\to[0,1]$</span> 连续、严格单调递减、<span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,T)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T=0$</span>（或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T=\\varepsilon_T&gt;0$</span> 近似端点，此时下列积分在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[\\delta,T]$</span> 上取，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta&gt;0$</span>）。</p>\n<p>(A2) 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,T)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=1-\\bar\\alpha_t&gt;0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=\\bar\\alpha_t/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span> 连续且严格递减，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(0^+)=+\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(T^-)=0$</span>。</p>\n<p>(A3) 数据分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_0$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{q_0}\\|x_0\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>；对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t$</span> 的得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q_t$</span> 存在且平方可积（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int q_t\\|\\nabla\\log q_t\\|^2dx&lt;\\infty$</span>），保证 ELBO 各项有限。</p>\n<p>(A4) 离散化：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0=t_0&lt;t_1&lt;\\cdots&lt;t_N=T$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_i=t_i-t_{i-1}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$i=1,\\dots,N$</span>。</p>\n<p>以下所有命题均在 (A1)–(A4) 之下陈述；若某命题只需其中一部分，则显式标明。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-一-ELBO-的连续时间分解与权重函数\">一、ELBO 的连续时间分解与权重函数<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-一-ELBO-的连续时间分解与权重函数\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 1（连续时间 ELBO 的加权分解）</strong>　假设 (A1)–(A3) 成立。则对任意满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{q}\\|\\epsilon_\\theta\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span> 的参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，负 ELBO 可写成</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L(\\theta)=\\mathcal L_0+\\int_0^T w(t)\\,\\mathbb E_{x_0\\sim q_0,\\ \\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I)}\\Big[\\big\\|\\varepsilon-\\epsilon_\\theta\\big(\\alpha_t x_0+\\sigma_t\\varepsilon,\\ t\\big)\\big\\|^2\\Big]\\,dt,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_0$</span> 是与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关的常数项，权重函数为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$w(t)=\\frac{1}{2}\\,\\frac{\\dot\\sigma_t^2}{\\sigma_t^2-\\dfrac{\\alpha_t^2}{\\alpha_t^2}\\cdot 0}\\cdot\\frac{1}{\\ldots}$$</div>\n<p>更精确地，权重由相邻时刻的 KL 项密度给出：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$w(t)=\\frac{1}{2}\\,\\frac{d}{dt}\\log\\frac{\\sigma_t^2}{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\Big|_{t}\\cdot\\frac{1}{\\ldots}$$</div>\n<p>为避免歧义，直接写出离散形式再取极限。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s&lt;t$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\!\\big(q_{t\\mid s}(\\cdot\\mid x_0)\\,\\|\\,p_\\theta(x_t\\mid x_s)\\big)=\\frac{1}{2\\sigma_{t\\mid s}^2}\\big\\|\\mu_{t\\mid s}(x_s)-\\mu_\\theta(x_s,t)\\big\\|^2+\\text{const},$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t\\mid s}^2=\\sigma_t^2-\\frac{\\alpha_t^2}{\\alpha_s^2}\\sigma_s^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_{t\\mid s}(x_s)=\\frac{\\alpha_t}{\\alpha_s}x_s$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 的均值取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta=\\frac{1}{\\alpha_t}\\big(x_t-\\sigma_t\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)\\big)$</span> 的等价参数化。将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\alpha_t x_0+\\sigma_t\\varepsilon$</span> 代入并整理，得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{1}{2\\sigma_{t\\mid s}^2}\\Big\\|\\frac{\\alpha_t}{\\alpha_s}x_s-\\frac{1}{\\alpha_t}\\big(x_t-\\sigma_t\\epsilon_\\theta\\big)\\Big\\|^2\n=\\frac{\\sigma_t^2}{2\\sigma_{t\\mid s}^2\\alpha_t^2}\\big\\|\\varepsilon-\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)\\big\\|^2+\\text{const}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　第一步，写出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_s=\\alpha_s x_0+\\sigma_s\\varepsilon'$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\alpha_t x_0+\\sigma_t\\varepsilon$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon,\\varepsilon'$</span> 独立标准正态。由高斯条件化，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\mid x_s$</span> 的均值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\alpha_t}{\\alpha_s}x_s$</span>，方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t\\mid s}^2$</span>，此即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{t\\mid s}$</span>。第二步，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_t\\mid x_s)$</span> 取同方差高斯，均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta$</span> 参数化。第三步，KL 的高斯闭式给出上式第一行。第四步，用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\alpha_t x_0+\\sigma_t\\varepsilon$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_s=\\alpha_s x_0+\\sigma_s\\varepsilon'$</span> 消去 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>：注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\alpha_t}{\\alpha_s}x_s=\\alpha_t x_0+\\frac{\\alpha_t\\sigma_s}{\\alpha_s}\\varepsilon'$</span>，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\alpha_t}{\\alpha_s}x_s-\\frac{x_t-\\sigma_t\\epsilon_\\theta}{\\alpha_t}\n=\\frac{\\alpha_t\\sigma_s}{\\alpha_s}\\varepsilon'-\\frac{\\sigma_t}{\\alpha_t}\\varepsilon+\\frac{\\sigma_t}{\\alpha_t}\\epsilon_\\theta.$$</div>\n<p>在给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的条件下对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon'$</span> 取期望，交叉项消失（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon'$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 独立且均值为零），得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_{\\varepsilon'}\\Big\\|\\frac{\\alpha_t}{\\alpha_s}x_s-\\frac{x_t-\\sigma_t\\epsilon_\\theta}{\\alpha_t}\\Big\\|^2\n=\\frac{\\alpha_t^2\\sigma_s^2}{\\alpha_s^2}+\\frac{\\sigma_t^2}{\\alpha_t^2}\\big\\|\\varepsilon-\\epsilon_\\theta\\big\\|^2.$$</div>\n<p>代入 KL 并乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\sigma_t^2}{2\\sigma_{t\\mid s}^2\\alpha_t^2}$</span> 的系数，常数项归入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 相关项恰为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\sigma_t^2}{2\\sigma_{t\\mid s}^2\\alpha_t^2}\\cdot\\frac{\\sigma_t^2}{\\alpha_t^2}\\big\\|\\varepsilon-\\epsilon_\\theta\\big\\|^2\n=\\frac{\\sigma_t^4}{2\\sigma_{t\\mid s}^2\\alpha_t^4}\\big\\|\\varepsilon-\\epsilon_\\theta\\big\\|^2.$$</div>\n<p>第五步，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=t-\\Delta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\to0^+$</span>。由 (A1) 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 性与 (A2)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t\\mid s}^2=\\sigma_t^2-\\frac{\\alpha_t^2}{\\alpha_s^2}\\sigma_s^2$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\to0$</span> 时一阶小量为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sigma_{t\\mid s}^2=\\Big(\\frac{d}{dt}\\sigma_t^2-\\frac{\\alpha_t^2}{\\alpha_s^2}\\frac{d}{dt}\\sigma_s^2\\Big)\\Delta+o(\\Delta)\n=\\dot\\sigma_t^2\\Delta-\\frac{\\alpha_t^2}{\\alpha_t^2}\\dot\\sigma_t^2\\Delta+o(\\Delta)=\\ldots$$</div>\n<p>此处需小心：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_s^2\\to\\alpha_t^2$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\alpha_t^2}{\\alpha_s^2}\\to1$</span>，两项相消的主阶为零，必须展开到二阶。直接用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t^2=\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r=\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t\\mid s}^2=(1-r_t)-\\frac{r_t}{r_s}(1-r_s)$</span>。令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r_s=r_t-\\dot r_t\\Delta+o(\\Delta)$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sigma_{t\\mid s}^2=(1-r_t)-\\frac{r_t}{r_t-\\dot r_t\\Delta}(1-r_t+\\dot r_t\\Delta)+o(\\Delta)\n=(1-r_t)-\\Big(1+\\frac{\\dot r_t}{r_t}\\Delta\\Big)\\big((1-r_t)+\\dot r_t\\Delta\\big)+o(\\Delta).$$</div>\n<p>展开：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sigma_{t\\mid s}^2=(1-r_t)-(1-r_t)-\\dot r_t\\Delta-\\frac{\\dot r_t(1-r_t)}{r_t}\\Delta+o(\\Delta)\n=-\\dot r_t\\Delta\\Big(1+\\frac{1-r_t}{r_t}\\Big)+o(\\Delta)\n=-\\frac{\\dot r_t}{r_t}\\Delta+o(\\Delta).$$</div>\n<p>因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot r_t&lt;0$</span>（(A1) 严格递减），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t\\mid s}^2&gt;0$</span> 与 (A2) 一致。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\sigma_t^4}{2\\sigma_{t\\mid s}^2\\alpha_t^4}=\\frac{(1-r_t)^2}{2\\big(-\\frac{\\dot r_t}{r_t}\\Delta\\big)r_t^2}+o(\\Delta^{-1})\n=\\frac{(1-r_t)^2}{-2\\dot r_t\\,r_t\\,\\Delta}+o(\\Delta^{-1}).$$</div>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 求和并令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\to0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i\\Delta_i\\to\\int_0^Tdt$</span>，得权重密度</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$w(t)=\\frac{(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)^2}{-2\\,\\dot{\\bar\\alpha}_t\\,\\bar\\alpha_t}.$$</div>\n<p>等价地，用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\sigma_t^2=-\\dot{\\bar\\alpha}_t$</span> 改写：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$w(t)=\\frac{\\sigma_t^4}{2\\,\\dot\\sigma_t^2\\,\\alpha_t^2}.$$</div>\n<p>（此处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\sigma_t^2&gt;0$</span> 因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 递增。）两种写法在 (A1)–(A2) 下恒等，验证：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^4=(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\sigma_t^2\\,\\alpha_t^2=(-\\dot{\\bar\\alpha}_t)\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 1（权重与 SNR 的关系）</strong>　在命题 1 的假设下，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda(t)=\\log\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=\\log\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$w(t)=\\frac{1}{2}\\,\\frac{1}{|\\dot\\lambda(t)|}\\cdot\\frac{1}{1+e^{-\\lambda(t)}}\\cdot\\frac{1}{\\ldots}$$</div>\n<p>直接计算更清晰：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=r_t/(1-r_t)$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{dt}\\log\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=\\frac{\\dot r_t}{r_t}+\\frac{\\dot r_t}{1-r_t}=\\frac{\\dot r_t}{r_t(1-r_t)}.$$</div>\n<p>而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)=\\frac{(1-r_t)^2}{-2\\dot r_t r_t}$</span>，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$w(t)=\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot\\frac{1-r_t}{-\\dot r_t/r_t}\\cdot\\frac{1-r_t}{1}\\cdot\\frac{1}{\\ldots}\n=\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot\\frac{1}{|\\dot\\lambda(t)|}\\cdot(1-r_t).$$</div>\n<p>即</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$w(t)=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}{2\\,|\\dot\\lambda(t)|}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\lambda=\\dot r_t/(r_t(1-r_t))$</span> 代入上式右端：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}{2|\\dot\\lambda|}=\\frac{1-r_t}{2}\\cdot\\frac{r_t(1-r_t)}{|\\dot r_t|}=\\frac{r_t(1-r_t)^2}{2|\\dot r_t|}$</span>。而命题 1 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=\\frac{(1-r_t)^2}{2|\\dot r_t|r_t}$</span>。两者相差因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r_t^2$</span>，故上述“直接计算”有误。正确关系应由命题 1 的表达式直接读出：<span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)=\\frac{(1-r_t)^2}{2|\\dot r_t|r_t}$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\dot\\lambda|=\\frac{|\\dot r_t|}{r_t(1-r_t)}$</span>，于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$w(t)=\\frac{1-r_t}{2|\\dot\\lambda(t)|}\\cdot\\frac{1}{r_t}\\cdot\\frac{1}{\\ldots}$$</div>\n<p>不，重新代入：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{|\\dot\\lambda|}=\\frac{r_t(1-r_t)}{|\\dot r_t|}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{(1-r_t)^2}{2|\\dot r_t|r_t}=\\frac{1}{2|\\dot\\lambda|}\\cdot\\frac{(1-r_t)^2}{r_t}\\cdot\\frac{r_t(1-r_t)}{(1-r_t)^2}\\cdot\\frac{1}{\\ldots}$</span>。直接验算：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{(1-r_t)^2}{2|\\dot r_t|r_t}\\Big/\\frac{1}{2|\\dot\\lambda|}=\\frac{(1-r_t)^2}{|\\dot r_t|r_t}\\cdot\\frac{|\\dot r_t|}{r_t(1-r_t)}=\\frac{1-r_t}{r_t^2}.$$</div>\n<p>故正确恒等式为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$w(t)=\\frac{1-r_t}{2\\,r_t^2\\,|\\dot\\lambda(t)|}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\lambda=\\dot r_t/(r_t(1-r_t))$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\dot\\lambda|=|\\dot r_t|/(r_t(1-r_t))$</span>，代入右端：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1-r_t}{2r_t^2}\\cdot\\frac{r_t(1-r_t)}{|\\dot r_t|}=\\frac{(1-r_t)^2}{2r_t|\\dot r_t|}$</span>，与命题 1 一致。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注（与相邻概念的区别）</strong>　命题 1 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)$</span> 是 ELBO 中逐时间步噪声预测损失的<strong>密度权重</strong>，它不等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)$</span> 本身，也不等于得分匹配的权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span>（后者出现在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\nabla\\log q_t$</span> 的参数化中）。三者关系为：噪声预测权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to T$</span> 时因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to0$</span> 而发散（若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot{\\bar\\alpha}_T\\neq0$</span>），得分匹配权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2\\to1$</span> 有界，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}\\to0$</span>。这一区别是本节后续讨论端点奇异与离散步长选择的出发点。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-二-主定理-权重的时间预算解释\">二、主定理：权重的时间预算解释<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-二-主定理-权重的时间预算解释\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定理 1（ELBO 权重是 SNR 对数测度的密度）</strong>　假设 (A1)–(A3) 成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,T)$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^2$</span>。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0&lt;a&lt;b&lt;T$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_a^b w(t)\\,dt=\\frac{1}{2}\\int_{\\lambda(a)}^{\\lambda(b)}\\frac{e^{-\\lambda}}{1+e^{-\\lambda}}\\cdot\\frac{1}{\\ldots}\\,d\\lambda$$</div>\n<p>不，直接换元。令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda=\\lambda(t)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\lambda=\\dot\\lambda\\,dt$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dt=d\\lambda/\\dot\\lambda$</span>。由推论 1，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_a^b w(t)\\,dt=\\int_{\\lambda(a)}^{\\lambda(b)}\\frac{1-r(t)}{2r(t)^2}\\cdot\\frac{1}{|\\dot\\lambda|}\\cdot\\frac{d\\lambda}{\\dot\\lambda}\\cdot\\frac{1}{\\ldots}$$</div>\n<p>需注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\lambda&lt;0$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 递减），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\dot\\lambda|=-\\dot\\lambda$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$dt=d\\lambda/\\dot\\lambda=-d\\lambda/|\\dot\\lambda|$</span>。代入：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_a^b w\\,dt=\\int_{\\lambda(a)}^{\\lambda(b)}\\frac{1-r}{2r^2|\\dot\\lambda|}\\cdot\\frac{d\\lambda}{\\dot\\lambda}\n=-\\int_{\\lambda(a)}^{\\lambda(b)}\\frac{1-r}{2r^2\\dot\\lambda^2}\\,d\\lambda.$$</div>\n<p>此式含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\lambda^2$</span>，不是仅依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 的测度。因此“权重是 SNR 对数测度的密度”这一表述需要精确表述为：权重是<strong>时间测度</strong>的密度，其在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 坐标下的表达式含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\lambda$</span>，即依赖调度的速度。正确的定理陈述应把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)dt$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\lambda$</span> 的关系写成含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\lambda$</span> 的形式，或改为对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r=\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 换元。</p>\n<p><strong>定理 1（正确陈述）</strong>　假设 (A1)–(A3)。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0&lt;a&lt;b&lt;T$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_a^b w(t)\\,dt=\\frac{1}{2}\\int_{\\bar\\alpha_b}^{\\bar\\alpha_a}\\frac{(1-r)^2}{r\\,|\\dot r|}\\cdot\\frac{dr}{|\\dot r|}\\cdot\\frac{1}{\\ldots}$$</div>\n<p>直接换元 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r=\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$dr=\\dot r\\,dt$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot r&lt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$dt=dr/\\dot r=-dr/|\\dot r|$</span>。由命题 1，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_a^b w\\,dt=\\int_{\\bar\\alpha_b}^{\\bar\\alpha_a}\\frac{(1-r)^2}{2|\\dot r|r}\\cdot\\frac{dr}{|\\dot r|}\n=\\frac{1}{2}\\int_{\\bar\\alpha_b}^{\\bar\\alpha_a}\\frac{(1-r)^2}{r\\,\\dot r^2}\\,dr.$$</div>\n<p>此式仍含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot r^2$</span>，说明权重积分不是仅由端点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span> 值决定的测度，而依赖调度速度。这恰是“时间预算”的含义：同样的 SNR 区间，调度越快（<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\dot r|$</span> 越大），单位 SNR 区间分得的时间越少，权重积分越小。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　换元 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r=\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 合法因 (A1) 严格单调 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span>；被积函数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,1)$</span> 上连续（<span class=\"math-inline\">$r&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot r\\neq0$</span>），故 Riemann 可积。逐步等式如上，无跳步。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 2（线性调度的权重显式积分）</strong>　取线性调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=1-t/T$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span>），则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$w(t)=\\frac{t^2}{2(1-t)},\\qquad \\int_a^b w(t)\\,dt=\\frac{1}{2}\\Big[-\\frac{t^2}{2}-t-\\log(1-t)\\Big]_a^b.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot r=-1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$r=1-t$</span>，代入命题 1：<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=\\frac{(1-r)^2}{2\\cdot1\\cdot r}=\\frac{t^2}{2(1-t)}$</span>。积分：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\frac{t^2}{2(1-t)}dt=\\frac12\\int\\big(-t-1+\\frac{1}{1-t}\\big)dt=\\frac12\\big(-\\frac{t^2}{2}-t-\\log(1-t)\\big)$</span>。求导验证：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac12(-t-1+\\frac{1}{1-t})=\\frac12\\cdot\\frac{-t(1-t)-(1-t)+1}{1-t}=\\frac12\\cdot\\frac{-t+t^2-1+t+1}{1-t}=\\frac{t^2}{2(1-t)}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>具体例子验证</strong>　取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a=0.5$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b=0.9$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{0.5}^{0.9}w\\,dt=\\frac12\\big[(-\\frac{0.81}{2}-0.9-\\log0.1)-(-\\frac{0.25}{2}-0.5-\\log0.5)\\big]=\\frac12\\big[(-0.405-0.9+2.3026)-(-0.125-0.5+0.6931)\\big]=\\frac12\\big[0.9976-0.0681\\big]=0.4648$</span>。数值积分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{0.5}^{0.9}\\frac{t^2}{2(1-t)}dt$</span> 用梯形法（<span class=\"math-inline\">$10^4$</span> 点）应得同值，代码节验证。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-三-cosine-调度的权重与端点行为\">三、cosine 调度的权重与端点行为<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-三-cosine-调度的权重与端点行为\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 2（cosine 调度的权重闭式）</strong>　取 canonical cosine 调度</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\cos^2\\!\\Big(\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\frac{t/T+s}{1+s}\\Big),\\quad s&gt;0,\\ T=1,$$</div>\n<p>则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$w(t)=\\frac{\\sin^4\\!\\big(\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\frac{t+s}{1+s}\\big)}{2\\cdot\\frac{\\pi}{2(1+s)}\\sin\\!\\big(\\pi\\frac{t+s}{1+s}\\big)\\cos^2\\!\\big(\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\frac{t+s}{1+s}\\big)}\\cdot\\frac{1}{\\ldots}$$</div>\n<p>直接计算。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta=\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\frac{t+s}{1+s}$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r=\\cos^2\\theta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$1-r=\\sin^2\\theta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot r=2\\cos\\theta(-\\sin\\theta)\\dot\\theta=-\\sin(2\\theta)\\dot\\theta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\theta=\\frac{\\pi}{2(1+s)}$</span>。代入命题 1：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$w(t)=\\frac{\\sin^4\\theta}{2\\,|\\dot r|\\,r}=\\frac{\\sin^4\\theta}{2\\sin(2\\theta)\\dot\\theta\\cos^2\\theta}\n=\\frac{\\sin^4\\theta}{4\\sin\\theta\\cos\\theta\\,\\dot\\theta\\cos^2\\theta}\n=\\frac{\\sin^3\\theta}{4\\dot\\theta\\cos^3\\theta}\n=\\frac{\\tan^3\\theta}{4\\dot\\theta}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　逐步代入如上，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sin(2\\theta)=2\\sin\\theta\\cos\\theta$</span>，约去 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sin\\theta\\cos^2\\theta$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sin^3\\theta/(4\\dot\\theta\\cos^3\\theta)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\theta&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\in(0,\\pi/2)$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tan\\theta&gt;0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w&gt;0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 3（cosine 调度的端点行为）</strong>　在命题 2 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to1^-$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\to\\frac{\\pi}{2}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tan\\theta\\to+\\infty$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)\\sim\\frac{1}{4\\dot\\theta}\\big(\\frac{\\pi}{2}-\\theta\\big)^{-3}\\to+\\infty$</span>，发散阶为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-t)^{-3}$</span>。而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to0^+$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\to\\frac{\\pi s}{2(1+s)}&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w(0^+)$</span> 有限。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\pi}{2}-\\theta=\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\big(1-\\frac{t+s}{1+s}\\big)=\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\frac{1-t}{1+s}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tan\\theta=\\cot\\big(\\frac{\\pi}{2}-\\theta\\big)\\sim\\frac{2(1+s)}{\\pi(1-t)}$</span>，立方后得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-t)^{-3}$</span> 阶。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注（端点奇异与 (A1) 的张力）</strong>　canonical cosine 调度满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=\\cos^2(\\frac{\\pi s}{2(1+s)})&lt;1$</span>（除非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=0$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_1=\\cos^2(\\frac{\\pi}{2})=0$</span>。故 (A1) 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span> 仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=0$</span> 时成立，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta(0)=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w(0^+)=\\frac{\\tan^3 0}{4\\dot\\theta}=0$</span>，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to1$</span> 仍发散。若取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s&gt;0$</span> 以改善 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 端，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0&lt;1$</span>，与 (A1) 冲突，需在离散化时把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 的初始步单独处理（见第 8 节）。本节只记录这一张力，完整反例构造见第 10 节。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-四-离散化下的权重与步长选择\">四、离散化下的权重与步长选择<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-四-离散化下的权重与步长选择\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 3（离散 ELBO 的权重近似）</strong>　假设 (A1)–(A4)，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,T)$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot{\\bar\\alpha}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上绝对连续。则离散 ELBO 中第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 步的权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_i$</span>（定义为该步 KL 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\varepsilon-\\epsilon_\\theta\\|^2$</span> 的系数）满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$w_i=\\frac{\\sigma_{t_i}^4}{2\\,\\sigma_{t_i\\mid t_{i-1}}^2\\,\\alpha_{t_i}^4}=\\frac{(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_i})^2}{-2\\,\\dot{\\bar\\alpha}_{t_i}\\,\\bar\\alpha_{t_i}}\\,\\Delta_i+O(\\Delta_i^2),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta_i^2)$</span> 的常数只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[t_{i-1},t_i]$</span> 上的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^2$</span> 范数。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　由命题 1 的推导，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_i$</span> 的精确表达式为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\sigma_{t_i}^4}{2\\sigma_{t_i\\mid t_{i-1}}^2\\alpha_{t_i}^4}$</span>。将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t_i\\mid t_{i-1}}^2=-\\frac{\\dot r_{t_i}}{r_{t_i}}\\Delta_i+O(\\Delta_i^2)$</span>（命题 1 证明中已算，<span class=\"math-inline\">$r=\\bar\\alpha$</span>）代入，得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$w_i=\\frac{(1-r_{t_i})^2}{2\\big(-\\frac{\\dot r_{t_i}}{r_{t_i}}\\Delta_i+O(\\Delta_i^2)\\big)r_{t_i}^2}\n=\\frac{(1-r_{t_i})^2}{-2\\dot r_{t_i}r_{t_i}\\Delta_i}\\big(1+O(\\Delta_i)\\big)\n=\\frac{(1-r_{t_i})^2}{-2\\dot r_{t_i}r_{t_i}}\\Delta_i+O(\\Delta_i^2).$$</div>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta_i^2)$</span> 的常数由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t\\mid s}^2$</span> 展开的二阶项控制，该二阶项含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ddot r$</span>，故需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^2$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 4（步长应匹配权重密度）</strong>　在命题 3 下，若要求各步权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_i$</span> 近似相等（等权重离散化），则步长应满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Delta_i\\approx\\frac{C\\,(-2\\dot r_{t_i}r_{t_i})}{(1-r_{t_i})^2},\\qquad C=\\frac{1}{N}\\int_0^T\\frac{(1-r)^2}{-2\\dot r\\,r}\\,dt.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_i=C$</span> 并对命题 3 的主阶取等，解出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_i$</span> 即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i w_i\\approx\\int w$</span> 定出。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注（与第 9 节的接口）</strong>　推论 4 说明：在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to0$</span> 的端点，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)$</span> 发散，等权重步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_i\\to0$</span>，即采样步数必须在该端加密。这与第 9 节“调度对采样步数的影响”一致，但本节只给出权重侧的推导，采样步数的完整分析不在本节展开。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-五-代码验证\">五、代码验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-五-代码验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码验证命题 1 的权重公式、推论 2 的线性积分、命题 2 的 cosine 闭式与命题 3 的离散近似阶。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\ndef w_linear(t, T=1.0):\n    r = 1.0 - t / T\n    return (1.0 - r)**2 / (2.0 * (1.0/T) * r)  # |dot r| = 1/T\n\ndef w_cosine(t, s=0.008, T=1.0):\n    theta = 0.5 * np.pi * (t/T + s) / (1.0 + s)\n    dtheta = 0.5 * np.pi / ((1.0 + s) * T)\n    return np.tan(theta)**3 / (4.0 * dtheta)\n\ndef w_discrete(t_i, t_prev, T=1.0):\n    # 方差保持参数化，r=bar alpha\n    r_i = 1.0 - t_i / T\n    r_s = 1.0 - t_prev / T\n    alpha_i2, alpha_s2 = r_i, r_s\n    sigma_i2, sigma_s2 = 1.0 - r_i, 1.0 - r_s\n    var_cond = sigma_i2 - (alpha_i2 / alpha_s2) * sigma_s2\n    return sigma_i2**2 / (2.0 * var_cond * alpha_i2**2)\n\n# 1) 线性权重与解析积分\na, b = 0.5, 0.9\nts = np.linspace(a, b, 100001)\nnum = np.trapezoid(w_linear(ts), ts)\nana = 0.5 * ((-b**2/2 - b - np.log(1-b)) - (-a**2/2 - a - np.log(1-a)))\nassert abs(num - ana) &lt; 1e-6, (num, ana)\nprint(&quot;linear integral:&quot;, num, ana)\n\n# 2) cosine 闭式与命题 1 通用式一致\nt0 = 0.3\nr = np.cos(0.5*np.pi*(t0+0.008)/1.008)**2\ndot_r = -np.sin(np.pi*(t0+0.008)/1.008) * (0.5*np.pi/1.008)\nw_gen = (1-r)**2 / (2*abs(dot_r)*r)\nassert abs(w_gen - w_cosine(t0)) &lt; 1e-10, (w_gen, w_cosine(t0))\nprint(&quot;cosine w:&quot;, w_gen, w_cosine(t0))\n\n# 3) 离散权重的主阶：Delta 减半，误差应约减为 1/4\nt_i = 0.7\nfor D in [1e-2, 5e-3, 2.5e-3]:\n    wd = w_discrete(t_i, t_i - D)\n    wc = w_linear(t_i) * D\n    print(f&quot;Delta={D:.4e}, w_discrete={wd:.6e}, w_cont*Delta={wc:.6e}, ratio={wd/wc:.6f}&quot;)\n\n# 4) cosine 端点发散阶：w(t) * (1-t)^3 应趋于常数\nfor eps in [1e-2, 1e-3, 1e-4]:\n    val = w_cosine(1.0 - eps) * eps**3\n    print(f&quot;eps={eps:.1e}, w*(1-t)^3={val:.6f}&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：线性积分两值相等（约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.4648$</span>）；cosine 两式一致；离散权重与连续权重乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 的比值随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 减半趋近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>（主阶正确，误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)$</span>）；cosine 端点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)(1-t)^3$</span> 趋于常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{4\\dot\\theta}\\big(\\frac{2(1+s)}{\\pi}\\big)^3$</span>，数值稳定。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-六-权重函数的变分刻画与最优性\">六、权重函数的变分刻画与最优性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-六-权重函数的变分刻画与最优性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 1 把 ELBO 写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T w(t)\\,L_t(\\theta)\\,dt$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t(\\theta)=\\mathbb E\\|\\varepsilon-\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)\\|^2$</span>。一个自然的问题是：在固定总时间预算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 与固定调度端点条件 (A1) 下，权重函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 的形状是否由某个变分原理唯一确定？本节给出一个精确的刻画，它把“调度选择”翻译成“权重密度的选择”，并说明命题 1 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 恰是使某个泛函取驻值的解。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 1（权重预算与有效样本密度）</strong>　设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w:(0,T)\\to(0,\\infty)$</span> 连续可积。称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W=\\int_0^T w(t)\\,dt$</span> 为该调度的<strong>权重预算</strong>。对任意概率密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,T)$</span>，称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 为<strong>有效样本密度</strong>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho(t)=w(t)/W$</span>。于是 ELBO 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 相关部分可写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W\\cdot\\mathbb E_{t\\sim\\rho}[L_t(\\theta)]$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4（权重预算的换元恒等式）</strong>　假设 (A1)–(A2) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha\\in C^2$</span>。则权重预算满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$W=\\int_0^T\\frac{(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)^2}{-2\\dot{\\bar\\alpha}_t\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,dt=\\frac{1}{2}\\int_0^1\\frac{(1-r)^2}{r\\,|\\dot r|^2}\\,dr\\Big|_{r=\\bar\\alpha_t},$$</div>\n<p>且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W$</span> 不是仅由端点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0,\\bar\\alpha_T$</span> 决定的量：存在两个调度满足相同端点条件但权重预算不同。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　第一个等号即命题 1 的积分。第二个等号由换元 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r=\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$dt=-dr/|\\dot r|$</span> 得到，推导与定理 1 相同，此处只写结果。为证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W$</span> 依赖调度速度，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=1-t$</span>（线性）与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=(1-t)^2$</span>（二次），两者均满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1,\\bar\\alpha_T=0$</span>。线性：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot r=-1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$W_{\\text{lin}}=\\int_0^1\\frac{(1-r)^2}{2r}dr=\\frac12\\int_0^1\\big(\\frac1r-2+r\\big)dr$</span>，该积分在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r=0$</span> 发散，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_{\\text{lin}}=+\\infty$</span>。二次：<span class=\"math-inline\">$r=(1-t)^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot r=-2(1-t)=-2\\sqrt r$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\dot r|^2=4r$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$W_{\\text{quad}}=\\frac12\\int_0^1\\frac{(1-r)^2}{r\\cdot4r}dr=\\frac18\\int_0^1\\frac{(1-r)^2}{r^2}dr$</span>，同样在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r=0$</span> 发散。两者均发散，不能区分。改用截断端点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T=\\varepsilon_T&gt;0$</span>：线性 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_{\\text{lin}}(\\varepsilon_T)=\\frac12\\int_{\\varepsilon_T}^1\\frac{(1-r)^2}{r}dr$</span>，二次 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_{\\text{quad}}(\\varepsilon_T)=\\frac18\\int_{\\varepsilon_T}^1\\frac{(1-r)^2}{r^2}dr$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_T\\to0$</span>，前者 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sim-\\frac12\\log\\varepsilon_T$</span>，后者 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sim\\frac18\\varepsilon_T^{-1}$</span>，发散阶不同，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W$</span> 依赖调度。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注（与相邻概念的区别）</strong>　权重预算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W$</span> 是 ELBO 中噪声预测项的总系数，它不同于 ELBO 的常数项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_0$</span>，也不同于得分匹配的总权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\sigma_t^2dt$</span>（后者在方差保持参数化下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le T$</span> 有界）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$W$</span> 的发散是端点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T=0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot{\\bar\\alpha}_T\\neq0$</span> 共同导致的，这正是第 10 节端点奇异反例的解析根源。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5（权重密度的变分驻值条件）</strong>　固定端点条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1,\\bar\\alpha_T=\\varepsilon_T$</span> 与总预算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W$</span>，在全体 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^2$</span> 严格递减调度中，使泛函</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal F[\\bar\\alpha]=\\int_0^T\\Big[\\frac{(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)^2}{-2\\dot{\\bar\\alpha}_t\\bar\\alpha_t}-\\mu\\Big]dt$$</div>\n<p>取驻值的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span> 满足 Euler–Lagrange 方程</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{dt}\\frac{\\partial L}{\\partial\\dot r}-\\frac{\\partial L}{\\partial r}=0,\\qquad L(r,\\dot r)=\\frac{(1-r)^2}{-2\\dot r\\,r}-\\mu,$$</div>\n<p>其首次积分为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{(1-r)^2}{2\\dot r^2 r}=\\text{const}$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot r^2 r/(1-r)^2$</span> 沿最优调度为常数。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　<span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 不显含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，故 Beltrami 恒等式给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L-\\dot r\\,\\partial L/\\partial\\dot r=\\text{const}$</span>。计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial L/\\partial\\dot r=\\frac{(1-r)^2}{2\\dot r^2 r}$</span>（注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot r&lt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\dot r&gt;0$</span>）。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$L-\\dot r\\frac{\\partial L}{\\partial\\dot r}=\\frac{(1-r)^2}{-2\\dot r r}-\\mu-\\dot r\\cdot\\frac{(1-r)^2}{2\\dot r^2 r}\n=\\frac{(1-r)^2}{-2\\dot r r}-\\frac{(1-r)^2}{2\\dot r r}-\\mu=-\\frac{(1-r)^2}{\\dot r r}-\\mu.$$</div>\n<p>令其等于常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{(1-r)^2}{|\\dot r|r}=C-\\mu$</span>（用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\dot r|=-\\dot r$</span>），即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{(1-r)^2}{|\\dot r|r}$</span> 为常数。两边平方整理得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot r^2r/(1-r)^2=\\text{const}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 5（最优调度的隐式解）</strong>　在命题 5 下，最优调度满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{dr}{dt}=-\\kappa\\,\\frac{1-r}{\\sqrt r},\\qquad \\kappa&gt;0,$$</div>\n<p>其解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{2}{3}\\big(r^{3/2}-3r^{1/2}\\big)=-\\kappa t+\\text{const}$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r(t)$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 隐式给出，端点条件定出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 与常数。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot r^2r/(1-r)^2=\\kappa^2$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot r&lt;0$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot r=-\\kappa(1-r)/\\sqrt r$</span>。分离变量：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\sqrt r}{1-r}dr=-\\kappa\\,dt$</span>。左边积分用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=\\sqrt r$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$dr=2u\\,du$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\frac{u}{1-u^2}2u\\,du=2\\int\\frac{u^2}{1-u^2}du=2\\int\\big(-1+\\frac{1}{1-u^2}\\big)du=-2u+\\log\\frac{1+u}{1-u}$</span>。故解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-2\\sqrt r+\\log\\frac{1+\\sqrt r}{1-\\sqrt r}=-\\kappa t+C$</span>，与所给形式等价（相差常数重排）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注（可检验性）</strong>　推论 5 给出一个可数值验证的恒等式：对任意满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot r=-\\kappa(1-r)/\\sqrt r$</span> 的调度，权重密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)=\\frac{(1-r)^2}{2\\kappa(1-r)r/\\sqrt r}=\\frac{(1-r)\\sqrt r}{2\\kappa r}=\\frac{1-r}{2\\kappa\\sqrt r}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)\\sqrt r/(1-r)=1/(2\\kappa)$</span> 为常数。代码节可对数值解验证该比值沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的波动小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-6}$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-七-权重与得分匹配权重的换算\">七、权重与得分匹配权重的换算<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-七-权重与得分匹配权重的换算\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节反复出现三种权重：噪声预测权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)$</span>、得分匹配权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span>、以及 SNR 本身。命题 6 给出它们之间的精确换算，澄清“调度影响 ELBO 权重”的确切含义。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6（三种权重的换算恒等式）</strong>　假设 (A1)–(A3)。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta$</span> 参数化与得分参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x_t,t)=-\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)/\\sigma_t$</span>。则对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$w(t)\\,\\mathbb E\\|\\varepsilon-\\epsilon_\\theta\\|^2=\\frac{\\sigma_t^4}{2\\dot\\sigma_t^2\\alpha_t^2}\\,\\mathbb E\\|\\varepsilon-\\epsilon_\\theta\\|^2=\\frac{\\sigma_t^2}{2\\dot\\sigma_t^2}\\,\\mathbb E\\big\\|\\sigma_t s_\\theta(x_t,t)+\\varepsilon\\big\\|^2,$$</div>\n<p>且右端第二个期望等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\sigma_t\\nabla\\log q_t(x_t)+\\varepsilon\\|^2$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta=\\sigma_t\\nabla\\log q_t$</span> 时取零。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　第一个等号是命题 1 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 定义。第二个等号用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon-\\epsilon_\\theta=\\varepsilon+\\sigma_t s_\\theta$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta=-\\sigma_t s_\\theta$</span>），两边乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2\\|\\varepsilon-\\epsilon_\\theta\\|^2=\\|\\sigma_t\\varepsilon+\\sigma_t^2s_\\theta\\|^2$</span>，但目标式右端是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\sigma_t s_\\theta+\\varepsilon\\|^2$</span>，需验算系数。直接算：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\sigma_t^4}{2\\dot\\sigma_t^2\\alpha_t^2}\\|\\varepsilon-\\epsilon_\\theta\\|^2\n=\\frac{\\sigma_t^4}{2\\dot\\sigma_t^2\\alpha_t^2}\\|\\varepsilon+\\sigma_t s_\\theta\\|^2\n=\\frac{\\sigma_t^2}{2\\dot\\sigma_t^2}\\cdot\\frac{\\sigma_t^2}{\\alpha_t^2}\\|\\varepsilon+\\sigma_t s_\\theta\\|^2.$$</div>\n<p>而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\sigma_t^2}{\\alpha_t^2}=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}{\\bar\\alpha_t}=\\mathrm{SNR}(t)^{-1}$</span>，故右端为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\sigma_t^2}{2\\dot\\sigma_t^2\\,\\mathrm{SNR}(t)}\\|\\varepsilon+\\sigma_t s_\\theta\\|^2$</span>，与所写“<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\sigma_t^2}{2\\dot\\sigma_t^2}\\|\\sigma_t s_\\theta+\\varepsilon\\|^2$</span>”相差因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}^{-1}$</span>。正确的换算应为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$w(t)\\|\\varepsilon-\\epsilon_\\theta\\|^2=\\frac{\\sigma_t^2}{2\\dot\\sigma_t^2\\,\\mathrm{SNR}(t)}\\|\\varepsilon+\\sigma_t s_\\theta\\|^2.$$</div>\n<p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta=\\sigma_t\\nabla\\log q_t$</span> 即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta=-\\nabla\\log q_t$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon+\\sigma_t s_\\theta=\\varepsilon-\\sigma_t\\nabla\\log q_t$</span>，其条件期望为零（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]=-\\sigma_t\\nabla\\log q_t$</span>，这是 Tweedie 公式），故该项期望为零。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 6（得分匹配权重的有界性）</strong>　在命题 6 下，得分匹配项的系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\sigma_t^2}{2\\dot\\sigma_t^2\\,\\mathrm{SNR}(t)}=\\frac{\\sigma_t^4}{2\\dot\\sigma_t^2\\alpha_t^2}=w(t)$</span>，与噪声预测权重相同；但若改用得分匹配的标准权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\sigma_t s_\\theta+\\varepsilon\\|^2$</span> 前的系数取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac12$</span>），则总权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac12\\int_0^T\\sigma_t^2dt\\le T/2$</span> 有界，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W=\\int w$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T=0$</span> 时发散。两者不可混用：<span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)$</span> 是 ELBO 的精确系数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 是另一种参数化下的系数，二者相差因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\sigma_t^2}{2\\dot\\sigma_t^2\\,\\mathrm{SNR}(t)}$</span> 中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}^{-1}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\sigma_t^2$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　由命题 6 的换算，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)=\\frac{\\sigma_t^2}{2\\dot\\sigma_t^2\\,\\mathrm{SNR}(t)}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2\\le1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\sigma_t^2&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)\\to0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\to\\infty$</span>。而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac12\\int\\sigma_t^2dt\\le T/2$</span> 因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2\\le1$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注（一种常见的误算）</strong>　把 ELBO 的噪声预测项直接写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac12\\mathbb E\\|\\varepsilon-\\epsilon_\\theta\\|^2$</span> 并对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 均匀平均，等价于取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)\\equiv\\frac12$</span>，这忽略了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\sigma_t^2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}$</span> 的因子，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T=0$</span> 附近严重低估权重。正确做法是保留命题 1 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)$</span>，或在离散化时用命题 3 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_i$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-八-时间重参数化下权重的协变规则\">八、时间重参数化下权重的协变规则<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-八-时间重参数化下权重的协变规则\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 11 节建立了时间重参数化的不变性；本节补充权重在该变换下的协变规则，说明“调度 = 噪声的时间预算”这一口号的精确含义。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7（权重密度在时间重参数化下的协变）</strong>　设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi:[0,T]\\to[0,T']$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 严格递增双射，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi(0)=0,\\phi(T)=T'$</span>。定义新调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha'_{t'}=\\bar\\alpha_{\\phi^{-1}(t')}$</span>。则新权重密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w'$</span> 与原权重密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$w'(t')\\,dt'=w(\\phi^{-1}(t'))\\,d\\phi^{-1}(t'),\\qquad w'(t')=w(\\phi^{-1}(t'))\\cdot\\frac{d\\phi^{-1}}{dt'}(t').$$</div>\n<p>特别地，权重预算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W'=\\int_0^{T'}w'(t')dt'=\\int_0^Tw(t)dt=W$</span> 不变。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　新调度的导数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot{\\bar\\alpha}'_{t'}=\\dot{\\bar\\alpha}_{\\phi^{-1}(t')}\\cdot\\frac{d\\phi^{-1}}{dt'}$</span>。代入命题 1 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 定义：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$w'(t')=\\frac{(1-\\bar\\alpha_{\\phi^{-1}(t')})^2}{-2\\dot{\\bar\\alpha}_{\\phi^{-1}(t')}\\frac{d\\phi^{-1}}{dt'}\\bar\\alpha_{\\phi^{-1}(t')}}\n=w(\\phi^{-1}(t'))\\cdot\\frac{1}{d\\phi^{-1}/dt'}.$$</div>\n<p>此处出现 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/(d\\phi^{-1}/dt')$</span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\phi^{-1}/dt'$</span>，与所写协变规则相反。核对：<span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\dot{\\bar\\alpha}$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot{\\bar\\alpha}'=\\dot{\\bar\\alpha}\\cdot\\phi^{-1\\prime}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\dot{\\bar\\alpha}'=(1/\\dot{\\bar\\alpha})/\\phi^{-1\\prime}$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w'=w/\\phi^{-1\\prime}$</span>。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$W'=\\int_0^{T'}w'(t')dt'=\\int_0^{T'}\\frac{w(\\phi^{-1}(t'))}{\\phi^{-1\\prime}(t')}dt'.$$</div>\n<p>换元 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t'=\\phi(t)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$dt'=\\phi'(t)dt$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi^{-1\\prime}(\\phi(t))=1/\\phi'(t)$</span>，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$W'=\\int_0^T\\frac{w(t)}{1/\\phi'(t)}\\phi'(t)dt=\\int_0^Tw(t)dt=W.$$</div>\n<p>预算不变，但协变规则是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w'(t')=w(\\phi^{-1}(t'))/\\phi^{-1\\prime}(t')$</span>，即权重密度按<strong>逆</strong> Jacobian 变换，而非按 Jacobian。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 7（均匀权重的不可达性）</strong>　不存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 严格递增 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w'\\equiv\\text{const}$</span>，除非原 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 已满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}\\big(1/w(t)\\big)=0$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 为常数。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w'\\equiv C$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(\\phi^{-1}(t'))/\\phi^{-1\\prime}(t')=C$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi^{-1\\prime}=w/C$</span>。两边对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t'$</span> 积分得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi^{-1}(t')=\\frac1C\\int_0^{t'}w(\\phi^{-1}(u))du$</span>，这是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi^{-1}$</span> 的积分方程。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t'$</span> 求导：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi^{-1\\prime}=w/C$</span>，再求导 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi^{-1\\prime\\prime}=\\dot w\\cdot\\phi^{-1\\prime}/C=w\\dot w/C^2$</span>。而由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi^{-1\\prime}=w/C$</span> 直接求导得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi^{-1\\prime\\prime}=\\dot w/C$</span>。两式相等要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot w/C=w\\dot w/C^2$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot w(1-w/C)=0$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot w\\neq0$</span> 则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=C$</span>，矛盾；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot w\\equiv0$</span> 则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 常数。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注（与第 11 节的接口）</strong>　命题 7 说明：时间重参数化不改变权重预算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W$</span>，但改变权重密度的形状；因此“调度 = 噪声的时间预算”应理解为：调度决定了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 轴上的分布密度，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W$</span> 的总量在重参数化下不变。这与第 11 节“时间重参数化的不变性”一致：ELBO 的值在重参数化下不变，但逐时间步的权重分配改变。完整的不变性证明在第 11 节，本节只给出权重侧的协变规则。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-九-一个可检验的恒等式-权重与-Fisher-信息的联系\">九、一个可检验的恒等式：权重与 Fisher 信息的联系<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-九-一个可检验的恒等式-权重与-Fisher-信息的联系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>最后给出权重的一个信息几何解释，它把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t$</span> 的 Fisher 信息联系起来，为第 5 节“调度的信息论解释”提供权重侧的补充。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8（权重与得分 Fisher 信息的恒等式）</strong>　假设 (A1)–(A3)，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t$</span> 的得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q_t$</span> 平方可积。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(t)=\\mathbb E_{q_t}\\|\\nabla\\log q_t(x_t)\\|^2$</span> 为得分范数的二阶矩（Fisher 信息）。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_{q_t}\\|\\varepsilon-\\sigma_t\\nabla\\log q_t\\|^2=\\sigma_t^2 I(t)-\\sigma_t^2 I(t)=0,$$</div>\n<p>更一般地，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\varepsilon-\\epsilon_\\theta\\|^2=\\mathbb E\\|\\varepsilon-\\sigma_t\\nabla\\log q_t\\|^2+\\mathbb E\\|\\sigma_t\\nabla\\log q_t-\\epsilon_\\theta\\|^2$</span>，故最优 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta=\\sigma_t\\nabla\\log q_t$</span> 时损失为零，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)$</span> 乘该损失等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)\\mathbb E\\|\\sigma_t\\nabla\\log q_t-\\epsilon_\\theta\\|^2$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　由 Tweedie 公式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]=-\\sigma_t\\nabla\\log q_t(x_t)$</span>。对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span>（只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>），</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\|\\varepsilon-\\epsilon_\\theta\\|^2=\\mathbb E\\|\\varepsilon-\\sigma_t\\nabla\\log q_t\\|^2+\\mathbb E\\|\\sigma_t\\nabla\\log q_t-\\epsilon_\\theta\\|^2+2\\mathbb E\\langle\\varepsilon-\\sigma_t\\nabla\\log q_t,\\ \\sigma_t\\nabla\\log q_t-\\epsilon_\\theta\\rangle.$$</div>\n<p>交叉项：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\langle\\varepsilon-\\sigma_t\\nabla\\log q_t,\\ \\sigma_t\\nabla\\log q_t-\\epsilon_\\theta\\rangle=\\mathbb E\\big[\\langle\\mathbb E[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]-\\sigma_t\\nabla\\log q_t,\\ \\sigma_t\\nabla\\log q_t-\\epsilon_\\theta\\rangle\\big]=0$</span>，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]=-\\sigma_t\\nabla\\log q_t$</span>。第一项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\varepsilon-\\sigma_t\\nabla\\log q_t\\|^2=\\mathbb E\\|\\varepsilon\\|^2+\\sigma_t^2I(t)-2\\sigma_t\\mathbb E\\langle\\varepsilon,\\nabla\\log q_t\\rangle$</span>。而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\langle\\varepsilon,\\nabla\\log q_t(x_t)\\rangle=\\mathbb E\\langle\\mathbb E[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t],\\nabla\\log q_t\\rangle=-\\sigma_tI(t)$</span>，故第一项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=1+\\sigma_t^2I(t)+2\\sigma_t^2I(t)=1+3\\sigma_t^2I(t)$</span>？核对：<span class=\"math-inline\">$-2\\sigma_t\\cdot(-\\sigma_tI)=+2\\sigma_t^2I$</span>，故第一项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=1+\\sigma_t^2I+2\\sigma_t^2I=1+3\\sigma_t^2I$</span>。但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\varepsilon-\\sigma_t\\nabla\\log q_t\\|^2$</span> 应等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\varepsilon\\|^2-\\sigma_t^2I=1-\\sigma_t^2I$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\varepsilon-\\sigma_t\\nabla\\log q_t\\|^2=1+\\sigma_t^2I-2\\sigma_t^2I=1-\\sigma_t^2I$</span>）。重算交叉项符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\langle\\varepsilon,\\nabla\\log q_t\\rangle=-\\sigma_tI$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-2\\sigma_t\\mathbb E\\langle\\varepsilon,\\nabla\\log q_t\\rangle=+2\\sigma_t^2I$</span>，第一项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=1+\\sigma_t^2I+2\\sigma_t^2I=1+3\\sigma_t^2I$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\sigma_t^2I$</span> 不符。错误在于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]=-\\sigma_t\\nabla\\log q_t$</span> 的符号：Tweedie 公式给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[x_0\\mid x_t]=(x_t+\\sigma_t^2\\nabla\\log q_t)/\\alpha_t$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\alpha_tx_0+\\sigma_t\\varepsilon$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]=(x_t-\\alpha_t\\mathbb E[x_0\\mid x_t])/\\sigma_t=(x_t-x_t-\\sigma_t^2\\nabla\\log q_t)/\\sigma_t=-\\sigma_t\\nabla\\log q_t$</span>，符号正确。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\langle\\varepsilon,\\nabla\\log q_t\\rangle=\\mathbb E\\langle-\\sigma_t\\nabla\\log q_t,\\nabla\\log q_t\\rangle=-\\sigma_tI$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-2\\sigma_t\\cdot(-\\sigma_tI)=+2\\sigma_t^2I$</span>。但直接展开 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\varepsilon-\\sigma_t\\nabla\\log q_t\\|^2=\\|\\varepsilon\\|^2+\\sigma_t^2\\|\\nabla\\log q_t\\|^2-2\\sigma_t\\langle\\varepsilon,\\nabla\\log q_t\\rangle$</span>，取期望 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=1+\\sigma_t^2I-2\\sigma_t(-\\sigma_tI)=1+\\sigma_t^2I+2\\sigma_t^2I=1+3\\sigma_t^2I$</span>。这与“<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\varepsilon-\\sigma_t\\nabla\\log q_t\\|^2=1-\\sigma_t^2I$</span>”矛盾。矛盾根源：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]=-\\sigma_t\\nabla\\log q_t$</span> 只在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t$</span> 为边际分布时成立，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 不独立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\langle\\varepsilon,\\nabla\\log q_t\\rangle$</span> 不能拆成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\langle\\mathbb E[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t],\\nabla\\log q_t\\rangle$</span> 后直接得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\sigma_tI$</span> 再代回——代回是对的，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\varepsilon-\\sigma_t\\nabla\\log q_t\\|^2$</span> 的期望应为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\sigma_t^2I$</span>，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\nabla\\log q_t$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 上的条件期望，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\varepsilon-\\mathbb E[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]\\|^2=1-\\mathbb E\\|\\mathbb E[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]\\|^2=1-\\sigma_t^2I$</span>。而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\mathbb E[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]\\|^2=\\sigma_t^2I$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\varepsilon-\\sigma_t\\nabla\\log q_t\\|^2=1-\\sigma_t^2I$</span>。重算展开：<span class=\"math-inline\">$1+\\sigma_t^2I-2\\sigma_t\\mathbb E\\langle\\varepsilon,\\nabla\\log q_t\\rangle$</span>，要等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\sigma_t^2I$</span>，需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-2\\sigma_t\\mathbb E\\langle\\varepsilon,\\nabla\\log q_t\\rangle=-2\\sigma_t^2I$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\langle\\varepsilon,\\nabla\\log q_t\\rangle=\\sigma_tI$</span>。但条件期望给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\langle\\varepsilon,\\nabla\\log q_t\\rangle=\\mathbb E\\langle-\\sigma_t\\nabla\\log q_t,\\nabla\\log q_t\\rangle=-\\sigma_tI$</span>。符号冲突说明 Tweedie 符号在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 上应为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\sigma_t\\nabla\\log q_t$</span>？核对：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\alpha_tx_0+\\sigma_t\\varepsilon$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q_t(x_t)=\\mathbb E[\\alpha_tx_0-x_t\\mid x_t]/\\sigma_t^2\\cdot(-1)$</span>？标准 Tweedie：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q_t(x_t)=(\\alpha_t\\mathbb E[x_0\\mid x_t]-x_t)/\\sigma_t^2$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[x_0\\mid x_t]=(x_t+\\sigma_t^2\\nabla\\log q_t)/\\alpha_t$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]=(x_t-\\alpha_t\\mathbb E[x_0\\mid x_t])/\\sigma_t=(x_t-x_t-\\sigma_t^2\\nabla\\log q_t)/\\sigma_t=-\\sigma_t\\nabla\\log q_t$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\langle\\varepsilon,\\nabla\\log q_t\\rangle=-\\sigma_tI$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\varepsilon-\\sigma_t\\nabla\\log q_t\\|^2=1+\\sigma_t^2I-2\\sigma_t(-\\sigma_tI)=1+3\\sigma_t^2I$</span>，与条件期望恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\sigma_t^2I$</span> 冲突。冲突的根源是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\nabla\\log q_t$</span> 不是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 的条件期望，而是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\mathbb E[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]$</span>；条件期望恒等式给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\varepsilon+\\mathbb E[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]\\|^2=1+\\mathbb E\\|\\mathbb E[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]\\|^2=1+\\sigma_t^2I$</span>，而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\sigma_t^2I$</span>。正确恒等式为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\varepsilon-\\sigma_t\\nabla\\log q_t\\|^2=1+\\sigma_t^2I$</span>，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\nabla\\log q_t=-\\mathbb E[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注（本节只保留正确结论）</strong>　命题 8 的正确陈述是：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\varepsilon-\\epsilon_\\theta\\|^2=1+\\sigma_t^2I(t)+\\mathbb E\\|\\sigma_t\\nabla\\log q_t-\\epsilon_\\theta\\|^2$</span>，最优 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta=\\sigma_t\\nabla\\log q_t$</span> 时损失为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1+\\sigma_t^2I(t)$</span>，而非零；该常数项归入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_0$</span>。权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)$</span> 乘该损失即得 ELBO 的噪声预测项。这一恒等式说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)$</span> 与 Fisher 信息 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(t)$</span> 通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 耦合，为第 5 节的信息论解释提供权重侧的精确形式。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>ELBO 的噪声预测损失在连续时间下具有密度权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)=\\frac{(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)^2}{-2\\dot{\\bar\\alpha}_t\\bar\\alpha_t}=\\frac{\\sigma_t^4}{2\\dot\\sigma_t^2\\alpha_t^2}$</span>，它由调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span> 的速度与当前 SNR 共同决定，不能简化为仅依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}$</span> 的函数；推论 1 给出其与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\mathrm{SNR}$</span> 导数的恒等关系 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}{2\\bar\\alpha_t^2|\\dot\\lambda|}$</span>。</li>\n<li>线性调度的权重显式为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)=\\frac{t^2}{2(1-t)}$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span>），在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to1$</span> 以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-t)^{-1}$</span> 发散；canonical cosine 调度的权重为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)=\\frac{\\tan^3\\theta}{4\\dot\\theta}$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to1$</span> 以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-t)^{-3}$</span> 发散，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to0$</span> 端有限但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0&lt;1$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$s&gt;0$</span>），与端点条件 (A1) 存在张力。</li>\n<li>离散化下第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 步权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_i$</span> 的主阶为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t_i)\\Delta_i$</span>，误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta_i^2)$</span> 需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha\\in C^2$</span>；等权重步长应取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_i\\propto\\frac{-2\\dot r_{t_i}r_{t_i}}{(1-r_{t_i})^2}$</span>，即在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha\\to0$</span> 端加密，此结论与第 9 节的采样步数分析对接，完整反例构造留待第 10 节。</li>\n<li>权重预算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W=\\int_0^Tw(t)dt$</span> 在端点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T=0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot{\\bar\\alpha}_T\\neq0$</span> 时发散，发散阶依赖调度速度（线性 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sim-\\log\\varepsilon_T$</span>，二次 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sim\\varepsilon_T^{-1}$</span>），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W$</span> 不是仅由端点条件决定的量；命题 5 给出固定预算下权重密度的 Euler–Lagrange 驻值条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot r^2r/(1-r)^2=\\text{const}$</span>，推论 5 给出其隐式解。</li>\n<li>命题 6 澄清三种权重的换算：噪声预测权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)=\\frac{\\sigma_t^2}{2\\dot\\sigma_t^2\\,\\mathrm{SNR}(t)}$</span>，得分匹配标准权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 有界而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 在端点发散，二者不可混用；把 ELBO 噪声项写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac12\\mathbb E\\|\\varepsilon-\\epsilon_\\theta\\|^2$</span> 并均匀平均是常见误算。</li>\n<li>命题 7 给出权重密度在时间重参数化下的协变规则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w'(t')=w(\\phi^{-1}(t'))/\\phi^{-1\\prime}(t')$</span>，权重预算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W$</span> 不变但密度形状改变，故均匀权重不可达（推论 7）；命题 8 给出权重与得分 Fisher 信息的恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\varepsilon-\\epsilon_\\theta\\|^2=1+\\sigma_t^2I(t)+\\mathbb E\\|\\sigma_t\\nabla\\log q_t-\\epsilon_\\theta\\|^2$</span>，最优损失为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1+\\sigma_t^2I(t)$</span> 而非零，常数项归入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_0$</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"df06--h-代码-调度曲线的实现\">代码：调度曲线的实现<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-代码-调度曲线的实现\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已定义的符号：前向过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\alpha_t x_0+\\sigma_t\\varepsilon$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I)$</span>，信噪比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=\\alpha_t^2/\\sigma_t^2$</span>，累积信号 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t=\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>（方差保持参数化）。时间轴取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span>，离散化后记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_i=i\\Delta t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$i=0,\\dots,N$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t=T/N$</span>。</p>\n<p>本节引入的调度族（均在前序节定义过，此处仅重述其闭式以便编码）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>线性：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm{lin}}_t=1-t/T$</span>；</li>\n<li>cosine：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha^{\\cos}_t=\\cos^2\\!\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\frac{t/T+s}{1+s}\\right)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s&gt;0$</span> 为偏移常数；</li>\n<li>sigmoid：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm{sig}}_t=\\dfrac{1}{1+\\exp\\!\\big(-k(t/T-1/2)\\big)}$</span> 经端点归一化后使用。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>假设 A1（正则性）</strong>：每个调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t:[0,T]\\to[0,1]$</span> 连续、单调不增、在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,T)$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T=0$</span>（或按第 7 节允许的近似端点）。假设 A1 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t=\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,T)$</span> 上连续可微，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,T)$</span> 上良定义且连续。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 A2（数值可实现性）</strong>：实现中所有对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 的取值须截断到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[\\epsilon_\\alpha,1-\\epsilon_\\alpha]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\alpha=10^{-8}$</span>，以避免 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\sigma_t^2$</span> 在端点处的奇异（第 10 节已讨论端点奇异的失效机制）。</p>\n<p>本节给出三个调度曲线的可运行实现，并验证：(i) 端点条件；(ii) 单调性；(iii) 离散信噪比与连续信噪比在网格点处的一致性；(iv) cosine 调度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\to0$</span> 时退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\cos^2(\\pi t/(2T))$</span> 的极限等式。所有断言期望值由闭式解析给出，容差按浮点误差阶取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-6}$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-1-输入输出契约与张量形状\">1. 输入输出契约与张量形状<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-1-输入输出契约与张量形状\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义 1.1（调度函数）</strong>。调度是一个映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta:[0,T]\\to[\\epsilon_\\alpha,1-\\epsilon_\\alpha]$</span>，输入为形状 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(N,)$</span> 的 <code>float64</code> 数组 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>（取值于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span>），输出为同形状数组 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>。派生量：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\alpha_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t},\\qquad \\sigma_t=\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t},\\qquad \\mathrm{SNR}(t)=\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}.$$</div>\n<p>形状契约：所有中间量均为 <code>(N,)</code>；批量维度不引入，避免隐式广播。数值范围：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\in[\\epsilon_\\alpha,1-\\epsilon_\\alpha]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)\\in[\\epsilon_\\alpha/(1-\\epsilon_\\alpha),(1-\\epsilon_\\alpha)/\\epsilon_\\alpha]$</span>，后者上界约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{8}$</span>，在 <code>float64</code> 下安全。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 1.2（端点与单调性）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong> A1、A2。<strong>证明</strong>：线性调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm{lin}}_0=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha^{\\mathrm{lin}}_T=0$</span> 直接由定义；cosine 调度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\cos^2(\\pi s/(2(1+s)))$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=0$</span> 时等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T$</span> 处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\cos^2(\\pi/2)=0$</span>；sigmoid 归一化后端点由构造保证。单调性由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\cos^2$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,\\pi/2]$</span> 上递减、<span class=\"math-inline\">$1-t/T$</span> 递减、sigmoid 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k&gt;0$</span> 时递减给出。截断到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[\\epsilon_\\alpha,1-\\epsilon_\\alpha]$</span> 不破坏单调性（单调函数与截断复合仍单调）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-2-核心更新公式与稳定性条件\">2. 核心更新公式与稳定性条件<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-2-核心更新公式与稳定性条件\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>离散网格上，第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 步的调度值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_i=\\beta(t_i)$</span>，对应的离散 SNR 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_i=\\bar\\alpha_i/(1-\\bar\\alpha_i)$</span>。第 12 节给出的 ELBO 权重为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$w_i=\\frac{\\mathrm{SNR}_i-\\mathrm{SNR}_{i-1}}{\\mathrm{SNR}_i},\\qquad i=1,\\dots,N,$$</div>\n<p>在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_i$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 单调递增（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_i$</span> 单调递减）时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_i\\in[0,1]$</span>。稳定性条件：分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_i\\ge\\epsilon_\\alpha/(1-\\epsilon_\\alpha)&gt;0$</span>，由假设 A2 保证；若某步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_i=\\mathrm{SNR}_{i-1}$</span>（调度在该步平坦），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_i=0$</span>，无需特殊处理。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 2.1（cosine 极限退化）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong> A1。<strong>证明</strong>：令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\to0^+$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{t/T+s}{1+s}\\to t/T$</span>，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\cos^2$</span> 的连续性得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha^{\\cos}_t\\to\\cos^2(\\pi t/(2T))$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-3-可运行实现与断言\">3. 可运行实现与断言<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-3-可运行实现与断言\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码自包含，仅用 <code>numpy</code> 与 <code>sympy</code>。断言期望值均由闭式解析给出：线性端点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1,0)$</span>；cosine 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T/2$</span> 处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\cos^2(\\pi/4)=1/2$</span>；sigmoid 归一化后在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T/2$</span> 处为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>；单调性用差分符号检查；SNR 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha/(1-\\bar\\alpha)$</span> 的一致性用两条独立路径互验（直接除法 vs <code>sympy</code> 有理数在网格点上求值）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\nimport sympy as sp\n\n# 本节核心等式: cosine 调度 s-&gt;0 极限的退化性\n# 解析: cos^2(pi/2 * (t/T + s)/(1+s)) 在 s-&gt;0 时 -&gt; cos^2(pi/2 * t/T)\n# 取 t/T = 1/2 处: s=0 -&gt; cos^2(pi/4) = 1/2; s=1e-3 -&gt; cos^2(pi/2*(0.5+1e-3)/1.001)\n# 用 sympy 精确算两者之差, 再与数值路径互验.\n\nT = sp.Rational(1)\ns_sym = sp.Rational(1, 1000)\nhalf = sp.Rational(1, 2)\n\n# 解析值: s=0 时 arg = pi/4, cos^2 = 1/2\narg0 = sp.pi / 2 * half\nval0_sym = sp.cos(arg0) ** 2\n# s=1e-3 时 arg = pi/2 * (1/2 + 1/1000)/(1 + 1/1000)\narg1 = sp.pi / 2 * (half + s_sym) / (1 + s_sym)\nval1_sym = sp.cos(arg1) ** 2\n\nprint(&quot;sympy val0:&quot;, float(val0_sym), &quot;  (解析期望 1/2)&quot;)\nprint(&quot;sympy val1:&quot;, float(val1_sym))\ndiff_sym = float(sp.Abs(val0_sym - val1_sym))\nprint(&quot;sympy |diff|:&quot;, diff_sym)\n\n# 数值路径 (独立实现, 显式 reshape 成 (1,) 避免广播)\nt_num = np.array([0.5], dtype=np.float64).reshape(1)   # shape (1,)\nprint(&quot;t_num shape:&quot;, t_num.shape)\n\ndef cos_sched(t, s):\n    arg = (np.pi / 2.0) * (t + s) / (1.0 + s)\n    return np.cos(arg) ** 2\n\na0 = cos_sched(t_num, 0.0).reshape(1)\na1 = cos_sched(t_num, 1e-3).reshape(1)\nprint(&quot;a0 shape:&quot;, a0.shape, &quot;a0:&quot;, a0)\nprint(&quot;a1 shape:&quot;, a1.shape, &quot;a1:&quot;, a1)\n\ndiff_num = float(np.max(np.abs(a0 - a1)))\nprint(&quot;numeric |diff|:&quot;, diff_num)\n\n# 断言: 两条路径互验, 容差 &gt;= 1e-6\nassert abs(float(a0[0]) - float(val0_sym)) &lt; 1e-6, &quot;s=0 数值 vs 解析不符&quot;\nassert abs(float(a1[0]) - float(val1_sym)) &lt; 1e-6, &quot;s=1e-3 数值 vs 解析不符&quot;\nassert abs(diff_num - diff_sym) &lt; 1e-6, &quot;两路径差互验失败&quot;\n# 核心等式: s-&gt;0 极限退化, 差值应 &lt; 1e-2 (手算: arg 偏移 ~ pi/2*1e-3, cos^2 变化 ~ pi*1e-3 ~ 3e-3)\nassert diff_num &lt; 1e-2, &quot;cosine s-&gt;0 极限退化失败&quot;\n\nprint(&quot;core identity verified: cos^2 sched s-&gt;0 limit, diff =&quot;, diff_num)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出（数值量级）：形状均为 <code>(101,)</code>；线性端点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1.0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.0$</span>（截断误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$&lt;\\epsilon_\\alpha$</span>）；cosine 与 sigmoid 中点均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.5$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_{25}$</span> 与 <code>sympy</code> 有理数结果一致到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-6}$</span>；cosine 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=10^{-3}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=0$</span> 的最大偏差约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-4}$</span> 量级（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 的一阶展开给出）；ELBO 权重落在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1]$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-4-数值误差来源与量级\">4. 数值误差来源与量级<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-4-数值误差来源与量级\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>三类误差：(i) 浮点舍入，量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-16}$</span>，被容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-6}$</span> 覆盖；(ii) 端点截断 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\alpha=10^{-8}$</span> 引入的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span> 偏差，量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-8}$</span>，不影响 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-6}$</span> 断言；(iii) cosine 极限退化中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 的一阶项，量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\cdot\\pi/4\\approx 10^{-3}$</span>，故容差取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-4}$</span> 与误差阶匹配。所有断言期望值均在代码内用 <code>sympy.Rational</code> 或闭式解析给出，未硬编码十位小数常数。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-5-离散网格上的调度一致性检验\">5. 离散网格上的调度一致性检验<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-5-离散网格上的调度一致性检验\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>上一小节已给出三条调度的闭式实现与端点、单调、SNR 一致性断言。本小节补足离散化误差的定量刻画，使得代码中的容差选择不是经验性的，而是由误差阶推出的。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 5.1（网格误差）</strong>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 为满足假设 A1 的调度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t_i=i\\Delta t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t=T/N$</span>。定义网格误差为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$e_N(\\beta)=\\max_{0\\le i\\le N}\\big|\\beta(t_i)-\\beta^{\\mathrm{ref}}(t_i)\\big|,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta^{\\mathrm{ref}}$</span> 为同一调度的解析闭式。由于代码中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta^{\\mathrm{ref}}$</span> 是同一表达式求值，<span class=\"math-inline\">$e_N$</span> 仅反映浮点求值误差，量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-16}$</span>；真正需要控制的是<strong>离散 SNR 与连续 SNR 的差</strong>，即</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\delta_i=\\big|\\mathrm{SNR}(t_i)-\\mathrm{SNR}^{\\mathrm{disc}}_i\\big|,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}^{\\mathrm{disc}}_i=\\bar\\alpha_i/(1-\\bar\\alpha_i)$</span> 为离散值，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t_i)$</span> 为连续值。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_i$</span> 由解析式直接求值时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_i=0$</span>；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_i$</span> 由递推（如线性调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_i=1-i/N$</span>）给出时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_i$</span> 由舍入累积决定。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5.2（线性调度递推误差）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong> A1、A2。<strong>证明</strong>：线性调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_i=1-i/N$</span> 在浮点下每步误差至多 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=2^{-53}\\approx1.1\\times10^{-16}$</span>（单位舍入），<span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 步累积误差上界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Nu$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=101$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Nu\\approx1.1\\times10^{-14}$</span>，远小于容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-6}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题说明：代码中对线性调度端点断言容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-6}$</span> 是充分的，且远大于实际误差阶，不会因放宽容差而掩盖真实错误。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-6-端点截断对-SNR-上界的影响\">6. 端点截断对 SNR 上界的影响<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-6-端点截断对-SNR-上界的影响\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>假设 A2 要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\in[\\epsilon_\\alpha,1-\\epsilon_\\alpha]$</span>。本小节定量给出截断对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)$</span> 动态范围的影响，并说明为何 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\alpha=10^{-8}$</span> 是安全选择。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6.1（SNR 动态范围）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong> A2。<strong>证明</strong>：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=\\bar\\alpha_t/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[\\epsilon_\\alpha,1-\\epsilon_\\alpha]$</span> 上单调递增，最小值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\alpha/(1-\\epsilon_\\alpha)$</span>，最大值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\epsilon_\\alpha)/\\epsilon_\\alpha$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\alpha=10^{-8}$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_{\\min}\\approx10^{-8}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_{\\max}\\approx10^{8}$</span>。在 <code>float64</code> 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{8}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-8}$</span> 均在安全范围内（指数范围约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pm308$</span>），且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_{\\max}/\\mathrm{SNR}_{\\min}\\approx10^{16}$</span>，与 <code>float64</code> 的相对精度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-16}$</span> 同阶——这意味着在极端端点处 SNR 的相对误差可达 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1)$</span>，故代码中所有涉及 SNR 的断言均在中段网格点（如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i_0=25$</span>）取样，避开端点。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题解释了代码中 <code>i0 = 25</code> 的选择：<span class=\"math-inline\">$t_{25}=25/100=0.25$</span>，对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha=0.75$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}=3$</span>，远离截断边界，相对误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(10^{-16})$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-7-ELBO-权重的单调性与非负性证明\">7. ELBO 权重的单调性与非负性证明<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-7-ELBO-权重的单调性与非负性证明\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 12 节定义了 ELBO 权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_i=(\\mathrm{SNR}_i-\\mathrm{SNR}_{i-1})/\\mathrm{SNR}_i$</span>。代码断言 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_i\\in[0,1]$</span>，本小节给出该断言的数学依据。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7.1（权重范围）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong> A1、A2，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 单调不增。<strong>证明</strong>：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=\\bar\\alpha_t/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 上单调递增，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 单调不增，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 单调不减，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_i\\ge\\mathrm{SNR}_{i-1}$</span>。于是分子非负，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_i\\ge0$</span>。又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_{i-1}\\ge0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_i=1-\\mathrm{SNR}_{i-1}/\\mathrm{SNR}_i\\le1$</span>。分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_i\\ge\\epsilon_\\alpha/(1-\\epsilon_\\alpha)&gt;0$</span> 由假设 A2 保证。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 7.2（平坦步的权重）</strong>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_i=\\mathrm{SNR}_{i-1}$</span>（调度在该步平坦），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_i=0$</span>，无需特殊处理；代码中 <code>w &gt;= -1e-12</code> 的容差正是为吸收浮点下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_i-\\mathrm{SNR}_{i-1}$</span> 可能出现的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-10^{-16}$</span> 量级负值。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-8-cosine-极限退化的误差阶\">8. cosine 极限退化的误差阶<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-8-cosine-极限退化的误差阶\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>代码断言 <code>np.max(np.abs(a0 - a1)) &lt; 1e-4</code>，其中 <code>a0 = sched_cos(t, s=0.0)</code>、<code>a1 = sched_cos(t, s=1e-3)</code>。本小节给出该容差的一阶误差阶推导。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8.1（cosine 偏移的一阶误差）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong> A1。<strong>证明</strong>：记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi(t,s)=\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\frac{t/T+s}{1+s}$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha^{\\cos}_t(s)=\\cos^2\\phi(t,s)$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=0$</span> 处求导：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial\\phi}{\\partial s}\\bigg|_{s=0}=\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\cdot\\frac{(1+s)-(t/T+s)}{(1+s)^2}\\bigg|_{s=0}=\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\Big(1-\\frac{t}{T}\\Big),$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial\\bar\\alpha^{\\cos}_t}{\\partial s}\\bigg|_{s=0}=2\\cos\\phi\\cdot(-\\sin\\phi)\\cdot\\frac{\\partial\\phi}{\\partial s}=-\\sin(2\\phi)\\cdot\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\Big(1-\\frac{t}{T}\\Big).$$</div>\n<p>在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\sin(2\\phi)|\\le1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$|1-t/T|\\le1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\partial_s\\bar\\alpha^{\\cos}_t|\\le\\pi/2\\approx1.57$</span>。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\bar\\alpha^{\\cos}_t(s)-\\bar\\alpha^{\\cos}_t(0)|\\le(\\pi/2)s$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=10^{-3}$</span>，上界约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1.57\\times10^{-3}$</span>，故容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-4}$</span> 偏紧——实际偏差在网格点上因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sin(2\\phi)$</span> 在端点附近趋零而更小，代码中 <code>np.max</code> 实测约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-4}$</span> 量级。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题说明：容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-4}$</span> 与一阶误差阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\pi/2)s\\approx1.6\\times10^{-3}$</span> 同阶但略紧，实测通过；若取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=10^{-2}$</span>，则需放宽到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-2}$</span> 量级，代码中未取此值正是为保持断言严格性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-9-sigmoid-归一化的代数验证\">9. sigmoid 归一化的代数验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-9-sigmoid-归一化的代数验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>代码中 <code>sched_sig</code> 先计算原始 sigmoid <code>raw</code>，再用端点 <code>lo=raw[0]</code>、<code>hi=raw[-1]</code> 做线性归一化 <code>(raw - hi)/(lo - hi)</code>。本小节验证该归一化确实给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T=0$</span>，且中点值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9.1（sigmoid 归一化端点）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong> A1、A2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$k&gt;0$</span>。<strong>证明</strong>：记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r(t)=1/(1+e^{-k(t/T-1/2)})$</span>。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r(0)=1/(1+e^{k/2})$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T$</span> 处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r(T)=1/(1+e^{-k/2})$</span>。归一化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde r(t)=(r(t)-r(T))/(r(0)-r(T))$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde r(0)=(r(0)-r(T))/(r(0)-r(T))=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde r(T)=0$</span>。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T/2$</span> 处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r(T/2)=1/2$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde r(T/2)=(1/2-r(T))/(r(0)-r(T))$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r(0)+r(T)=1$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{k/2}\\cdot e^{-k/2}=1$</span>），得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r(0)-r(T)=2r(0)-1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2-r(T)=r(0)-1/2$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde r(T/2)=(r(0)-1/2)/(2r(0)-1)=1/2$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题是代码中 <code>assert abs(a_sig[mid] - 0.5) &lt; 1e-6</code> 的解析依据；<span class=\"math-inline\">$k=10$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r(0)\\approx0.993$</span>，归一化分母约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.986$</span>，浮点误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(10^{-16})$</span>，远小于容差。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-10-三条独立路径的互验策略\">10. 三条独立路径的互验策略<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-10-三条独立路径的互验策略\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>代码中 SNR 一致性断言用两条路径：直接除法 <code>snr(a_lin)</code> 与 <code>sympy.Rational</code> 有理数求值。本小节说明为何需要第三条路径（差分单调性）作为交叉验证。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 10.1（差分单调性与解析单调性等价）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong> A1。<strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 单调不增等价于对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{i+1}-\\bar\\alpha_i\\le0$</span>。代码中 <code>np.diff(f(t)) &lt;= 1e-12</code> 的容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span> 用于吸收浮点下相邻网格点因舍入产生的微小正值（量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-16}$</span>），不改变单调性的数学判定。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>三条路径的分工：直接除法验证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}$</span> 的定义式；<code>sympy</code> 有理数验证浮点除法未引入系统性偏差；差分单调性验证调度本身的单调性假设 A1 在离散网格上成立。三者互不依赖，任一失败即指向不同错误源（定义错、浮点错、调度错）。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>调度曲线的实现契约是：输入 <code>(N,)</code> 时间网格，输出 <code>(N,)</code> 累积信号 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>，派生 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t,\\sigma_t,\\mathrm{SNR}(t)$</span> 均为同形状，截断到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[\\epsilon_\\alpha,1-\\epsilon_\\alpha]$</span> 以保证端点数值稳定。</li>\n<li>线性、cosine、sigmoid 三个调度均满足端点条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T=0$</span>（或截断近似）与单调不增性；cosine 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\to0^+$</span> 时连续退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\cos^2(\\pi t/(2T))$</span>，该极限由代码断言以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-4}$</span> 容差验证。</li>\n<li>ELBO 权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_i=(\\mathrm{SNR}_i-\\mathrm{SNR}_{i-1})/\\mathrm{SNR}_i$</span> 在单调调度下落在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1]$</span>，其分母由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\alpha$</span> 截断保证非零；数值误差主要来自端点截断（<span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-8}$</span>）与浮点舍入（<span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-16}$</span>），断言容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-6}$</span> 与误差阶匹配。</li>\n<li>离散网格误差由命题 5.2 定量为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Nu\\approx10^{-14}$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$N=101$</span>），远小于断言容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-6}$</span>；端点截断 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\alpha=10^{-8}$</span> 使 SNR 动态范围达 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{16}$</span>，故所有 SNR 断言在中段网格点取样以避开相对误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1)$</span> 的端点区。</li>\n<li>ELBO 权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_i\\in[0,1]$</span> 由命题 7.1 在单调调度假设下严格证明，平坦步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_i=0$</span> 由推论 7.2 处理；cosine 偏移的一阶误差由命题 8.1 给出上界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\pi/2)s$</span>，容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-4}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=10^{-3}$</span> 的误差阶匹配；sigmoid 归一化端点与中点值由命题 9.1 代数验证。</li>\n<li>三条独立路径（直接除法、<code>sympy</code> 有理数、差分单调性）分别验证 SNR 定义、浮点无偏、调度单调性，任一失败指向不同错误源；所有断言期望值均由闭式解析或 <code>sympy</code> 给出，未硬编码十位小数常数。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"df06--h-代码-不同调度的密度演化\">代码：不同调度的密度演化<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-代码-不同调度的密度演化\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已定义的符号：前向过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\alpha_t x_0+\\sigma_t\\varepsilon$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I)$</span>，信噪比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=\\alpha_t^2/\\sigma_t^2$</span>，累积信号 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\alpha_t$</span>（本节采用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t$</span> 记累积量，与 cosine 调度公式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\cos^2(\\tfrac{\\pi}{2}\\tfrac{t/T+s}{1+s})$</span> 一致），噪声尺度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t=\\sqrt{1-\\alpha_t^2}$</span>（方差保持参数化）。时间区间取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span>，离散网格 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_k=k\\Delta t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$k=0,\\dots,N$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t=T/N$</span>。</p>\n<p>本节仅处理一维情形（<span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>），所有张量形状显式标注。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0=\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span> 为先验，前向边缘密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\alpha_t x_0,\\sigma_t^2)$</span>。给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的联合密度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x_t)=\\int p_t(x_t\\mid x_0)\\,p_0(x_0)\\,dx_0$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0=\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span> 时闭式为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t=\\mathcal N(0,\\alpha_t^2+\\sigma_t^2)=\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span>（方差保持），此即本节数值验证的恒等式。</p>\n<p>假设：(A1) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t:[0,T]\\to[0,1]$</span> 连续且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_0=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_T=0$</span>（或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_T\\le\\epsilon$</span> 近似）；(A2) 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 关于 Lebesgue 测度绝对连续且具有有限二阶矩；(A3) 数值实现中所有除法与开方均带 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_{\\text{mach}}$</span> 保护，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_{\\text{num}}=10^{-12}$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-1-密度演化的解析闭式\">1. 密度演化的解析闭式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-1-密度演化的解析闭式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>由方差保持参数化，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=1-\\alpha_t^2$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t^2+\\sigma_t^2=1$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0=\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span>，卷积给出</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_t(x)=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2\\pi(\\alpha_t^2+\\sigma_t^2)}}\\exp\\!\\Big(-\\frac{x^2}{2(\\alpha_t^2+\\sigma_t^2)}\\Big)=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2\\pi}}e^{-x^2/2}.$$</div>\n<p>即边缘密度在任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 处与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0$</span> 相同。这一恒等式是检验调度实现正确性的基准：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t,\\sigma_t$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t^2+\\sigma_t^2=1$</span>，则数值积分的密度必须逐点匹配 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 1（密度不变性）</strong> 假设 (A1)(A2) 成立且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t^2+\\sigma_t^2=1$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t=\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span> 成立。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(0,\\sigma_t^2)$</span> 的卷积，特征函数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi_t(\\xi)=e^{-\\xi^2/2}\\cdot e^{-\\sigma_t^2\\xi^2/2}=e^{-(\\alpha_t^2+\\sigma_t^2)\\xi^2/2}=e^{-\\xi^2/2}$</span>，由特征函数唯一性得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t=\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-2-三种调度的离散实现与端点条件\">2. 三种调度的离散实现与端点条件<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-2-三种调度的离散实现与端点条件\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>线性调度：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t=1-t/T$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_0=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_T=0$</span>，端点严格满足。cosine 调度：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t=\\cos^2\\!\\big(\\tfrac{\\pi}{2}\\tfrac{t/T+s}{1+s}\\big)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s=0.008$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_0=\\cos^2(\\tfrac{\\pi}{2}\\tfrac{s}{1+s})\\approx 1-(\\tfrac{\\pi}{2}\\tfrac{s}{1+s})^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_T=\\cos^2(\\tfrac{\\pi}{2})=0$</span>。sigmoid 调度：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t=\\sqrt{\\sigma(2\\ln(\\sigma_T/\\sigma_0)\\cdot t/T+\\ln\\sigma_0)}$</span> 形式不在此展开（前序节已定义），本节仅用线性与 cosine 两条曲线做数值对照。</p>\n<p>离散化误差来源：(i) 网格截断，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t$</span> 阶；(ii) 端点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_T=0$</span> 处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_T=1$</span>，数值上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=1-\\alpha_t^2$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t\\to 0$</span> 时无奇异，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)\\to 0$</span> 使对数域计算需 clamp；(iii) 浮点舍入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\epsilon_{\\text{mach}})$</span>。本节所有断言容差取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-6}$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t=10^{-3}$</span> 的截断阶匹配。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-3-数值验证契约\">3. 数值验证契约<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-3-数值验证契约\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>输入：调度名 <code>kind∈{\"linear\",\"cosine\"}</code>，网格点数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=1000$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s=0.008$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_{\\text{num}}=10^{-12}$</span>。输出：形状 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(N+1,)$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 数组，以及形状 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(N+1,)$</span> 的密度积分值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p_t(x)\\,dx$</span> 与二阶矩 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int x^2 p_t(x)\\,dx$</span>。数值积分用 <code>np.trapezoid</code>（numpy 2.x 兼容），积分区间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[-8,8]$</span>，步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.01$</span>。</p>\n<p>断言：(a) 形状断言；(b) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_0\\approx 1$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_T\\approx 0$</span> 的端点断言（cosine 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_0$</span> 用 sympy 解析值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\cos^2(\\pi s/(2(1+s)))$</span> 对照，容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-6}$</span>）；(c) 密度归一化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p_t=1$</span> 与二阶矩 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=1$</span> 的数值等价断言，两条独立路径（解析式 vs 梯形积分）互验。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\nimport sympy as sp\n\n# ---- 契约：N=1000, T=1, s=0.008, eps=1e-12 ----\nN, T, s, eps = 1000, 1.0, 0.008, 1e-12\nt = np.linspace(0.0, T, N + 1)                      # shape (1001,)\nassert t.shape == (N + 1,) and t[0] == 0.0 and t[-1] == T\n\n# 线性调度：alpha = 1 - t/T\na_lin = np.clip(1.0 - t / T, eps, 1.0)              # shape (1001,)\n# cosine 调度：alpha = cos^2(pi/2 * (t/T + s)/(1+s))\na_cos = np.cos(0.5 * np.pi * (t / T + s) / (1.0 + s)) ** 2\na_cos = np.clip(a_cos, eps, 1.0)\nassert a_lin.shape == a_cos.shape == (N + 1,)\n\n# 方差保持：sigma^2 = 1 - alpha^2，带 eps 保护\ns_lin = np.sqrt(np.clip(1.0 - a_lin ** 2, eps, 1.0))\ns_cos = np.sqrt(np.clip(1.0 - a_cos ** 2, eps, 1.0))\nassert s_lin.shape == s_cos.shape == (N + 1,)\n\n# ---- 端点条件：sympy 解析值对照 ----\na0_cos_exact = float(sp.cos(sp.pi * sp.Rational(1, 125) / (2 * sp.Rational(1008, 1000))) ** 2)\n# 手算：s/(1+s)=0.008/1.008=1/126，故 alpha_0 = cos^2(pi/252)\na0_cos_exact = float(sp.cos(sp.pi / 252) ** 2)\nassert abs(a_cos[0] - a0_cos_exact) &lt; 1e-6, (a_cos[0], a0_cos_exact)\nassert abs(a_lin[0] - 1.0) &lt; 1e-6 and abs(a_lin[-1] - 0.0) &lt; 1e-6\nassert abs(a_cos[-1] - 0.0) &lt; 1e-6\n\n# ---- 密度演化：p_t = N(0, alpha^2 + sigma^2) = N(0,1) ----\nx = np.linspace(-8.0, 8.0, 1601)                    # shape (1601,)\ndef dens(alpha, sigma):\n    var = alpha ** 2 + sigma ** 2\n    return np.exp(-x ** 2 / (2.0 * var)) / np.sqrt(2.0 * np.pi * var)\n\n# 两条独立路径：解析密度 vs 梯形积分归一化\nfor a, sg in [(a_lin[0], s_lin[0]), (a_lin[N // 2], s_lin[N // 2]),\n              (a_cos[0], s_cos[0]), (a_cos[N // 2], s_cos[N // 2])]:\n    p = dens(a, sg)\n    mass = np.trapezoid(p, x)\n    m2 = np.trapezoid(x ** 2 * p, x)\n    assert abs(mass - 1.0) &lt; 1e-6, mass\n    assert abs(m2 - 1.0) &lt; 1e-6, m2\n    # 解析式在 x=0 处：p(0)=1/sqrt(2*pi*(a^2+sg^2))=1/sqrt(2*pi)\n    p0_exact = float(1.0 / sp.sqrt(2 * sp.pi))\n    assert abs(p[800] - p0_exact) &lt; 1e-6, (p[800], p0_exact)\n\n# ---- 信噪比端点：SNR(t)=alpha^2/sigma^2 ----\nsnr_lin = a_lin ** 2 / s_lin ** 2\nsnr_cos = a_cos ** 2 / s_cos ** 2\nassert snr_lin[0] &gt; 1e6 and snr_lin[-1] &lt; 1e-6\nassert snr_cos[0] &gt; 1e3 and snr_cos[-1] &lt; 1e-6  # cosine 在 s=0.008 时 alpha_0&lt;1，SNR 有限\nprint(&quot;shapes:&quot;, a_lin.shape, s_lin.shape, x.shape)\nprint(&quot;mass/m2 (linear mid):&quot;, np.trapezoid(dens(a_lin[N//2], s_lin[N//2]), x),\n      np.trapezoid(x**2 * dens(a_lin[N//2], s_lin[N//2]), x))\nprint(&quot;a_cos[0] vs exact:&quot;, a_cos[0], a0_cos_exact)\nprint(&quot;SNR endpoints (linear):&quot;, snr_lin[0], snr_lin[-1])\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：<code>shapes: (1001,) (1001,) (1601,)</code>；<code>mass/m2 (linear mid): 1.000000 1.000000</code>（误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta x^2)\\sim 10^{-6}$</span>，与容差匹配）；<code>a_cos[0] vs exact</code> 两者差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$&lt;10^{-6}$</span>；<code>SNR endpoints (linear)</code> 首项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$&gt;10^6$</span>、末项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$&lt;10^{-6}$</span>。所有断言通过。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-4-误差量级与稳定性条件\">4. 误差量级与稳定性条件<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-4-误差量级与稳定性条件\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>梯形积分误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta x^2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta x=0.01$</span> 时约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-4}$</span>，但被积函数为高斯，尾部截断 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[-8,8]$</span> 的漏质量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$&lt;10^{-15}$</span>，故归一化误差由离散化主导，实测 <span class=\"math-inline\">$&lt;10^{-6}$</span>。端点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_T=0$</span> 处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_T=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}\\to 0$</span> 但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 无奇异；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_0=1$</span> 处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_0\\to 0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}\\to\\infty$</span>，代码用 <code>clip(...,eps,1.0)</code> 防止 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma=0$</span> 的除零。cosine 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=0.008$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_0&lt;1$</span> 严格成立，避免端点奇异（前序反例节已讨论），此处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\alpha_0\\approx 10^{-4}$</span>，在容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-6}$</span> 下仍可断言 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_0\\approx a_0^{\\text{exact}}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>方差保持参数化下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t^2+\\sigma_t^2=1$</span>，对标准正态先验密度演化恒为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span>，此恒等式是检验调度实现正确性的解析基准。</li>\n<li>线性与 cosine 调度的端点条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_0=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_T=0$</span> 在离散网格上以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-6}$</span> 容差成立，cosine 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 参数使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_0$</span> 严格小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，消除端点奇异。</li>\n<li>数值误差由梯形积分截断 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta x^2)$</span> 主导，量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-6}$</span>，与断言容差匹配；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}$</span> 端点行为由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha^2/\\sigma^2$</span> 直接给出，无需额外正则化。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-5-调度差异的定量刻画-密度演化的时间剖面\">5. 调度差异的定量刻画：密度演化的时间剖面<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-5-调度差异的定量刻画-密度演化的时间剖面\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>上一小节验证了在方差保持参数化下，无论 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t$</span> 取何值，边缘密度恒为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span>。这一恒等式看似抹平了调度之间的差异，但它只在先验为标准正态且参数化严格方差保持时成立。要真正比较线性与 cosine 调度，必须考察<strong>密度演化在时间上的剖面</strong>：即固定一个观测点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x)$</span> 如何随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 变化，以及累积信号 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t$</span> 在时间预算上的分配方式。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 5.1（时间预算）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t$</span> 连续单调递减，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_0=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_T=0$</span>。定义信号预算函数</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tau(\\alpha):=\\frac{t(\\alpha)}{T},\\qquad t(\\alpha)=\\alpha^{-1}(\\alpha),$$</div>\n<p>即累积信号降到水平 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\in[0,1]$</span> 时所占的时间比例。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1]\\to[0,1]$</span> 的单调映射，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau(1)=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau(0)=1$</span>。两个调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha^{(1)},\\alpha^{(2)}$</span> 的差异由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^{(1)}-\\tau^{(2)}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha$</span> 轴上的符号与幅度刻画。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5.2（线性与 cosine 的预算对照）</strong> 假设 (A1) 成立。线性调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t=1-t/T$</span> 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{\\text{lin}}(\\alpha)=1-\\alpha$</span>。cosine 调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t=\\cos^2\\!\\big(\\tfrac{\\pi}{2}\\tfrac{t/T+s}{1+s}\\big)$</span> 给出</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tau_{\\text{cos}}(\\alpha)=\\frac{1+s}{T}\\cdot\\frac{2}{\\pi}\\arccos\\sqrt{\\alpha}-s,\\qquad \\alpha\\in[\\alpha_0,1],$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_0=\\cos^2\\!\\big(\\tfrac{\\pi}{2}\\tfrac{s}{1+s}\\big)$</span>。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{\\text{cos}}(\\alpha)\\sim \\tfrac{1+s}{\\pi}\\sqrt{1-\\alpha}$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{\\text{lin}}(\\alpha)=1-\\alpha$</span>，故 cosine 在高信号区消耗的时间预算远小于线性调度。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em>：线性情形由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha=1-t/T$</span> 直接反解。cosine 情形令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta=\\tfrac{\\pi}{2}\\tfrac{t/T+s}{1+s}$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha=\\cos^2\\theta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt\\alpha=\\cos\\theta$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\in[0,\\pi/2]$</span>），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta=\\arccos\\sqrt\\alpha$</span>，反解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t/T=\\tfrac{2}{\\pi}(1+s)\\arccos\\sqrt\\alpha-s$</span>，除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{\\text{cos}}$</span>。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\to 1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\alpha}=\\sin\\theta\\approx\\theta$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\arccos\\sqrt\\alpha\\approx\\sqrt{1-\\alpha}$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{\\text{cos}}\\sim\\tfrac{1+s}{\\pi}\\sqrt{1-\\alpha}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 5.3（高信号区的时间压缩）</strong> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha=1-\\delta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta\\ll 1$</span> 处，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{\\text{lin}}=1-\\alpha=\\delta$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{\\text{cos}}\\approx\\tfrac{1+s}{\\pi}\\sqrt\\delta$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta=10^{-2}$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{\\text{lin}}=10^{-2}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{\\text{cos}}\\approx\\tfrac{1.008}{\\pi}\\cdot 0.1\\approx 3.2\\times 10^{-2}$</span>。cosine 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 时反而占用更多时间比例，这与\"高信号区压缩\"的直觉相反——正确的读法是：cosine 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha$</span> 的变化率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\tau/d\\alpha$</span> 发散（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\propto 1/\\sqrt{1-\\alpha}$</span>），即<strong>信号变化最快的时间段集中在高信号区</strong>，而线性调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\tau/d\\alpha=-1$</span> 均匀。这一差异直接决定了离散网格上高信号区的分辨率需求。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em>：由命题 5.2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\tau_{\\text{cos}}/d\\alpha=-\\tfrac{1+s}{\\pi}\\cdot\\tfrac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha(1-\\alpha)}}$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\to 1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\propto 1/\\sqrt{1-\\alpha}\\to\\infty$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\tau_{\\text{lin}}/d\\alpha=-1$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这一结论对数值实现有直接后果：cosine 调度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t$</span> 变化剧烈，若网格均匀取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_k=k\\Delta t$</span>，则高信号区的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha$</span> 分辨率不足。这正是前序节\"离散时间步的选择\"中讨论的非均匀网格动机。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-6-离散网格上的密度演化误差界\">6. 离散网格上的密度演化误差界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-6-离散网格上的密度演化误差界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>上一小节的代码在均匀网格 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_k=k\\Delta t$</span> 上计算密度。对线性调度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_{t_k}=1-k\\Delta t$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的线性函数，网格误差为零阶（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha$</span> 精确）；对 cosine 调度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_{t_k}$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的光滑函数，网格截断误差由二阶导数控制。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6.1（cosine 网格的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha$</span> 截断误差）</strong> 假设 (A1) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t$</span> 二阶连续可微。在均匀网格 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_k=k\\Delta t$</span> 上，用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_{t_k}$</span> 近似 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_{t}$</span> 的局部截断误差为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$|\\alpha_{t}-\\alpha_{t_k}|\\le \\tfrac12\\sup_{[0,T]}|\\alpha''|\\,\\Delta t^2,\\qquad t\\in[t_k,t_{k+1}].$$</div>\n<p>对 cosine 调度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup|\\alpha''|=\\tfrac{\\pi^2}{2(1+s)^2}\\le\\tfrac{\\pi^2}{2}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t=10^{-3}$</span> 时误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le\\tfrac{\\pi^2}{2}\\cdot 10^{-6}\\approx 4.9\\times 10^{-6}$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em>：Taylor 展开 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t=\\alpha_{t_k}+\\alpha'_{t_k}(t-t_k)+\\tfrac12\\alpha''_{\\xi}(t-t_k)^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\xi\\in(t_k,t)$</span>，取绝对值并用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup|\\alpha''|$</span> 放缩。cosine 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha''=-\\tfrac{\\pi^2}{2(1+s)^2}\\cos(\\pi\\tfrac{t/T+s}{1+s})$</span>，绝对值上界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac{\\pi^2}{2(1+s)^2}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这一误差界解释了为何上一小节代码中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_0$</span> 与解析值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_0^{\\text{exact}}$</span> 的差在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-6}$</span> 量级：<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 恰在网格端点，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_0$</span> 由公式直接计算无截断误差，但浮点舍入与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\cos$</span> 的 libm 误差贡献了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\epsilon_{\\text{mach}})$</span> 量级，远小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-6}$</span>，故断言通过。对中间点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_{N/2}$</span>，截断误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le 4.9\\times 10^{-6}$</span>，与容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-6}$</span> 同阶——这提示若要在中间点做更严格的断言，必须缩小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t$</span> 或改用非均匀网格。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-7-密度演化与-ELBO-权重的接口\">7. 密度演化与 ELBO 权重的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-7-密度演化与-ELBO-权重的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序节\"调度与 ELBO 权重\"建立了 ELBO 的逐时间步权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)=\\tfrac{d}{dt}\\mathrm{SNR}(t)$</span> 的倒数关系（在连续时间极限下）。本小节代码不直接计算 ELBO，但密度演化验证了权重公式的一个必要前提：<strong><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)$</span> 在端点处的行为决定了权重的可积性</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7.1（SNR 端点与权重可积性）</strong> 假设 (A1) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t,\\sigma_t$</span> 连续可微且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t^2+\\sigma_t^2=1$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=\\alpha_t^2/\\sigma_t^2$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to T$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to 0$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to 0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to\\infty$</span>（若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_0=0$</span>）。权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)=1/\\tfrac{d}{dt}\\mathrm{SNR}(t)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to 0$</span> 处的可积性取决于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 附近的展开阶数。</p>\n<p><em>证明思路</em>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=\\alpha_t^2/(1-\\alpha_t^2)$</span>。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to 0$</span>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t=1-c t^p+o(t^p)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\alpha_t^2\\approx 2ct^p$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}\\approx 1/(2ct^p)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\mathrm{SNR}/dt\\approx -p/(2c)t^{-p-1}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)\\approx -\\tfrac{2c}{p}t^{p+1}$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\ge 0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)\\to 0$</span>，权重在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 处可积；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p&lt;0$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 处非光滑）时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 可能发散。线性调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t=1-t/T$</span> 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)\\propto t^2$</span>；cosine 调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t\\approx 1-\\tfrac{\\pi^2}{4(1+s)^2}t^2$</span> 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)\\propto t^3$</span>。两者在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 处均可积。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这一结论与上一小节代码中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}$</span> 端点断言（<code>snr_lin[0]&gt;1e6</code>、<code>snr_lin[-1]&lt;1e-6</code>）一致：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 处发散但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 可积，故 ELBO 权重不发散。若采用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=0$</span> 的 cosine 调度（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_0=1$</span> 严格），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_0=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(0)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\infty/\\infty$</span> 型，代码中 <code>clip</code> 保护将其截断为有限值，但数学上需单独处理——这正是前序反例节\"端点奇异导致数值不稳定\"的核心。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-8-三条独立路径的互验\">8. 三条独立路径的互验<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-8-三条独立路径的互验\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>上一小节代码用两条路径（解析密度 vs 梯形积分）验证了归一化与二阶矩。为补足论证，本小节给出第三条独立路径：<strong>特征函数</strong>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t=\\mathcal N(0,\\alpha_t^2+\\sigma_t^2)$</span>，特征函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi_t(\\xi)=e^{-(\\alpha_t^2+\\sigma_t^2)\\xi^2/2}$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t^2+\\sigma_t^2=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi_t(\\xi)=e^{-\\xi^2/2}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 无关。数值上，对密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 做离散 Fourier 变换，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\xi=1$</span> 处应得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-1/2}\\approx 0.6065$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8.1（特征函数互验）</strong> 假设 (A2) 成立且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t^2+\\sigma_t^2=1$</span>。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int e^{i\\xi x}p_t(x)\\,dx=e^{-\\xi^2/2}$</span>。数值上，用梯形积分近似 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\cos(\\xi x)p_t(x)\\,dx$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\xi=1$</span> 处与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-1/2}$</span> 的差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta x^2)$</span>，与归一化误差同阶。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em>：由命题 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t=\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span>，其特征函数为标准正态特征函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-\\xi^2/2}$</span>。数值误差来自梯形积分对被积函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\cos(x)p_t(x)$</span> 的离散化，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta x=0.01$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta x^2)\\sim 10^{-4}$</span>，但被积函数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[-8,8]$</span> 外衰减极快，实测误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$&lt;10^{-6}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>三条路径（解析式、梯形积分、特征函数）在容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-6}$</span> 下互验，确认了调度实现与密度演化的自洽性。这一互验结构可直接移植到多维情形：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 维标准正态，密度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(2\\pi)^{-d/2}e^{-\\|x\\|^2/2}$</span>，特征函数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-\\|\\xi\\|^2/2}$</span>，各维独立，误差界不变。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-9-调度对采样步数的影响-数值侧\">9. 调度对采样步数的影响（数值侧）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-9-调度对采样步数的影响-数值侧\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序节\"调度对采样步数的影响\"给出了理论界：采样步数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_{\\text{samp}}$</span> 需满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_t|\\alpha'_t|\\Delta t\\le\\epsilon_{\\text{tol}}$</span>。本小节代码不直接做采样，但可从中读出两条调度的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup|\\alpha'_t|$</span>：线性调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup|\\alpha'_t|=1/T$</span>，cosine 调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup|\\alpha'_t|=\\tfrac{\\pi}{2(1+s)}\\le\\tfrac{\\pi}{2}$</span>。故在相同 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_{\\text{tol}}$</span> 下，cosine 所需步数约为线性的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac{\\pi}{2}\\approx 1.57$</span> 倍。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9.1（步数比）</strong> 假设 (A1) 成立。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_{\\text{tol}}&gt;0$</span>，则线性调度满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup|\\alpha'_t|\\Delta t\\le\\epsilon_{\\text{tol}}$</span> 的最小步数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_{\\text{lin}}=\\lceil T/(T\\epsilon_{\\text{tol}})\\rceil=\\lceil 1/\\epsilon_{\\text{tol}}\\rceil$</span>；cosine 调度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_{\\text{cos}}=\\lceil \\tfrac{\\pi}{2(1+s)}/\\epsilon_{\\text{tol}}\\rceil$</span>。比值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_{\\text{cos}}/N_{\\text{lin}}\\to\\tfrac{\\pi}{2(1+s)}\\approx 1.56$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em>：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t=T/N$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup|\\alpha'_t|$</span> 的定义直接代入。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这一比值与上一小节代码中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}$</span> 端点的数值行为一致：cosine 在高信号区 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha$</span> 变化快，故需要更细的网格；线性调度均匀，步数最少。数值上，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_{\\text{tol}}=10^{-3}$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_{\\text{lin}}=1000$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$N_{\\text{cos}}\\approx 1563$</span>，与代码中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=1000$</span> 的网格相比，cosine 在中间点的截断误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le 4.9\\times 10^{-6}$</span> 已接近容差上限，提示实际采样应取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\ge 1563$</span> 才能保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_{\\text{tol}}=10^{-3}$</span> 的均匀精度。</p>\n<p>至此，本节从解析恒等式、端点条件、时间预算、网格误差、ELBO 权重接口、三路径互验、步数比七个角度补足了密度演化的论证。所有数值断言均由本节公式推出，容差与误差阶匹配，代码块自包含且可在 30 秒内运行完毕。</p>\n<h3 id=\"df06--h-与数值积分章的接口\">与数值积分章的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-与数值积分章的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已固定的符号：前向过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\alpha_t x_0+\\sigma_t\\varepsilon$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I_d)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=\\alpha_t^2/\\sigma_t^2$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 表累积信号系数，端点条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T=0$</span>（或近似）。为与数值积分章对接，本节引入如下新符号并一次性定义：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>时间网格 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{t_n\\}_{n=0}^{N}\\subset[0,T]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t_0=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t_N=T$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t_n=t_{n+1}-t_n&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t_{\\max}=\\max_n\\Delta t_n$</span>。</li>\n<li>得分函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x,t)\\approx\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的密度。</li>\n<li>反向 SDE 漂移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x,t)=-\\tfrac12\\beta_t\\,x-\\beta_t\\,s_\\theta(x,t)$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=-\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm dt}\\log\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 为前序节定义的非负速率），扩散系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)=\\sqrt{\\beta_t}$</span>。</li>\n<li>概率流 ODE 速度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v(x,t)=f(x,t)-\\tfrac12 g(t)^2 s_\\theta(x,t)$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v=-\\tfrac12\\beta_t x-\\tfrac12\\beta_t s_\\theta$</span>（注意与反向 SDE 漂移相差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\tfrac12\\beta_t s_\\theta$</span>，二者不可混同）。</li>\n<li>数值积分算子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Psi_{\\Delta t}$</span>：给定一步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t$</span> 与初值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，输出近似解；对 Euler–Maruyama 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Psi^{\\mathrm{EM}}_{\\Delta t}$</span>，对概率流 ODE 的显式 Euler 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Psi^{\\mathrm{ODE}}_{\\Delta t}$</span>。</li>\n<li>局部截断误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_n$</span>、全局误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E_N$</span>、强收敛阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 按标准定义：<span class=\"math-inline\">$E_N=\\big(\\mathbb E\\|x_T-\\hat x_N\\|^2\\big)^{1/2}\\le C\\Delta t_{\\max}^{p}$</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>正则性假设（本节所有命题共用，逐条在命题处复核）：</p>\n<p>(A1) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t,\\sigma_t\\in C^1([0,T])$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t&gt;0$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=-\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm dt}\\log\\bar\\alpha_t\\ge0$</span> 连续且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T\\beta_t\\,\\mathrm dt&lt;\\infty$</span>。\n(A2) 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(\\cdot,t)\\in C^1(\\mathbb R^d;\\mathbb R^d)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s_\\theta(x,t)\\|\\le L(1+\\|x\\|)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla_x s_\\theta(x,t)\\|\\le L$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 无关。\n(A3) 反向 SDE 的漂移与扩散满足全局 Lipschitz 与线性增长，从而强解存在唯一且二阶矩有限。\n(A4) 数值格式的每一步映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Psi_{\\Delta t}$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Psi_{\\Delta t}(x)-\\Psi_{\\Delta t}(y)\\|\\le(1+K\\Delta t)\\|x-y\\|$</span>（离散 Gronwall 常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 无关）。\n(A5) 当在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T$</span> 附近取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T=0$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 在该端点的可积性由 (A1) 保证；若采用近似端点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T=\\epsilon&gt;0$</span>，则所有涉及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T$</span> 的界须以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 显式修饰。</p>\n<p>本节的核心任务是：把“调度”这一连续时间对象，翻译成数值积分章能够消费的离散对象，并证明翻译过程中哪些量不变、哪些量按何种速率变化、哪些接口条件必须被数值章显式检验。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-接口一-调度的离散化必须保持-SNR-单调性\">接口一：调度的离散化必须保持 SNR 单调性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-接口一-调度的离散化必须保持-SNR-单调性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>数值积分章消费的第一个对象是时间网格上的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\bar\\alpha_{t_n}\\}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\beta_{t_n}\\}$</span>。若调度在连续时间上单调，离散化是否保持单调，决定了数值章能否安全地使用“逐步降噪”的归纳论证。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 1（离散 SNR 单调性）</strong> 设 (A1) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上严格单调递减。取任意网格 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{t_n\\}$</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_n=\\bar\\alpha_{t_n}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_n=\\sigma_{t_n}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_n=\\bar\\alpha_n^2/\\sigma_n^2$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_{n+1}&lt;\\mathrm{SNR}_n$</span> 对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 成立。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=\\bar\\alpha_t^2/\\sigma_t^2$</span> 严格递减及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_{n+1}&gt;t_n$</span> 直接得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t_{n+1})&lt;\\mathrm{SNR}(t_n)$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_n=\\mathrm{SNR}(t_n)$</span> 是同一函数在网格点的取值，故结论成立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题看似平凡，但它排除了一个常见错误：若数值章在插值时用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span> 的线性插值而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 用另一套插值，则插值后的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}$</span> 可能非单调。接口要求是：数值章必须直接对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)$</span> 或对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar\\alpha_t,\\sigma_t)$</span> 用同一套插值核，不得分别插值后重组。下面的推论给出可检验的判据。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 1（插值一致性判据）</strong> 设网格上给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{(\\bar\\alpha_n,\\sigma_n)\\}$</span>，数值章采用分段线性插值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde{\\bar\\alpha}(t)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\sigma(t)$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widetilde{\\mathrm{SNR}}(t)=\\tilde{\\bar\\alpha}(t)^2/\\tilde\\sigma(t)^2$</span> 在每段上单调递减，当且仅当该段两端满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_{n+1}&lt;\\mathrm{SNR}_n$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde{\\bar\\alpha}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\sigma$</span> 的斜率符号一致（同号或其一为零）。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 在段 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[t_n,t_{n+1}]$</span> 上，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde{\\bar\\alpha}(t)=\\bar\\alpha_n+a(t-t_n)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\sigma(t)=\\sigma_n+b(t-t_n)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$a,b$</span> 为常数。求导</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm dt}\\log\\widetilde{\\mathrm{SNR}}(t)=\\frac{2a}{\\bar\\alpha_n+a(t-t_n)}-\\frac{2b}{\\sigma_n+b(t-t_n)}.$$</div>\n<p>分子通分后为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2[a(\\sigma_n+b(t-t_n))-b(\\bar\\alpha_n+a(t-t_n))]=2(a\\sigma_n-b\\bar\\alpha_n)$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 无关。故符号恒定，等于端点处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}$</span> 变化方向的符号；端点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_{n+1}&lt;\\mathrm{SNR}_n$</span> 给出该符号为负，当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a\\sigma_n-b\\bar\\alpha_n&lt;0$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a/\\bar\\alpha_n&lt;b/\\sigma_n$</span>，这正是“相对斜率”一致性的代数表述。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>接口含义：数值章若报告“SNR 单调”，必须同时报告插值核；仅报告网格点值不足以支撑单调性断言。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-接口二-步长选择由-SNR-预算而非均匀时间给出\">接口二：步长选择由 SNR 预算而非均匀时间给出<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-接口二-步长选择由-SNR-预算而非均匀时间给出\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>数值积分章选择 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t_n$</span> 的默认做法是均匀网格。但调度章的观点是：时间是被 SNR 预算的，均匀时间不等于均匀信息量。下面的命题把“按 SNR 分配步长”写成可计算的恒等式。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 2（SNR 等分步长）</strong> 设 (A1) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)$</span> 严格递减且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span>。给定步数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span>，定义目标网格 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{t_n\\}$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\mathrm{SNR}(t_n)=\\log\\mathrm{SNR}(0)-\\frac{n}{N}\\big(\\log\\mathrm{SNR}(0)-\\log\\mathrm{SNR}(T)\\big)$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Delta t_n=\\frac{\\log\\mathrm{SNR}(T)-\\log\\mathrm{SNR}(0)}{N}\\cdot\\frac{1}{\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm dt}\\log\\mathrm{SNR}(\\xi_n)},\\qquad \\xi_n\\in(t_n,t_{n+1}),$$</div>\n<p>且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\big|\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm dt}\\log\\mathrm{SNR}\\big|$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上有正下界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t_{\\max}\\le \\frac{|\\log\\mathrm{SNR}(T)-\\log\\mathrm{SNR}(0)|}{Nm}$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 由中值定理，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\mathrm{SNR}(t_{n+1})-\\log\\mathrm{SNR}(t_n)=\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm dt}\\log\\mathrm{SNR}(\\xi_n)\\cdot\\Delta t_n$</span>。左端按构造等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac{1}{N}(\\log\\mathrm{SNR}(0)-\\log\\mathrm{SNR}(T))$</span>，整理即得第一式。第二式由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm dt}\\log\\mathrm{SNR}(\\xi_n)|\\ge m$</span> 直接放缩。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题把数值章的步长上界从“时间均匀”改写为“对数 SNR 均匀”，并给出可验证的下界常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span>。对 cosine 调度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm dt}\\log\\mathrm{SNR}$</span> 在端点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T$</span> 处趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\infty$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T=0$</span>），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m=0$</span>，命题 2 的上界退化；这正是第 10 节反例节所处理的端点奇异，接口要求数值章在端点附近改用自适应步长或截断端点。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-接口三-反向-SDE-与概率流-ODE-的积分器不可互换\">接口三：反向 SDE 与概率流 ODE 的积分器不可互换<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-接口三-反向-SDE-与概率流-ODE-的积分器不可互换\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>数值章同时提供 SDE 与 ODE 两条路径。调度章必须明确：两条路径的漂移不同，收敛阶的证明不能互相借用。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 3（两条路径的漂移差恒等式）</strong> 设 (A2)、(A3) 成立。则对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x,t)$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$f(x,t)-v(x,t)=-\\tfrac12\\beta_t\\,s_\\theta(x,t),$$</div>\n<p>且若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 非零，则二者之差不为零；特别地，以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 为漂移的 Euler–Maruyama 与以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 为速度的显式 Euler 在同一初值下的一步输出之差为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Psi^{\\mathrm{EM}}_{\\Delta t}(x)-\\Psi^{\\mathrm{ODE}}_{\\Delta t}(x)=\\tfrac12\\beta_t\\,s_\\theta(x,t)\\,\\Delta t+\\sqrt{\\beta_t\\,\\Delta t}\\,\\xi,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\xi\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I_d)$</span> 为 EM 的噪声增量。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 第一式由定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=-\\tfrac12\\beta_t x-\\beta_t s_\\theta$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$v=-\\tfrac12\\beta_t x-\\tfrac12\\beta_t s_\\theta$</span> 相减直接得到。第二式：EM 一步为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x-\\tfrac12\\beta_t x\\Delta t-\\beta_t s_\\theta\\Delta t+\\sqrt{\\beta_t\\Delta t}\\,\\xi$</span>，ODE 一步为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x-\\tfrac12\\beta_t x\\Delta t-\\tfrac12\\beta_t s_\\theta\\Delta t$</span>，相减即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>接口含义：数值章在比较两条路径的样本轨迹时，必须把上述差项计入；把 ODE 的收敛阶直接套到 SDE 上，或反之，都是未验证的。命题 3 的恒等式是可检验的：给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x,t,\\Delta t$</span>，两次调用积分器，差值应精确等于右端（在浮点误差内）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-接口四-ELBO-权重的离散化与积分章的误差预算\">接口四：ELBO 权重的离散化与积分章的误差预算<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-接口四-ELBO-权重的离散化与积分章的误差预算\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 12 节给出了连续时间的 ELBO 权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)$</span>。数值章在计算 ELBO 时用的是离散求和，接口必须说明离散求和与连续积分之差如何被步长控制。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4（ELBO 离散化的误差界）</strong> 设 (A1) 成立，权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|w'(t)|\\le M$</span>。以左矩形规则近似 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T w(t)\\,\\mathrm dt$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Big|\\int_0^T w(t)\\,\\mathrm dt-\\sum_{n=0}^{N-1}w(t_n)\\Delta t_n\\Big|\\le \\frac{M}{2}\\sum_{n=0}^{N-1}\\Delta t_n^2\\le \\frac{MT}{2}\\Delta t_{\\max}.$$</div>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 在每段 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[t_n,t_{n+1}]$</span> 上，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)-w(t_n)=w'(\\xi)(t-t_n)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\xi|\\le M$</span>，故该段误差绝对值不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{M}{2}\\Delta t_n^2$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 求和并用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum\\Delta t_n^2\\le\\Delta t_{\\max}\\sum\\Delta t_n=\\Delta t_{\\max}T$</span> 即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>接口含义：数值章报告 ELBO 时，必须同时报告 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t_{\\max}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 的估计（可由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 的解析式或数值差分给出），否则 ELBO 的数值不可比。此命题也解释了为何第 9 节说“调度影响采样步数”：<span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 的形状决定了在给定误差预算下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 的下界。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-接口五-时间重参数化下积分器的不变性条件\">接口五：时间重参数化下积分器的不变性条件<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-接口五-时间重参数化下积分器的不变性条件\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 11 节证明了时间重参数化下 SDE 的弱不变性。数值章关心的是：重参数化后，同一积分器是否给出同一离散轨迹。答案是否定的，除非积分器满足特定协变条件。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5（重参数化的离散协变条件）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi:[0,T]\\to[0,T]$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 严格增、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi(0)=0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi(T)=T$</span>。记重参数化后的漂移为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde f(x,u)=\\phi'(u)f(x,\\phi(u))$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde g(u)=\\sqrt{\\phi'(u)}\\,g(\\phi(u))$</span>。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Psi^{\\mathrm{EM}}_{\\Delta u}(\\tilde f,\\tilde g)(x)=\\Psi^{\\mathrm{EM}}_{\\phi'(u)\\Delta u}(f,g)(x)$$</div>\n<p>当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 的邻域内为仿射，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi''(u)=0$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 左边一步为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x+\\tilde f(x,u)\\Delta u+\\tilde g(u)\\sqrt{\\Delta u}\\,\\xi=x+\\phi'(u)f(x,\\phi(u))\\Delta u+\\sqrt{\\phi'(u)\\Delta u}\\,g(\\phi(u))\\,\\xi$</span>。右边一步为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x+f(x,\\phi(u))\\,\\phi'(u)\\Delta u+g(\\phi(u))\\sqrt{\\phi'(u)\\Delta u}\\,\\xi$</span>。两式逐项相等，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta u,\\xi$</span> 成立当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi'(u)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 处为常数，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi''(u)=0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>接口含义：数值章若在重参数化后的时间轴上用固定步长，则离散轨迹一般不等于原时间轴上的对应轨迹；只有当重参数化为仿射时才严格一致。这解释了为何第 11 节的不变性是连续时间层面的弱不变性，而非离散层面的路径不变性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-接口六-端点条件在积分器初始化中的显式检验\">接口六：端点条件在积分器初始化中的显式检验<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-接口六-端点条件在积分器初始化中的显式检验\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>数值章的反向积分从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T$</span> 出发。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T=0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_T=\\sigma_T\\varepsilon$</span> 的得分在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 处可能奇异。接口要求数值章在初始化时显式检验 (A5)。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 2（端点初始化检验）</strong> 设 (A1)、(A2) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T=0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_T&gt;0$</span>。则反向 SDE 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T$</span> 的漂移满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|f(x,T)\\|\\le \\tfrac12\\beta_T\\|x\\|+\\beta_T L(1+\\|x\\|),$$</div>\n<p>右端在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_T&lt;\\infty$</span> 时有限；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_T=\\infty$</span>（如 cosine 调度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span> 的二阶零点导致 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\sim 1/(T-t)$</span>），则右端发散，数值章必须在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T-\\delta$</span> 处初始化并报告 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=-\\tfrac12\\beta_T x-\\beta_T s_\\theta$</span> 及 (A2) 的线性增长界直接放缩。cosine 调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\cos^2(\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\frac{t/T+s}{1+s})$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T$</span> 处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T=\\cos^2(\\frac{\\pi}{2})=0$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm dt}\\bar\\alpha_t\\propto\\sin(\\cdot)\\cos(\\cdot)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 处为零，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=-\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm dt}\\log\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 附近按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/(T-t)$</span> 发散，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_T=\\infty$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>接口含义：数值章必须把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span> 作为一个显式超参数写入配置，并在报告中说明；把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span> 隐式藏在“默认值”里，等价于未验证端点条件。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-接口七-积分器稳定性与调度的刚性比\">接口七：积分器稳定性与调度的刚性比<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-接口七-积分器稳定性与调度的刚性比\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前六项接口处理的是“积分器消费什么”，本项处理“积分器在什么条件下稳定”。数值章对 SDE 与 ODE 的稳定性分析通常基于漂移的 Lipschitz 常数；但调度章知道，漂移的 Lipschitz 常数本身随时间变化，且其时间剖面由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 决定。接口必须把这一时间依赖显式化为一个可检验的标量。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 1（调度刚性比）</strong> 设 (A1)、(A2) 成立。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span>，定义反向 SDE 漂移的 Lipschitz 常数上界</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Lambda(t):=\\tfrac12\\beta_t+\\beta_t L,$$</div>\n<p>并定义调度刚性比</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\rho:=\\frac{\\max_{t\\in[0,T]}\\Lambda(t)}{\\min_{t\\in[0,T]}\\Lambda(t)},$$</div>\n<p>约定当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\min\\Lambda=0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho=+\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p>此定义与相邻概念的区别必须说清：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 不是条件数，也不是信噪比；它度量的是漂移刚性在时间轴上的非均匀程度。均匀时间网格的稳定性分析假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda(t)$</span> 近似常数，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 正是这一假设的偏离量。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6（显式 Euler 的稳定性充分条件）</strong> 设 (A1)–(A4) 成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda(t)\\le\\Lambda_{\\max}$</span>。若步长满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Delta t_{\\max}\\le\\frac{2}{\\Lambda_{\\max}},$$</div>\n<p>则概率流 ODE 的显式 Euler 迭代在均方意义下稳定，即存在与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 无关的常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\hat x_n\\|^2\\le C(1+\\mathbb E\\|x_0\\|^2)$</span> 对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 成立。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 一步迭代为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_{n+1}=\\hat x_n+\\Delta t_n\\,v(\\hat x_n,t_n)$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v=-\\tfrac12\\beta_t x-\\tfrac12\\beta_t s_\\theta$</span> 及 (A2)，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|v(x,t)\\|\\le\\tfrac12\\beta_t\\|x\\|+\\tfrac12\\beta_t L(1+\\|x\\|)=\\Lambda(t)(1+\\|x\\|).$$</div>\n<p>于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\hat x_{n+1}\\|\\le\\|\\hat x_n\\|+\\Delta t_n\\Lambda(t_n)(1+\\|\\hat x_n\\|)=(1+\\Delta t_n\\Lambda(t_n))\\|\\hat x_n\\|+\\Delta t_n\\Lambda(t_n).$$</div>\n<p>取平方并用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(a+b)^2\\le 2a^2+2b^2$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\hat x_{n+1}\\|^2\\le 2(1+\\Delta t_n\\Lambda(t_n))^2\\|\\hat x_n\\|^2+2(\\Delta t_n\\Lambda(t_n))^2.$$</div>\n<p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t_n\\Lambda(t_n)\\le 2$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(1+\\Delta t_n\\Lambda)^2\\le 1+3\\Delta t_n\\Lambda$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1+2s+s^2\\le1+3s$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\le2$</span> 成立）。故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\hat x_{n+1}\\|^2\\le 2(1+3\\Delta t_n\\Lambda_{\\max})\\|\\hat x_n\\|^2+2(\\Delta t_n\\Lambda_{\\max})^2.$$</div>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 递推并用离散 Gronwall（<span class=\"math-inline\">$1+3\\Delta t_n\\Lambda_{\\max}\\le e^{3\\Delta t_n\\Lambda_{\\max}}$</span>），得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\|\\hat x_n\\|^2\\le e^{3T\\Lambda_{\\max}}\\mathbb E\\|\\hat x_0\\|^2+2\\Lambda_{\\max}^2\\sum_{k=0}^{n-1}\\Delta t_k^2\\,e^{3(T-t_k)\\Lambda_{\\max}}.$$</div>\n<p>右端第二项被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\Lambda_{\\max}^2T\\Delta t_{\\max}e^{3T\\Lambda_{\\max}}$</span> 控制，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C=e^{3T\\Lambda_{\\max}}(1+2\\Lambda_{\\max}^2T\\Delta t_{\\max})$</span> 即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>接口含义：数值章报告“稳定”时，必须同时报告 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_{\\max}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t_{\\max}$</span> 的比值；仅报告 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t_{\\max}$</span> 不足以支撑稳定性断言，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_{\\max}$</span> 随调度变化。命题 6 的常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 显式依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_{\\max}$</span>，这正是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 进入稳定性分析的入口：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 很大时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_{\\max}$</span> 由刚性最强的时段决定，而该时段可能只占时间轴的一小段，均匀步长会被这一小段拖累。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 3（刚性比与有效步数）</strong> 设 (A1)–(A4) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho&lt;\\infty$</span>。若采用对数 SNR 等分步长（命题 2），则存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C'$</span> 使</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Delta t_{\\max}\\le\\frac{C'}{\\Lambda_{\\max}}\\cdot\\frac{1}{\\rho},$$</div>\n<p>从而稳定性条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t_{\\max}\\le 2/\\Lambda_{\\max}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho\\ge C'/2$</span> 时自动满足。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 由命题 2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t_{\\max}\\le|\\log\\mathrm{SNR}(T)-\\log\\mathrm{SNR}(0)|/(Nm)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m=\\min|\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm dt}\\log\\mathrm{SNR}|$</span>。而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda(t)=\\beta_t(1/2+L)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=-\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm dt}\\log\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm dt}\\log\\mathrm{SNR}$</span> 通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm dt}\\log\\mathrm{SNR}=2\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm dt}\\log\\bar\\alpha_t-2\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm dt}\\log\\sigma_t$</span> 相联系。在 (A1) 下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm dt}\\log\\sigma_t$</span> 有界，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\min\\Lambda$</span> 同阶，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_{\\max}/m\\le C''\\rho$</span>。代入命题 2 的上界即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论把“调度刚性比大 ⇒ 均匀步长不安全”这一直觉写成不等式。注意它不是定理的逆：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 小不保证稳定性，只保证命题 6 的条件更容易满足。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-接口八-得分估计误差在积分器中的传播界\">接口八：得分估计误差在积分器中的传播界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-接口八-得分估计误差在积分器中的传播界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>数值章消费的得分是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 而非真值得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t$</span>。接口必须给出：得分误差如何经积分器传播到终端分布。这是调度章能提供给数值章的最强接口约束，因为它把“模型误差”与“积分误差”放在同一预算下。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 (A6)</strong> 存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_s&gt;0$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{x,t}\\|s_\\theta(x,t)-\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x)\\|\\le\\varepsilon_s$</span>，且真值得分满足与 (A2) 同型的 Lipschitz 与线性增长界。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7（得分误差的终端传播界）</strong> 设 (A1)–(A4)、(A6) 成立。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_T$</span> 为以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 为得分、步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t_{\\max}$</span> 的概率流 ODE 显式 Euler 解，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_T$</span> 为以真值得分、同一格式的解。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\big(\\mathbb E\\|\\hat x_T-x_T\\|^2\\big)^{1/2}\\le e^{KT}\\Big(\\Delta t_{\\max}\\cdot\\sup_t\\|v_{\\mathrm{true}}(\\cdot,t)\\|_{C^2}+\\varepsilon_s\\int_0^T\\beta_t\\,\\mathrm dt\\Big),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 为 (A4) 的离散 Gronwall 常数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_{\\mathrm{true}}$</span> 为以真值得分定义的速度。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_n=\\hat x_n-x_n$</span>。一步之差为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\delta_{n+1}=\\delta_n+\\Delta t_n\\big(v_\\theta(\\hat x_n,t_n)-v_{\\mathrm{true}}(x_n,t_n)\\big).$$</div>\n<p>插入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_\\theta(x_n,t_n)$</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v_\\theta(\\hat x_n,t_n)-v_{\\mathrm{true}}(x_n,t_n)=\\big(v_\\theta(\\hat x_n,t_n)-v_\\theta(x_n,t_n)\\big)+\\big(v_\\theta(x_n,t_n)-v_{\\mathrm{true}}(x_n,t_n)\\big).$$</div>\n<p>第一项由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_\\theta$</span> 的 Lipschitz 性（(A2) 加 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 有界）被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\|\\delta_n\\|$</span> 控制。第二项由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_\\theta-v_{\\mathrm{true}}=-\\tfrac12\\beta_t(s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log p_t)$</span> 及 (A6) 被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\beta_t\\varepsilon_s$</span> 控制。故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\delta_{n+1}\\|\\le(1+K\\Delta t_n)\\|\\delta_n\\|+\\tfrac12\\beta_t\\varepsilon_s\\Delta t_n+\\tau_n,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_n$</span> 为真值格式的局部截断误差，被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t_n^2\\sup\\|v_{\\mathrm{true}}\\|_{C^2}$</span> 控制。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 递推并用离散 Gronwall，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\delta_N\\|\\le e^{KT}\\Big(\\|\\delta_0\\|+\\sum_{n}\\tfrac12\\beta_{t_n}\\varepsilon_s\\Delta t_n+\\sum_n\\tau_n\\Big).$$</div>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_0=0$</span>（同一初值），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_n\\beta_{t_n}\\Delta t_n\\to\\int_0^T\\beta_t\\,\\mathrm dt$</span>（左矩形，误差被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t_{\\max}\\cdot\\mathrm{TV}(\\beta)$</span> 控制，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{TV}$</span> 为全变差，由 (A1) 有限），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_n\\tau_n\\le\\Delta t_{\\max}T\\sup\\|v_{\\mathrm{true}}\\|_{C^2}$</span>。取期望并用 Jensen 即得所述界。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>接口含义有三层。第一，得分误差的传播系数是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T\\beta_t\\,\\mathrm dt=\\log(1/\\bar\\alpha_T)$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T\\to0$</span> 时发散），这解释了为何端点条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T=0$</span> 使得分误差在终端被放大：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T\\beta_t\\,\\mathrm dt$</span> 正是第 12 节 ELBO 权重积分的对偶量。第二，截断误差与得分误差可加分离，数值章可以分别报告两项预算。第三，界中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{KT}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t_{\\max}$</span> 的乘积结构说明：减小步长不能抵消得分误差，只能抵消截断误差；要控制终端分布误差，必须同时控制 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_s$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t_{\\max}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 4（端点截断对得分误差预算的修正）</strong> 设采用近似端点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T=\\epsilon&gt;0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T\\beta_t\\,\\mathrm dt=\\log(1/\\epsilon)$</span>，命题 7 的得分误差项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_s\\log(1/\\epsilon)$</span>。若进一步在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T-\\delta$</span> 处初始化（推论 2），则有效积分为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^{T-\\delta}\\beta_t\\,\\mathrm dt=\\log(\\bar\\alpha_{T-\\delta}/\\epsilon)$</span>，得分误差项降为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_s\\log(\\bar\\alpha_{T-\\delta}/\\epsilon)$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=-\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm dt}\\log\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T\\beta_t\\,\\mathrm dt=\\log\\bar\\alpha_0-\\log\\bar\\alpha_T=\\log(1/\\epsilon)$</span>（用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span>）。截断到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T-\\delta$</span> 时积分上限改为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T-\\delta$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\bar\\alpha_0-\\log\\bar\\alpha_{T-\\delta}=\\log(1/\\bar\\alpha_{T-\\delta})$</span>，再减去端点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 的贡献即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论给出一个可操作的权衡：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span> 越大，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{T-\\delta}$</span> 越大，得分误差预算越小，但截断引入的分布偏差越大。数值章必须把这一权衡作为显式配置项，而非隐式默认。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-接口九-调度曲线的可微性与积分器的阶数匹配\">接口九：调度曲线的可微性与积分器的阶数匹配<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-接口九-调度曲线的可微性与积分器的阶数匹配\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>数值章的高阶积分器（如 Heun、RK4）要求漂移关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 足够光滑。调度章必须说明：哪些调度满足这一要求，哪些不满足，以及不满足时高阶积分器的实际阶数如何退化。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8（调度光滑性与积分器阶数的匹配）</strong> 设 (A1)–(A4) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v(x,\\cdot)\\in C^r([0,T])$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{x,t}\\|\\partial_t^r v(x,t)\\|&lt;\\infty$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r$</span> 阶显式 Runge–Kutta 格式的全局误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta t_{\\max}^r)$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v(x,\\cdot)$</span> 仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T)\\setminus\\{t^\\ast\\}$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^r$</span> 且在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t^\\ast$</span> 处有跳跃，则全局误差退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta t_{\\max}^{\\min(r,1)})$</span>，即一阶。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 第一部分是标准 Runge–Kutta 收敛定理，其条件正是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r$</span> 阶连续可微与有界（Butcher 的阶条件）。第二部分：在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t^\\ast$</span> 所在的那一步，局部截断误差不再被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t^{r+1}$</span> 控制，而被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t^2$</span> 控制（因跳跃使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 的差分为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1)$</span>），该步贡献 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta t^2)$</span> 到全局误差；其余步贡献 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta t^r)$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r\\ge2$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta t^2)$</span> 主导，故全局为一阶。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>接口含义：线性调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=1-t/T$</span> 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=1/(T-t)$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 处发散，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 处不连续；cosine 调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\cos^2(\\cdot)$</span> 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\propto\\tan(\\cdot)$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 处同样发散。二者都使高阶积分器在端点附近退化为一阶。数值章若声称使用 RK4，必须同时报告端点截断 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span> 与退化区间；否则“四阶”是未验证的标签。sigmoid 调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\sigma(\\lambda(t))$</span> 在端点处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span> 指数趋近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 有界，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 光滑，高阶积分器保持阶数——这是 sigmoid 调度在数值上的结构性优势，而非经验观察。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-接口十-接口条件的联合检验清单\">接口十：接口条件的联合检验清单<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-接口十-接口条件的联合检验清单\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前九项接口各自给出一个条件。数值章需要一份可执行的联合检验清单，把九个条件压缩为有限个断言。本项给出该清单的数学形式，并证明清单的充分性。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 2（接口合格性）</strong> 称数值章对给定调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar\\alpha_t,\\sigma_t)$</span> 与积分器 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Psi$</span> 接口合格，若以下五条同时成立：</p>\n<p>(I1) 网格值与插值核一致，且推论 1 的斜率符号条件成立；\n(I2) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t_{\\max}\\le 2/\\Lambda_{\\max}$</span>（命题 6），或报告 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 并说明为何稳定性由其他机制保证；\n(I3) 端点截断 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span> 显式给出，且推论 2 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_{T-\\delta}&lt;\\infty$</span> 被验证；\n(I4) 得分误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_s$</span> 与截断误差分别报告，且命题 7 的界被计算；\n(I5) 积分器阶数与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的光滑性匹配（命题 8），退化区间被标注。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9（接口合格性的充分性）</strong> 设 (A1)–(A6) 成立，数值章接口合格。则终端分布误差满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\big(\\mathbb E\\|\\hat x_T-x_T\\|^2\\big)^{1/2}\\le e^{KT}\\Big(\\Delta t_{\\max}\\sup_t\\|v_{\\mathrm{true}}\\|_{C^2}+\\varepsilon_s\\log(1/\\bar\\alpha_{T-\\delta})\\Big)+\\mathrm{Err}_{\\mathrm{trunc}}(\\delta),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Err}_{\\mathrm{trunc}}(\\delta)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T-\\delta$</span> 初始化引入的分布偏差，且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta\\to0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Err}_{\\mathrm{trunc}}(\\delta)\\to0$</span>（在 (A1) 下由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span> 的连续性）。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 由 (I2)、(I3)、(I5)，命题 6 与命题 8 保证数值格式在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T-\\delta]$</span> 上稳定且达到匹配阶数；由 (I4)，命题 7 的界在截断区间上成立，得分误差项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_s\\log(1/\\bar\\alpha_{T-\\delta})$</span>（推论 4）；由 (I1)，SNR 单调性保证逐步降噪的归纳论证可用。截断偏差由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta\\to0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{T-\\delta}\\to\\bar\\alpha_T$</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{T-\\delta}\\to p_T$</span>（在弱收敛意义下，由 (A1) 的连续性与 Fokker–Planck 方程的解连续性）给出。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题的意义在于：它把“接口合格”这一操作性概念转化为一个可计算的误差上界。数值章不必逐条证明九个接口，只需验证五条断言并计算右端三项。三项中，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t_{\\max}$</span> 项由积分器控制，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_s\\log(1/\\bar\\alpha_{T-\\delta})$</span> 项由模型与端点截断共同控制，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Err}_{\\mathrm{trunc}}(\\delta)$</span> 项由截断控制——这正是调度章向数值章输出的完整误差预算。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>调度章向数值积分章输出的接口对象是三元组 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\{\\bar\\alpha_{t_n}\\},\\{\\beta_{t_n}\\},\\text{插值核})$</span>；SNR 单调性只在插值核一致时可由网格值推出（命题 1、推论 1）。</li>\n<li>步长选择应由对数 SNR 等分给出（命题 2），其有效性依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm dt}\\log\\mathrm{SNR}$</span> 的正下界；端点奇异使该下界为零，必须由数值章以截断 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span> 显式处理（推论 2）。</li>\n<li>反向 SDE 与概率流 ODE 的漂移差恒为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\tfrac12\\beta_t s_\\theta$</span>（命题 3），ELBO 离散化误差按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t_{\\max}$</span> 线性控制（命题 4），重参数化下的离散协变仅对仿射变换成立（命题 5）；三者共同构成数值章必须逐项检验的接口条件。</li>\n<li>调度刚性比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 把漂移 Lipschitz 常数的时间非均匀性压缩为一个标量（定义 1），命题 6 与推论 3 证明：均匀步长的稳定性由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_{\\max}$</span> 而非平均刚性决定，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 大时对数 SNR 等分步长自动满足稳定性条件。</li>\n<li>得分误差经积分器传播的系数是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T\\beta_t\\,\\mathrm dt=\\log(1/\\bar\\alpha_T)$</span>（命题 7），端点截断 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span> 把该系数修正为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(1/\\bar\\alpha_{T-\\delta})$</span>（推论 4）；截断误差与得分误差可加分离，数值章必须分别报告。</li>\n<li>调度曲线的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>-光滑性决定高阶积分器的实际阶数（命题 8）：线性与 cosine 调度在端点处使 RK4 退化为一阶，sigmoid 调度保持阶数；接口合格性（定义 2、命题 9）把九项接口压缩为五条可执行断言与三项可计算误差预算，构成调度章向数值积分章的最终输出。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"df06--h-本章推导链-调度-噪声的时间预算\">本章推导链：调度 = 噪声的时间预算<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-本章推导链-调度-噪声的时间预算\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已建立的符号：前向过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\alpha_t x_0+\\sigma_t\\varepsilon$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t,\\sigma_t&gt;0$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span> 连续可微，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=\\alpha_t^2/\\sigma_t^2$</span> 严格单调递减；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\alpha_t^2$</span> 为累积信号系数（本章 cosine 与线性调度均以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 表述）；<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t$</span> 为边缘密度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span> 为得分模型诱导的密度；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(t)$</span> 为时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的 ELBO 被积项。本节新引入的符号仅一个：<strong>噪声预算函数</strong></p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$B(t):=\\int_0^t \\frac{\\dot\\sigma_s}{\\sigma_s}\\,\\mathrm ds=\\log\\frac{\\sigma_t}{\\sigma_0},\\qquad t\\in[0,T],$$</div>\n<p>及其逆预算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau(u):=B^{-1}(u)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$u\\in[B(0),B(T)]$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span> 度量“到时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 为止累计注入的对数噪声尺度”，是把调度翻译成时间预算的坐标。假设：(A1) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\sigma_t\\ge 0$</span>（非负噪声速率），从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span> 单调不减、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 良定义；(A2) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\alpha_t\\le 0$</span>；(A3) 端点条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T=0$</span>（或按第 7 节的近似版本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T=\\epsilon$</span>）；(A4) 对得分匹配项，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(\\cdot,t)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 在紧集上 Lipschitz、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla\\log p_\\theta\\|^2$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 可积，以便对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 求导时用 Leibniz 法则。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-一-预算坐标下的信噪比恒等式\">一、预算坐标下的信噪比恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-一-预算坐标下的信噪比恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>调度的本质是把“噪声注入多少”与“信号保留多少”绑定为一条曲线；预算坐标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span> 把这条曲线拉直。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\alpha_t^2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=e^{2B(t)}\\sigma_0^2$</span>，有</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=\\frac{\\alpha_t^2}{\\sigma_t^2}=\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_t}{\\sigma_0^2}\\,e^{-2B(t)}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>命题 1（预算恒等式）</strong> 在 (A1)(A2) 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,T)$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm dt}\\log \\mathrm{SNR}(t)=\\frac{\\dot{\\bar\\alpha}_t}{\\bar\\alpha_t}-2\\frac{\\dot\\sigma_t}{\\sigma_t}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\mathrm{SNR}=\\log\\bar\\alpha_t-\\log\\sigma_0^2-2B(t)$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 求导；<span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span> 可微由 (A1) 保证，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t&gt;0$</span> 由 (A2) 与端点条件保证，故对数可导。逐项求导即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此恒等式说明：信噪比的瞬时衰减率 = 信号衰减率 − 2×噪声注入率。调度设计即在这两个速率之间分配预算。线性调度取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot{\\bar\\alpha}_t$</span> 为常数，cosine 调度取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 为余弦平方，二者在预算坐标下的形状差异正是本节推导链的起点。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-二-三种调度在预算坐标下的显式表达\">二、三种调度在预算坐标下的显式表达<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-二-三种调度在预算坐标下的显式表达\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>（i）线性调度。</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=1-t/T$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span>），并令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=1-\\bar\\alpha_t=t/T$</span>（方差保持参数化）。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$B(t)=\\tfrac12\\log\\frac{t/T}{1-t/T}\\Big|_{t=0}^{t},\\qquad \\mathrm{SNR}(t)=\\frac{1-t/T}{t/T}=\\frac{T-t}{t}.$$</div>\n<p>在预算坐标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=B(t)$</span> 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}=e^{-2u}\\cdot\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_t}{\\sigma_0^2}$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 的函数由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=\\tau(u)$</span> 给出，显式解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t/T=\\sigma^2=e^{2u}/(1+e^{2u})$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau(u)}=1/(1+e^{2u})$</span>。线性调度的预算曲线是 logistic 型。</p>\n<p><strong>（ii）cosine 调度。</strong> 取</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\cos^2\\!\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\frac{t/T+s}{1+s}\\right),\\qquad s&gt;0,$$</div>\n<p>则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=\\cos^2(\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\frac{s}{1+s})&lt;1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T=\\cos^2(\\frac{\\pi}{2})=0$</span>。为满足 (A3) 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span>，需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=0$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$s&gt;0$</span> 是第 7 节讨论的偏移版本，本节推导链只取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=0$</span> 的规范形式，并在需要时注明偏移仅改变端点邻域的预算分配。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=0$</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\cos^2\\!\\left(\\frac{\\pi t}{2T}\\right),\\qquad \\sigma_t^2=1-\\bar\\alpha_t=\\sin^2\\!\\left(\\frac{\\pi t}{2T}\\right).$$</div>\n<p>则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=\\cot^2\\!\\left(\\frac{\\pi t}{2T}\\right),\\qquad B(t)=\\log\\tan\\!\\left(\\frac{\\pi t}{2T}\\right)-\\log\\tan 0,$$</div>\n<p>后者在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 发散，说明 cosine 调度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 处噪声尺度以对数速率趋于零，预算坐标在端点奇异——这正是第 10 节反例节的接口，本节只记录该事实而不展开。</p>\n<p><strong>（iii）sigmoid 调度。</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\varsigma(-k(t/T-m))$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varsigma$</span> 为标准 logistic 函数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$k&gt;0$</span> 为陡度、<span class=\"math-inline\">$m\\in(0,1)$</span> 为拐点。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=\\varsigma(km)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T=\\varsigma(-k(1-m))$</span>，一般不等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，需按第 7 节做端点截断或重参数化。其预算曲线在拐点附近近似线性、两端饱和，是线性与 cosine 的折中。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 1（预算等价类）</strong> 若两条调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\alpha,\\sigma)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\alpha',\\sigma')$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=\\mathrm{SNR}'(t)$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立，则它们的预算函数相差一个常数：<span class=\"math-inline\">$B(t)-B'(t)=\\log(\\sigma_0/\\sigma_0')$</span>，且得分匹配的 ELBO 权重（第 12 节）逐点相同。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm dt}\\log\\mathrm{SNR}$</span> 只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span> 的导数；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}=\\mathrm{SNR}'$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm dt}\\log\\mathrm{SNR}=\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm dt}\\log\\mathrm{SNR}'$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\dot{\\bar\\alpha}}{\\bar\\alpha}-2\\dot B=\\frac{\\dot{\\bar\\alpha}'}{\\bar\\alpha'}-2\\dot B'$</span>。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha=\\bar\\alpha'$</span>（同一信号路径）下得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot B=\\dot B'$</span>，积分即得常数差。ELBO 权重只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)$</span>（第 12 节命题），故逐点相同。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论把“调度”的等价类刻画为“预算函数加常数”，是本节推导链的核心：<strong>调度不是一条任意曲线，而是噪声预算在时间轴上的分配方案；两条调度等价当且仅当它们给出相同的预算分配（相差常数）。</strong></p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-三-离散步长作为预算的离散化\">三、离散步长作为预算的离散化<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-三-离散步长作为预算的离散化\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 8 节已给出离散时间步的选择准则；本节把它翻译成预算语言。设离散网格 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0=t_0&lt;t_1&lt;\\cdots&lt;t_N=T$</span>，步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_i=t_{i+1}-t_i$</span>。定义<strong>预算增量</strong></p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Delta B_i:=B(t_{i+1})-B(t_i)=\\int_{t_i}^{t_{i+1}}\\frac{\\dot\\sigma_s}{\\sigma_s}\\,\\mathrm ds.$$</div>\n<p><strong>命题 2（步长的预算解释）</strong> 在 (A1) 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\sigma_t/\\sigma_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[t_i,t_{i+1}]$</span> 上连续且不变号，则存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\xi_i\\in(t_i,t_{i+1})$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta B_i=\\Delta_i\\cdot\\frac{\\dot\\sigma_{\\xi_i}}{\\sigma_{\\xi_i}}$</span>；特别地，等预算网格（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta B_i\\equiv\\Delta B$</span>）与等时间网格（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_i\\equiv\\Delta$</span>）一般不同，二者重合当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\sigma_t/\\sigma_t$</span> 为常数。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由积分中值定理（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\sigma/\\sigma$</span> 连续）得第一式。等预算网格要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_i=\\Delta B/(\\dot\\sigma_{\\xi_i}/\\sigma_{\\xi_i})$</span>，等时间网格要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_i=\\Delta$</span>；二者对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 重合当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\sigma_{\\xi_i}/\\sigma_{\\xi_i}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 无关，即该比率为常数。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 2 给出第 9 节“调度对采样步数影响”的定量接口：采样步数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 的选择应使每步的预算增量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta B$</span> 落在得分网络可分辨的范围内；cosine 调度在端点处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\sigma/\\sigma$</span> 发散（见上），等时间网格会在端点产生过大的预算增量，等预算网格则自动加密端点——这是第 10 节数值不稳定的预算根源。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-四-ELBO-权重作为预算的泛函\">四、ELBO 权重作为预算的泛函<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-四-ELBO-权重作为预算的泛函\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 12 节已建立 ELBO 权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)$</span> 的关系；本节把它写成预算的泛函，完成推导链的闭合。设得分匹配损失为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{SM}}=\\int_0^T w(t)\\,\\mathbb E_{x_0,\\varepsilon}\\big\\|\\nabla\\log p_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\nabla\\log q_t(x_t)\\big\\|^2\\,\\mathrm dt,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)$</span> 由第 12 节给出为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)=\\dot\\sigma_t^2/\\sigma_t^2$</span>（方差保持参数化下的标准权重，具体形式以第 12 节为准，本节只引用其预算表达）。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 3（权重—预算恒等式）</strong> 在 (A1)(A4) 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)=\\dot\\sigma_t^2/\\sigma_t^2$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$w(t)\\,\\mathrm dt=\\big(\\dot B(t)\\big)^2\\sigma_t^2\\,\\mathrm dt=\\sigma_t^2\\,\\mathrm d B(t)\\cdot\\dot B(t)\\,\\mathrm dt,$$</div>\n<p>且沿预算坐标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=B(t)$</span>，有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T w(t)\\,\\mathrm dt=\\int_{B(0)}^{B(T)}\\sigma_{\\tau(u)}^2\\,\\dot B(\\tau(u))\\,\\mathrm du$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span> 的定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot B=\\dot\\sigma/\\sigma$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=\\dot B^2\\sigma^2$</span>，第一式成立。换元 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=B(t)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm du=\\dot B\\,\\mathrm dt$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm dt=\\mathrm du/\\dot B$</span>，代入得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int w\\,\\mathrm dt=\\int \\dot B^2\\sigma^2\\cdot(\\mathrm du/\\dot B)=\\int\\sigma_{\\tau(u)}^2\\dot B(\\tau(u))\\,\\mathrm du$</span>。换元合法性由 (A1)（<span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span> 单调 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot B\\ge0$</span>）与 (A4)（被积函数可积）保证，属 Leibniz 换元公式的标准应用。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 3 说明：ELBO 权重在预算坐标下变成“噪声方差 × 预算速率”的乘积，调度对 ELBO 的影响完全由预算曲线 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{\\tau(u)}^2\\dot B(\\tau(u))$</span> 决定。线性调度下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^2=t/T$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot B=1/(2t(1-t/T))$</span>，权重在端点发散；cosine 调度下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^2=\\sin^2(\\pi t/2T)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot B=\\pi/(T\\sin(\\pi t/T))$</span>，权重在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 处以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/t$</span> 发散。两者都需第 10 节的端点处理，但发散阶数不同：线性为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/(t(1-t))$</span>，cosine 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/t$</span>，这是 cosine 在端点数值更稳定的预算解释。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-五-具体例子-三种调度的预算曲线数值验证\">五、具体例子：三种调度的预算曲线数值验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-五-具体例子-三种调度的预算曲线数值验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$N=8$</span> 等时间网格，计算三种调度在网格点上的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta B$</span>，验证命题 1 与命题 2 的恒等式。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\nT = 1.0\nN = 8\nt = np.linspace(0, T, N + 1)\ndt = T / N\n\ndef linear(t):\n    ab = 1 - t / T\n    return ab, 1 - ab\n\ndef cosine(t):\n    ab = np.cos(np.pi * t / (2 * T))**2\n    return ab, 1 - ab\n\ndef sigmoid_sched(t, k=10.0, m=0.5):\n    ab = 1 / (1 + np.exp(k * (t / T - m)))\n    return ab, 1 - ab\n\nfor name, f in [(&quot;linear&quot;, linear), (&quot;cosine&quot;, cosine), (&quot;sigmoid&quot;, sigmoid_sched)]:\n    ab, var = f(t)\n    snr = ab / np.maximum(var, 1e-12)\n    # 预算 B(t) = 0.5 * log(var / var0)，var0 取 t=0 处的方差\n    var0 = var[0] if var[0] &gt; 0 else 1e-12\n    B = 0.5 * np.log(np.maximum(var, 1e-12) / var0)\n    dB = np.diff(B)\n    print(f&quot;{name}: SNR shape={snr.shape}, B shape={B.shape}, dB shape={dB.shape}&quot;)\n    print(f&quot;  SNR[0]={snr[0]:.4e}, SNR[-1]={snr[-1]:.4e}&quot;)\n    print(f&quot;  B[0]={B[0]:.4e}, B[-1]={B[-1]:.4e}, sum(dB)={dB.sum():.4e}&quot;)\n    assert snr.shape == (N + 1,)\n    assert np.all(np.diff(snr) &lt;= 1e-12)  # SNR 单调不增\n    assert abs(dB.sum() - (B[-1] - B[0])) &lt; 1e-10  # 预算增量求和等于总预算\n\n# 命题 1 数值验证：d/dt log SNR = ab_dot/ab - 2 * sigma_dot/sigma\nt_mid = 0.5\neps = 1e-6\nfor name, f in [(&quot;linear&quot;, linear), (&quot;cosine&quot;, cosine)]:\n    ab1, var1 = f(np.array([t_mid - eps]))\n    ab2, var2 = f(np.array([t_mid + eps]))\n    lhs = (np.log(ab2[0] / var2[0]) - np.log(ab1[0] / var1[0])) / (2 * eps)\n    ab, var = f(np.array([t_mid]))\n    # 数值导数\n    ab_d = (ab2[0] - ab1[0]) / (2 * eps)\n    var_d = (var2[0] - var1[0]) / (2 * eps)\n    rhs = ab_d / ab[0] - var_d / var[0]\n    print(f&quot;{name}: lhs={lhs:.6f}, rhs={rhs:.6f}, diff={abs(lhs - rhs):.2e}&quot;)\n    assert abs(lhs - rhs) &lt; 1e-4\nprint(&quot;all assertions passed&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：三种调度的 SNR 形状均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(9,)$</span>，SNR 单调不增，预算增量求和等于总预算；命题 1 的数值导数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-4}$</span> 内吻合。代码中 <code>sigmoid</code> 的端点不满足 (A3)，故其 <code>SNR[0]</code> 与 <code>SNR[-1]</code> 不为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，这与第 7 节的端点截断讨论一致，本节只作数值对照而不修改其定义。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>调度被严格定义为噪声预算函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B(t)=\\int_0^t\\dot\\sigma_s/\\sigma_s\\,\\mathrm ds$</span> 在时间轴上的分配；命题 1 给出信噪比衰减率 = 信号衰减率 − 2×噪声注入率的恒等式，三种调度的差异即预算曲线形状的差异。</li>\n<li>命题 2 把离散步长翻译为预算增量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta B_i$</span>，等预算网格与等时间网格一般不同；cosine 调度在端点处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\sigma/\\sigma$</span> 发散，等时间网格会在端点产生过大预算增量，这是第 10 节数值不稳定的预算根源。</li>\n<li>命题 3 把 ELBO 权重写成预算坐标下的泛函 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{\\tau(u)}^2\\dot B(\\tau(u))$</span>，线性与 cosine 调度的权重发散阶数分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/(t(1-t))$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/t$</span>；推论 1 刻画了调度的预算等价类，为第 15 节与数值积分章的接口提供了坐标不变的语言。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-六-预算坐标下的采样步数下界\">六、预算坐标下的采样步数下界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-六-预算坐标下的采样步数下界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 9 节已给出采样步数对生成质量的经验影响；本节把它翻译成预算语言，给出一个可证明的下界。设反向采样采用 Euler–Maruyama 或概率流 ODE 的一阶离散，步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_i$</span> 对应预算增量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta B_i$</span>。定义<strong>预算分辨率</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta&gt;0$</span> 为得分网络在预算坐标下可分辨的最小增量：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta B_i\\le\\delta$</span>，则相邻两步的边缘密度之比在得分估计误差范围内不可区分。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4（步数下界）</strong> 在 (A1) 下，设总预算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta B_{\\mathrm{tot}}=B(T)-B(0)$</span>，若要求每步预算增量不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span>，则所需步数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$N\\ge\\left\\lceil\\frac{\\Delta B_{\\mathrm{tot}}}{\\delta}\\right\\rceil.$$</div>\n<p>进一步，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\sigma_t/\\sigma_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上连续且严格正，则等预算网格的步长满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_i=\\delta/\\big(\\dot\\sigma_{\\xi_i}/\\sigma_{\\xi_i}\\big)$</span>，且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\sigma_t/\\sigma_t$</span> 在端点发散时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\to\\infty$</span> 才能使端点处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta B_i\\le\\delta$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 第一式由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i\\Delta B_i=\\Delta B_{\\mathrm{tot}}$</span> 与每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta B_i\\le\\delta$</span> 直接得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\delta\\ge\\Delta B_{\\mathrm{tot}}$</span>，取整即得。第二式由命题 2 的积分中值定理，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta B_i=\\delta$</span> 反解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_i$</span>。端点发散情形：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\sigma_t/\\sigma_t\\to\\infty$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to0^+$</span>），则对任意固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta B_0=\\int_0^\\Delta\\dot\\sigma_s/\\sigma_s\\,\\mathrm ds=\\infty$</span>，故任何有限步数都无法使首步预算增量有界，必须令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\to0$</span> 即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\to\\infty$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 4 给出第 9 节“调度对采样步数影响”的定量形式：线性调度的总预算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta B_{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\frac12\\log\\frac{T}{0}$</span> 在端点发散，cosine 调度的总预算同样发散，二者都要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span> 反比增长；而 sigmoid 调度因两端饱和，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\sigma/\\sigma$</span> 在端点有界，总预算有限，故存在与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span> 无关的有限下界。这正是 sigmoid 调度在固定步数下数值更稳的预算解释，与第 10 节的反例节接口一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-七-预算重参数化的不变性与得分匹配的协变\">七、预算重参数化的不变性与得分匹配的协变<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-七-预算重参数化的不变性与得分匹配的协变\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 11 节已建立时间重参数化的不变性；本节把它推广到预算坐标，证明得分匹配损失在预算重参数化下协变。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi:[0,T]\\to[0,T']$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 严格单调映射，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi(0)=0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi(T)=T'$</span>，定义重参数化调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\sigma_t:=\\sigma_{\\phi^{-1}(t)}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\alpha_t:=\\alpha_{\\phi^{-1}(t)}$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde B(t)=B(\\phi^{-1}(t))$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde B'(t)=\\dot B(\\phi^{-1}(t))\\cdot(\\phi^{-1})'(t)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5（预算协变）</strong> 在 (A1)(A4) 下，得分匹配损失在重参数化下满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_0^{T'}\\tilde w(t)\\,\\mathbb E\\big\\|\\nabla\\log p_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\nabla\\log q_t(x_t)\\big\\|^2\\,\\mathrm dt=\\int_0^T w(s)\\,\\mathbb E\\big\\|\\nabla\\log p_\\theta(x_s,s)-\\nabla\\log q_s(x_s)\\big\\|^2\\,\\mathrm ds,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde w(t)=w(\\phi^{-1}(t))\\cdot(\\phi^{-1})'(t)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w(s)=\\dot\\sigma_s^2/\\sigma_s^2$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 换元 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=\\phi^{-1}(t)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm dt=\\phi'(s)\\,\\mathrm ds$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\phi^{-1})'(t)=1/\\phi'(s)$</span>。代入左式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_0^{T'}\\tilde w(t)\\,\\mathbb E\\|\\cdot\\|^2\\,\\mathrm dt=\\int_0^T w(s)\\cdot\\frac{1}{\\phi'(s)}\\cdot\\mathbb E\\|\\cdot\\|^2\\cdot\\phi'(s)\\,\\mathrm ds=\\int_0^T w(s)\\,\\mathbb E\\|\\cdot\\|^2\\,\\mathrm ds.$$</div>\n<p>换元合法性由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi$</span> 严格单调 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\cdot\\|^2$</span> 可积（(A4)）保证，属 Leibniz 换元公式的标准应用。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 5 说明：得分匹配损失对时间重参数化是协变的，权重按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\phi^{-1})'$</span> 变换；因此“调度”与“时间轴”不是两个独立对象，而是同一预算分配在不同坐标下的两种表述。这与推论 1 的预算等价类互补：推论 1 说相同预算给出相同权重，命题 5 说不同时间轴给出协变权重。二者合起来刻画了调度在“预算—时间”二维坐标下的完整不变性结构，是第 15 节与数值积分章接口的代数基础。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-八-预算曲线的凸性与端点预算分配\">八、预算曲线的凸性与端点预算分配<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-八-预算曲线的凸性与端点预算分配\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 6 节的最优调度变分问题已给出泛函形式；本节在预算坐标下给出一个可检验的凸性判据，说明为何 cosine 调度在端点分配更多预算。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6（凸性判据）</strong> 在 (A1)(A3) 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 是凸函数且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>，则预算函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B(t)=\\frac12\\log\\sigma_t^2$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的凸性由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ddot{\\bar\\alpha}_t/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)+(\\dot{\\bar\\alpha}_t/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t))^2$</span> 的符号决定；特别地，cosine 调度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,T)$</span> 上满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\ddot B(t)=\\frac{\\pi^2}{4T^2}\\cdot\\frac{1}{\\sin^2(\\pi t/2T)}\\cdot\\left(1+\\cot^2\\!\\left(\\frac{\\pi t}{2T}\\right)\\right)&gt;0,$$</div>\n<p>即 cosine 调度的预算曲线严格凸，端点处预算增量随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to0^+$</span> 以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/t$</span> 发散。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot B=\\frac12\\cdot\\frac{-\\dot{\\bar\\alpha}_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ddot B=\\frac12\\left[\\frac{-\\ddot{\\bar\\alpha}_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}-\\frac{\\dot{\\bar\\alpha}_t^2}{(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)^2}\\right]$</span>，整理得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ddot B=\\frac12\\left[\\frac{-\\ddot{\\bar\\alpha}_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}-\\left(\\frac{\\dot{\\bar\\alpha}_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\right)^2\\right]$</span>。对 cosine 调度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\cos^2(\\pi t/2T)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot{\\bar\\alpha}_t=-\\frac{\\pi}{T}\\sin(\\pi t/2T)\\cos(\\pi t/2T)=-\\frac{\\pi}{2T}\\sin(\\pi t/T)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ddot{\\bar\\alpha}_t=-\\frac{\\pi^2}{2T^2}\\cos(\\pi t/T)$</span>。代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^2=\\sin^2(\\pi t/2T)$</span>，逐项化简得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ddot B=\\frac{\\pi^2}{4T^2}\\cdot\\frac{1}{\\sin^2(\\pi t/2T)}\\cdot(1+\\cot^2(\\pi t/2T))$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,T)$</span> 上严格正。端点发散由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sin(\\pi t/2T)\\sim\\pi t/2T$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to0^+$</span>）得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot B\\sim1/t$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 6 给出第 6 节最优调度变分问题的局部判据：预算曲线的凸性决定了预算在时间轴上的分配偏向。cosine 调度的严格凸性意味着它在端点附近分配了远多于中段的预算增量，这与第 9 节“cosine 在端点需要更密网格”的结论互为表里。线性调度的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ddot B$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T/2$</span> 处变号（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^2=t/T$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ddot B=-1/(2t^2)&lt;0$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t&gt;0$</span> 恒负，故线性调度预算曲线严格凹），说明线性调度在中段分配更多预算、端点分配更少，与 cosine 相反。这一凸性对比是三种调度数学差异的局部刻画，补足了命题 1 只给出一阶导数的不足。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-九-预算坐标下的密度演化恒等式\">九、预算坐标下的密度演化恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-九-预算坐标下的密度演化恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 14 节的代码节已给出不同调度的密度演化数值对照；本节给出其解析恒等式，作为代码验证的理论依据。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t$</span> 为前向边缘密度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q_t$</span> 为得分。在预算坐标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=B(t)$</span> 下，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varrho_u:=q_{\\tau(u)}$</span>。由连续性方程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t q_t=-\\nabla\\cdot(q_t\\nabla\\log q_t)$</span>（第 5 节的概率流 ODE 接口），换元到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\partial_u\\varrho_u=-\\frac{1}{\\dot B(\\tau(u))}\\nabla\\cdot(\\varrho_u\\nabla\\log\\varrho_u).$$</div>\n<p><strong>命题 7（预算密度演化）</strong> 在 (A1)(A4) 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot B(\\tau(u))&gt;0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot(\\varrho_u\\nabla\\log\\varrho_u)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 可积，则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_1&lt;u_2$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\varrho_{u_2}(x)-\\varrho_{u_1}(x)=-\\int_{u_1}^{u_2}\\frac{1}{\\dot B(\\tau(u))}\\nabla\\cdot(\\varrho_u\\nabla\\log\\varrho_u)(x)\\,\\mathrm du.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由连续性方程与换元 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=B(t)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t=\\dot B\\,\\partial_u$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot B\\,\\partial_u\\varrho_u=-\\nabla\\cdot(\\varrho_u\\nabla\\log\\varrho_u)$</span>，两边除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot B$</span> 得第一式。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 积分并用微积分基本定理（被积函数关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 可积，由 (A4)）即得第二式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 7 说明：预算坐标下的密度演化速率被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\dot B(\\tau(u))$</span> 调制；cosine 调度在端点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot B\\to\\infty$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varrho_u$</span> 在端点附近演化极慢（预算增量大但密度变化率被压制），这正是第 14 节代码中 cosine 调度在端点密度曲线更平滑的解析原因。线性调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot B$</span> 在端点发散但阶数更低（<span class=\"math-inline\">$1/(t(1-t))$</span> vs <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/t$</span>），密度演化在端点附近更快，数值上更易出现振荡。命题 7 与命题 3 的权重恒等式共同构成第 14 节代码验证的两个理论锚点：前者管密度演化，后者管损失权重。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df06--h-十-推导链的闭合-预算作为调度的唯一不变量\">十、推导链的闭合：预算作为调度的唯一不变量<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df06--h-十-推导链的闭合-预算作为调度的唯一不变量\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>综合命题 1–7 与推论 1，本节推导链可闭合为一条主定理。</p>\n<p><strong>定理（调度 = 噪声的时间预算）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，以下三条陈述等价：</p>\n<p>(i) 两条调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\alpha,\\sigma)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\alpha',\\sigma')$</span> 给出相同的信噪比轨迹 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=\\mathrm{SNR}'(t)$</span>；</p>\n<p>(ii) 两条调度的预算函数相差常数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$B(t)-B'(t)\\equiv c$</span>，且信号路径相同 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\bar\\alpha'_t$</span>；</p>\n<p>(iii) 两条调度给出逐点相同的 ELBO 权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)=w'(t)$</span>，且得分匹配损失在任意时间重参数化下协变相等。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> (i)<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Rightarrow$</span>(ii)：由推论 1 直接得。(ii)<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Rightarrow$</span>(iii)：由命题 3，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=\\dot B^2\\sigma^2$</span>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B-B'\\equiv c$</span> 则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot B=\\dot B'$</span>，又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^2=\\sigma_0^2e^{2B}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma'^2=\\sigma_0'^2e^{2B'}$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha=\\bar\\alpha'$</span> 下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^2=1-\\bar\\alpha=\\sigma'^2$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=w'$</span>；协变相等由命题 5 得。(iii)<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Rightarrow$</span>(i)：由命题 3 的逆，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=w'$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^2=\\sigma'^2$</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot B^2=\\dot B'^2$</span>，结合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha=\\bar\\alpha'$</span> 与命题 1 的恒等式得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}=\\mathrm{SNR}'$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此定理把“调度”的数学身份钉死为<strong>预算函数在时间轴上的分配</strong>：信噪比轨迹、预算曲线、ELBO 权重三者互为等价刻画，任一确定则其余确定。线性、cosine、sigmoid 三种调度的差异，全部归结为预算曲线 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B(t)$</span> 的形状差异——线性为凹、cosine 为凸、sigmoid 为两端饱和的 S 形。这一闭合为第 15 节与数值积分章的接口提供了唯一的不变量语言：数值积分器只需在预算坐标下离散，调度选择即预算曲线选择，二者不再分离。</p>", "cjk": 57672, "missing": []};
